#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline.rst:5
msgid "Organize the pipeline"
msgstr "Organizacija cevovoda"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:3
msgid "Lost opportunities"
msgstr "Izgubljene priložnosti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:5
msgid ""
"Not every opportunity results in a successful sale. To keep the pipeline up-"
"to-date, *lost* opportunities need to be identified. Specifying why an "
"opportunity was lost helps identify recurring issues, reveal coaching "
"opportunities, and can assist with improving overall sales strategy."
msgstr ""
"Ne vsaka priložnost se konča s uspešno prodajo. Da bi bil cevovod vedno "
"posodobljen, je treba identificirati *izgubljene* priložnosti. Določanje "
"razloga, zakaj je bila priložnost izgubljena, pomaga prepoznati ponavljajoče "
"se težave, razkriti priložnosti za mentorstvo in lahko pomaga pri "
"izboljšanju splošne prodajne strategije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:10
msgid ""
":doc:`Merging lost opportunities <merge_similar>` with active ones will pull "
"them back into the pipeline."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Združevanje izgubljenih priložnosti <merge_similar>` z aktivnimi jih "
"bo povleklo nazaj v cevovod."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:14
msgid "Mark an opportunity as lost"
msgstr "Označi priložnost kot izgubljeno"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:16
msgid ""
"To mark an opportunity as lost, first open the :menuselection:`CRM app`, and "
"then select an opportunity from the pipeline by clicking on its "
"corresponding Kanban card. Doing so reveals that opportunity's detail form."
msgstr ""
"Če želite označiti priložnost kot izgubljeno, najprej "
"odprite :menuselection:`aplikacijo CRM` in nato izberite priložnost iz "
"cevovoda s klikom na njeno ustrezno Kanban kartico. S tem se prikaže obrazec "
"s podrobnostmi priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:20
msgid ""
"Then, click :guilabel:`Lost`, located at the top of the opportunity's detail "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Izgubljeno`, ki se nahaja na vrhu obrazca s "
"podrobnostmi priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:22
msgid ""
"Buttons from the top of an opportunity record with the lost button "
"emphasized."
msgstr "Gumbi na vrhu zapisa priložnosti z označenim gumbom izgubljeno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:25
msgid ""
"This opens the :guilabel:`Mark Lost` pop-up window. From the :guilabel:`Lost "
"Reason` drop-down menu, choose an existing lost reason. If no applicable "
"reason is available, then create a new one by entering it into "
"the :guilabel:`Lost Reason` field, and then clicking :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"To odpre pojavno okno :guilabel:`Označi kot izgubljeno`. Iz spustnega "
"menija :guilabel:`Razlog za izgubo` izberite obstoječi razlog za izgubo. Če "
"primeren razlog ni na voljo, ustvarite novega tako, da ga vnesete v "
"polje :guilabel:`Razlog za izgubo` in nato kliknete :guilabel:`Ustvari`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:29
msgid ""
"Additional notes and comments can be added below the lost reason in the "
"designated :guilabel:`Closing Note` field."
msgstr ""
"Dodatne opombe in komentarje je mogoče dodati pod razlogom za izgubo v "
"namenskem polju :guilabel:`Zaključna opomba`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:33
msgid ""
"Neither the :guilabel:`Lost Reason` field, nor the :guilabel:`Closing Note` "
"field, on the :guilabel:`Mark Lost` pop-up window are required. However, it "
"is recommended to include this information for the sake of traceability, "
"accountability, and reporting purposes."
msgstr ""
"Niti polje :guilabel:`Razlog za izgubo` niti polje :guilabel:`Zaključna "
"opomba` v pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Označi kot izgubljeno` nista obvezna. "
"Vendar je priporočljivo vključiti te informacije zaradi sledljivosti, "
"odgovornosti in poročanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:40
msgid "Lost reasons popup with sample reasons."
msgstr "Pojavno okno razlogov za izgubo z vzorčnimi razlogi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:43
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Mark as Lost`, a red :guilabel:`Lost` banner is "
"added to the upper-right corner of the opportunity."
msgstr ""
"Po kliku na :guilabel:`Označi kot izgubljeno` se v zgornji desni kot "
"priložnosti doda rdeč napis :guilabel:`Izgubljeno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:46
msgid "A lost opportunity with the lost banner added."
msgstr "Izgubljena priložnost z dodanim napisom izgubljeno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:50
msgid ""
"To mark an *inactive* (archived) opportunity as lost, set "
"the :guilabel:`Probability` field to `0` percent."
msgstr ""
"Če želite označiti *neaktivno* (arhivirano) priložnost kot izgubljeno, "
"nastavite polje :guilabel:`Verjetnost` na `0` odstotkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:56
msgid "Create/edit lost reasons"
msgstr "Ustvari/uredi razloge za izgubo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:58
msgid ""
"To create a new lost reason, or edit an existing one, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Lost Reasons`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite ustvariti nov razlog za izgubo ali urediti obstoječega, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`aplikacija CRM --> Konfiguracija --> Razlogi za izgubo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:61
msgid ""
"To edit an existing lost reason, click the reason to be edited to highlight "
"it. From here, change the selected lost reason by editing "
"the :guilabel:`Description` field."
msgstr ""
"Če želite urediti obstoječi razlog za izgubo, kliknite razlog, ki ga želite "
"urediti, da ga označite. Od tukaj spremenite izbrani razlog za izgubo z "
"urejanjem polja :guilabel:`Opis`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:64
msgid ""
"To create a new lost reason, click :guilabel:`New` in the upper-left corner "
"of the :guilabel:`Lost Reasons` page. Then, type the new lost reason in "
"the :guilabel:`Description` field."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje novega razloga za izgubo kliknite :guilabel:`Novo` v zgornjem "
"levem kotu strani :guilabel:`Razlogi za izgubo`. Nato vnesite nov razlog za "
"izgubo v polje :guilabel:`Opis`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:68
msgid "View lost opportunities"
msgstr "Ogled izgubljenih priložnosti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:70
msgid ""
"To retrieve lost opportunities, go :menuselection:`CRM app --> Sales --> My "
"Pipeline`, then click on the search bar at the top of the page, and then "
"remove all of the default filters."
msgstr ""
"Za priklic izgubljenih priložnosti pojdite :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --"
"> Prodaja --> Moj cevovod`, nato kliknite iskalno vrstico na vrhu strani in "
"odstranite vse privzete filtre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:73
msgid "Search bar with lost filter emphasized."
msgstr "Iskalna vrstica s poudarjenim filtrom za izgubljene priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:76
msgid ""
"Open the :guilabel:`Filters` drop-down menu by clicking the :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(dropdown)` icon to the right of the search bar to open the "
"drop-down menu containing :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By`, "
"and :guilabel:`Favorites` options, designated into respective columns."
msgstr ""
"Odprite spustni meni :guilabel:`Filtri` s klikom na ikono :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(spustni meni)` desno od iskalne vrstice, da se odpre "
"spustni meni z možnostmi :guilabel:`Filtri`, :guilabel:`Združi po` "
"in :guilabel:`Priljubljene`, razvrščenimi v ustrezne stolpce."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:81
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Lost` option from the :guilabel:`Filters` section. "
"Upon selecting :guilabel:`Lost`, only the opportunities marked as `Lost` "
"appear on the :guilabel:`Pipeline` page."
msgstr ""
"Izberite možnost :guilabel:`Izgubljeno` v razdelku :guilabel:`Filtri`. Po "
"izbiri :guilabel:`Izgubljeno` se na strani :guilabel:`Cevovod` prikažejo "
"samo priložnosti, označene kot `Izgubljene`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:85
msgid "Sort opportunities by lost reason"
msgstr "Razvrščanje priložnosti po razlogu za izgubo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:87
msgid ""
"To filter opportunities by a specific lost reason, click the :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(dropdown)` icon to the right of the search bar again to "
"open the drop-down menu. In addition to the :guilabel:`Lost` filter, under "
"the :guilabel:`Filters` column, click :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter`, which "
"opens an :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Za filtriranje priložnosti po določenem razlogu za izgubo ponovno kliknite "
"ikono :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(spustni meni)` desno od iskalne "
"vrstice, da se odpre spustni meni. Poleg filtra :guilabel:`Izgubljeno` v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Filtri` kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj filter po meri`, kar "
"odpre pojavno okno :guilabel:`Dodaj filter po meri`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:92
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` pop-up window, click in the first field "
"and type `Lost Reason` in the search bar, or scroll to search through the "
"list to locate it. Then, click into the next field, and select :guilabel:`=` "
"from the drop-down menu. Click into the third field, and then select a lost "
"reason from the drop-down menu. Finally, click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""
"V pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Dodaj filter po meri` kliknite v prvo polje in "
"vnesite `Lost Reason` v iskalno vrstico ali se pomaknite navzdol po seznamu, "
"da ga poiščete. Nato kliknite v naslednje polje in izberite :guilabel:`=` iz "
"spustnega menija. Kliknite v tretje polje in nato izberite razlog za izgubo "
"iz spustnega menija. Na koncu kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:97
msgid "Search bar with custom filter added for lost reason."
msgstr "Iskalna vrstica z dodanim filtrom po meri za razlog za izgubo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:101
msgid ""
"To view results for more than one lost reason, select the "
"operator :guilabel:`is in` in the second field of the custom filter in "
"the :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` pop-up window. Choosing this operator "
"makes it possible to choose multiple lost reasons in the third field."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled rezultatov za več kot en razlog za izgubo izberite "
"operator :guilabel:`je v` v drugem polju filtra po meri v pojavnem "
"oknu :guilabel:`Dodaj filter po meri`. Izbira tega operatorja omogoča izbiro "
"več razlogov za izgubo v tretjem polju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:105
msgid "Add Custom Filter pop-up with multiple lost reasons selected."
msgstr "Pojavno okno Dodaj filter po meri z izbranimi več razlogi za izgubo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:109
msgid "Restore lost opportunities"
msgstr "Obnovitev izgubljenih priložnosti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:111
msgid ""
"To restore a lost opportunity, open the :menuselection:`CRM` app to reveal "
"the :guilabel:`Pipeline` dashboard. Or, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app "
"--> Sales --> My Pipeline`. From here, click the :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(dropdown)` icon to the right of the search bar to open the "
"drop-down menu that contains :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By`, "
"and :guilabel:`Favorites` columns."
msgstr ""
"Za obnovitev izgubljene priložnosti odprite aplikacijo :menuselection:`CRM`, "
"da se prikaže nadzorna plošča :guilabel:`Cevovod`. Ali pa pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> Prodaja --> Moj cevovod`. Od tod "
"kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(spustni meni)` desno od "
"iskalne vrstice, da se odpre spustni meni s "
"stolpci :guilabel:`Filtri`, :guilabel:`Združi po` "
"in :guilabel:`Priljubljene`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:117
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Filters` column, select :guilabel:`Lost`. Doing so "
"reveals all the lost opportunities on the :guilabel:`Pipeline` page."
msgstr ""
"V stolpcu :guilabel:`Filtri` izberite :guilabel:`Izgubljeno`. S tem se na "
"strani :guilabel:`Cevovod` prikažejo vse izgubljene priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:121
msgid ""
"To see all opportunities in the database, remove the default :guilabel:`My "
"Pipeline` filter from the search bar."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled vseh priložnosti v bazi podatkov odstranite privzeti "
"filter :guilabel:`Moj cevovod` iz iskalne vrstice."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:124
msgid ""
"From the lost opportunity's detail form, click :guilabel:`Restore` in the "
"upper-left corner. Doing so removes the red :guilabel:`Lost` banner from the "
"opportunity form, signifying the opportunity has been restored."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu s podrobnostmi o izgubljeni priložnosti "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Obnovi` v zgornjem levem kotu. S tem se odstrani rdeč "
"napis :guilabel:`Izgubljeno` z obrazca priložnosti, kar pomeni, da je bila "
"priložnost obnovljena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:128
msgid "Lost opportunity with emphasis on the Restore button."
msgstr "Izgubljena priložnost s poudarjenim gumbom Obnovi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:132
msgid "Restore multiple opportunities at once"
msgstr "Obnovitev več priložnosti naenkrat"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:134
msgid ""
"To restore multiple opportunities at once, open the dashboard mega menu by "
"clicking the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(dropdown)` icon (to the right "
"of the search bar) and select the default :guilabel:`Lost` option located "
"under the left-side :guilabel:`Filters` column."
msgstr ""
"Za obnovitev več priložnosti naenkrat odprite mega meni nadzorne plošče s "
"klikom na ikono :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(spustni meni)` (desno od "
"iskalne vrstice) in izberite privzeto možnost :guilabel:`Izgubljeno`, ki se "
"nahaja v levem stolpcu :guilabel:`Filtri`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:138
msgid ""
"Next, select the list view option, represented by the :icon:`fa-"
"bars` :guilabel:`(list)` icon in the upper-right corner. Doing so places all "
"the opportunities from the :guilabel:`Pipeline` page in a list view. With "
"the list view chosen, select the checkbox to the left of each opportunity to "
"be restored."
msgstr ""
"Nato izberite možnost seznamskega pogleda, ki jo predstavlja ikona :icon:`fa-"
"bars` :guilabel:`seznam` v zgornjem desnem kotu. S tem so vse priložnosti s "
"strani :guilabel:`Cevovod` prikazane v seznamskem pogledu. Ko je seznamski "
"pogled izbran, označite potrditveno polje levo od vsake priložnosti, ki jo "
"želite obnoviti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:143
msgid ""
"Once the desired opportunities have been selected, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` drop-down menu at the top of "
"the :guilabel:`Pipeline` page. From the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` "
"drop-down menu, select :guilabel:`Unarchive`."
msgstr ""
"Ko so želene priložnosti izbrane, kliknite spustni meni :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Dejanja` na vrhu strani :guilabel:`Cevovod`. V spustnem "
"meniju :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Dejanja` izberite :guilabel:`Razveljavi "
"arhiviranje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:147
msgid ""
"Doing so removes those selected opportunities from the :guilabel:`Pipeline` "
"page because they no longer fit the :guilabel:`Lost` filter criteria. Delete "
"the :guilabel:`Lost` filter from the search bar to reveal these newly-"
"restored opportunities."
msgstr ""
"S tem so izbrane priložnosti odstranjene s strani :guilabel:`Cevovod`, ker "
"ne ustrezajo več kriterijem filtra :guilabel:`Izgubljeno`. Izbrišite "
"filter :guilabel:`Izgubljeno` iz iskalne vrstice, da prikažete te na novo "
"obnovljene priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:151
msgid "Action button from list view with the Unarchive option emphasized."
msgstr ""
"Gumb za dejanje iz seznamskega pogleda s poudarjeno možnostjo Razveljavi "
"arhiviranje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:155
msgid "Manage lost leads"
msgstr "Upravljanje izgubljenih potencialnih strank"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:157
msgid ""
"If *Leads* are enabled on a database, then they can be marked as *lost* in "
"the same manner as opportunities. Leads use the same :ref:`lost reasons <crm/"
"lost-reasons>` as opportunities."
msgstr ""
"Če so v zbirki podatkov omogočene *potencialne stranke*, jih lahko označite "
"kot *izgubljene* na enak način kot priložnosti. Potencialne stranke "
"uporabljajo enake :ref:`razloge za izgubo <crm/lost-reasons>` kot "
"priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:161
msgid ""
"To enable leads, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` and check the :guilabel:`Leads` checkbox. This adds a "
"new :guilabel:`Leads` menu to the header menu bar at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Če želite omogočiti potencialne stranke, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve` in "
"označite potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Potencialne stranke`. S tem se doda "
"nov meni :guilabel:`Potencialne stranke` v menijsko vrstico glave na vrhu "
"strani."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:166
msgid "Mark a lead as lost"
msgstr "Označitev potencialne stranke kot izgubljene"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:168
msgid ""
"To mark a lead as lost, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads`, and "
"select a lead from the list. Doing so reveals that lead's detail form. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Lost`, located at the top of the lead's detail form."
msgstr ""
"Če želite označiti potencialno stranko kot izgubljeno, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> Potencialne stranke` in izberite "
"potencialno stranko s seznama. S tem se odpre obrazec s podrobnostmi te "
"potencialne stranke. Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Izgubljeno`, ki se nahaja na "
"vrhu obrazca s podrobnostmi potencialne stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:172
msgid ""
"This opens the :guilabel:`Mark Lost` pop-up window. From the :guilabel:`Lost "
"Reason` drop-down menu, choose an existing lost reason. If no applicable "
"reason is available, then create a new one by entering it into "
"the :guilabel:`Lost Reason` field, and selecting :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"To odpre pojavno okno :guilabel:`Označi kot izgubljeno`. V spustnem "
"meniju :guilabel:`Razlog za izgubo` izberite obstoječi razlog za izgubo. Če "
"ni na voljo ustreznega razloga, ustvarite novega tako, da ga vnesete v "
"polje :guilabel:`Razlog za izgubo` in izberete :guilabel:`Ustvari`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:176
msgid ""
"Additional notes and comments can be added below the lost reason designated "
"in the :guilabel:`Closing Note` field."
msgstr ""
"Dodatne opombe in komentarje lahko dodate pod navedenim razlogom za izgubo v "
"polju :guilabel:`Opomba ob zaprtju`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:183
msgid "Restore lost leads"
msgstr "Obnovitev izgubljenih potencialnih strank"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:185
msgid ""
"To restore a lost lead, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads`, and "
"then click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(dropdown)` icon to the "
"right of the search bar to open the drop-down menu that contains "
"the :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By`, and :guilabel:`Favorites` "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"Če želite obnoviti izgubljeno potencialno stranko, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> Potencialne stranke` in nato kliknite "
"ikono :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`spustni meni` desno od iskalne "
"vrstice, da odprete spustni meni, ki vsebuje "
"stolpce :guilabel:`Filtri`, :guilabel:`Združi po` "
"in :guilabel:`Priljubljene`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:190
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Filters` column, select :guilabel:`Lost`. Doing so "
"reveals all the lost leads on the :guilabel:`Leads` page."
msgstr ""
"V stolpcu :guilabel:`Filtri` izberite :guilabel:`Izgubljeno`. S tem so "
"prikazane vse izgubljene potencialne stranke na "
"strani :guilabel:`Potencialne stranke`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:193
msgid ""
"Then, click on the desired lost lead to restore, which opens that lead's "
"detail form."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite na želeno izgubljeno potencialno stranko, ki jo želite "
"obnoviti, s čimer se odpre njen obrazec s podrobnostmi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:195
msgid ""
"From the lost lead's detail form, click :guilabel:`Restore` in the upper-"
"left corner. Doing so removes the red :guilabel:`Lost` banner from the lead "
"form, signifying the lead has been restored."
msgstr ""
"V obrazcu s podrobnostmi izgubljene potencialne stranke "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Obnovi` v zgornjem levem kotu. S tem je z obrazca "
"potencialne stranke odstranjen rdeč napis :guilabel:`Izgubljeno`, kar "
"pomeni, da je bila potencialna stranka obnovljena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:199
msgid "Restore multiple leads at once"
msgstr "Obnovitev več potencialnih strank hkrati"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:201
msgid ""
"To restore multiple leads at once, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Leads`, open the :guilabel:`Filters` drop-down menu, and select "
"the :guilabel:`Lost` option. Select the checkbox to the left of each lead to "
"be restored."
msgstr ""
"Če želite obnoviti več potencialnih strank hkrati, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> Potencialne stranke`, odprite spustni "
"meni :guilabel:`Filtri` in izberite možnost :guilabel:`Izgubljeno`. Označite "
"potrditveno polje levo od vsake potencialne stranke, ki jo želite obnoviti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:205
msgid ""
"Once the desired leads have been selected, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` drop-down menu at the top of "
"the :guilabel:`Leads` page. From the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` "
"drop-down menu, select :guilabel:`Unarchive`."
msgstr ""
"Ko so želene potencialne stranke izbrane, kliknite spustni meni :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Dejanja` na vrhu strani :guilabel:`Potencialne stranke`. V "
"spustnem meniju :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Dejanja` "
"izberite :guilabel:`Razveljavi arhiviranje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:209
msgid ""
"Doing so removes those selected leads from the :guilabel:`Leads` page "
"because they no longer fit the :guilabel:`Lost` filter criteria. Delete "
"the :guilabel:`Lost` filter from the search bar to reveal these newly-"
"restored leads."
msgstr ""
"S tem so izbrane potencialne stranke odstranjene s "
"strani :guilabel:`Potencialne stranke`, ker ne ustrezajo več kriterijem "
"filtra :guilabel:`Izgubljeno`. Izbrišite filter :guilabel:`Izgubljeno` iz "
"iskalne vrstice, da prikažete te na novo obnovljene potencialne stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/lost_opportunities.rst:214
msgid ":doc:`../performance/win_loss`"
msgstr ":doc:`../performance/win_loss`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Learn how to create and manage multiple sales teams in the Odoo CRM app, "
"including adding team members with or without rule-based assignment, "
"enabling multi teams, using the sales team dashboard, and switching between "
"teams in the CRM pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Spoznajte, kako ustvariti in upravljati več prodajnih ekip v aplikaciji Odoo "
"CRM, vključno z dodajanjem članov ekipe z dodeljevanjem na podlagi pravil "
"ali brez njega, omogočanjem več ekip, uporabo nadzorne plošče prodajne ekipe "
"in preklapljanjem med ekipami v prodajnem lijaku CRM."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:8
msgid "Manage sales teams"
msgstr "Upravljanje prodajnih ekip"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:10
msgid ""
"The *Sales Teams* feature within Odoo's **CRM** app allows for the creation "
"and management of multiple sales teams, each with their own assignment "
"rules, invoicing targets, and roster of salespeople. This in turn makes it "
"easy to have different sales teams for different regions, different "
"languages, different compensation structures, performance tracking purposes, "
"and more."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija *Prodajne ekipe* v Odoo aplikaciji **CRM** omogoča ustvarjanje in "
"upravljanje več prodajnih ekip, vsaka s svojimi pravili dodeljevanja, cilji "
"fakturiranja in seznamom prodajalcev. To omogoča, da imate različne prodajne "
"ekipe za različne regije, različne jezike, različne strukture nadomestil, "
"namene sledenja uspešnosti in več."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:18
msgid "Create a sales team"
msgstr "Ustvarite prodajno ekipo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:20
msgid ""
"To create a new sales team, go to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration "
"--> Sales Teams`, then click :guilabel:`New`. On the blank sales team form, "
"enter a name in the :guilabel:`Sales Team` field. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Pipeline` or :guilabel:`Leads` box to ensure that leads and "
"opportunities can be assigned to the sales team."
msgstr ""
"Če želite ustvariti novo prodajno ekipo, pojdite na "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> Konfiguracija --> Prodajne ekipe`, nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`. V prazen obrazec prodajne ekipe vnesite ime v "
"polje :guilabel:`Prodajna ekipa`. Označite polje :guilabel:`Prodajni lijak` "
"ali :guilabel:`Indici`, da zagotovite možnost dodelitve indicev in "
"priložnosti prodajni ekipi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:25
msgid "Next, select a :guilabel:`Team Leader` from the drop-down list."
msgstr "Nato izberite :guilabel:`Vodjo ekipe` s spustnega seznama."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:27
msgid ""
"Set an :guilabel:`Email Alias` to automatically generate a lead/opportunity "
"for this sales team whenever a message is sent to that unique email address. "
"Choose whether to accept emails "
"from :guilabel:`Everyone`, :guilabel:`Authenticated "
"Partners`, :guilabel:`Followers only`, or :guilabel:`Authenticated "
"Employees`."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite :guilabel:`Vzdevek e-pošte`, da samodejno ustvarite možnega kupca/"
"priložnost za to prodajno ekipo, kadar koli je sporočilo poslano na ta "
"edinstveni e-poštni naslov. Izberite, ali želite sprejemati e-pošto "
"od :guilabel:`Vseh`, :guilabel:`Overjenih partnerjev`, :guilabel:`Samo "
"sledilcev` ali :guilabel:`Overjenih zaposlenih`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:32
msgid ""
"For databases with multiple companies, select a :guilabel:`Company` from the "
"drop-down menu to assign this team to. Please note, this field is not "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Za zbirke podatkov z več podjetji izberite :guilabel:`Podjetje` iz spustnega "
"menija, da dodelite to ekipo. Upoštevajte, da to polje ni obvezno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:35
msgid ""
"If *Leads* have been enabled in the **CRM** app's Configuration settings, "
"two checkboxes appear that determine whether leads assigned to the sales "
"team should go directly into the pipeline or be set as leads first."
msgstr ""
"Če so *Potencialne stranke* omogočene v nastavitvah konfiguracije aplikacije "
"**CRM**, se pojavita dve potrditveni polji, ki določata, ali naj se "
"potencialne stranke, dodeljene prodajni ekipi, takoj uvrstijo v cevovod ali "
"naj bodo najprej nastavljene kot potencialne stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:39
msgid "The settings page for a new sales team."
msgstr "Stran z nastavitvami za novo prodajno ekipo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:43
msgid ""
"If the **Sales** app is installed on the database, an :guilabel:`Invoicing "
"Target` field appears on the sales team form. This is the revenue target for "
"the current month. The amount entered in this field is used to populate the "
"invoicing progress bar on the :ref:`sales team dashboard <crm/"
"manage_sales_teams/sales-team-dashboard>`."
msgstr ""
"Če je v zbirki podatkov nameščena aplikacija **Prodaja**, se na obrazcu "
"prodajne ekipe prikaže polje :guilabel:`Cilj izdaje računov`, ki predstavlja "
"ciljni prihodek za tekoči mesec. Znesek, vnesen v to polje, se uporablja za "
"prikaz vrstice napredka izdaje računov na :ref:`nadzorni plošči prodajne "
"ekipe <crm/manage_sales_teams/sales-team-dashboard>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:49
msgid "Add sales team members"
msgstr "Dodajte člane prodajne ekipe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:51
msgid ""
"The workflow for adding members to a sales team varies slightly if the *Rule-"
"Based Assignment* option is enabled in :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`. Both workflows begin on a sales team's "
"configuration page. By default, rule-based assignment is not enabled."
msgstr ""
"Postopek dodajanja članov v prodajno ekipo se nekoliko razlikuje, če je v "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve` omogočena "
"možnost *Dodeljevanje na podlagi pravil*. Oba postopka se začneta na "
"konfiguracijski strani prodajne ekipe. Dodeljevanje na podlagi pravil "
"privzeto ni omogočeno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:56
msgid "With rule-based assignment"
msgstr "Z dodeljevanjem na podlagi pravil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:58
msgid ""
"To add team members with rule-based assignment enabled, click "
"the :guilabel:`Add Sales Team Members` link under the *Members* tab. This "
"opens the *Create Sales Team Members* pop-up window. Assign a salesperson in "
"the title field and adjust their lead assignment rules if desired under the "
"*Lead Assignment* tab. Click the :guilabel:`Save & Close` button to finish, "
"or click :guilabel:`Save & New` to open a blank form and keep adding sales "
"team members."
msgstr ""
"Za dodajanje članov ekipe z omogočenim dodeljevanjem na podlagi pravil "
"kliknite povezavo :guilabel:`Dodaj člane prodajne ekipe` pod zavihkom "
"*Člani*. S tem se odpre pojavno okno *Ustvari člane prodajne ekipe*. V "
"naslovnem polju dodelite prodajalca in po želji prilagodite njegova pravila "
"za dodeljevanje indicev pod zavihkom *Dodeljevanje indicev*. Za zaključek "
"kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Shrani in zapri` ali pa kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani "
"in novo`, da odprete prazen obrazec in nadaljujete z dodajanjem članov "
"prodajne ekipe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:65
msgid ""
"When using rule-based assignments, Odoo automatically limits the maximum "
"number of leads an individual team member can be assigned in a day. This "
"limit is determined by the number in the :guilabel:`Capacity` field and is "
"equal to that number divided by 30 (for the number of days in the period). "
"**This may result in leads going unassigned if all sales team members' daily "
"capacity has been met.**"
msgstr ""
"Pri uporabi dodeljevanja na podlagi pravil Odoo samodejno omeji največje "
"število potencialnih strank, ki jih je mogoče dodeliti posameznemu članu "
"ekipe na dan. Ta omejitev je določena s številko v polju "
":guilabel:`Kapaciteta` in je enaka tej številki deljeno s 30 (za število dni "
"v obdobju). **To lahko povzroči, da potencialne stranke ostanejo "
"nedodeljene, če je dnevna kapaciteta vseh članov prodajne ekipe izpolnjena.**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:72
msgid ""
"Sales team member John Doe has a :guilabel:`Capacity` maximum of 120 leads "
"in a 30-day period. This means that the database automatically assigns John "
"a maximum of 4 leads per day. If John were the only member of the sales team "
"and 10 leads were created in a single day, only 4 would be assigned to him. "
"The other 6 would go unassigned."
msgstr ""
"Član prodajne ekipe Janez Novak ima največjo :guilabel:`Kapaciteto` 120 "
"potencialnih strank v 30-dnevnem obdobju. To pomeni, da baza podatkov Janezu "
"samodejno dodeli največ 4 potencialne stranke na dan. Če bi bil Janez edini "
"član prodajne ekipe in bi bilo v enem dnevu ustvarjenih 10 potencialnih "
"strank, bi mu bilo dodeljenih le 4. Preostalih 6 bi ostalo nedodeljenih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:77
msgid ""
"If it's necessary to prevent this salesperson from being automatically "
"assigned leads, click the :guilabel:`Pause assignment` checkbox. If auto "
"assignment is paused, the salesperson can still be assigned leads manually."
msgstr ""
"Če želite preprečiti samodejno dodeljevanje indicev temu prodajalcu, "
"označite potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Zaustavi dodeljevanje`. Če je "
"samodejno dodeljevanje začasno ustavljeno, je prodajalcu še vedno mogoče "
"ročno dodeljevati indice."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:81
msgid ""
"The Create Sales Team Members pop-up window with Maggie Davidson about to be "
"added."
msgstr ""
"Pojavno okno Ustvari člane prodajne ekipe, v katerem bo dodana Maggie "
"Davidson."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:84
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Leads (30 days)` graphic on the sales team members' cards "
"tracks how many leads a salesperson has been assigned in the past thirty "
"days for this team relative to the maximum number that they should be "
"assigned. A sales team member's maximum number of leads may be set on their "
"*Open: Sales Team Members* form."
msgstr ""
"Grafika :guilabel:`Potencialne stranke (30 dni)` na karticah članov prodajne "
"ekipe sledi, koliko potencialnih strank je bilo prodajalcu dodeljenih v "
"zadnjih tridesetih dneh za to ekipo glede na največje število, ki bi mu "
"moralo biti dodeljeno. Največje število potencialnih strank člana prodajne "
"ekipe je mogoče nastaviti na njegovem obrazcu :guilabel:`Odpri: Člani "
"prodajne ekipe`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:90
msgid ""
":doc:`Assignment rules <../track_leads/lead_scoring>` can be configured for "
"individual salespeople using the *Domain* section."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Pravila dodeljevanja <../track_leads/lead_scoring>` je mogoče "
"konfigurirati za posamezne prodajalce v razdelku *Domena*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:94
msgid "Without rule-based assignment"
msgstr "Brez dodeljevanja na podlagi pravil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:96
msgid ""
"To add team members without rule-based assignment enabled, click "
"the :guilabel:`+ Add Sales Team Members` link under the *Members* tab. This "
"opens the *Add: Salespersons* pop-up window. Click the checkbox to the left "
"of the salesperson to be added to the team, then click :guilabel:`Select`. "
"New salespersons can be created from this window by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`New` button, as well."
msgstr ""
"Za dodajanje članov ekipe brez omogočene dodelitve na podlagi pravil "
"kliknite povezavo :guilabel:`Dodaj prodajalce` na zavihku :guilabel:`Člani`. "
"Odpre se pojavno okno :guilabel:`Dodaj: Prodajalci`. Označite potrditveno "
"polje levo od prodajalca, ki ga želite dodati ekipi, nato kliknite "
":guilabel:`Izberi`. Nove prodajalce je mogoče ustvariti tudi iz tega okna s "
"klikom na gumb :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:101
msgid ""
"The Add: Salespersons pop-up window on a new sales team with Mitchell Admin "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Pojavno okno Dodaj: Prodajalci na novi prodajni ekipi z izbranim Mitchell "
"Admin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:104
msgid ""
"If creating a new salesperson, click :guilabel:`Save & Close` when finished, "
"or :guilabel:`Save & New` to add additional members."
msgstr ""
"Če ustvarjate novega prodajalca, kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani in zapri`, ko "
"končate, ali :guilabel:`Shrani in novo`, da dodate dodatne člane."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:108
msgid "Enable multi teams"
msgstr "Omogočite več ekip"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:110
msgid ""
"To allow salespeople to be assigned to more than one sales team, the *Multi "
"Teams* setting needs to be enabled. First, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM "
"app --> Configuration --> Settings`. Under the *CRM* section, click the "
"checkbox labeled :guilabel:`Multi Teams`. Then, click :guilabel:`Save` at "
"the top of the page. Salespeople may then be assigned to multiple teams at "
"the same time without having to be manually moved between team pipelines."
msgstr ""
"Če želite prodajalcem omogočiti dodelitev v več kot eno prodajno ekipo, mora "
"biti omogočena nastavitev *Več ekip*. Najprej pojdite na "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`. V razdelku "
"*CRM* označite potrditveno polje z oznako :guilabel:`Več ekip`. Nato na vrhu "
"strani kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`. Prodajalce lahko nato hkrati dodelite v "
"več ekip, ne da bi jih bilo treba ročno premikati med prodajnimi lijaki ekip."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:119
msgid "Sales team dashboard"
msgstr "Nadzorna plošča prodajne ekipe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:121
msgid ""
"To view the sales team dashboard, go to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Sales --"
"> Teams`. Any team the user is a member of appears in the dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled nadzorne plošče prodajne ekipe pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> Prodaja --> Ekipe`. Vsaka ekipa, "
"katere član je uporabnik, se prikaže na nadzorni plošči."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:124
msgid "The sales team dashboard in the CRM app."
msgstr "Nadzorna plošča prodajne ekipe v aplikaciji CRM."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:127
msgid ""
"Click on the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon in "
"the top-right corner of team's card to open a drop-down menu. Then, to view "
"or edit the team's settings, click :guilabel:`Configuration`."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(navpična tri pičica)` v "
"zgornjem desnem kotu kartice ekipe, da odprete spustni meni. Nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Konfiguracija`, da si ogledate ali uredite nastavitve "
"ekipe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:132
msgid "View teams in the pipeline"
msgstr "Ogled ekip v prodajnem lijaku"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:134
msgid ""
"On the CRM pipeline, a drop-down labeled :guilabel:`All Teams` allows for "
"rapidly switching between defined salesteams. Click the drop-down menu to "
"choose from teams. Teams may be :ref:`created <crm/manage_sales_teams/create-"
"sales-team>` or deleted from this drop-down by clicking :guilabel:`Manage "
"Teams`."
msgstr ""
"V prodajnem lijaku CRM spustni meni z oznako :guilabel:`Vse ekipe` omogoča "
"hitro preklapljanje med definiranimi prodajnimi ekipami. Kliknite spustni "
"meni, da izberete ekipo. V tem spustnem meniju lahko ekipe tudi "
":ref:`ustvarite <crm/manage_sales_teams/create-sales-team>` ali izbrišete s "
"klikom na :guilabel:`Upravljaj ekipe`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:139
msgid "The expanded All Teams drop-down menu."
msgstr "Razširjen spustni meni Vse ekipe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/manage_sales_teams.rst:143
msgid ":doc:`../optimize/utilize_activities`"
msgstr ":doc:`../optimize/utilize_activities`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:3
msgid "Merge similar leads and opportunities"
msgstr "Združite podobne potencialne stranke in priložnosti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically detects similar *leads* and *opportunities* within the "
"*CRM* app. Identifying these duplicated records allows them to be merged "
"without losing any information in the process. Not only does this help keep "
"the *pipeline* organized, but it also prevents customers from being "
"contacted by more than one salesperson."
msgstr ""
"Odoo samodejno zazna podobne *potencialne stranke* in *priložnosti* v "
"aplikaciji *CRM*. Prepoznavanje teh podvojenih zapisov omogoča njihovo "
"združevanje brez izgube kakršnih koli informacij med postopkom. To ne pomaga "
"le pri organiziranosti *cevovoda*, temveč tudi preprečuje, da bi stranke "
"kontaktirala več kot ena oseba s prodaje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:11
msgid ""
"When merging opportunities, no information is lost. Data from the other "
"opportunity is logged in the chatter, and the information fields, for "
"reference."
msgstr ""
"Pri združevanju priložnosti se ne izgubi nobena informacija. Podatki iz "
"druge priložnosti so zabeleženi v klepetu in poljih z informacijami za "
"referenco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:15
msgid "Identify similar leads and opportunities"
msgstr "Prepoznajte podobne potencialne stranke in priložnosti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:17
msgid ""
"Similar leads and opportunities are identified by comparing the *email "
"address* and *phone number* of the associated contact. If a similar lead/"
"opportunity is found, a *Similar Leads* smart button appears at the top of "
"the lead (or opportunity) record."
msgstr ""
"Podobne potencialne stranke in priložnosti se prepoznajo s primerjavo *e-"
"poštnega naslova* in *telefonske številke* povezanega kontakta. Če je "
"najdena podobna potencialna stranka/priložnost, se na vrhu zapisa "
"potencialne stranke (ali priložnosti) prikaže pametno gumb *Podobne "
"potencialne stranke*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:21
msgid "An opportunity record with emphasis on the Similar Leads smart button."
msgstr ""
"Zapis priložnosti s poudarkom na pametnem gumbu Podobne potencialne stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:26
msgid "Comparing similar leads and opportunities"
msgstr "Primerjava podobnih priložnosti in potencialnih strank"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:28
msgid ""
"To compare the details of similar leads/opportunities, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Pipeline` or :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Leads`. Open a lead or opportunity, and click the :guilabel:`Similar Leads` "
"smart button. Doing so opens a Kanban view that only displays similar leads/"
"opportunities. Click on a card to view the details for the lead/opportunity, "
"and confirm if they should be merged."
msgstr ""
"Za primerjavo podrobnosti podobnih priložnosti/potencialnih strank se "
"pomaknite na :menuselection:`CRM app --> Pipeline` ali :menuselection:`CRM "
"app --> Leads`. Odprite priložnost ali potencialno stranko in kliknite "
"pametni gumb :guilabel:`Similar Leads`. S tem odprete pogled Kanban, ki "
"prikazuje samo podobne priložnosti/potencialne stranke. Kliknite kartico, da "
"si ogledate podrobnosti za priložnost/potencialno stranko in potrdite, ali "
"naj se združijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:38
msgid ""
"When merging, Odoo gives priority to whichever lead/opportunity was created "
"in the system first, merging the information into the first created lead/"
"opportunity. However, if a lead and an opportunity are being merged, the "
"resulting record is referred to as an opportunity, regardless of which "
"record was created first."
msgstr ""
"Pri združevanju Odoo daje prednost potencialni stranki/priložnosti, ki je "
"bila najprej ustvarjena v sistemu, in združi informacije v najprej "
"ustvarjeno potencialno stranko/priložnost. Če pa se združujeta potencialna "
"stranka in priložnost, se dobljeni zapis imenuje priložnost, ne glede na to, "
"kateri zapis je bil ustvarjen prvi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:43
msgid ""
"After confirming that the leads/opportunities should be merged, return to "
"the Kanban view using the breadcrumb link, or by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Similar Leads` smart button. Click the :icon:`oi-view-"
"list` :guilabel:`(list)` icon to change to list view."
msgstr ""
"Ko potrdite, da naj se priložnosti/potencialne stranke združijo, se vrnite "
"na pogled Kanban s povezavo v drobtinah ali s klikom na pametni "
"gumb :guilabel:`Similar Leads`. Kliknite ikono :icon:`oi-view-"
"list` :guilabel:`(list)`, da preklopite na pogled seznama."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:47
msgid ""
"Check the box on the left of the page for the leads/opportunities to be "
"merged. Then, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` icon at the top "
"of the page, to reveal a drop-down menu. From that drop-down menu, select "
"the :guilabel:`Merge` option to merge the selected opportunities or leads."
msgstr ""
"Označite polje na levi strani spletne strani za priložnosti/potencialne "
"stranke, ki naj se združijo. Nato kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` na vrhu strani, da prikažete spustni meni. Iz "
"spustnega menija izberite možnost :guilabel:`Merge`, da združite izbrane "
"priložnosti ali potencialne stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:52
msgid ""
"When :guilabel:`Merge` is selected from the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` drop-down menu, a :guilabel:`Merge` pop-up modal "
"appears. In that pop-up modal, under the :guilabel:`Assign opportunities to` "
"heading, select a :guilabel:`Salesperson` and :guilabel:`Sales Team` from "
"the appropriate drop-down menus."
msgstr ""
"Ko je iz spustnega menija :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` izbrana "
"možnost :guilabel:`Merge`, se pojavi pojavno okno :guilabel:`Merge`. V tem "
"pojavnem oknu pod naslovom :guilabel:`Assign opportunities to` "
"izberite :guilabel:`Salesperson` in :guilabel:`Sales Team` iz ustreznih "
"spustnih menijev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:57
msgid ""
"Below those fields, the leads/opportunities to merge are listed, along with "
"their related information. To merge those selected leads/opportunities, "
"click :guilabel:`Merge`."
msgstr ""
"Pod temi polji so navedene priložnosti/potencialne stranke, ki naj se "
"združijo, skupaj z njihovimi povezanimi informacijami. Za združitev izbranih "
"priložnosti/potencialnih strank kliknite :guilabel:`Merge`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:60
msgid ""
"List of similar leads and opportunities selected for merge in the CRM app."
msgstr ""
"Seznam podobnih priložnosti in potencialnih strank, izbranih za združitev v "
"aplikaciji CRM."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:65
msgid ""
"Merging is an irreversible action. Do **not** merge leads/opportunities "
"unless absolutely certain they should be combined."
msgstr ""
"Združevanje je nepreklicno dejanje. Priložnosti/potencialnih strank **ne** "
"združujte, razen če ste popolnoma prepričani, da jih je treba združiti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:69
msgid "When leads/opportunities should not be merged"
msgstr "Kdaj priložnosti in potencialnih strank ne smete združiti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:71
msgid ""
"There may be instances where a similar lead or opportunity is identified, "
"but should *not* be merged. These circumstances vary, based on the processes "
"of the sales team and organization. Some potential scenarios are listed "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Obstajajo lahko primeri, ko je podobna priložnost ali potencialna stranka "
"identificirana, vendar je *ne* smete združiti. Te okoliščine se razlikujejo "
"glede na procese prodajne ekipe in organizacije. Spodaj je navedenih nekaj "
"možnih scenarijev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:76
msgid "Lost leads"
msgstr "Izgubljene potencialne stranke"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:78
msgid ""
"If a lead/opportunity has been marked as :doc:`lost <lost_opportunities>`, "
"it can still be merged with an active lead or opportunity. The resulting "
"lead/opportunity is marked active, and added to the pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Če je bila priložnost/potencialna stranka označena kot :doc:`lost "
"<lost_opportunities>`, jo je še vedno mogoče združiti z aktivno priložnostjo "
"ali potencialno stranko. Nastala priložnost/potencialna stranka je označena "
"kot aktivna in dodana v linijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:83
msgid "Different contact within an organization"
msgstr "Različna kontaktna oseba znotraj organizacije"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:85
msgid ""
"Leads/opportunities from the same organization, but with different points of "
"contact, may not have the same needs. In this case, it is beneficial to "
"*not* merge these records, though assigning the same salesperson, or sales "
"team, can prevent duplicated work and miscommunication."
msgstr ""
"Priložnosti/potencialne stranke iz iste organizacije, vendar z različnimi "
"kontaktnimi točkami, morda nimajo enakih potreb. V tem primeru je koristno, "
"da teh zapisov *ne* združite, čeprav lahko dodelitev istega prodajalca ali "
"prodajne ekipe prepreči podvojeno delo in napačno komunikacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:90
msgid "Existing duplicates with more than one salesperson"
msgstr "Obstoječi podvojeni zapisi z več kot enim prodajalcem"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:92
msgid ""
"If more than one lead/opportunity exists in the database, there may be "
"multiple salespeople assigned to them, who are actively working on them "
"independently. While these leads/opportunities may need to be managed "
"separately, it is recommended that any affected salespeople be tagged in an "
"internal note for visibility."
msgstr ""
"Če v zbirki podatkov obstaja več kot ena priložnost/potencialna stranka, jim "
"je morda dodeljenih več prodajalcev, ki neodvisno aktivno delajo na njih. "
"Čeprav je morda treba te priložnosti/potencialne stranke upravljati ločeno, "
"je priporočljivo, da označite vse prizadete prodajalce v interni opombi za "
"preglednost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:98
msgid "Contact information is similar but not exact"
msgstr "Kontaktni podatki so podobni, vendar ne enaki"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:100
msgid ""
"Similar leads and opportunities are identified by comparing the email "
"addresses and phone numbers of the associated contacts. However, if the "
"email address is *similar*, but not *exact*, they may need to remain "
"independent."
msgstr ""
"Podobne priložnosti in potencialne stranke se identificirajo s primerjavo e-"
"poštnih naslovov in telefonskih številk povezanih stikov. Vendar če je e-"
"poštni naslov *podoben*, vendar ne *enak*, morda morajo ostati neodvisni."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:105
msgid ""
"Three different leads were added to the pipeline and assigned to different "
"salespeople. They were identified as *Similar Leads* due to the email "
"addresses of the contacts."
msgstr ""
"Tri različne potencialne stranke so bile dodane v linijo in dodeljene "
"različnim prodajalcem. Identificirane so bile kot *Similar Leads* zaradi e-"
"poštnih naslovov stikov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:108
msgid ""
"Two of the leads appear to come from the same individual, `Robin`, and have "
"identical email addresses. These leads should be merged."
msgstr ""
"Dve izmed potencialnih strank izvirata iz iste osebe, `Robin`, in imata "
"enaki e-poštni naslovi. Ti potencialni stranki je treba združiti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:111
msgid ""
"The third lead has the same email domain, but the address is different, as "
"is the contact name. While this lead is most likely from the same "
"organization, it is from a different contact, and should **not** be merged."
msgstr ""
"Tretja potencialna stranka ima isto e-poštno domeno, vendar je naslov "
"drugačen, prav tako tudi ime stika. Čeprav je ta potencialna stranka "
"najverjetneje iz iste organizacije, gre za drugačen stik in je **ne smete** "
"združiti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/pipeline/merge_similar.rst:115
msgid ""
"List of similar leads with emphasis on the contact information in the CRM "
"app."
msgstr ""
"Seznam podobnih potencialnih strank s poudarkom na kontaktnih podatkih v "
"aplikaciji CRM."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads.rst:5
msgid "Assign and track leads"
msgstr "Dodelitev in sledenje potencialnim strankam"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:3
msgid "Lead distribution report"
msgstr "Poročilo o porazdelitvi potencialnih strank"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:5
msgid ""
"A *lead distribution report* can be used to see if active leads are being "
"assigned equitably across sales members. It can also be used to view the "
"distribution of good or :doc:`quality leads <quality_leads_report>`, and see "
"how frequently each salesperson is receiving (and keeping) leads."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite lahko *poročilo o porazdelitvi potencialnih strank*, da preverite, "
"ali se aktivne potencialne stranke pravično dodeljujejo med prodajnimi "
"člani. Uporabite ga lahko tudi za ogled porazdelitve dobrih "
"ali :doc:`kakovostnih potencialnih strank <quality_leads_report>` in za "
"pregled, kako pogosto posamezen prodajalec prejema (in obdrži) potencialne "
"stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:9
msgid ""
"Lead distribution reports can be run each week to help keep salespeople on "
"track, while providing them with ample good leads. These reports can also be "
"used to see whether sales members are staying productive, if good leads are "
"being lost too often by one salesperson, and what percentage of good leads "
"are being retained overall."
msgstr ""
"Poročila o porazdelitvi potencialnih strank je mogoče izvajati vsak teden, "
"da prodajalci ostanejo na pravi poti in hkrati prejmejo dovolj dobrih "
"potencialnih strank. Ta poročila lahko uporabite tudi za pregled, ali "
"prodajni člani ostajajo produktivni, če en prodajalec prepogosto izgublja "
"dobre potencialne stranke in kolikšen odstotek dobrih potencialnih strank se "
"v celoti obdrži."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:15
msgid "Create lead distribution reports"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje poročil o porazdelitvi potencialnih strank"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:17
msgid ""
"To create a lead distribution report, first navigate to :menuselection:`CRM "
"app --> Reporting --> Pipeline`, which reveals the :guilabel:`Pipeline "
"Analysis` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje poročila o porazdelitvi potencialnih strank najprej "
"odprite :menuselection:`aplikacija CRM --> Poročanje --> Prodajni lijak`, "
"kar prikaže nadzorno plošco :guilabel:`Analiza prodajnega lijaka`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:20
msgid ""
"Remove all the default filters in the search bar at the top of the page. "
"Doing so displays data related to *all* leads."
msgstr ""
"Odstranite vse privzete filtre v iskalni vrstici na vrhu strani. S tem se "
"prikažejo podatki o *vseh* potencialnih strankah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:23
msgid ""
":ref:`Custom filters <search/custom-filters>` can now be added by clicking "
"the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down caret)` icon, to the right of the "
"search bar, to reveal a drop-down menu of search and filter options."
msgstr ""
"Zdaj lahko dodate :ref:`filtre po meri <search/custom-filters>` tako, da "
"kliknete ikono :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(puščica navzdol)` na desni "
"strani iskalne vrstice, da se prikaže spustni meni z možnostmi iskanja in "
"filtriranja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:27
msgid ""
"Three columns are displayed: :ref:`Filters <search/filters>`, :ref:`Group By "
"<search/group>`, and :ref:`Favorites <search/favorites>`. To begin, navigate "
"to the bottom of the :guilabel:`Filters` column, and click :guilabel:`Add "
"Custom Filter`. This opens an :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` pop-up window, "
"where the essential filters can be added one at a time."
msgstr ""
"Prikazani so trije stolpci: :ref:`Filtri <search/filters>`, :ref:`Združi po "
"<search/group>` in :ref:`Priljubljene <search/favorites>`. Za začetek "
"pojdite na dno stolpca :guilabel:`Filtri` in kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj "
"filter po meri`. To odpre pojavno okno :guilabel:`Dodaj filter po meri`, "
"kjer lahko posamezno dodate bistvene filtre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:35
msgid "Essential filters"
msgstr "Bistveni filtri"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:37
msgid ""
"The following filter conditions are used to create a basic lead distribution "
"report. Together they gather all leads created within a certain timespan "
"that have an associated contact method and have been assigned to a sales "
"team."
msgstr ""
"Naslednji pogoji filtriranja se uporabljajo za ustvarjanje osnovnega "
"poročila o porazdelitvi potencialnih strank. Skupaj zberejo vse potencialne "
"stranke, ustvarjene v določenem časovnem obdobju, ki imajo povezano "
"kontaktno metodo in so dodeljene prodajni ekipi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:42
msgid "Lead creation date"
msgstr "Datum ustvarjanja potencialne stranke"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:44
msgid ""
"Click the first field, under :guilabel:`Match any of the following rules:`, "
"that has the value :guilabel:`Country` in it. In the popover that appears, "
"type `Created on` in the search bar, or scroll to search through the list to "
"locate and select it."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite prvo polje pod :guilabel:`Ujemanje s katerim koli od naslednjih "
"pravil:`, ki ima vrednost :guilabel:`Država`. V pojavnem oknu, ki se "
"prikaže, vnesite `Created on` v iskalno vrstico ali se pomaknite po seznamu, "
"da ga poiščete in izberete."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:48
msgid ""
"Then, in the second field of that row, select :guilabel:`>=` from the drop-"
"down menu. This operator **only** includes values greater than (or equal to) "
"the value in the third, rightmost field."
msgstr ""
"Nato v drugem polju te vrstice v spustnem meniju izberite :guilabel:`>=`. Ta "
"operator vključuje **samo** vrednosti, večje od (ali enake) vrednosti v "
"tretjem, skrajno desnem polju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:51
msgid ""
"The third field on the :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` pop-up window should "
"contain the earliest date leads are selected from."
msgstr ""
"Tretje polje v pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Dodaj filter po meri` mora vsebovati "
"najzgodnejši datum, od katerega se izberejo potencialne stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:54
msgid ""
"For example, setting `01/01/2024 00:00:00` only includes leads created from, "
"and including, the first day of 2024."
msgstr ""
"Na primer, nastavitev `01/01/2024 00:00:00` vključuje samo potencialne "
"stranke, ustvarjene od prvega dne leta 2024 (vključno)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:57
msgid "Add a Created On rule for the start of the year onward."
msgstr "Dodajte pravilo Created On za začetek leta naprej."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:64
msgid "Sales team"
msgstr "Prodajna ekipa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:66
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New rule` to add another row to the form, and "
"choose :guilabel:`Sales Team` for this rule's parameter. Then, click the "
"second field of the new rule, and select :guilabel:`contains` from the drop-"
"down menu. Selecting this operator filters for any records that contain the "
"words in the third, rightmost field."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Novo pravilo`, da obrazcu dodate novo vrstico, in "
"izberite :guilabel:`Prodajna ekipa` za parameter tega pravila. Nato kliknite "
"drugo polje novega pravila in iz spustnega menija "
"izberite :guilabel:`vsebuje`. Izbira tega operatorja filtrira zapise, ki "
"vsebujejo besede v tretjem, skrajno desnem polju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:72
msgid ""
"For certain pre-determined, limited choices like a sales team, "
"the :guilabel:`is in` operator helps make for an easier and more accurate "
"selection, via a drop-down menu in the third field, instead of risking a "
"typo or incorrect value in the text box field that accompanies "
"the :guilabel:`contains` operator."
msgstr ""
"Za določene vnaprej določene, omejene izbire, kot je prodajna ekipa, "
"operator :guilabel:`je v` omogoča lažjo in natančnejšo izbiro prek spustnega "
"menija v tretjem polju, namesto da bi tvegali tipkarsko napako ali napačno "
"vrednost v besedilnem polju, ki spremlja operator :guilabel:`vsebuje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:77
msgid ""
"In this third field, enter the name of the desired sales team(s) that are to "
"be included in the report. It is important for all :guilabel:`contains` "
"argument values to be specific enough and spelled correctly as they exist in "
"Odoo, otherwise this risks returning multiple (or zero) values."
msgstr ""
"V to tretje polje vnesite ime želene prodajne ekipe (ekip), ki naj bodo "
"vključene v poročilo. Pomembno je, da so vse vrednosti "
"argumenta :guilabel:`vsebuje` dovolj specifične in pravilno črkane, kot "
"obstajajo v Odoo, sicer obstaja tveganje vrnitve več (ali nič) vrednosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:81
msgid "Use Sales Team to filter the location the lead is associated with."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite Prodajna ekipa za filtriranje lokacije, s katero je povezana "
"potencialna stranka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:86
msgid ""
"By adding more than one rule to the form, a new option emerges at the top of "
"the pop-up window above all the filters, to specify "
"whether :guilabel:`any` :icon:`fa-caret-down` or :guilabel:`all` :icon:`fa-"
"caret-down` of the conditions should match. This distinction is important to "
"set correctly, as it impacts the driving logic of how the filters return "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Z dodajanjem več kot enega pravila obrazcu se nad vsemi filtri na vrhu "
"pojavnega okna prikaže nova možnost, da določite, ali naj se "
"ujema :guilabel:`katera koli` :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
"ali :guilabel:`vsi` :icon:`fa-caret-down` pogoji. To razlikovanje je "
"pomembno pravilno nastaviti, saj vpliva na logiko delovanja, kako filtri "
"vračajo podatke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:91
msgid ""
"Click the default :guilabel:`any` :icon:`fa-caret-down` menu item and be "
"sure the :guilabel:`all` :icon:`fa-caret-down` option is chosen instead. "
"This setting will **only** show records that match *all* the rules contained "
"inside the form."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite privzeto postavko menija :guilabel:`katera koli` :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` in se prepričajte, da je namesto tega izbrana "
"možnost :guilabel:`vsi` :icon:`fa-caret-down`. Ta nastavitev bo prikazala "
"**samo** zapise, ki se ujemajo z *vsemi* pravili v obrazcu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:98
msgid "Contact method"
msgstr "Način stika"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:101
msgid ""
"The instruction below is not necessary, however, it's highly recommended to "
"add a set contact value to the report's search criteria. A lot of spam, "
"duplicate, or low quality leads can easily be screened out of the report "
"simply by adding either a set :guilabel:`Phone` or :guilabel:`Email` rule."
msgstr ""
"Spodnja navodila niso nujna, vendar je zelo priporočljivo dodati nastavljeno "
"vrednost stika v merila iskanja poročila. Veliko neželene pošte, podvojenih "
"ali slabo kakovostnih potencialnih strank je mogoče preprosto izločiti iz "
"poročila z dodajanjem pravila za nastavljeno :guilabel:`Telefon` "
"ali :guilabel:`E-pošta`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:106
msgid ""
"Add another :guilabel:`New rule` to the form and set the first field to the "
"first field to :guilabel:`Phone`. Then, select :guilabel:`is set` from the "
"drop-down menu in the second field. Selecting this operator **only** filters "
"for records that have a phone number associated with the lead."
msgstr ""
"Obrazcu dodajte še eno :guilabel:`Novo pravilo` in prvo polje nastavite "
"na :guilabel:`Telefon`. Nato iz spustnega menija v drugem polju "
"izberite :guilabel:`je nastavljeno`. Izbira tega operatorja filtrira "
"**samo** zapise, ki imajo s potencialno stranko povezano telefonsko številko."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:111
msgid ""
"Alternatively (or in addition to the above rule), click :guilabel:`New rule` "
"and set the first field to :guilabel:`Email`. Then, select :guilabel:`is "
"set` from the drop-down menu in the second field."
msgstr ""
"Alternativno (ali poleg zgornjega pravila) kliknite :guilabel:`Novo pravilo` "
"in prvo polje nastavite na :guilabel:`E-pošta`. Nato iz spustnega menija v "
"drugem polju izberite :guilabel:`je nastavljeno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:114
msgid ""
"These rules add only leads with an associated contact method to the report."
msgstr ""
"Ta pravila poročilu dodajo samo potencialne stranke s povezanim načinom "
"stika."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:119
msgid "Active status"
msgstr "Aktivni status"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:121
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`(Add branch)` icon to the right of "
"the `Phone is set` line, to add a new rule that branches from the rules "
"above."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`(Dodaj vejo)` desno od vrstice "
"`Telefon je nastavljeno`, da dodate novo pravilo, ki se razveji od zgornjih "
"pravil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:124
msgid ""
"Two horizontal sets of fields appear below a line "
"showing :guilabel:`any` :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`of:` option. This "
"setting filters for records that match **any** of the rules contained "
"inside. This uses the same logic as an OR (`|`) logical operator."
msgstr ""
"Pod vrstico, ki prikazuje možnost :guilabel:`katera koli` :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`od:`, se pojavita dva vodoravna niza polj. Ta nastavitev "
"filtrira zapise, ki se ujemajo s **katerim koli** pravil, vsebovanih "
"znotraj. To uporablja enako logiko kot logični operator ALI (`|`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:128
msgid ""
"Set the first field to :guilabel:`Active`. Then, select :guilabel:`is set` "
"in the next field."
msgstr ""
"Prvo polje nastavite na :guilabel:`Aktivno`. Nato v naslednjem polju "
"izberite :guilabel:`je nastavljeno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:130
msgid ""
"Next, click the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(Add New Rule)` button next "
"to :guilabel:`Active is set` to create a new line of fields beneath it."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite gumb :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(Dodaj novo pravilo)` "
"poleg :guilabel:`Aktivno je nastavljeno`, da pod njim ustvarite novo vrstico "
"polj."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:133
msgid ""
"Set the first field to :guilabel:`Active`. Then, select :guilabel:`is not "
"set` in the next field."
msgstr ""
"Prvo polje nastavite na :guilabel:`Aktivno`. Nato v naslednjem polju "
"izberite :guilabel:`ni nastavljeno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:135
msgid "Use Active to include active status in the report."
msgstr "Uporabite Aktivno, da v poročilo vključite aktivni status."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:139
msgid "This rule adds the activity status of the lead to the report."
msgstr "To pravilo poročilu doda status aktivnosti potencialne stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:142
msgid ""
"Active status is an important filter to include when creating a lead "
"distribution report because it includes **all** leads regardless of won/lost "
"or active/inactive status in the report. This provides a comprehensive view "
"of all the leads assigned to each sales member."
msgstr ""
"Aktivni status je pomemben filter, ki ga je treba vključiti pri ustvarjanju "
"poročila o distribuciji potencialnih strank, ker vključuje **vse** "
"potencialne stranke ne glede na status pridobljeno/izgubljeno ali aktivno/"
"neaktivno v poročilu. To omogoča celovit pregled vseh potencialnih strank, "
"dodeljenih posameznemu prodajnemu članu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:147
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:105
msgid "Group by"
msgstr "Združi po"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:149
msgid ""
"Once all filters are set, click the :guilabel:`Add` button to add these "
"filters to the search bar. To have the report grouped appropriately, click "
"the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down caret)` icon, to the right of the "
"search bar, and click :guilabel:`Salesperson` in the :guilabel:`Group By` "
"section. All results are now grouped by the salesperson assigned to each "
"lead."
msgstr ""
"Ko so vsi filtri nastavljeni, kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Dodaj`, da dodate te "
"filtre v iskalno vrstico. Da bo poročilo ustrezno združeno, kliknite "
"ikono :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(puščica navzdol)` na desni strani "
"iskalne vrstice in kliknite :guilabel:`Prodajalec` v "
"razdelku :guilabel:`Združi po`. Vsi rezultati so zdaj združeni po "
"prodajalcu, dodeljenem vsaki potencialni stranki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:154
msgid ""
"Once the rules for the filter are set, click the purple :guilabel:`Confirm` "
"button at the bottom of the pop-up menu to save the custom filter and close "
"the pop-up menu."
msgstr ""
"Ko so pravila za filter nastavljena, kliknite vijoлиčni "
"gumb :guilabel:`Potrdi` na dnu pojavnega menija, da shranite filter po meri "
"in zaprete pojavni meni."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:157
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Pipeline Analysis` dashboard is now displayed again with each "
"filter rule in the search bar."
msgstr ""
"Nadzorna plošča :guilabel:`Analiza prodajnega lijaka` je zdaj ponovno "
"prikazana z vsakim pravilom filtra v iskalni vrstici."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:160
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(Graph)` icon, to the right of "
"the search bar, to view the report as a bar chart. Alternatively, click "
"the :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(List)` icon to view leads in a grouped "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(Graf)` na desni strani "
"iskalne vrstice, da si poročilo ogledate kot stolpčni grafikon. Drugače "
"kliknite ikono :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(Seznam)`, da si potencialne "
"stranke ogledate v združenem seznamu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:165
msgid ""
"To save the filter so it can easily be re-applied, click the :guilabel:`Save "
"current search` button in the :guilabel:`Favorites` section of the search "
"bar drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Če želite shraniti filter, da ga je mogoče enostavno ponovno uporabiti, "
"kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Shrani trenutno iskanje` v "
"razdelku :guilabel:`Priljubljene` spustnega menija iskalne vrstice."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:168
msgid ""
"Next, type a name for the filter in the text box below. Check "
"the :guilabel:`Shared` checkbox to have the filter shared with any user with "
"access to the pipeline. Finally, click the purple :guilabel:`Save` button "
"below to save the filter."
msgstr ""
"Nato vnesite ime za filter v spodnje besedilno polje. Označite potrditveno "
"polje :guilabel:`V skupni rabi`, da bo filter v skupni rabi z vsemi "
"uporabniki, ki imajo dostop do prodajnega lijaka. Nazadnje kliknite "
"vijoлиčni gumb :guilabel:`Shrani` spodaj, da shranite filter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:172
msgid ""
"The filter will now appear with the name it was given under "
"the :guilabel:`Favorites` section of the drop-down menu and can be re-"
"applied by clicking on it."
msgstr ""
"Filter se bo zdaj pojavil z imenom, ki mu je bilo dodeljeno, v "
"razdelku :guilabel:`Priljubljene` spustnega menija in ga je mogoče ponovno "
"uporabiti s klikom nanj."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:176
msgid "Filter for quality leads"
msgstr "Filtriranje za kakovostne potencialne stranke"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:178
msgid ""
"The following additional conditions are provided as an example of a *good*, "
"but *not comprehensive*, set of rules for finding quality leads. These "
"filters should be applied on top of the :ref:`crm/track_leads/essential-"
"filters` in the order specified to achieve a heavily-detailed filter."
msgstr ""
"Naslednji dodatni pogoji so podani kot primer *dobrega*, vendar *ne "
"izcrpnega* nabora pravil za iskanje kakovostnih potencialnih strank. Te "
"filtre je treba uporabiti poleg :ref:`crm/track_leads/essential-filters` v "
"navedenem vrstnem redu, da dosežete zelo podroben filter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:183
msgid ""
"**Referred-by:** Filter for referrals, such as by appointment or sales "
"member."
msgstr ""
"**Priporočil:** Filtrirajte po priporočilih, na primer po sestanku ali "
"prodajnem članu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:184
msgid ""
"**Source:** Filter for specific source UTMs, such as Facebook or LinkedIn."
msgstr ""
"**Vir:** Filtrirajte po določenih UTM virih, kot sta Facebook ali LinkedIn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:185
msgid "**Notes:** Filter for internal notes."
msgstr "**Opombe:** Filtrirajte po notranjih opombah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:186
msgid "**Tags:** Filter for categorical tags."
msgstr "**Oznake:** Filtrirajte po kategorijskih oznakah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:187
msgid ""
"**Email:** Filter for specific email domains, such as gmail.com or yahoo.com."
msgstr ""
"**E-pošta:** Filtrirajte po določenih e-poštnih domenah, kot sta gmail.com "
"ali yahoo.com."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:188
msgid ""
"**Salesperson:** Filter for leads associated with certain sales members."
msgstr ""
"**Prodajalec:** Filtrirajte po potencialnih strankah, povezanih z določenimi "
"prodajnimi člani."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:190
msgid ""
"These conditions can be added, removed, or modified to best fit the desired "
"information in the report."
msgstr ""
"Te pogoje je mogoče dodati, odstraniti ali spremeniti, da kar najbolje "
"ustrezajo želenim informacijam v poročilu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:194
msgid ":ref:`quality_leads_report/add-quality-rules`"
msgstr ":ref:`quality_leads_report/add-quality-rules`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:195
msgid ":doc:`../../../essentials/search`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../essentials/search`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:3
msgid "Assign leads with predictive lead scoring"
msgstr ""
"Dodelitev potencialnih strank s prediktivnim ocenjevanjem potencialnih strank"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Odoo **CRM** app can automatically assign leads/opportunities to sales "
"teams and salespeople. A standard practice is to assign leads based on the "
"probability of winning each lead. Companies can prioritize the leads that "
"are more likely to result in successful deals by quickly assigning them to "
"the appropriate salespeople."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija Odoo **CRM** lahko samodejno dodeli potencialne stranke/"
"priložnosti prodajnim ekipam in prodajalcem. Običajna praksa je dodelitev "
"potencialnih strank na podlagi verjetnosti uspeha vsake potencialne stranke. "
"Podjetja lahko dajo prednost potencialnim strankam, ki bodo verjetneje "
"vodile do uspešnih poslov, tako da jih hitro dodelijo ustreznim prodajalcem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:10
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically calculates the probability of winning each lead using a "
"method called *predictive lead scoring*."
msgstr ""
"Odoo samodejno izračuna verjetnost pridobitve vsakega potencialnega posla z "
"metodo, imenovano *napovedovanje točk potencialnih poslov*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:14
msgid "Predictive lead scoring"
msgstr "Napovedovanje točk potencialnih poslov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:16
msgid ""
"Predictive lead scoring is a machine-learning model that uses historical "
"data from Odoo **CRM** to score open leads/opportunities."
msgstr ""
"Napovedovanje ocenjevanja potencialnih strank je model strojnega učenja, ki "
"uporabljaHistorične podatke iz aplikacije Odoo **CRM** za ocenjevanje "
"odprtih potencialnih strank/priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:19
msgid ""
"As a company processes opportunities through the CRM pipeline, Odoo collects "
"data on which opportunities are won and lost. Predictive lead scoring uses "
"this data to predict the probability of winning each new lead or opportunity."
msgstr ""
"Ko podjetje obdeluje priložnosti skozi prodajni lijak CRM, Odoo zbira "
"podatke o tem, katere priložnosti so pridobljene in katere izgubljene. "
"Napovedovanje točk potencialnih poslov uporablja te podatke za napovedovanje "
"verjetnosti pridobitve vsakega novega potencialnega posla ali priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:23
msgid ""
"The more opportunities that are sent through the CRM pipeline, the more data "
"Odoo collects, resulting in more accurate probabilities."
msgstr ""
"Več priložnosti kot je poslanih skozi prodajni lijak CRM, več podatkov Odoo "
"zbere, kar vodi do natančnejših verjetnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:26
msgid ""
"Specifically, Odoo's predictive lead scoring uses the *naive Bayes* "
"probability model:"
msgstr ""
"Natančneje, napovedovanje točk potencialnih poslov v Odoo uporablja "
"verjetnostni model *naivni Bayes*:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:28
msgid ""
"\\begin{equation}\n"
"P(A | B) = \\frac{P(A) \\times P(B | A)}{P(B)}\n"
"\\end{equation}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{equation}\n"
"P(A | B) = \\frac{P(A) \\times P(B | A)}{P(B)}\n"
"\\end{equation}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:33
msgid "Breaking down the equation:"
msgstr "Razčlenitev enačbe:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:35
msgid "P(A|B) = The probability of a successful lead *in this case*"
msgstr "P(A|B) = Verjetnost uspešnega potencialnega posla *v tem primeru*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:36
msgid ""
"P(A) = The overall probability of a lead being successful regardless of the "
"conditions"
msgstr ""
"P(A) = Splošna verjetnost, da bo potencialni posel uspešen, ne glede na "
"pogoje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:37
msgid ""
"P(B|A) = The probability of this being the case given a lead is successful"
msgstr ""
"P(B|A) = Verjetnost, da je to primer, glede na to, da je potencialni posel "
"uspešen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:38
msgid "P(B) = The probability of this being the case"
msgstr "P(B) = Verjetnost, da je to primer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:40
msgid ""
"The term *in this case* refers to the variables that can affect a lead being "
"successful in Odoo. This can include variables such as the assigned "
"Salesperson, the source of the lead, the language of the lead, and other "
"historical and demographic data."
msgstr ""
"Izraz *v tem primeru* se nanaša na spremenljivke, ki lahko vplivajo na "
"uspešnost potencialnega posla v Odoo. To lahko vključuje spremenljivke, kot "
"so dodeljeni prodajalec, vir potencialnega posla, jezik potencialnega posla "
"ter druge zgodovinske in demografske podatke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:44
msgid ""
"Which variables are considered in this calculation can be :ref:`configured "
"<lead_scoring/configuration>` to tailor the calculation to each business's "
"needs."
msgstr ""
"Katere spremenljivke so upoštevane v tem izračunu, je "
"mogoče :ref:`konfigurirati <lead_scoring/configuration>`, da se izračun "
"prilagodi potrebam vsakega podjetja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:47
msgid ""
"The probability of success of each opportunity is displayed on the "
"opportunity form, and it updates automatically as the opportunity progresses "
"through the CRM pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Verjetnost uspeha vsake priložnosti je prikazana na obrazcu priložnosti in "
"se samodejno posodablja, ko priložnost napreduje skozi prodajni lijak CRM."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:50
msgid "The probability of success displayed on the opportunity form."
msgstr "Verjetnost uspeha, prikazana na obrazcu priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:53
msgid ""
"When an opportunity moves to the next stage, its probability of success "
"automatically increases according to the predictive lead scoring algorithm."
msgstr ""
"Ko priložnost preide v naslednjo fazo, se njena verjetnost uspeha samodejno "
"poveča v skladu z algoritmom napovedovanja točk potencialnih poslov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:61
msgid ""
"Predictive lead scoring is always active in Odoo **CRM**. However, the "
"variables used to calculate the probability of success can be customized in "
"the settings."
msgstr ""
"Napovedovanje ocenjevanja potencialnih strank je v aplikaciji Odoo **CRM** "
"vedno aktivno. Vendar pa je mogoče spremenljivke, ki se uporabljajo za "
"izračun verjetnosti uspeha, prilagoditi v nastavitvah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:64
msgid ""
"To customize the variables used by predictive lead scoring, go "
"to :menuselection:`CRM --> Configuration --> Settings`. "
"Under :guilabel:`Predictive Lead Scoring`, click on the :guilabel:`Update "
"Probabilities` button."
msgstr ""
"Če želite prilagoditi spremenljivke, ki jih uporablja napovedovanje točk "
"potencialnih poslov, pojdite na :menuselection:`CRM --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Nastavitve`. Pod :guilabel:`Napovedovanje točk potencialnih poslov` kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Posodobi verjetnosti`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:68
msgid ""
"Then, click on the drop-down menu and the :icon:`oi-"
"close` :guilabel:`(Delete)` icon to choose which variables the predictive "
"lead scoring feature takes into account."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite spustni meni in ikono :icon:`oi-close` :guilabel:`Izbriši`, da "
"izberete, katere spremenljivke upošteva funkcija napovednega ocenjevanja "
"potencialnih strank."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:71
msgid ""
"The Update Probabilities window in the Predictive Lead Scoring settings."
msgstr ""
"Okno Posodobi verjetnosti v nastavitvah Napovedovanje točk potencialnih "
"poslov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:74
msgid "Any number of the following variables can be activated:"
msgstr "Aktiviranih je lahko poljubno število naslednjih spremenljivk:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`State`: the geographical state from which the opportunity "
"originates"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Stanje`: geografsko stanje, iz katerega izvira priložnost"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Country`: the geographical country from which the opportunity "
"originates"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Država`: geografska država, iz katere izvira priložnost"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Phone Quality`: whether or not a phone number is listed for the "
"opportunity"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kakovost telefona`: ali je za priložnost navedena telefonska "
"številka ali ne"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email Quality`: whether or not an email address is listed for the "
"opportunity"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kakovost e-pošte`: ali je za priložnost naveden e-poštni naslov "
"ali ne"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: the source of an opportunity (e.g. search engine, social "
"media)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vir`: vir priložnosti (npr. iskalni mehanizem, družbeni mediji)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:81
msgid ":guilabel:`Language`: the spoken language specified on the opportunity"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Jezik`: govorjeni jezik, naveden pri priložnosti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:82
msgid ":guilabel:`Tags`: the tags placed on the opportunity"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Oznake`: oznake, dodeljene priložnosti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:85
msgid ""
"The variables `Stage` and `Team` are always in effect. `Stage` refers to the "
"CRM pipeline stage that an opportunity is in. `Team` refers to the sales "
"team that is assigned to an opportunity. Predictive lead scoring *always* "
"takes into account these two variables, regardless of which optional "
"variables are selected."
msgstr ""
"Spremenljivki `Stage` in `Team` sta vedno aktivni. `Stage` se nanaša na fazo "
"v prodajnem kanalu CRM, v kateri je priložnost. `Team` se nanaša na prodajno "
"ekipo, ki je dodeljena priložnosti. Napovedovanje rezultatov potencialnih "
"strank *vedno* upošteva ti dve spremenljivki, ne glede na to, katere izbirne "
"spremenljivke so izbrane."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:90
msgid ""
"Next, click on the date field next to the option :guilabel:`Consider leads "
"created as of the:` to select the date from which predictive lead scoring "
"begins its calculations."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite na polje datuma poleg možnosti :guilabel:`Upoštevaj "
"potencialne stranke, ustvarjene od:`, da izberete datum, od katerega "
"napovedovanje ocenjevanja potencialnih strank začne svoje izračune."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:93
msgid "Lastly, click :guilabel:`Update` to save changes."
msgstr "Na koncu kliknite :guilabel:`Posodobi`, da shranite spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:96
msgid "Change the probability manually"
msgstr "Ročna sprememba verjetnosti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:98
msgid ""
"An opportunity's probability of success can be changed manually on the "
"opportunity form. Click on the probability number to edit it. The "
"probability for a lead **cannot** be manually set to 100%. Attemping to "
"convert a lead with a 100% probability into an opportunity will result in an "
"error message:"
msgstr ""
"Verjetnost uspeha priložnosti je mogoče ročno spremeniti na obrazcu "
"priložnosti. Kliknite številko verjetnosti, da jo uredite. Verjetnosti "
"potencialne stranke **ni mogoče** ročno nastaviti na 100 %. Poskus pretvorbe "
"potencialne stranke s 100 % verjetnostjo v priložnost bo povzročil sporočilo "
"o napaki:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:103
msgid ""
"The error message that appears when attempting to convert a 100% probability "
"lead into an\n"
"opportunity."
msgstr ""
"Sporočilo o napaki, ki se prikaže pri poskusu pretvorbe potencialne stranke "
"s 100 % verjetnostjo v priložnost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:107
msgid ""
"Manually changing the probability overwrites the automatic probability "
"updates for that lead/opportunity. The AI-computed probability remains "
"visible and automatically updates as the opportunity moves through each "
"stage of the pipeline or as more information is added to the lead form. To "
"revert to the AI-computed probability, click on the AI icon next to the "
"probability percentage."
msgstr ""
"Ročna sprememba verjetnosti prepiše samodejne posodobitve verjetnosti za to "
"potencialno stranko/priložnost. Verjetnost, ki jo izračuna umetna "
"inteligenca, ostane vidna in se samodejno posodablja, ko priložnost "
"napreduje skozi vsako stopnjo v procesu ali ko se obrazcu potencialne "
"stranke dodajo nove informacije. Če želite obnoviti verjetnost, ki jo "
"izračuna umetna inteligenca, kliknite ikono UI poleg odstotka verjetnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:113
msgid ""
"The icon used to reactivate automatic probability on an opportunity form."
msgstr ""
"Ikona za ponovno aktiviranje samodejne verjetnosti na obrazcu priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:117
msgid "Assign leads based on probability"
msgstr "Dodelitev potencialnih strank glede na verjetnost"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:119
msgid ""
"Odoo **CRM** can assign leads/opportunities to sales teams and salespeople "
"based on specified rules. Create assignment rules based on the leads' "
"probability of success to prioritize those that are more likely to result in "
"leads and opportunities."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija Odoo **CRM** lahko dodeli potencialne stranke/priložnosti "
"prodajnim ekipam in prodajalcem na podlagi določenih pravil. Ustvarite "
"pravila dodeljevanja na podlagi verjetnosti uspeha potencialnih strank, da "
"date prednost tistim, ki bodo verjetneje vodile do potencialnih strank in "
"priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:124
msgid "Configure rule-based assignment"
msgstr "Konfiguracija dodeljevanja na podlagi pravil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:126
msgid ""
"To activate *rule-based assignment*, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, and activate :guilabel:`Rule-Based Assignment`."
msgstr ""
"Za aktiviranje *dodeljevanja na podlagi pravil* pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`CRM --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve` in "
"aktivirajte :guilabel:`Dodeljevanje na podlagi pravil`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:129
msgid ""
"The rule-based assignment feature can be set to run :guilabel:`Manually`, "
"meaning an Odoo user must manually trigger the assignment, "
"or :guilabel:`Repeatedly`, meaning Odoo automatically triggers the "
"assignment according to the chosen time period."
msgstr ""
"Funkcijo dodeljevanja na podlagi pravil je mogoče nastaviti za "
"izvajanje :guilabel:`Ročno`, kar pomeni, da mora uporabnik Odoo ročno "
"sprožiti dodelitev, ali :guilabel:`Ponavljajoče`, kar pomeni, da Odoo "
"samodejno sproži dodelitev v skladu z izbranim časovnim obdobjem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:133
msgid ""
"To configure automatic lead assignment, select :guilabel:`Repeatedly` for "
"the :guilabel:`Running` section. The frequency of this automatic assignment "
"is customized within the :guilabel:`Repeat every` section. Enter a specific "
"number and select a corresponding time period to establish the desired "
"interval. Time periods range from :guilabel:`Minutes` to :guilabel:`Weeks`."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo samodejnega dodeljevanja potencialnih strank "
"izberite :guilabel:`Ponavljajoče` za razdelek :guilabel:`Izvajanje`. "
"Pogostost te samodejne dodelitve se prilagodi v "
"razdelku :guilabel:`Ponavljaj vsakih`. Vnesite določeno število in izberite "
"ustrezno časovno obdobje za vzpostavitev želenega intervala. Časovna obdobja "
"segajo od :guilabel:`Minute` do :guilabel:`Tednov`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:138
msgid "The Rule-Based Assignment setting in CRM settings."
msgstr "Nastavitev dodeljevanja na podlagi pravil v nastavitvah CRM."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:141
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`rule-based assignment` is set to run :guilabel:`Repeatedly`, "
"the assignment can still be triggered manually using the :icon:`fa-"
"refresh` :guilabel:`(Update now)` icon in the :guilabel:`Rule-Based "
"Assignment` settings, or using the :guilabel:`Assign Leads` button on the "
"sales team configuration page. Once a lead has been assigned to a "
"salesperson via this rule, the leads are automatically converted into an "
"opportunity by the system."
msgstr ""
"Če je :guilabel:`dodeljevanje na podlagi pravil` nastavljeno na "
"izvajanje :guilabel:`Večkrat`, lahko dodelitev še vedno sprožite ročno z "
"ikono :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Posodobi zdaj` v "
"nastavitvah :guilabel:`Dodeljevanje na podlagi pravil` ali z "
"gumbom :guilabel:`Dodeli potencialne stranke` na strani za konfiguracijo "
"prodajne ekipe. Ko je potencialna stranka dodeljena prodajniku prek tega "
"pravila, sistem samodejno pretvori potencialne stranke v priložnost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:148
msgid "Configure assignment rules"
msgstr "Konfiguracija pravil za dodeljevanje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:150
msgid ""
"Next, configure the *assignment rules* for each sales team or salesperson. "
"These rules determine which leads Odoo assigns to which people. To get "
"started, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM --> Configuration --> Sales Teams`, "
"and select a sales team."
msgstr ""
"Nato konfigurirajte *pravila dodeljevanja* za vsako prodajno ekipo ali "
"prodajalca. Ta pravila določajo, katere potencialne stranke Odoo dodeli "
"katerim osebam. Za začetek pojdite na :menuselection:`CRM --> Konfiguracija "
"--> Prodajne ekipe` in izberite prodajno ekipo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:154
msgid ""
"On the sales team configuration form, under :guilabel:`Assignment Rules`, "
"click on :guilabel:`Edit Domain` to configure the rules that Odoo uses to "
"determine lead assignment for this sales team. The rules can include "
"anything that may be relevant for this company or team, and any number of "
"rules can be added."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu za konfiguracijo prodajne ekipe pod :guilabel:`Pravila za "
"dodeljevanje` kliknite :guilabel:`Uredi domeno`, da konfigurirate pravila, "
"ki jih Odoo uporablja za določanje dodeljevanja potencialnih strank tej "
"prodajni ekipi. Pravila lahko vključujejo karkoli, kar je lahko pomembno za "
"to podjetje ali ekipo, in dodati je mogoče poljubno število pravil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:159
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add Filter` to start creating assignment rules. Click on "
"the :icon:`fa-plus-circle` sign on the right of the assignment rule to add "
"another line. Click on the :guilabel:`x` symbol to remove the line."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj filter`, da začnete ustvarjati pravila "
"dodeljevanja. Kliknite na :icon:`fa-plus-circle` na desni strani pravila "
"dodeljevanja, da dodate novo vrstico. Kliknite na simbol :guilabel:`x`, da "
"odstranite vrstico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:163
msgid ""
"To create an assignment rule based on an opportunity's probability of "
"success, click on the far left drop-down menu of an assignment rule line, "
"and select :guilabel:`Probability`."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje pravila za dodeljevanje na podlagi verjetnosti uspeha "
"priložnosti kliknite skrajni levi spustni meni vrstice pravila za "
"dodeljevanje in izberite :guilabel:`Verjetnost`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:166
msgid ""
"From the middle drop-down menu, select the desired equation symbol—most "
"likely the symbol for *greater than*, *less than*, *greater than or equal "
"to*, or *less than or equal to*."
msgstr ""
"Iz srednjega spustnega menija izberite želeni simbol enačbe—najverjetneje "
"simbol za *večje kot*, *manjše kot*, *večje ali enako* ali *manjše ali "
"enako*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:169
msgid ""
"In the far right space, enter the desired number value of the probability. "
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Save` to save changes."
msgstr ""
"V skrajni desni prostor vnesite želeno številčno vrednost verjetnosti. "
"Nazadnje kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`, da shranite spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:173
msgid ""
"To configure an assignment rule such that a sales team receives leads that "
"have a probability of success of 20% or greater, create a :guilabel:`Domain` "
"line that reads: `Probability >= 20`."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo pravila za dodeljevanje tako, da prodajna ekipa prejme "
"potencialne stranke, ki imajo verjetnost uspeha 20 % ali več, ustvarite "
"vrstico :guilabel:`Domena`, ki se glasi: `Probability >= 20`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:176
msgid ""
"Sales team domain set to probability greater than or equal to twenty percent."
msgstr ""
"Domena prodajne ekipe nastavljena na verjetnost večjo ali enako dvajset "
"odstotkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:179
msgid ""
"Separate assignment rules can also be configured for individual team "
"members. From the sales team configuration page, click on a team member in "
"the :guilabel:`Members` tab, then edit the :guilabel:`Domain` section. "
"Click :guilabel:`Save` to save changes."
msgstr ""
"Ločena pravila za dodeljevanje je mogoče konfigurirati tudi za posamezne "
"člane ekipe. Na strani konfiguracije prodajne ekipe kliknite člana ekipe v "
"zavihku :guilabel:`Člani`, nato uredite odsek :guilabel:`Domena`. "
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`, da shranite spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:183
msgid ""
"If automatic lead assignment is configured in the settings, both the sales "
"team and individual team members have the option to :guilabel:`Skip auto "
"assignment`. Check this box to omit a particular sales team or salesperson "
"from being assigned leads automatically by Odoo's rule-based assignment "
"feature. If :guilabel:`Skip auto assignment` is activated, the sales team or "
"salesperson can still be assigned leads manually."
msgstr ""
"Če je v nastavitvah konfigurirano samodejno dodeljevanje potencialnih "
"strank, imata tako prodajna ekipa kot posamezni člani ekipe "
"možnost :guilabel:`Preskoči samodejno dodeljevanje`. Označite to polje, če "
"želite izključiti določeno prodajno ekipo ali prodajalca iz samodejnega "
"dodeljevanja potencialnih strank s funkcijo dodeljevanja Odoo na podlagi "
"pravil. Če je aktivirano :guilabel:`Preskoči samodejno dodeljevanje`, se "
"lahko prodajni ekipi ali prodajalcu še vedno ročno dodelijo potencialne "
"stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_scoring.rst:189
msgid ""
"To manually assign leads to this sales team, click on the :guilabel:`Assign "
"Leads` button at the top of the sales team configuration page. This assigns "
"any leads that are currently unassigned and match this team's specified "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"Za ročno dodelitev potencialnih strank tej prodajni ekipi kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Dodeli potencialne stranke` na vrhu konfiguracijske strani "
"prodajne ekipe. To dodeli vse potencialne stranke, ki so trenutno "
"nedodeljene in se ujemajo z določeno domeno te ekipe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:3
msgid "Marketing attribution reports"
msgstr "Poročila o atribuciji trženja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:5
msgid ""
"Use the Odoo *CRM* app to compile a *marketing attribution report*, which "
"analyzes the source of leads, and groups them in such a way as to calculate "
"marketing's overall impact on lead generation, attribution, won rate, and "
"more."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite aplikacijo Odoo *CRM* za sestavo *poročila o atribuciji trženja*, "
"ki analizira vir potencialnih strank in jih združi tako, da izračuna splošni "
"vpliv trženja na generiranje potencialnih strank, atribucijo, stopnjo "
"uspešnosti in več."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:10
msgid "Leads Analysis dashboard"
msgstr "Nadzorna plošča Analiza potencialnih strank"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:12
msgid ""
"Begin by navigating to the :guilabel:`Leads Analysis` dashboard by going "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Reporting --> Leads`."
msgstr ""
"Začnite tako, da se pomaknete na nadzorno ploščo :guilabel:`Analiza "
"potencialnih strank` tako, da greste na :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> "
"Poročanje --> Potencialne stranke`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:16
msgid ""
"Reports can also be run on the :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads` dashboard, "
"which is **only** accessible if the *Leads* feature has been activated on "
"the *Settings* page."
msgstr ""
"Poročila lahko zaženete tudi na nadzorni plošči :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"CRM --> Potencialne stranke`, do katere lahko dostopate **samo**, če je "
"funkcija *Potencialne stranke* aktivirana na strani *Nastavitve*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:19
msgid ""
"If the *Leads* feature has **not** been activated, the :menuselection:`CRM "
"app --> Sales --> My Pipeline` dashboard can also be used to run reports."
msgstr ""
"Če funkcija *Potencialne stranke* **ni** aktivirana, lahko za izvajanje "
"poročil uporabite tudi nadzorno ploščo :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> "
"Prodaja --> Moja prodajna pot`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:22
msgid ""
"Both dashboards contain the necessary *Filters* and *Group By* criteria to "
"run an attribution report."
msgstr ""
"Obe nadzorni plošči vsebujeta potrebna merila *Filtri* in *Združi po* za "
"izvajanje poročila o atribuciji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:26
msgid ":doc:`Convert leads into opportunities <../acquire_leads/convert>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Pretvorite potencialne stranke v priložnosti <../acquire_leads/"
"convert>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:27
msgid ":doc:`Create leads <../acquire_leads/email_manual>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Ustvarite potencialne stranke <../acquire_leads/email_manual>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:29
msgid ""
"Open the CRM app and click on the Reporting tab at the top of the page, then "
"click Leads."
msgstr ""
"Odprite aplikacijo CRM in kliknite na zavihek Poročanje na vrhu strani, nato "
"kliknite Potencialne stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:33
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(graph)` view is shown, by default, "
"with :guilabel:`Active or Inactive` and :guilabel:`Created on: [current "
"year]` filters active in the :guilabel:`Search...` bar. The graph "
"visualization displays the number of leads generated, by month and by sales "
"team, with each sales team attributed to its own color per month shown."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto je prikazan pogled :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(graf)`, z "
"aktivnimi filtri :guilabel:`Aktivne ali neaktivne` in :guilabel:`Ustvarjeno "
"dne: [trenutno leto]` v vrstici :guilabel:`Iskanje...`. Grafična "
"vizualizacija prikazuje število generiranih potencialnih strank po mesecih "
"in po prodajnih ekipah, pri čemer je vsaki prodajni ekipi pripisana svoja "
"barva na mesec."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:38
msgid ""
"Switch the view to the :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(list)` option, by "
"clicking the respective icon located at the top-right of the dashboard. This "
"allows leads to easily be displayed in the grouping set by the *Group By* "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Preklopite pogled na možnost :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(seznam)` s "
"klikom na ustrezno ikono v zgornjem desnem kotu nadzorne plošče. To omogoča "
"enostavno prikazovanje potencialnih strank v skupini, nastavljeni s "
"parametri *Združi po*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:42
msgid ""
"Click the button with four horizontal lines on the top right of the Leads "
"Analysis page."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb s štirimi vodoravnimi črtami v zgornjem desnem kotu strani "
"Analiza potencialnih strank."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:47
msgid "Add UTM parameters"
msgstr "Dodajte parametre UTM"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:49
msgid ""
"*Urchin Tracking Modules (UTMs)* are snippets of text embedded in URLs that "
"are used to track visitor data. This includes parameters relating to how a "
"visitor reached the link, such as the type of website visited, and/or "
"marketing campaign the visit came from."
msgstr ""
"*Urchin Tracking Modules (UTM)* so delčki besedila, vdelani v URL-je, ki se "
"uporabljajo za sledenje podatkov obiskovalcev. To vključuje parametre, ki se "
"nanašajo na to, kako je obiskovalec dosegel povezavo, kot je vrsta obiskane "
"spletne strani in/ali marketinška kampanja, iz katere je prišel obisk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:53
msgid ""
"Odoo can use these UTMs as parameters in the marketing attribution report to "
"track the metrics and performance of marketing campaigns."
msgstr ""
"Odoo lahko uporabi te UTM-je kot parametre v poročilu o atribuciji trženja "
"za sledenje metrik in uspešnosti marketinških kampanj."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:57
msgid "Create UTMs"
msgstr "Ustvarite UTM-je"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:59
msgid ""
"The :doc:`link tracker <../../../websites/website/reporting/link_tracker>` "
"in Odoo can be used to create and configure UTMs."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje in konfiguracijo UTM-jev je mogoče uporabiti :doc:`sledilnik "
"povezav <../../../websites/website/reporting/link_tracker>` v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:62
msgid ""
"UTMs can also be automatically generated by the :doc:`Email Marketing "
"<../../../marketing/email_marketing>` and :doc:`Marketing Automation "
"<../../../marketing/marketing_automation>` apps."
msgstr ""
"UTM-je lahko samodejno generirajo tudi aplikaciji :doc:`E-poštno trženje "
"<../../../marketing/email_marketing>` in :doc:`Avtomatizacija trženja "
"<../../../marketing/marketing_automation>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:66
msgid ""
"The UTM parameters used in a marketing attribution report are *Medium*, "
"*Source*, and *Campaign*, in descending order of coverage."
msgstr ""
"Parametri UTM, ki se uporabljajo v poročilu o pripisovanju trženja, so "
"*Medij*, *Vir* in *Kampanja*, v padajočem vrstnem redu pokritosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:69
msgid ""
"*Medium* is the UTM with the widest coverage, and is used to identify the "
"medium used to access the link. This can include mediums such as social "
"media, email, or cost per click (CPC)."
msgstr ""
"*Medij* je UTM z najširšo pokritostjo in se uporablja za identifikacijo "
"medija, uporabljenega za dostop do povezave. To lahko vključuje medije, kot "
"so družbeni mediji, e-pošta ali cena na klik (CPC)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:71
msgid ""
"*Source* is more narrow, and is used to identify the source of traffic. For "
"example, the name of a website, search engine used, or a specific social "
"media platform."
msgstr ""
"*Vir* je ožji in se uporablja za identifikacijo vira prometa. Na primer, ime "
"spletne strani, uporabljenega iskalnika ali določene platforme družbenih "
"medijev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:73
msgid ""
"*Campaign* is the most narrow, and can track specific marketing campaigns by "
"name. This can include a contest or product name, type of sale, etc."
msgstr ""
"*Kampanja* je najožja in lahko sledi določenim trženjskim kampanjam po "
"imenu. To lahko vključuje tekmovanje ali ime izdelka, vrsto razprodaje itd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:77
msgid "Create reports"
msgstr "Ustvari poročila"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:79
msgid ""
"To start creating a report, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down "
"arrow)` to the right of the :guilabel:`Search...` bar to see the list of "
"filtering and grouping parameters."
msgstr ""
"Za začetek ustvarjanja poročila kliknite :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(puščica navzdol)` desno od vrstice :guilabel:`Iskanje...`, "
"da vidite seznam parametrov za filtriranje in združevanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Filters`, located in the left column of the search options, can "
"be used to keep only the results that fit the filter. For example, selecting "
"the :guilabel:`Won` filter only shows leads that have been won in the "
"attribution report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Filtri`, ki se nahajajo v levem stolpcu možnosti iskanja, se "
"lahko uporabljajo za obdržanje samo tistih rezultatov, ki ustrezajo filtru. "
"Na primer, izbira filtra :guilabel:`Pridobljeno` prikaže samo potencialne "
"stranke, ki so bile pridobljene v poročilu o pripisovanju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Group By`, found in the middle column, is used to organize the "
"results into groups, and can be used with or without filters."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Združi po`, ki se nahaja v srednjem stolpcu, se uporablja za "
"organiziranje rezultatov v skupine in se lahko uporablja z ali brez filtrov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:89
msgid "Select any number of filters and groups in the search options."
msgstr "Izberite poljubno število filtrov in skupin v možnostih iskanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:94
msgid ""
"Setting multiple :guilabel:`Group By` options creates nested groups, "
"according to which option is selected first. For example, "
"selecting :guilabel:`Medium`, followed by :guilabel:`Source`, and "
"then :guilabel:`Campaign`, in :guilabel:`Group By` column, sorts all results "
"*first* by medium, *then* by the specific sources in each medium, followed "
"by the campaigns in each source."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitev več možnosti :guilabel:`Združi po` ustvari gnezdene skupine glede "
"na to, katera možnost je izbrana prva. Na primer, izbira :guilabel:`Medij`, "
"nato :guilabel:`Vir` in potem :guilabel:`Kampanja` v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Združi po`, razvršča vse rezultate *najprej* po mediju, "
"*nato* po določenih virih v vsakem mediju, sledi pa kampanje v vsakem viru."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:99
msgid ""
"This can be verified by looking at the direction, and order, of the "
"selections in the group tile that appears in the :guilabel:`Search...` bar."
msgstr ""
"To lahko preverite tako, da pogledate smer in vrstni red izbir na ploščici "
"skupine, ki se prikaže v vrstici :guilabel:`Iskanje...`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:102
msgid ""
"The text in the tile is `Country > City`, showing that city is a subgroup of "
"country."
msgstr ""
"Besedilo na ploščici je `Država > Mesto`, kar prikazuje, da je mesto "
"podskupina države."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:107
msgid "For a useful first report:"
msgstr "Za uporabno prvo poročilo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:109
msgid ""
"#. From the :guilabel:`Filters` column, select the :guilabel:`Active` filter "
"to view only leads that are still marked as active. #. From "
"the :guilabel:`Group By` column, select (in this specific "
"order) :guilabel:`Source`, followed by the :guilabel:`City` "
"or :guilabel:`Country`, depending on which grouping is more relevant."
msgstr ""
"#. Iz stolpca :guilabel:`Filtri` izberite filter :guilabel:`Aktivno`, da si "
"ogledate samo potencialne stranke, ki so še vedno označene kot aktivne. #. "
"Iz stolpca :guilabel:`Združi po` izberite (v tem določenem vrstnem "
"redu) :guilabel:`Vir`, sledi :guilabel:`Mesto` ali :guilabel:`Država`, "
"odvisno od tega, katero združevanje je bolj relevantno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:115
msgid "Each lead is now sorted by source, followed by city or country."
msgstr ""
"Vsaka potencialna stranka je zdaj razvrščena po viru, nato po mestu ali "
"državi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:119
msgid ""
"This report contains all active leads, grouped first by the source of the "
"lead, then by the city or country each lead is from. This is useful to see "
"the density of active opportunities sorted by location."
msgstr ""
"To poročilo vsebuje vse aktivne potencialne stranke, najprej združene po "
"viru potencialne stranke, nato po mestu ali državi, iz katere je vsaka "
"potencialna stranka. To je uporabno za ogled gostote aktivnih priložnosti, "
"razvrščenih po lokaciji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:123
msgid ""
"With this data, marketing campaigns, such as conferences or billboards, can "
"be targeted to the locations generating the largest amount of potential "
"revenue. Similarly, more attention can be put toward increasing outreach in "
"locations where existing marketing campaigns are less effective."
msgstr ""
"S temi podatki je mogoče trženjske kampanje, kot so konference ali jumbo "
"plakati, usmeriti na lokacije, ki ustvarjajo največjo količino potencialnih "
"prihodkov. Podobno je mogoče več pozornosti posvetiti povečanju dosega na "
"lokacijah, kjer so obstoječe trženjske kampanje manj učinkovite."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:129
msgid "Export reports"
msgstr "Izvoz poročil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:131
msgid ""
"To set the measures of the report, begin by navigating to the :icon:`oi-view-"
"pivot` :guilabel:`(pivot view)` on the :guilabel:`Leads Analysis` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Za nastavitev mer poročila začnite tako, da se pomaknete na :icon:`oi-view-"
"pivot` :guilabel:`(vrtilni pogled)` na nadzorni plošči :guilabel:`Analiza "
"potencialnih strank`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:134
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Measures` button to view the available measures of the "
"report. Select the desired measures from the drop-down menu (multiple "
"measures can be selected), and verify the measures, filters, and groups are "
"all displayed correctly in the pivot table. This ensures the data is ready "
"for export."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Mere`, da si ogledate razpoložljive mere poročila. "
"Izberite želene mere iz spustnega menija (izberemo lahko več mer) in "
"preverite, ali so mere, filtri in skupine pravilno prikazani v vrtilni "
"tabeli. To zagotavlja, da so podatki pripravljeni za izvoz."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:139
msgid ""
"To quickly export the data in a list, as a .xlsx file, navigate to "
"the :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(list view)`. Click on "
"the :guilabel:`Actions` :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon, located to "
"the right of :guilabel:`Lead Analysis` in the top-left of the page, and "
"click :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`Export All`. The report downloads "
"automatically as a .xlsx file."
msgstr ""
"Za hiter izvoz podatkov na seznam kot datoteko .xlsx se pomaknite "
"na :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(pogled seznama)`. Kliknite "
"ikono :guilabel:`Dejanja` :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(zobnik)`, ki se nahaja "
"desno od :guilabel:`Analiza potencialnih strank` v zgornjem levem delu "
"strani, in kliknite :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`Izvozi vse`. Poročilo se "
"samodejno prenese kot datoteka .xlsx."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:144
msgid ""
"For more export options, the report can be exported to the Odoo *Documents* "
"app. From the :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(list view)` "
"of :guilabel:`Leads Analysis` page, begin by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Actions` :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon again. Now, "
"navigate to :icon:`fa-table` :guilabel:`Spreadsheet`, and click :icon:`oi-"
"view-list` :guilabel:`Insert list in spreadsheet`. A pop-up window "
"titled, :guilabel:`Select a spreadsheet to insert your list.` appears."
msgstr ""
"Za več možnosti izvoza je poročilo mogoče izvoziti v aplikacijo Odoo "
"*Documents*. Na strani :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(seznamski "
"pogled)` :guilabel:`Analiza priložnosti` začnite s klikom na "
"ikono :guilabel:`Dejanja` :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(zobnik)`. Nato se "
"pomaknite na :icon:`fa-table` :guilabel:`Preglednica` in kliknite :icon:`oi-"
"view-list` :guilabel:`Vstavi seznam v preglednico`. Prikaže se pojavno okno "
"z naslovom :guilabel:`Izberite preglednico za vstavljanje seznama.`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:150
msgid ""
"The report can be renamed using the `Name of the list` field, if desired. "
"The number of items on the report can be set with the field labeled: `Insert "
"the first _ records of the list`. Next, select either a new :guilabel:`Blank "
"spreadsheet`, or export into an existing spreadsheet. Finally, click "
"the :guilabel:`Confirm` button."
msgstr ""
"Poročilo lahko preimenujete s poljem `Name of the list`, če želite. Število "
"postavk na poročilu lahko nastavite s poljem: `Insert the first _ records of "
"the list`. Nato izberite novo :guilabel:`Prazno preglednico` ali izvozite v "
"obstoječo preglednico. Nazadnje kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Potrdi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:155
msgid ""
"Set the name, number of records, and location of the export in the option "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"V meniju z možnostmi nastavite ime, število zapisov in lokacijo izvoza."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/marketing_attribution.rst:159
msgid ""
"To export the report as a .xlsx file, for use in an external spreadsheets "
"program, click the :guilabel:`Actions` :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` "
"icon, and select the :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`Export All` option. If "
"prompted, choose a file location, name the file, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Za izvoz poročila kot datoteke .xlsx za uporabo v zunanjem programu za "
"preglednice kliknite ikono :guilabel:`Dejanja` :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(zobnik)` in izberite možnost :icon:`fa-"
"upload` :guilabel:`Izvozi vse`. Če ste pozvani, izberite lokacijo datoteke, "
"poimenujte datoteko in nato kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:3
msgid "Quality leads report"
msgstr "Poročilo o kakovostnih priložnostih"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:5
msgid ""
"A *quality lead* is a lead that is likely to result in a sale. It should "
"match the characteristics most commonly believed to help salespeople close a "
"deal, in addition to more precise criteria that is specific to each "
"organization."
msgstr ""
"*Kakovostna priložnost* je priložnost, ki bo verjetno privedla do prodaje. "
"Mora se ujemati z značilnostmi, za katere se najpogosteje verjame, da "
"pomagajo prodajalcem skleniti posel, poleg bolj natančnih meril, ki so "
"specifična za vsako organizacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:10
msgid ""
"The specific criteria that defines a *quality lead* is different for every "
"organization. For more information, see :ref:`Define a quality lead "
"<track_links/define-a-lead>`."
msgstr ""
"Specifična merila, ki opredeljujejo *kakovostno priložnost*, so različna za "
"vsako organizacijo. Za več informacij glejte :ref:`Opredelitev kakovostne "
"priložnosti <track_links/define-a-lead>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:13
msgid ""
"A quality leads *report* compares how many quality leads each salesperson "
"has received over a specific amount of time, such as within the past 30 "
"days. Sales managers can use such a report to make more informed decisions "
"when assigning new leads to their team"
msgstr ""
"*Poročilo* o kakovostnih priložnostih primerja, koliko kakovostnih "
"priložnosti je vsak prodajalec prejel v določenem časovnem obdobju, na "
"primer v zadnjih 30 dneh. Vodje prodaje lahko uporabijo takšno poročilo za "
"bolj premišljene odločitve pri dodeljevanju novih priložnosti svoji ekipi"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:18
msgid ""
"A sales manager pulls a quality leads report using their company's criteria:"
msgstr ""
"Vodja prodaje pripravi poročilo o kakovostnih priložnostih z uporabo meril "
"svojega podjetja:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:20
msgid "Leads must include a phone number and an email address."
msgstr "Priložnosti morajo vključevati telefonsko številko in e-poštni naslov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:21
msgid "The email address must be from a professional domain."
msgstr "E-poštni naslov mora biti iz profesionalne domene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:22
msgid ""
"The source for the lead must be from a live chat conversation or an "
"appointment with a salesperson."
msgstr ""
"Vir priložnosti mora biti iz pogovora v živo ali sestanka s prodajalcem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:25
msgid ""
"After running the report, the manager can see that, although everyone's "
"ability to close a deal has varied, some members of the sales team have "
"received a higher number of quality leads than others."
msgstr ""
"Po izvedbi poročila lahko vodja vidi, da je, čeprav se je sposobnost vseh za "
"sklenitev posla razlikovala, nekaj članov prodajne ekipe prejelo večje "
"število kakovostnih priložnosti kot drugi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:29
msgid "An example of a quality leads report in the Odoo CRM application."
msgstr "Primer poročila o kakovostnih priložnostih v aplikaciji Odoo CRM."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:33
msgid ""
"Using this information, the sales manager may decide to assign more quality "
"leads to the sales people currently on the lower end, to balance out the "
"distribution of quality leads."
msgstr ""
"S temi informacijami se lahko vodja prodaje odloči dodeliti več kakovostnih "
"priložnosti prodajalcem, ki so trenutno na nižjem koncu, da bi uravnovesil "
"porazdelitev kakovostnih priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:39
msgid "Create a quality leads report"
msgstr "Ustvarite poročilo o kakovostnih priložnostih"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:41
msgid ""
"To create a quality leads report, first navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app "
"--> Reporting --> Pipeline` to open the :guilabel:`Pipeline Analysis` "
"dashboard. Click into the :guilabel:`Search...` bar at the top of the page "
"and remove any active filters."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje poročila o kakovostnih priložnostih najprej pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> Poročanje --> Cevovod`, da odprete "
"nadzorno ploščo :guilabel:`Analiza cevovoda`. Kliknite v "
"vrstico :guilabel:`Iskanje...` na vrhu strani in odstranite vse aktivne "
"filtre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:45
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`🔻(triangle pointed down)` icon to the right of "
"the :guilabel:`Search...` bar to open the drop-down mega menu that "
"contains :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By`, "
"and :guilabel:`Favorites` columns. Click :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter`. This "
"opens a :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikono :guilabel:`🔻(trikotnik navzdol)` desno od "
"vrstice :guilabel:`Iskanje...`, da odprete spustni mega meni, ki vsebuje "
"stolpce :guilabel:`Filtri`, :guilabel:`Združi po` "
"in :guilabel:`Priljubljeni`. Kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj filter po meri`. To "
"odpre pojavno okno :guilabel:`Dodaj filter po meri`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:50
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:65
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` pop-up window allows for the creation of "
"more specific filters."
msgstr ""
"Pojavno okno :guilabel:`Dodaj filter po meri` omogoča ustvarjanje bolj "
"specifičnih filtrov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:55
msgid ""
"In order to generate a quality leads report, filters need to be created for "
"the following conditions:"
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje poročila o kakovostnih priložnostih je treba ustvariti filtre "
"za naslednje pogoje:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:58
msgid ""
":ref:`Starting date <quality_leads_report/starting-date>`: limits results to "
"those created within a specific time frame."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Datum začetka <quality_leads_report/starting-date>`: omeji rezultate "
"na tiste, ustvarjene v določenem časovnem okviru."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:60
msgid ""
":ref:`Specific sales teams <quality_leads_report/sales-team>`: limits "
"results to only include leads for one or more sales teams. This filter is "
"optional and should not be included if the is intended for the entire "
"company."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Določene prodajne ekipe <quality_leads_report/sales-team>`: omeji "
"rezultate samo na potencialne stranke za eno ali več prodajnih ekip. Ta "
"filter ni obvezen in naj ne bo vključen, če je namenjen za celotno podjetje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:63
msgid ""
":ref:`Exclude unassigned leads <quality_leads_report/unassigned-leads>`: "
"excludes leads without an assigned salesperson."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Izključi nedodeljene potencialne stranke <quality_leads_report/"
"unassigned-leads>`: izključi potencialne stranke brez dodeljenega prodajalca."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:65
msgid ""
":ref:`Include archived leads <quality_leads_report/archived-leads>`: ensures "
"that both active and inactive leads are included in the results."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Vključi arhivirane potencialne stranke <quality_leads_report/archived-"
"leads>`: zagotovi, da so v rezultatih vključene tako aktivne kot neaktivne "
"potencialne stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:67
msgid ""
":ref:`Add rules for quality leads <quality_leads_report/add-quality-rules>`: "
"includes or excludes results based on criteria that is specific to a company "
"or sales team."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Dodaj pravila za kakovostne potencialne stranke <quality_leads_report/"
"add-quality-rules>`: vključi ali izključi rezultate na podlagi meril, "
"specifičnih za podjetje ali prodajno ekipo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:70
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:136
msgid ""
"An example of the Custom Filter pop-up window with all of the rules "
"configured."
msgstr "Primer pojavnega okna Filtra po meri z vsemi configuriranimi pravili."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:74
msgid ""
"An example of the *Custom Filter* pop-up window with all of the default "
"rules configured."
msgstr ""
"Primer pojavnega okna *Filter po meri* z vsemi privzetimi pravili, ki so "
"configurirana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:79
msgid "Add a starting date filter"
msgstr "Dodaj filter datuma začetka"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:81
msgid ""
"Begin by first defining the rule's parameter with a date range, by clicking "
"into the first field, on the left of the row, and typing `Created On` in "
"the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, or by scrolling through the menu's list to "
"locate it."
msgstr ""
"Začnite tako, da najprej določite parameter pravila z datumskim območjem, "
"tako da kliknete v prvo polje na levi strani vrstice in vtipkate `Created "
"On` v iskalno vrstico :guilabel:`Iskanje...` ali z drsenjem skozi seznam "
"menija, da ga poiščete."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:85
msgid ""
"In the rule's operator drop-down menu, define the parameter further by "
"selecting either:"
msgstr ""
"V spustnem meniju operatorja pravila dodatno določite parameter z izbiro ene "
"od možnosti:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`>= (greater than or equal to)` to specify a start date and "
"include all entries *after* that start date (as well as the initial value "
"itself); or"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`>= (večje ali enako)`, da določite začetni datum in vključite vse "
"vnose *po* tem začetnem datumu (skupaj z začetno vrednostjo samo); ali"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`is between` to more sharply define a time frame with a clear "
"start and end date. All matching entries that fit within the defined start "
"and end dates are included in the report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`je med`, da natančneje določite časovni okvir z jasnim začetnim "
"in končnim datumom. Vsi ujemajoči vnosi, ki se ujemajo z določenima začetnim "
"in končnim datumom, so vključeni v poročilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:92
msgid ""
"With either option, use the pop-up calendar's day and time pickers, in the "
"far right field, to define the respective date range. Setting these values "
"concludes the creation of the first rule."
msgstr ""
"Pri obeh možnostih uporabite izbirnike dneva in časa v pojavnem koledarju v "
"skrajno desnem polju, da določite ustrezno datumsko območje. Nastavitev teh "
"vrednosti zaključi ustvarjanje prvega pravila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:98
msgid "Add a sales team filter"
msgstr "Dodaj filter prodajne ekipe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:101
msgid ""
"This filter is optional. To view results for the entire company, do **not** "
"add this filter."
msgstr ""
"Ta filter ni obvezen. Za ogled rezultatov za celotno podjetje **ne** dodajte "
"tega filtra."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:107
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:129
msgid ""
"In the rule's second field, select :guilabel:`is in` from the drop-down "
"menu. Selecting this operator limits results to the sales teams selected in "
"the next field."
msgstr ""
"V drugem polju pravila izberite :guilabel:`je v` iz spustnega menija. Izbira "
"tega operatorja omeji rezultate na prodajne ekipe, izbrane v naslednjem "
"polju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:110
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:132
msgid ""
"Lastly, in the third field, select the desired sales team from the drop-down "
"menu. Multiple teams can be added in this field, where each parameter is "
"treated with an \"or\" (e.g. \"any\") operator in the search logic."
msgstr ""
"Nazadnje, v tretjem polju izberite želeno prodajno ekipo iz spustnega "
"menija. V tem polju je mogoče dodati več ekip, pri čemer se vsak parameter "
"obravnava z operatorjem \"ali\" (npr. \"kateri koli\") v logiki iskanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:119
msgid ""
"Next, add a :guilabel:`New Rule`. Then, click into the first field for the "
"new rule, and type `Salesperson` in the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, or scroll "
"to search through the list to locate it."
msgstr ""
"Nato dodajte :guilabel:`Novo pravilo`. Nato kliknite v prvo polje za novo "
"pravilo in vtipkajte `Salesperson` v iskalno vrstico :guilabel:`Iskanje...` "
"ali pomaknite se po seznamu, da ga poiščete."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:122
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:113
msgid ""
"In the rule's second field, select :guilabel:`is set` from the drop-down "
"menu. Selecting this operator excludes any leads not assigned to a specific "
"salesperson."
msgstr ""
"V drugem polju pravila izberite :guilabel:`je nastavljeno` iz spustnega "
"menija. Izbira tega operatorja izključi vse potencialne stranke, ki niso "
"dodeljene določenemu prodajalcu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:128
msgid "Include archived leads"
msgstr "Vključi arhivirane potencialne stranke"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:131
msgid ""
"This filter is also optional, as it adds archived (inactive) leads to the "
"report, however it is recommended to include this since it pulls *all* "
"assigned leads, regardless of status, into the report. This ensures a more "
"accurate representation of assigned leads is captured. However, to pull a "
"report that only includes active leads, do **not** activate this feature."
msgstr ""
"Ta filter je prav tako neobvezen, saj dodaja arhivirane (neaktivne) "
"potencialne stranke v poročilo, vendar je priporočljivo, da ga vključite, "
"ker v poročilo vključi *vse* dodeljene potencialne stranke, ne glede na "
"status. To zagotavlja natančnejši prikaz dodeljenih potencialnih strank. Če "
"pa želite poročilo, ki vključuje samo aktivne potencialne stranke, te "
"funkcije **ne** aktivirajte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:136
msgid ""
"Next, in the upper-right corner of the :guilabel:`Add Custom filter` pop-up "
"window, move the :guilabel:`Include archived` toggle to active."
msgstr ""
"Nato v zgornjem desnem kotu pojavnega okna :guilabel:`Dodaj filter po meri` "
"premaknite stikalo :guilabel:`Vključi arhivirane` v aktivno stanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:139
msgid ""
"The Add Custom Filter pop-up with emphasis on the Include Archived toggle."
msgstr ""
"Pojavno okno Dodaj filter po meri s poudarkom na stikalu Vključi arhivirane."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:143
msgid "Enabling this feature adds archived (inactive) leads to the report."
msgstr ""
"Omogočanje te funkcije doda arhivirane (neaktivne) potencialne stranke v "
"poročilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:148
msgid "Add rules for quality leads"
msgstr "Dodajte pravila za kakovostne potencialne stranke"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:150
msgid ""
"The filters added in this step vary, based on how an organization defines a "
"*quality lead*."
msgstr ""
"Filtri, dodani v tem koraku, se razlikujejo glede na to, kako organizacija "
"opredeljuje *kakovostno potencialno stranko*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:155
msgid "Define a quality lead"
msgstr "Opredelite kakovostno potencialno stranko"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:157
msgid ""
"As defined earlier, a *quality lead* is a lead that is likely to result in a "
"won opportunity. Although the exact criteria for a quality lead varies from "
"organization to organization, it is often a combination of factors commonly "
"attributed to positive sales outcomes, in addition to factors valued by the "
"specific organization."
msgstr ""
"Kot je bilo že navedeno, je *kakovostna potencialna stranka* tista, ki bo "
"najverjetneje vodila do pridobljene priložnosti. Čeprav se natančna merila "
"za kakovostno potencialno stranko razlikujejo od organizacije do "
"organizacije, je pogosto kombinacija dejavnikov, ki se običajno pripisujejo "
"pozitivnim prodajnim rezultatom, poleg dejavnikov, ki jih ceni konkretna "
"organizacija."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:162
msgid ""
"In addition to the basic filters and grouping options outlined in the "
"general :ref:`Quality leads report <track_links/create-quality-leads-"
"report>`, consider the following filters when defining a quality lead:"
msgstr ""
"Poleg osnovnih filtrov in možnosti razvrščanja v skupine, opisanih v "
"splošnem poročilu :ref:`Kakovostne potencialne stranke <track_links/create-"
"quality-leads-report>`, pri opredeljevanju kakovostne potencialne stranke "
"upoštevajte naslednje filtre:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email` or :guilabel:`Phone`: the information in these fields can "
"help determine whether or not a lead is a professional contact."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`E-pošta` ali :guilabel:`Telefon`: informacije v teh poljih lahko "
"pomagajo določiti, ali je potencialna stranka profesionalni stik ali ne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:168
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: this field links to the marketing and lead generation "
"efforts from other Odoo applications, including *Live Chat*, *Social "
"Marketing*, and *Email Marketing*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vir`: to polje se povezuje s trženjskimi dejavnostmi in "
"dejavnostmi pridobivanja potencialnih strank iz drugih aplikacij Odoo, "
"vključno z *Klepet v živo*, *Družbeno Trženje* in *E-poštno trženje*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:170
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stage`: this filter can be used to eliminate or target leads that "
"have reached specific stages."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Stopnja`: ta filter se lahko uporabi za izključitev ali ciljanje "
"potencialnih strank, ki so dosegle določene stopnje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:172
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Medium`: a lead's source can indicate its quality level, as "
"various channels have different won rates and expected revenues."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Medij`: vir potencialne stranke lahko kaže na raven njene "
"kakovosti, saj imajo različni kanali različne stopnje uspešnosti in "
"pričakovane prihodke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:174
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Campaign`: adding this filter helps track of the success of "
"different marketing efforts to capture high quality leads."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kampanja`: dodajanje tega filtra pomaga pri sledenju uspeha "
"različnih trženjskih dejavnosti za pridobivanje visoko kakovostnih "
"potencialnih strank."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:176
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Lost Reason`: exclude leads that may appear to be quality based "
"on various criteria, but have been marked as *lost* for specified reasons."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Razlog izgube`: izključite potencialne stranke, ki se lahko na "
"podlagi različnih meril zdijo kakovostne, vendar so bile označene kot "
"*izgubljene* iz določenih razlogov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:178
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: include or exclude results based on one or more customized "
"tags."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Oznake`: vključite ali izključite rezultate na podlagi ene ali "
"več prilagojenih oznak."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:181
msgid ""
"When adding rules to a custom filter, keep the statements preceding each "
"rule in mind. The statement above a rule determines whether the search "
"results must match **all** of the rules below the statement, or **any** of "
"the rules below the statement."
msgstr ""
"Pri dodajanju pravil filtru po meri imejte v mislih izjave pred vsakim "
"pravilom. Izjava nad pravilom določa, ali se morajo rezultati iskanja "
"ujemati z **vsemi** pravili pod izjavo ali s **katerim koli** pravilom pod "
"izjavo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:185
msgid ""
"Close up of the match rule options on a add custom filter pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Bližnji posnetek možnosti ujemanja pravil v pojavnem oknu Dodaj filter po "
"meri."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:190
msgid "View the report"
msgstr "Oglejte si poročilo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:198
msgid ""
"Close up on the match all rules option on the add a custom filter pop-up "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Bližnji posnetek možnosti ujemanja vseh pravil v pojavnem oknu Dodaj filter "
"po meri."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:202
msgid ""
"After the filters are configured, click :guilabel:`Add`. The default display "
"for the report is a bar graph, where the leads are grouped by *stage*."
msgstr ""
"Ko so filtri konfigurirani, kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj`. Privzeti prikaz "
"poročila je stolpčni diagram, kjer so potencialni kupci razvrščeni po *fazi*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:205
msgid ""
"To group the results by salesperson, click the :guilabel:`🔻(triangle "
"pointed down)` icon to the right of the :guilabel:`Search...` bar to open "
"the drop-down mega menu. Under the :guilabel:`Group By` heading, "
"select :guilabel:`Salesperson`. In the same column, under "
"the :guilabel:`Group By` heading, click :guilabel:`Add a Custom Group`, then "
"select :guilabel:`Active` on the resulting drop-down menu to layer in lead "
"*status*, under the parent :guilabel:`Salesperson` grouping."
msgstr ""
"Za razvrščanje rezultatov po prodajalcu kliknite ikono :guilabel:`🔻 "
"(trikotnik, usmerjen navzdol)` na desni strani "
"vrstice :guilabel:`Iskanje...`, da odprete spustni meni. Pod "
"naslovom :guilabel:`Razvrsti po` izberite :guilabel:`Prodajalec`. V istem "
"stolpcu pod naslovom :guilabel:`Razvrsti po` kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj "
"razvrščanje po meri`, nato pa v spustnemu meniju "
"izberite :guilabel:`Aktivno`, da dodate *status* potencialnega kupca kot "
"podrejeno razvrščanje nadrejenega razvrščanja :guilabel:`Prodajalec`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:211
msgid ""
"The report now displays the total count of *quality leads* each salesperson "
"has received in the designated time period. Because there are "
"layered :guilabel:`Group By` filters, the grouped leads are also color-coded "
"to identify whether they are *active* or *marked as lost*."
msgstr ""
"Poročilo zdaj prikazuje skupno število *kakovostnih potencialnih kupcev*, ki "
"jih je prejel vsak prodajalec v določenem časovnem obdobju. Ker so "
"filtri :guilabel:`Razvrsti po` razvrščeni v plasti, so razvrščeni "
"potencialni kupci tudi barvno kodirani za prepoznavanje, ali so *aktivni* "
"ali *označeni kot izgubljeni*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:216
msgid ""
"To save this search for later, click the :guilabel:`🔻(triangle pointed "
"down)` icon next to the :guilabel:`Search...` bar to open the drop-down "
"menu. Under the :guilabel:`Favorites` heading, click :guilabel:`Save current "
"search`."
msgstr ""
"Za shranjevanje tega iskanja za pozneje kliknite ikono :guilabel:`🔻 "
"(trikotnik, usmerjen navzdol)` poleg vrstice :guilabel:`Iskanje...`, da "
"odprete spustni meni. Pod naslovom :guilabel:`Priljubljene` "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani trenutno iskanje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/quality_leads_report.rst:220
msgid ""
"In the drop-down menu, rename the report from the default `Pipeline` label "
"to `Quality Leads`, and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"V spustnem meniju preimenujte poročilo iz privzete oznake `Pipeline` v "
"`Kakovostni potencialni kupci` in kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:3
msgid "Resellers"
msgstr "Preprodajalci"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:5
msgid ""
"Within Odoo's **CRM** app, leads can be forwarded to resellers (or "
"partners). Leads can be manually assigned or automatically assigned based on "
"the resellers' designated *level* and location. Reseller partners may also "
"take assigned leads and convert them into opportunities in the user portal."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo aplikaciji **CRM** je mogoče potencialne stranke posredovati "
"preprodajalcem (ali partnerjem). Potencialne stranke je mogoče dodeliti "
"ročno ali samodejno glede na določeno *raven* in lokacijo preprodajalcev. "
"Partnerji preprodajalci lahko tudi prevzamejo dodeljene potencialne stranke "
"in jih v uporabniškem portalu pretvorijo v priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:12
msgid ""
"To use the reseller features, the *Resellers* module must be installed "
"first. Navigate to the :guilabel:`Apps` application, and remove "
"the :guilabel:`Apps` filter from the search bar. Then, search for "
"`Resellers`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite uporabljati funkcije preprodajalcev, morate najprej namestiti "
"modul *Preprodajalci*. Pojdite v aplikacijo :guilabel:`Aplikacije` in "
"odstranite filter :guilabel:`Aplikacije` iz iskalne vrstice. Nato poiščite "
"`Resellers`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:16
msgid "The resellers module in Odoo."
msgstr "Modul preprodajalcev v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:19
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Activate` on the :guilabel:`Resellers` module card that "
"appears. Doing so installs the module and returns to the main Odoo dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Aktiviraj` na kartici modula :guilabel:`Preprodajalci`, "
"ki se prikaže. S tem namestite modul in se vrnete na glavno Odoo nadzorno "
"ploščo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:22
msgid ""
"After the module is installed, navigate to :menuselection:` CRM app --> "
"Configuration`. There is a new section, titled :guilabel:`Resellers`, with "
"two options beneath it: :guilabel:`Levels` and :guilabel:`Partner "
"Activations`. There may be additional options depending on the apps and "
"modules that are installed in the database."
msgstr ""
"Po namestitvi modula pojdite na :menuselection:` aplikacija CRM --> "
"Konfiguracija`. Prikaže se nov razdelek z naslovom :guilabel:`Preprodajalci` "
"z dvema možnostma pod njim: :guilabel:`Ravni` in :guilabel:`Aktivacije "
"partnerjev`. Glede na aplikacije in module, nameščene v bazi podatkov, so "
"lahko na voljo dodatne možnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:30
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:78
msgid "Levels"
msgstr "Ravni"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:32
msgid ""
"*Levels* are used to differentiate between various resellers. To view the "
"levels, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Members --"
"> Levels`. On the :guilabel:`Levels` page that appears, there are three "
"default levels:"
msgstr ""
"*Ravni* se uporabljajo za razlikovanje med različnimi preprodajalci. Če si "
"želite ogledati ravni, pojdite na :menuselection:`aplikacija CRM --> "
"Konfiguracija --> Člani --> Ravni`. Na strani :guilabel:`Ravni`, ki se "
"prikaže, so tri privzete ravni:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:36
msgid ":guilabel:`Gold`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Zlato`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:37
msgid ":guilabel:`Silver`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Srebro`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:38
msgid ":guilabel:`Bronze`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Bron`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:40
msgid ""
"New levels can be added as needed by clicking :guilabel:`New` and filling "
"out the resulting level form."
msgstr ""
"Po potrebi je mogoče dodati nove ravni tako, da kliknete :guilabel:`Novo` in "
"izpolnite obrazec ravni, ki se prikaže."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:43
msgid ""
"Existing levels can also be edited and renamed if desired. To modify a "
"level, select it from the list and make any desired changes on the level "
"form page that appears."
msgstr ""
"Obstoječe ravni je mogoče tudi urediti in po želji preimenovati. Če želite "
"spremeniti raven, jo izberite s seznama in na obrazcu ravni, ki se prikaže, "
"naredite želene spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:46
msgid ""
"Level weight is used to decide the probability that a partner is assigned a "
"lead or opportunity. On the level form, assign a numerical value (greater "
"than zero) to the :guilabel:`Level Weight` field. If the weight is zero, no "
"leads are assigned."
msgstr ""
"Utež ravni se uporablja za določitev verjetnosti, da je partnerju dodeljena "
"potencialna stranka ali priložnost. Na obrazcu ravni dodelite številčno "
"vrednost (večjo od nič) polju :guilabel:`Utež ravni`. Če je utež nič, "
"potencialne stranke niso dodeljene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:51
msgid ""
"*Level Weight* can also be assigned on an individual contact record. The "
"weight assigned to the individual record overrides the default weight set in "
"the level configuration form."
msgstr ""
"*Utež ravni* je mogoče dodeliti tudi v posameznem zapisu stika. Utež, "
"dodeljena posameznemu zapisu, preglasi privzeto utež, nastavljeno v obrazcu "
"za konfiguracijo ravni."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:57
msgid "Partner activations"
msgstr "Aktivacije partnerjev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:59
msgid ""
"Partner *activations* are used to determine a partner's status. Activations "
"are assigned on an individual contact record, and can be used to group or "
"filter the *Partnership Analysis* report (:menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Reporting --> Partnerships`)."
msgstr ""
"*Aktivacije* partnerjev se uporabljajo za določanje statusa partnerja. "
"Aktivacije so dodeljene v posameznem zapisu stika in jih je mogoče uporabiti "
"za združevanje ali filtriranje poročila *Analiza partnerstev* "
"(:menuselection:`aplikacija CRM --> Poročanje --> Partnerstva`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:63
msgid ""
"To view the partner levels, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Configuration --> Partner Activations`."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled ravni partnerjev pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> "
"Konfiguracija --> Aktivacije partnerjev`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:66
msgid "Three activation types are created by default in the **CRM** app:"
msgstr "V aplikaciji **CRM** so privzeto ustvarjene tri vrste aktivacij:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:68
msgid ":guilabel:`Fully Operational`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Popolnoma operativno`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:69
msgid ":guilabel:`Ramp-up`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Zaganjanje`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:70
msgid ":guilabel:`First Contact`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Prvi stik`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:72
msgid ""
"New partner activations can be added, as needed, by clicking :guilabel:`New` "
"and entering a :guilabel:`Name` on the new line that appears. Then, select "
"the desired status in the :guilabel:`Active` column."
msgstr ""
"Po potrebi je mogoče dodati nove aktivacije partnerjev tako, da "
"kliknete :guilabel:`Novo` in vnesete :guilabel:`Ime` v novo vrstico, ki se "
"prikaže. Nato v stolpcu :guilabel:`Aktivno` izberite želeni status."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:76
msgid ""
"Existing partner activations can also be edited and renamed, if desired. To "
"rename a status, click the :guilabel:`Name` field of a desired level and "
"enter a new name."
msgstr ""
"Obstoječe aktivacije partnerjev je mogoče tudi urediti in po želji "
"preimenovati. Če želite preimenovati status, kliknite polje :guilabel:`Ime` "
"želene ravni in vnesite novo ime."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:79
msgid ""
"To change the active status of an activation, slide the toggle in "
"the :guilabel:`Active` column of the desired activation to the *inactive* "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Za spremembo aktivnega statusa aktivacije premaknite stikalo v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Aktivno` želene aktivacije v položaj *neaktivno*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:82
msgid "The list of default partner activations in the CRM app."
msgstr "Seznam privzetih aktivacij partnerjev v aplikaciji CRM."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:86
msgid "Partner assignments"
msgstr "Dodelitve partnerjev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:88
msgid ""
"After :ref:`levels <crm/partner-levels>` and :ref:`partner activations <crm/"
"partner-activations>` are configured, partners may be assigned to handle "
"specific customers."
msgstr ""
"Ko sta konfigurirani :ref:`ravni <crm/partner-levels>` in :ref:`aktivacije "
"partnerjev <crm/partner-activations>`, je mogoče partnerjem dodeliti "
"obravnavo določenih strank."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:91
msgid ""
"To update an individual partner record, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app "
"--> Sales --> Customers`, and click the Kanban card for the desired partner "
"to open the customer record."
msgstr ""
"Za posodobitev posameznega zapisa partnerja pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> Prodaja --> Stranke` in kliknite "
"kartico Kanban za želenega partnerja, da odprete zapis stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:94
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Partner Level` field, and select an option from the "
"drop-down menu to assign a level. Click the :guilabel:`Partner Assignment` "
"tab and click the :guilabel:`Activation` field under the :guilabel:`Partner "
"Activation header`. Select a partner activation type from the drop-down "
"list, if desired. Then, click the :guilabel:`Level Weight` field to assign a "
"different level weight, if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite polje :guilabel:`Raven partnerja` in iz spustnega menija izberite "
"možnost za dodelitev ravni. Kliknite zavihek :guilabel:`Dodelitev partnerja` "
"in kliknite polje :guilabel:`Aktivacija` pod :guilabel:`glavo Aktivacija "
"partnerja`. Po želji izberite vrsto aktivacije partnerja s spustnega "
"seznama. Nato kliknite polje :guilabel:`Utež ravni`, da po potrebi dodelite "
"drugo utež ravni."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:101
msgid "Publish partners"
msgstr "Objavi partnerje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:103
msgid ""
"With the Odoo **Website** app and *Resellers* module installed, a new "
"webpage (`/partners`) is created to display a list of all active partners "
"from the **CRM** app."
msgstr ""
"Z nameščeno aplikacijo **Spletna stran** Odoo in modulom *Preprodajalci* je "
"ustvarjena nova spletna stran (`/partners`), ki prikazuje seznam vseh "
"aktivnih partnerjev iz aplikacije **CRM**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:106
msgid ""
"Next, return to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Sales --> Customers`, and click "
"the Kanban card for a partner. From that partner's contact form, click "
"the :guilabel:`Go to Website` smart button at the top of the page to open "
"that partner's webpage."
msgstr ""
"Nato se vrnite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija CRM --> Prodaja --> Stranke` in "
"kliknite kartico Kanban za partnerja. Na kontaktnem obrazcu tega partnerja "
"kliknite pametni gumb :guilabel:`Pojdi na spletno stran` na vrhu strani, da "
"odprete spletno stran tega partnerja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:110
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Edit` at the top-right of the partner's webpage, and "
"use the :doc:`building blocks <../../../websites/website/web_design/"
"building_blocks>` to add any additional design elements or information about "
"the partner."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Uredi` v zgornjem desnem kotu spletne strani "
"partnerja in uporabite :doc:`gradnike <../../../websites/website/web_design/"
"building_blocks>`, da dodate dodatne elemente oblikovanja ali informacije o "
"partnerju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:115
msgid "A company summary is a useful addition to this page."
msgstr "Povzetek podjetja je uporabna dopolnitev te strani."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:117
msgid ""
"After making any necessary changes to the page, click :guilabel:`Save`. At "
"the top of the page, slide the :guilabel:`Unpublished` toggle to the "
"active, :guilabel:`Published` position, if needed."
msgstr ""
"Po vseh potrebnih spremembah strani kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`. Na vrhu "
"strani premaknite :guilabel:`Neobjavljeno` stikalo v aktivni "
"položaj :guilabel:`Objavljeno`, če je potrebno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:120
msgid "Repeat these steps for all partners."
msgstr "Ponovite te korake za vse partnerje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:122
msgid ""
"An example of the partners webpage, displaying available partners by level "
"and location."
msgstr ""
"Primer spletne strani partnerjev, ki prikazuje razpoložljive partnerje po "
"ravni in lokaciji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:126
msgid "Partners and the user portal"
msgstr "Partnerji in uporabniški portal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:128
msgid ""
"Reseller partners who have been assigned leads and opportunities can view "
"them in their user portals. Clicking either the :guilabel:`Leads` "
"or :guilabel:`Opportunities` button brings up a list of all leads or "
"opportunities assigned to that partner. Individual leads and opportunities "
"can be clicked for more details."
msgstr ""
"Partnerji preprodajalci, ki so jim dodeljeni potencialni posli in "
"priložnosti, si jih lahko ogledajo v svojih uporabniških portalih. Klik na "
"gumb :guilabel:`Potencialni posli` ali :guilabel:`Priložnosti` prikaže "
"seznam vseh potencialnih poslov ali priložnosti, dodeljenih temu partnerju. "
"Posamezne potencialne posle in priložnosti lahko kliknete za več podrobnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:133
msgid ""
"An example of the partners' user portal and the lead and opportunity buttons."
msgstr ""
"Primer uporabniškega portala partnerjev ter gumbov za potencialne posle in "
"priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:137
msgid "Partner leads"
msgstr "Potencialni posli partnerjev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:139
msgid ""
"Leads viewed through a partner's user portal contain the same information as "
"the lead viewed through the **CRM** app. Reseller partners may click either "
"the :guilabel:`I'm interested` or :guilabel:`I'm not interested` buttons. "
"Clicking either button brings up the :guilabel:`Lead Feedback` form."
msgstr ""
"Potencialni posli, ki si jih partner ogleda preko svojega uporabniškega "
"portala, vsebujejo enake informacije kot potencialni posel, ki si ga "
"ogledate v aplikaciji **CRM**. Partnerji preprodajalci lahko kliknejo "
"gumb :guilabel:`Me zanima` ali :guilabel:`Me ne zanima`. Klik na katerega "
"koli gumba prikaže obrazec :guilabel:`Povratne informacije o potencialnem "
"poslu`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:143
msgid "The lead page as seen in a reseller's user portal."
msgstr ""
"Stran potencialnega posla, kot jo vidi preprodajalec v uporabniškem portalu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:146
msgid ""
"If the partner has expressed interest, the form prompts them to enter their "
"next planned action and expected revenue for the lead and to confirm that "
"they have contacted the customer. Entering this information and clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Confirm` button converts the lead into an opportunity. "
"Failing to fill out the form **prevents** the lead from converting to an "
"opportunity."
msgstr ""
"Če je partner izrazil zanimanje, ga obrazec pozove, da vnese naslednje "
"načrtovano dejanje in pričakovani prihodek za potencialni posel ter potrdi, "
"da je stopil v stik s stranko. Vnos teh informacij in klik na "
"gumb :guilabel:`Potrdi` pretvori potencialni posel v priložnost. "
"Neizpolnitev obrazca **preprečuje** pretvorbo potencialnega posla v "
"priložnost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:151
msgid ""
"The Lead Feedback form brought up by clicking the \"I'm interested\" button."
msgstr ""
"Obrazec Povratne informacije o potencialnem poslu, ki se prikaže s klikom na "
"gumb \"Me zanima\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:154
msgid ""
"If the partner is not interested in the opportunity, the :guilabel:`Lead "
"Feedback` form prompts the partner to enter why they're not interested in "
"the lead, whether they've contacted the customer, and whether they think the "
"lead is spam. This version of the :guilabel:`Lead Feedback` form does not "
"need to be completed by the partner to be confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Če partner ni zainteresiran za priložnost, obrazec :guilabel:`Povratne "
"informacije o potencialnem poslu` pozove partnerja, da vnese, zakaj ga "
"potencialni posel ne zanima, ali je stopil v stik s stranko in ali meni, da "
"gre za neželeno pošto. Te različice obrazca :guilabel:`Povratne informacije "
"o potencialnem poslu` ni potrebno izpolniti, da jo partner lahko potrdi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:159
msgid ""
"The Lead Feedback form brought up by clicking the \"I'm not interested\" "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Obrazec Povratne informacije o potencialnem poslu, ki se prikaže s klikom na "
"gumb \"Me ne zanima\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:163
msgid "Partner opportunities"
msgstr "Priložnosti partnerjev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:165
msgid ""
"Leads accepted by the partner are converted into *opportunities*. Clicking "
"an opportunity reveals the same information displayed in the **CRM** app, "
"but in a view designed for the user portal. From an opportunity's page, the "
"reseller may:"
msgstr ""
"Potencialni posli, ki jih partner sprejme, se pretvorijo v *priložnosti*. "
"Klik na priložnost razkrije enake informacije, ki so prikazane v aplikaciji "
"**CRM**, vendar v prikazu, namenjenem uporabniškemu portalu. Na strani "
"priložnosti lahko preprodajalec:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:169
msgid "Change the opportunity's stage."
msgstr "Spremeni stopnjo priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:170
msgid ""
"Edit the opportunity's information, including priority, planned revenue, and "
"pertinent dates."
msgstr ""
"Uredi informacije o priložnosti, vključno s prioriteto, načrtovanim "
"prihodkom in ustreznimi datumi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:171
msgid "Update the contact information for the opportunity."
msgstr "Posodobi kontaktne informacije za priložnost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:172
msgid "Leave notes, messages, and more in the opportunity's chatter."
msgstr "V klepetu priložnosti pusti opombe, sporočila in več."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:175
msgid ""
"The reseller's ability to change these settings depends on the access "
"granted to them by a database administrator. See the :doc:`access rights "
"<../../../general/users/access_rights>` documentation for more details."
msgstr ""
"Preprodajalčeva možnost spreminjanja teh nastavitev je odvisna od dostopa, "
"ki mu ga dodeli skrbnik podatkovne baze. Za več podrobnosti si oglejte "
"dokumentacijo o :doc:`dostopnih pravicah <../../../general/users/"
"access_rights>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:179
msgid "An opportunity's page as viewed within the user portal."
msgstr "Stran priložnosti, kot se prikazuje v uporabniškem portalu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:183
msgid ":doc:`../../../general/users/user_portals`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../general/users/user_portals`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:3
msgid "Unattended leads report"
msgstr "Poročilo o neobdelanih potencialnih strankah"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:5
msgid ""
"*Unattended leads* are leads that have scheduled activities that are either "
"due or past due. Whenever an activity is scheduled, Odoo tracks the due "
"date, and sends email reminders to the users the activity is assigned to."
msgstr ""
"*Neobdelane potencialne stranke* so potencialne stranke, ki imajo načrtovane "
"aktivnosti, ki so bodisi dospele bodisi zamujene. Kadar je aktivnost "
"načrtovana, Odoo sledi datumu dospetja in pošlje e-poštna opomina "
"uporabnikom, ki jim je aktivnost dodeljena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:9
msgid ""
"An *unattended leads report* compiles all active leads in the pipeline with "
"due or past due activities, allowing a sales manager to identify which "
"opportunities require immediate attention."
msgstr ""
"*Poročilo o neobdelanih potencialnih strankah* zbere vse aktivne potencialne "
"stranke v cevovodu z dospelimi ali zamujenimi aktivnostmi, kar prodajnemu "
"vodji omogoča prepoznavo priložnosti, ki zahtevajo takojšnjo pozornost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:12
msgid ""
"By pulling a daily unattended leads report, sales managers can remind their "
"teams to address outstanding activities before they become past due, helping "
"avoid neglected leads and reinforcing proactive behaviors in their "
"salespeople."
msgstr ""
"S pridobivanjem dnevnega poročila o neobdelanih potencialnih strankah lahko "
"prodajni vodje opominjajo svoje ekipe, da obravnavajo neizvedene aktivnosti, "
"preden postanejo zamujene, kar pomaga preprečiti zanemarjene potencialne "
"stranke in krepi proaktivno vedenje pri prodajnikih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:18
msgid ""
"A sales manager starts their day by pulling an unattended leads report, and "
"upon switching to list view, they see the following:"
msgstr ""
"Prodajni vodja začne svoj dan s pridobivanjem poročila o neobdelanih "
"potencialnih strankah in ob preklopu v seznamski pogled vidi naslednje:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:21
msgid ""
"List view of a sample Unattended Leads report with the activities emphasized."
msgstr ""
"Seznamski pogled vzorčnega poročila o neobdelanih potencialnih strankah z "
"označenimi aktivnostmi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:25
msgid ""
"Their team member, Mitchell, has two leads in the *Proposition* stage with "
"activities that are due."
msgstr ""
"Njihov član ekipe, Mitchell, ima dve potencialni stranki v fazi *Predlog* z "
"aktivnostmi, ki so dospele."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:28
msgid ""
"The yellow :guilabel:`📞 (phone)` icon indicates that the `Modern Open "
"Space` lead has a phone call activity scheduled for today. The "
"red :guilabel:`✉️ (envelope)` icon indicates that the `5 VP Chairs` lead has "
"an email activity scheduled that is past due."
msgstr ""
"Rumena ikona :guilabel:`📞 (telefon)` označuje, da ima potencialna stranka "
"`Modern Open Space` načrtovan telefonski klic za danes. Rdeča "
"ikona :guilabel:`✉️ (ovojnica)` označuje, da ima potencialna stranka `5 VP "
"Chairs` načrtovano aktivnost e-pošte, ki je zamujala."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:32
msgid ""
"Clicking on the `5 VP Chairs` lead, the sales manager opens the record of "
"the lead and reviews the chatter. They see that the email was scheduled to "
"be sent two days ago, but Mitchell never marked this activity as done."
msgstr ""
"S klikom na potencialno stranko `5 VP Chairs` prodajni vodja odpre zapis "
"potencialne stranke in pregleda klepetanje. Vidi, da je bilo e-poštno "
"sporočilo načrtovano za pošiljanje pred dvema dnevoma, vendar Mitchell te "
"aktivnosti nikoli ni označil kot opravljeno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:36
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:152
msgid "Example of overdue activities notification in the chatter of a lead."
msgstr ""
"Primer obvestila o zamujenih aktivnostih v klepetanju potencialne stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:41
msgid ""
"In order to pull a unattended leads report, sales teams **must** be "
"regularly utilizing activity in the *CRM* pipeline, on individual lead and "
"opportunity cards."
msgstr ""
"Za pridobitev poročila o neobdelanih potencialnih strankah **morajo** "
"prodajne ekipe redno uporabljati aktivnosti v cevovodu *CRM*, na posameznih "
"karticah potencialnih strank in priložnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:44
msgid ""
"It is **not** possible to compile a complete report if the sales people are "
"not using the *Activities* feature in the *chatter*"
msgstr ""
"Če prodajniki ne uporabljajo funkcije *Aktivnosti* v *klepetanju*, "
"sestavitev celotnega poročila **ni** mogoča"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:47
msgid ""
"For more information, refer to :doc:`Activities <../../../essentials/"
"activities>`"
msgstr ""
"Za več informacij glejte :doc:`Aktivnosti <../../../essentials/activities>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:50
msgid "Create an unattended leads report"
msgstr "Ustvarite poročilo o neobdelanih potencialnih strankah"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:52
msgid ""
"To create an unattended leads report, first navigate to :menuselection:`CRM "
"app --> Reporting --> Pipeline` to open the :guilabel:`Pipeline Analysis` "
"dashboard. Click into the :guilabel:`Search...` bar at the top of the page, "
"and remove all of the default filters."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje poročila o neobdelanih potencialnih strankah najprej pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`aplikacija CRM --> Poročanje --> Cevovod`, da odprete "
"nadzorno ploščo :guilabel:`Analiza cevovoda`. Kliknite v "
"vrstico :guilabel:`Iskanje...` na vrhu strani in odstranite vse privzete "
"filtre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:57
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Created on` filter can remain active, as this variable may be "
"useful to include in the report."
msgstr ""
"Filter :guilabel:`Ustvarjeno dne` lahko ostane aktiven, saj je lahko ta "
"spremenljivka koristna za vključitev v poročilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:60
msgid ""
"Next, add custom filters by clicking the :guilabel:`🔻(triangle pointed "
"down)` icon to the right of the :guilabel:`Search...` bar to open the drop-"
"down menu that contains :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By`, "
"and :guilabel:`Favorites` columns. Under the :guilabel:`Filters` column, "
"click :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter`, which opens an :guilabel:`Add Custom "
"Filter` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Nato dodajte filtre po meri tako, da kliknete ikono :guilabel:`🔻(trikotnik, "
"usmerjen navzdol)` na desni strani vrstice :guilabel:`Iskanje...`, da "
"odprete spustni meni, ki vsebuje "
"stolpce :guilabel:`Filtri`, :guilabel:`Združi po` "
"in :guilabel:`Priljubljeni`. Pod stolpcem :guilabel:`Filtri` "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj filter po meri`, kar odpre pojavno "
"okno :guilabel:`Dodaj filter po meri`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:70
msgid ""
"In order to generate an unattended leads report, filters need to be created "
"for the following conditions:"
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje poročila o nespremljanih potencialnih strankah je treba "
"ustvariti filtre za naslednje pogoje:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:73
msgid ""
":ref:`Past due activities <unattended_leads_report/past-due>`: limits the "
"results to only include leads with an assigned activity where the due date "
"has past. This can be altered to include activities due to occur on the date "
"the report is generated as well."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Pretekle aktivnosti <unattended_leads_report/past-due>`: omejuje "
"rezultate samo na potencialne stranke z dodeljeno aktivnostjo, katere rok je "
"potekel. To je mogoče prilagoditi tako, da vključuje tudi aktivnosti, ki jih "
"je treba izvesti na dan, ko se poročilo ustvari."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:76
msgid ""
":ref:`Unassigned leads <unattended_leads_report/exclude-unassigned>`: "
"excludes leads without an assigned salesperson."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Nedodeljene potencialne stranke <unattended_leads_report/exclude-"
"unassigned>`: izključuje potencialne stranke brez dodeljenega prodajalca."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:78
msgid ""
":ref:`Specific sales teams <unattended_leads_report/sales-team>`: limits "
"results to only include leads assigned to one or more sales teams. This "
"filter is optional and should not be included if the report is intended for "
"the entire company."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Določene prodajne ekipe <unattended_leads_report/sales-team>`: omejuje "
"rezultate samo na potencialne stranke, dodeljene eni ali več prodajnim "
"ekipam. Ta filter ni obvezen in ga ne smete vključiti, če je poročilo "
"namenjeno celemu podjetju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:85
msgid "Add filter for past due activities"
msgstr "Dodajte filter za pretekle aktivnosti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:87
msgid ""
"Click the first field for the new rule, and type `Activities` in "
"the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, or scroll to search through the list to "
"locate it. Then, next to :guilabel:`Activities`, click the :guilabel:`> "
"(greater than sign)` to open a new drop-down menu with secondary conditions."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite prvo polje za novo pravilo in v vrstico :guilabel:`Iskanje...` "
"vnesite `Activities` ali se pomaknite po seznamu, da ga poiščete. Nato "
"poleg :guilabel:`Activities` kliknite :guilabel:`> (znak večje kot)`, da "
"odprete nov spustni meni z dodatnimi pogoji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:91
msgid ""
"Type `Due Date` in the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, or scroll to search "
"through the list. Click :guilabel:`Due Date` to add it to the rule."
msgstr ""
"V vrstico :guilabel:`Iskanje...` vnesite `Due Date` ali se pomaknite po "
"seznamu, da ga poiščete. Kliknite :guilabel:`Due Date`, da ga dodate k "
"pravilu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:94
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:182
msgid ""
"Custom filter pop-up with emphasis on the options for activities and due "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Pojavno okno filtra po meri s poudarkom na možnostih za aktivnosti in rok."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:98
msgid ""
"Then, click into then next field and select :guilabel:`<=` from the drop-"
"down menu. Selecting this operator includes all activities with a due date "
"up to, and including, the date selected in the next field."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite v naslednje polje in iz spustnega menija "
"izberite :guilabel:`<=`. Izbira tega operatorja vključuje vse aktivnosti z "
"rokom do vključno z datumom, izbranim v naslednjem polju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:102
msgid "The third field can be left as today's date, or adjusted as needed."
msgstr ""
"Tretje polje lahko pustite kot današnji datum ali pa ga po potrebi "
"prilagodite."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:109
msgid ""
"After filtering for activities, add a :guilabel:`New Rule`. Then, click into "
"the first field for the new rule, and type `Salesperson` in "
"the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, or scroll to search through the list to "
"locate it."
msgstr ""
"Po filtriranju aktivnosti dodajte :guilabel:`Novo pravilo`. Nato kliknite v "
"prvo polje za novo pravilo in v vrstico :guilabel:`Iskanje...` vnesite "
"`Salesperson` ali se pomaknite po seznamu, da ga poiščete."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:119
msgid "Add a Sales team"
msgstr "Dodajte prodajno ekipo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:122
msgid ""
"This filter is optional. To view results for the entire company, do **not** "
"add this filter, and continue to :ref:`View results <unattended_leads_report/"
"view-results>`"
msgstr ""
"Ta filter ni obvezen. Za ogled rezultatov za celotno podjetje **ne** dodajte "
"tega filtra in nadaljujte na :ref:`Ogled rezultatov <unattended_leads_report/"
"view-results>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:140
msgid ""
"An example of the **Add Custom Filter** pop-up window with all of the rules "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Primer pojavnega okna **Dodaj filter po meri** z vsemi konfiguriranimi "
"pravili."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:156
msgid ""
"After the filters are configured, click :guilabel:`Add`. The resulting "
"report displays all leads assigned to a salesperson where an activity is "
"past due, or is due on the current date. The default display is a bar graph, "
"where the leads are grouped by *stage*."
msgstr ""
"Ko so filtri konfigurirani, kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj`. Dobljeno poročilo "
"prikazuje vse potencialne stranke, dodeljene prodajalcu, kjer je aktivnost "
"pretečena ali je v roku na trenutni datum. Privzeti prikaz je stolpčni "
"grafikon, kjer so potencialne stranke združene po *fazi*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:160
msgid ""
"To group the results by salesperson, click the :guilabel:`🔻(triangle "
"pointed down)` icon to the right of the :guilabel:`Search...` bar to open "
"the drop-down menu that contains :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By`, "
"and :guilabel:`Favorites` columns. Under the :guilabel:`Group By` heading, "
"select :guilabel:`Salesperson`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite združiti rezultate po prodajalcih, kliknite "
"ikono :guilabel:`🔻(trikotnik, usmerjen navzdol)` na desni strani "
"vrstice :guilabel:`Iskanje...`, da odprete spustni meni, ki vsebuje "
"stolpce :guilabel:`Filtri`, :guilabel:`Združi po` "
"in :guilabel:`Priljubljeni`. Pod naslovom :guilabel:`Združi po` "
"izberite :guilabel:`Prodajalec`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:166
msgid ""
"The option to group by :guilabel:`Sales Team` is also available under "
