msgstr ""
"Če želite ustvariti in nastaviti zaslon za pripravo, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Prodajna točka --> Naročila --> Zaslon za pripravo`, "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Novo` in ga konfigurirajte:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:26
msgid ""
"Enter a descriptive :guilabel:`Name` (e.g., `Main Kitchen`, `Bar`, `Pickup "
