"restaurant>` :ref:`prek zaslona za uvajanje <pos/use/create-pos>` in izbiri "
"kartice :guilabel:`Restavracija`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:77
msgid ""
"The **Kitchen Display** app is automatically installed whenever "
"a :doc:`restaurant point of sale <../restaurant>` is :ref:`created <pos/use/"
"create-pos>` and provides quick access to the :guilabel:`Preparation "
"Display` overview from the main dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija **Kuhinjski prikaz** je samodejno nameščena, kadar koli "
"je :doc:`prodajna točka za restavracijo <../restaurant>` :ref:`ustvarjena "
"<pos/use/create-pos>` in omogoča hiter dostop do pregleda :guilabel:`Prikaz "
"priprave` z glavne nadzorne plošče."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:80
msgid ""
"If at least one :doc:`restaurant point of sale <../restaurant>` is "
"configured, the :ref:`order status screen <preparation/order-status-screen>` "
"is installed by default. To use it in a shop environment, install "
"the :guilabel:`PoS Order Tracking Customer Display` module."
msgstr ""
"Če je konfigurirana vsaj ena :doc:`prodajna točka za restavracijo <../"
"restaurant>`, je :ref:`zaslon stanja naročila <preparation/order-status-"
"screen>` privzeto nameščen. Za uporabo v trgovinskem okolju namestite "
"modul :guilabel:`PoS Order Tracking Customer Display`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:85
msgid ""
"To use the preparation display, log in via a web browser on a mobile device "
"or a touchscreen connected via USB or HDMI. IoT boxes are not supported."
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo prikaza priprave se prijavite prek spletnega brskalnika na "
"mobilni napravi ali na zaslonu na dotik, povezanem prek USB ali HDMI. IoT "
"škatle niso podprte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:91
msgid "Preparation display interface"
msgstr "Vmesnik prikaza priprave"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:93
msgid ""
"To open the preparation display, click :guilabel:`Preparation Screen` on the "
"Kanban card. The interface consists of a :ref:`top bar <pos/preparation/top-"
"bar>`, a collapsible :ref:`side panel <pos/preparation/sidepanel>`, and "
"the :ref:`order cards <pos/preparation/order-cards>` section."
msgstr ""
"Za odprtje prikaza priprave kliknite :guilabel:`Zaslon priprave` na Kanban "
"kartici. Vmesnik je sestavljen iz :ref:`zgornje vrstice <pos/preparation/top-"
"bar>`, zložljivega :ref:`stranskega pulta <pos/preparation/sidepanel>` in "
"sekcije :ref:`kartic naročil <pos/preparation/order-cards>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:100
msgid "Top bar"
msgstr "Zgornja vrstica"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:102
msgid ""
"The top bar shows the progress of :guilabel:`All` orders across configured "
"stages, such as `To prepare`/`To cook`, `Ready`, and `Completed`, along with "
"the number of orders per stage. Click a stage to see the related orders."
msgstr ""
"Zgornja vrstica prikazuje napredek :guilabel:`Vseh` naročil skozi "
"konfigurirane stopnje, kot so `V pripravi`/`V kuhanju`, `Pripravljeno` in "
"`Dokončano`, skupaj s številom naročil na stopnjo. Kliknite stopnjo za ogled "
"povezanih naročil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:106
msgid "Order count in the top bar."
msgstr "Število naročil v zgornji vrstici."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:109
msgid "The top bar offers the following buttons:"
msgstr "Zgornja vrstica ponuja naslednje gumbe:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:111
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-undo` :guilabel:`Recall`: Undo the most recent order stage move. "
"This is only possible if this move was made on the selected stage."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-undo` :guilabel:`Prekliči`: Razveljavi najnovejšo premik naročila "
"v fazo. To je mogoče le, če je bil ta premik narejen v izbrani fazi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:113
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`Done`: Delete all completed orders in the last "
"stage at once."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`Opravljeno`: Izbriši vsa dokončana naročila v "
"zadnji fazi hkrati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:114
msgid ":icon:`fa-sign-out` :guilabel:`Close`: Exit the display."
msgstr ":icon:`fa-sign-out` :guilabel:`Zapri`: Zapusti prikaz."

