msgid ":guilabel:`Time`, such as :guilabel:`Today` or :guilabel:`Tomorrow`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Čas`, kot je :guilabel:`Danes` ali :guilabel:`Jutri`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:125
msgid ""
":doc:`Preset <presets>`, such as :guilabel:`Dine in` "
"or :guilabel:`Delivery`, if applicable"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Prednastavitev <presets>`, kot je :guilabel:`Na mestu` "
