#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:126
msgid ""
":ref:`POS categories <pos/products/categories>` defined on the :ref:`display "
"form <pos/preparation/configuration>`, such as :guilabel:`Food` "
"or :guilabel:`Drinks`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Kategorije POS <pos/products/categories>`, določene v :ref:`obrazcu za "
"prikaz <pos/preparation/configuration>`, kot je :guilabel:`Hrana` "
"ali :guilabel:`Pijače`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:129
