#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:149
msgid ""
"Stages, i.e., the status such as `To prepare`, `Ready`, etc., highlighted in "
"the defined color (only shown when :guilabel:`All` orders are displayed)."
msgstr ""
"Faze, tj. status, kot je `Za pripravo`, `Pripravljeno` itd., označen z "
