msgstr ""
"Če je nastavljeno polje :guilabel:`Potrditev po e-pošti`: Stranke morajo "
"vnesti svoj :guilabel:`E-naslov`, da nadaljujejo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/presets.rst:178
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Table` is selected in the :guilabel:`Service at` field "
"for :guilabel:`Self ordering` mode, customers must enter their tracker "
