msgstr ""
"Prilagodite polje :guilabel:`Skupno ime`, da ohranite samo IP naslov, nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Naprej`, nato :guilabel:`V redu`. Počakajte, da lučke na "
"tiskalniku prenehajo utripati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:69
msgid "Warning page about the connection privacy on Google Chrome"
msgstr "Opozorilna stran o zasebnosti povezave v brskalniku Google Chrome"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/epos_ssc.rst:74
msgid ""
"The Epson homepage may vary depending on the printer model used. For the "
