#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_lna.rst:7
msgid ""
"`Local Network Access <https://developer.chrome.com/release-notes/"
"142#local_network_access_restrictions>`_ is a security feature that limits a "
"website's ability to send requests to servers on a local network. Access "
"requires explicit user permission, which makes it possible to grant network "
"access to a specific web page. Using |LNA|, Odoo Point of Sale can "
"communicate with devices with local access directly from the browser and "
"without requiring an :doc:`SSL certificate <epos_ssc>`."
msgstr ""
"`Dostop do lokalnega omrežja <https://developer.chrome.com/release-notes/"
"142#local_network_access_restrictions>`_ je varnostna funkcija, ki omejuje "
"zmožnost spletnega mesta za pošiljanje zahtev strežnikom v lokalnem omrežju. "
"Dostop zahteva izrecno dovoljenje uporabnika, kar omogoča odobritev "
"omrežnega dostopa določeni spletni strani. Z uporabo |LNA| lahko Odoo POS "
"komunicira z napravami z lokalnim dostopom neposredno iz brskalnika in brez "
"zahteve po :doc:`certifikatu SSL <epos_ssc>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_lna.rst:14
msgid ""
"Local Network Access is available in most browsers based on `Chromium "
"version 142 <https://developer.chrome.com/release-notes/142>`_ or higher, "
"including Google Chrome, Brave, Microsoft Edge, Vivaldi, and Opera."
msgstr ""
"Dostop do lokalnega omrežja je na voljo v večini brskalnikov, ki temeljijo "
"na `Chromium različici 142 <https://developer.chrome.com/release-notes/"
"142>`_ ali višji, vključno z Google Chrome, Brave, Microsoft Edge, Vivaldi "
"in Opera."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_lna.rst:19
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_lna.rst:30
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/qr_code_payment.rst:11
msgid "Activation"
msgstr "Aktivacija"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/pos_lna.rst:21
msgid ""
"|LNA| is enabled by default and automatically used for compatible devices, "
"such as :ref:`ePOS printers <pos/epos-printers/supported-printers>`, when "
"the :guilabel:`Use Local Network Access` checkbox is enabled on "
"the :ref:`printer form <pos/epos-printers/configuration>`."
msgstr ""
