msgstr ""
"Napravi Cashdro mora biti dodeljen statični IP-naslov, da je zagotovljeno "
"stabilno delovanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/cashdro.rst:23
