msgid ""
"The **Asynchronous Notifications** are automated messages confirming "
"successful payments or refunds by QFPay."
msgstr ""
"**Asinhrona obvestila** so avtomatska sporočila, ki potrjujejo uspešna "
"plačila ali povračila s strani QFPay."

