#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:220
msgid ""
"Go to the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/settings>`, scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`PoS Interface` section, and enable :guilabel:`Booking`."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na :ref:`nastavitve POS <pos/use/settings>`, pomaknite se navzdol do "
"razdelka :guilabel:`Vmesnik POS` in omogočite :guilabel:`Rezervacija`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:222
msgid ""
"Enter a name in the :guilabel:`Appointment type` field and "
"click :guilabel:`Create and edit`."
msgstr ""
"V polje :guilabel:`Appointment type` vnesite ime in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Create and edit`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:223
msgid ""
"Configure the :ref:`Appointment type <appointments/configure>` form and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurirajte obrazec :ref:`Appointment type <appointments/configure>` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Save`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:224
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save` in the :ref:`POS settings <pos/use/settings>`."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani` v :ref:`nastavitvah POS <pos/use/settings>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:227
msgid ""
"To ensure that only existing resources can be booked for a specific point of "
"sale, set the :guilabel:`Book` field to :guilabel:`Resources` in "
"the :guilabel:`Appointment type` form and select tables. Then, "
"enable :guilabel:`Group Bookings` to ensure the maximum capacity does not "
"exceed the combined capacity of the selected resources."
msgstr ""
"Da zagotovite, da je mogoče za določeno točko prodaje rezervirati le "
"obstoječe vire, nastavite polje :guilabel:`Rezerviraj` na :guilabel:`Viri` v "
"obrazcu :guilabel:`Vrsta sestanka` in izberite mize. Nato omogočite "
":guilabel:`Skupinske rezervacije`, da največja kapaciteta ne preseže skupne "
"kapacitete izbranih virov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:233
msgid ""
"To accommodate a booking that exceeds the capacity of a single table, click "
"the :icon:`fa-cubes` (:guilabel:`Resources`) icon in "
"the :guilabel:`Appointment Type` form, select a table, and add additional "
"tables in the :guilabel:`Linked Resource` field to merge them when necessary."
msgstr ""
"Če želite prilagoditi rezervacijo, ki presega kapaciteto ene mize, kliknite "
"ikono :icon:`fa-cubes` (:guilabel:`Viri`) v obrazcu :guilabel:`Vrsta "
"sestanka`, izberite mizo in v polju :guilabel:`Povezani vir` dodajte dodatne "
"mize, da jih po potrebi združite."

