"to :ref:`configure the attribute and values <products/variants/attributes>`."
msgstr ""
"V zavihku *Lastnosti in različice* kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico`, nato "
"pa v spustnem meniju :guilabel:`Lastnost` izberite ali ustvarite možnost. Če "
"želite ustvariti novo, vnesite ime in kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari in uredi`, "
"da :ref:`konfigurirate lastnost in vrednosti <products/variants/attributes>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:118
msgid ""
"A moving company rates their services based on distance. Any move within San "
"Francisco uses the flat rate of $165 per hour. Depending on the distance the "
"customer is moving outside of San Francisco, the company adds an additional "
"fee."
msgstr ""
"Selitveno podjetje svoje storitve obračunava glede na razdaljo. Za vsako "
"selitev znotraj San Francisca velja fiksna postavka 165 $ na uro. Glede na "
"razdaljo selitve stranke izven San Francisca podjetje zaračuna dodatno "
"pristojbino."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:122
msgid ""
"Go to the :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products --> Products` and "
"click :guilabel:`New` to create a new product. Configure the base rental "
"price and period using the *General Information* and *Sales* tabs."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite v :menuselection:`Aplikacija Izposoja --> Izdelki --> Izdelki` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`, da ustvarite nov izdelek. Osnovno ceno in obdobje "
"izposoje konfigurirajte v zavihkih *Splošne informacije* in *Prodaja*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:126
msgid ""
"On the *Attributes & Variants* tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line` and select "
"`Distance` as an :guilabel:`Attribute`. In the :guilabel:`Values` column, "
"add `50 mi`, `100 mi`, and `200 mi`."
msgstr ""
"V zavihku *Lastnosti in različice* kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico` ter "
"izberite `Distance` kot :guilabel:`Lastnost`. V stolpec "
":guilabel:`Vrednosti` dodajte `50 mi`, `100 mi` in `200 mi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:129
msgid "Example of service variants in the Attributes & Variants tab."
msgstr "Primer različic storitve v zavihku Lastnosti in različice."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:133
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:149
msgid "Add multiple rental prices"
msgstr "Dodajanje več najemnih cen"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:135
msgid ""
"There are two ways to configure additional rental rates in the **Rental** "
"app: :ref:`Pricelists <rental/labor_service_products/pricelists-method>` and "
"the :ref:`Prices <rental/labor_service_products/prices-tab>` tab."
msgstr ""
"V aplikaciji **Izposoja** sta na voljo dva načina za nastavitev dodatnih "
"najemnih cen: :ref:`Ceniki <rental/labor_service_products/pricelists-method>"
"` in zavihek :ref:`Cene <rental/labor_service_products/prices-tab>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:142
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:109
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:158
msgid "Using the Pricelists method"
msgstr "Uporaba metode cenikov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:144
msgid ""
"Creating a :ref:`new pricelist <sales/products/create-edit-pricelists>` "
"allows for better customization when applying rental rates to specific time "
"periods, products, or customers using *Pricelist Rules*. It is a separate "
"form that users can apply to quotations or select on the rental product form "
"to add new price rules to. To create a new pricelist, go "
"to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products --> Pricelists` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarjanje :ref:`novega cenika <sales/products/create-edit-pricelists>` "
"omogoča boljšo prilagoditev pri uporabi najemnih cen za določena časovna "
"obdobja, izdelke ali stranke s pomočjo *pravil cenika*. Gre za ločen "
"obrazec, ki ga lahko uporabniki uporabijo za ponudbe ali izberejo na obrazcu "
"najemnega izdelka ter mu dodajo nova pravila za cene. Če želite ustvariti "
"nov cenik, pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Izposoja --> Izdelki --> "
"Ceniki` in kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`."

