msgid ""
"A photography studio rents out its photographers on an hourly and daily "
"basis. The hourly rate is $30, but the studio offers a 20% discount for all-"
"day sessions (eight hours or more). All reservations require a 24-hour "
"notice to reserve a photographer. Navigate to :menuselection:`Rental app --> "
"Products --> Products` and click the desired product."
msgstr ""
"Fotografski studio oddaja svoje fotografe na urni in dnevni ravni. Urna "
"postavka znaša 30 $, vendar studio ponuja 20-odstotni popust za celodnevne "
"termine (osem ur ali več). Za rezervacijo fotografa je pri vseh rezervacijah "
"potrebno 24-urno predhodno obvestilo. Pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Izposoja --> Izdelki --> Izdelki` in kliknite želeni izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:160
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Sales Price` and then click the :guilabel:`Sales` tab "
"to configure the :guilabel:`Periodicity` as :guilabel:`Hours` and enter `24` "
"for the :guilabel:`Padding Time`."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite :guilabel:`Prodajna cena` in nato kliknite zavihek "
":guilabel:`Prodaja`, da nastavite :guilabel:`Periodičnost` na "
":guilabel:`Ure` ter vnesite `24` za :guilabel:`Varnostni čas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:163
msgid "Example of Periodicity configuration on the Sales tab."
msgstr "Primer konfiguracije periodičnosti v zavihku Prodaja."

