msgid ""
"The :ref:`Pricelists <sales/products/pricelist-configuration>` feature must "
"be enabled for this tab to display."
msgstr ""
"Za prikaz tega zavihka mora biti omogočena funkcija :ref:`Ceniki <sales/"
"products/pricelist-configuration>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:187
msgid ""
"Rental rates can also be configured as a new price rule for an existing "
"pricelist using the *Prices* tab on the product form. If no pricelist is "
"configured beforehand, the *Default* pricelist is selected."
msgstr ""
"Najemne cene je mogoče konfigurirati tudi kot novo cenovno pravilo za "
"obstoječi cenik z uporabo zavihka *Cene* na obrazcu izdelka. Če cenik "
"predhodno ni nastavljen, je izbran *privzeti* cenik."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:191
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:209
msgid ""
"It is recommended to create a new pricelist first instead of using the "
"*Default* pricelist. Keeping the *Default* pricelist blank ensures there is "
"a clean pricelist for the base rental rate."
msgstr ""
"Priporočljivo je, da najprej ustvarite nov cenik, namesto da uporabite "
"*privzeti* cenik. Če pustite *privzeti* cenik prazen, zagotovite čist cenik "
"za osnovno najemno ceno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:194
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products --> Products`, then "
"click the desired product. Click the *Prices* tab and click :guilabel:`Add a "
"price`."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Izposoja --> Izdelki --> Izdelki` in "
"kliknite želeni izdelek. Kliknite zavihek *Cene* in kliknite "
":guilabel:`Dodaj ceno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:197
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:215
msgid ""
"Select the desired :guilabel:`Pricelist`, then enter the minimum time "
"required for the price change to trigger in the :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` "
"column. The :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` column is based on the *Periodicity* "
"field in the :guilabel:`Sales` tab."
msgstr ""
"Izberite želeni :guilabel:`Cenik`, nato pa v stolpec :guilabel:`Min. "
"količina` vnesite najkrajši čas, potreben za sprožitev spremembe cene. "
"Stolpec :guilabel:`Min. količina` temelji na polju *Periodičnost* v zavihku "
":guilabel:`Prodaja`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:201
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:219
msgid ""
"Lastly, enter the :guilabel:`Price` rate. Click the :icon:`fa-cloud-"
"upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon near the top to save."
msgstr ""
"Nazadnje vnesite stopnjo :guilabel:`Cena`. Za shranjevanje pri vrhu kliknite "
"ikono :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Ročno shrani)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:205
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:223
msgid ""
"Add a date range in the :guilabel:`Validity` column. To add "
"a :guilabel:`Validity` column, click the :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(Settings)` icon and enable :guilabel:`Validity`."
msgstr ""
"V stolpec :guilabel:`Veljavnost` dodajte datumski razpon. Če želite dodati "
"stolpec :guilabel:`Veljavnost`, kliknite ikono :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` "
":guilabel:`(Nastavitve)` in omogočite :guilabel:`Veljavnost`."

