#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:36
msgid ""
"A configured Setting page with the Inventory section displayed for the "
"Rental app."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurirana stran z nastavitvami s prikazanim razdelkom Zaloga za "
"aplikacijo Izposoja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:39
msgid ""
"In the *Pick up & Returns* section, the :guilabel:`Availabilities` setting "
"uses :ref:`work hour schedules <employees/working_hours/working_hours_form>` "
"to specify what days and business hours of the week customers can book or "
"return rental products online at a company level. To edit the default "
"calendar, click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(Internal Link)` icon."
msgstr ""
"V razdelku *Prevzem in vračila* nastavitev :guilabel:`Razpoložljivosti` "
"uporablja :ref:`urnike delovnega časa <employees/working_hours/"
"working_hours_form>` za določitev dni in delovnih ur v tednu, v katerih "
"lahko stranke na ravni podjetja prek spleta rezervirajo ali vrnejo izdelke "
"za izposojo. Za urejanje privzetega koledarja kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`(Notranja povezava)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:44
msgid ""
"In the *Products* section, users can enable the following "
"features: :doc:`Variants <../../sales/products_prices/products/"
"variants>`, :doc:`Pricelists <../../sales/products_prices/prices/"
"pricing>`, :doc:`Promotions, Loyalty & Gift Card <../../sales/"
"products_prices/loyalty_discount>`, and :doc:`../../sales/products_prices/"
"prices/discounts`."
msgstr ""
"V razdelku *Izdelki* lahko uporabniki omogočijo naslednje funkcije: "
":doc:`Različice <../../sales/products_prices/products/variants>`, "
":doc:`Ceniki <../../sales/products_prices/prices/pricing>`, :doc:`Promocije, "
"zvestoba in darilne kartice <../../sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount>` "
"in :doc:`../../sales/products_prices/prices/discounts`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:50
msgid ""
"In the *Quotations* section, users can enable the :doc:`../../sales/"
"sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder` and :doc:`../../sales/sales_quotations/"
"quote_template` features to use when creating a quotation."
msgstr ""
"V razdelku *Ponudbe* lahko uporabniki omogočijo funkciji :doc:`../../sales/"
"sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder` in :doc:`../../sales/sales_quotations/"
"quote_template` za uporabo pri ustvarjanju ponudbe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:54
msgid ""
"If the **Inventory** app is installed, the *Inventory* section is displayed. "
"The :ref:`Rental Transfers <rental/products/rental-transfers>` checkbox "
"enables automatic creation of delivery and return receipts for a rental "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Če je nameščena aplikacija **Zaloga**, se prikaže razdelek *Zaloga*. "
"Potrditveno polje :ref:`Prenosi za izposojo <rental/products/rental-"
"transfers>` omogoča samodejno ustvarjanje prevzemnic in povratnic za izdelek "
"za izposojo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:59
msgid ""
"The **Inventory** app automatically creates an internal default location "
"once the :guilabel:`Rental Transfers` feature is enabled. Odoo uses the new "
"default location, `Customer/Rental`, to track products during the rental "
"period (moving them from Stock to Customer/Rental upon rental, and back upon "
"return). **Do not** modify this location to avoid corrupting inventory "
"tracking."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija **Inventory** samodejno ustvari privzeto notranjo lokacijo, ko je "
"omogočena funkcija :guilabel:`Najemni prenosi`. Odoo uporablja novo privzeto "
"lokacijo `Customer/Rental` za sledenje izdelkov med najemnim obdobjem "
"(premikanje iz zaloge v Customer/Rental ob najemu in nazaj ob vrnitvi). "
"**Ne** spreminjajte te lokacije, da se izognete pokvarjenju sledenja zalogi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:65
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save` to apply the changes."
msgstr "Kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`, da uveljavite spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:70
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:16
msgid "App integration configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija integracije aplikacij"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:72
msgid ""
"The **Rental** app relies on additional Odoo app integration to expand its "
"settings and product configurations. The following apps are essential for "
"workflow efficiency and automation when creating a product and rental order:"
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija **Najem** se opira na integracije z dodatnimi aplikacijami Odoo "
"za razširitev nastavitev in konfiguracije izdelkov. Naslednje aplikacije so "
"bistvene za učinkovitost poteka dela in avtomatizacijo pri ustvarjanju "
"izdelka in naloga najema:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:76
msgid ""
"**Sales**: Enables online payments and signatures within the **Rental** app."
msgstr ""
"**Prodaja**: omogoča spletna plačila in podpise v aplikaciji **Izposoja**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:77
msgid ""
"**Sign**: Allows uploading and customization of various rental and service "
"agreements. These documents are used to facilitate the :guilabel:`Request "
"Signature` feature."
msgstr ""
"**Podpis**: omogoča nalaganje in prilagajanje različnih pogodb o najemu in "
"storitvah. Ti dokumenti se uporabljajo za omogočanje funkcije "
":guilabel:`Zahtevaj podpis`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:79
msgid ""
"**Planning**: Integrates with the **Rental** app to automatically match "
"service products with employees or materials based on availability. This "
"setting is configured on the product form."
msgstr ""
"**Načrtovanje**: Se integrira z aplikacijo **Najem** za samodejno ujemanje "
"storitev z zaposlenimi ali materiali glede na razpoložljivost. Ta nastavitev "
"je konfigurirana na obrazcu izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:81
msgid ""
"**Project**: Enables automatic creation of a project, a task, or both when a "
"rental quote that includes the configured product is confirmed. This setting "
"is configured on the product form."
msgstr ""
"**Projekt**: omogoča samodejno ustvarjanje projekta, opravila ali obojega ob "
"potrditvi ponudbe za izposojo, ki vključuje konfigurirani izdelek. Ta "
"nastavitev se konfigurira na obrazcu izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Inventory**: Enables warehouse delivery and return receipts, product "
"tracking options, variants, and product downtime."
msgstr ""
"**Zaloga**: Omogoča potrdila o dobavi in vrnitvi skladišča, možnosti "
"sledenja izdelkov, variante in izpad delovanja izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:85
msgid ""
"**eCommerce**: Allows product configuration for the online shop. This "
"setting is configured on the product form."
msgstr ""
"**e-Trgovina**: Omogoča konfiguracijo izdelka za spletno trgovino. Ta "
"nastavitev je konfigurirana na obrazcu izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:89
msgid ":doc:`../../sales/sales_quotations/get_paid_to_validate`"
msgstr ":doc:`../sales/sales_quotations/get_paid_to_validate`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:90
msgid ":doc:`../../sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:92
msgid ":doc:`../../../productivity/sign`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../productivity/sign`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:93
msgid ":doc:`../../../services/project`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../services/project`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:96
msgid "Search for rental products"
msgstr "Iskanje najemnih izdelkov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:98
msgid ""
"To view all products available for rent in the database, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products`. By default, "
"the :guilabel:`Rental` filter appears in the search bar, and the view is "
"Kanban. Click the search bar and from the preset filters, "
"select :guilabel:`Goods`, :guilabel:`Services`, or both. All the selected "
"options appear as Kanban cards. For Goods, the card displays the name, "
"rental rate, and amount on hand. For Services, the card displays the name, "
"the number of variants if configured, and the rental price."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled vseh izdelkov, ki so v zbirki podatkov na voljo za izposojo, "
"pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Izposoja --> Izdelki`. Privzeto se v "
"iskalni vrstici prikaže filter :guilabel:`Izposoja`, pogled pa je kanban. "
"Kliknite iskalno vrstico in med vnaprej nastavljenimi filtri izberite "
":guilabel:`Blago`, :guilabel:`Storitve` ali oboje. Vse izbrane možnosti se "
"prikažejo kot kartice kanban. Pri blagu kartica prikazuje ime, ceno izposoje "
"in količino na zalogi. Pri storitvah kartica prikazuje ime, število različic "
"(če so konfigurirane) in ceno izposoje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:106
msgid ":doc:`Configure a service product <service_products>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Konfiguracija storitvenega izdelka <service_products>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:107
msgid ":doc:`Configure a physical product <products>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Konfiguracija fizičnega izdelka <products>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Rental** app allows users to customize scheduling, pricing, and "
"inventory for physical rental products that require stock movement, "
"otherwise known as *Goods*. Users can set up multiple pickup and drop-off "
"locations and track rental products by serial number. Some examples are:"
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija Odoo **Izposoja** uporabnikom omogoča prilagajanje urnikov, "
"določanja cen in zalog za fizične izdelke za izposojo, ki zahtevajo premik "
"zalog, znane tudi kot *Blago*. Uporabniki lahko nastavijo več lokacij za "
"prevzem in vračilo ter sledijo izdelkom za izposojo po serijski številki. "
"Nekaj primerov:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:9
msgid "Bikes"
msgstr "Kolesa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:10
msgid "Clothes"
msgstr "Oblačila"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:11
msgid "Furniture"
msgstr "Pohištvo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:16
msgid ""
"The **Rental** app offers many app-integration features. Depending on the "
"installed Odoo apps, specific settings are available. To learn more about "
"the default settings for rental products, refer to the :ref:`Configuration "
"<rental/product_type/configuration>` section on the *Rental product types* "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija **Izposoja** ponuja številne funkcije integracije aplikacij. "
"Glede na nameščene aplikacije Odoo so na voljo določene nastavitve. Če "
"želite izvedeti več o privzetih nastavitvah za izdelke za izposojo, si "
"oglejte razdelek :ref:`Konfiguracija <rental/product_type/configuration>` na "
"strani *Vrste izdelkov za izposojo*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:24
msgid ""
"The following configurations assume the **Rental**, **Inventory**, and "
"**Sales** apps are installed."
msgstr ""
"Naslednje konfiguracije predvidevajo, da so nameščene aplikacije "
"**Izposoja**, **Zaloga** in **Prodaja**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:29
msgid "Create a new physical product"
msgstr "Ustvarite nov fizični izdelek"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:31
msgid ""
"To set up a new physical rental product, go to the :menuselection:`Rental "
"app --> Products`, then click :guilabel:`New`. A new product window displays "
"with the *General Information* tab open as a default."
msgstr ""
"Za nastavitev novega fizičnega izdelka za izposojo pojdite na "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija Izposoja --> Izdelki` in kliknite "
":guilabel:`Novo`. Prikaže se novo okno izdelka s privzeto odprtim zavihkom "
"*Splošne informacije*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:38
msgid ""
"In the new form, the :guilabel:`Sales` checkbox is already ticked by "
"default. In the *General Information* tab, select :guilabel:`Goods` for "
"the :guilabel:`Product Type`. The :guilabel:`Tracking` field is set "
"to :guilabel:`By Quantity` by default. For the :guilabel:`Category` field, "
"select :guilabel:`Goods` from the drop-down menu or create a new category by "
"typing in the name and clicking :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"V novem obrazcu je potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Prodaja` že privzeto "
"označeno. V zavihku *Splošne informacije* izberite :guilabel:`Blago` za "
"polje :guilabel:`Vrsta izdelka`. Polje :guilabel:`Sledenje` je privzeto "
"nastavljeno na :guilabel:`Po količini`. Za polje :guilabel:`Kategorija` v "
"spustnem meniju izberite :guilabel:`Blago` ali ustvarite novo kategorijo "
"tako, da vpišete ime in kliknete :guilabel:`Ustvari`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:44
msgid "Example of a Goods rental product form."
msgstr "Primer obrazca izdelka za najem vrste Blago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:47
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon and in "
"the new :guilabel:`Quantity on Hand` field, enter the number of products "
"that are available to rent."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Ročno shrani)` in v novo "
"polje :guilabel:`Količina na zalogi` vnesite število izdelkov, ki so na "
"voljo za najem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:51
msgid ""
"For products that have the *By Lots or By Unique Serial Number* enabled, "
"refer to the :ref:`Configure product tracking <rental/products/product-"
"tracking>` section."
msgstr ""
"Za izdelke, ki imajo omogočeno možnost *Po lotih ali po enolični serijski "
"številki*, glejte razdelek :ref:`Nastavitev sledenja izdelkom <rental/"
"products/product-tracking>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:59
msgid ""
"Set up a base rental rate by entering the lowest rental price in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales Price` field. Next, click the :guilabel:`Sales` tab, "
"then in the *Rental* section select a unit of time from "
"the :guilabel:`Periodicity` drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Osnovno tarifo najema nastavite tako, da v polje :guilabel:`Prodajna cena` "
"vnesete najnižjo ceno najema. Nato kliknite zavihek :guilabel:`Prodaja` in v "
"razdelku *Najem* v spustnem meniju :guilabel:`Periodičnost` izberite časovno "
"enoto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:63
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Pickup` and :guilabel:`Return` fields are displayed for "
"every :guilabel:`Periodicity` field option except :guilabel:`Hours` (which "
"only displays the :guilabel:`Padding Time` field). The :guilabel:`Pickup` "
"and :guilabel:`Return` times only apply to online rental orders. "
"The :guilabel:`Padding Time` field makes the product unavailable to rent for "
"the selected duration (in hours)."
msgstr ""
"Polji :guilabel:`Prevzem` in :guilabel:`Vračilo` sta prikazani pri vseh "
"možnostih polja :guilabel:`Periodičnost` razen pri :guilabel:`Ure` (kjer je "
"prikazano samo polje :guilabel:`Čas priprave`). Časa za :guilabel:`Prevzem` "
"in :guilabel:`Vračilo` veljata le za spletna naročila najema. Polje "
":guilabel:`Čas priprave` poskrbi, da izdelek za izbrano trajanje (v urah) ni "
"na voljo za najem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:69
msgid ""
"Additional rental rates can be configured on the *Prices* tab, though these "
"rates are restricted to the :guilabel:`Periodicity` value selected in the "
"*Sales* tab. In other words, a rental product can only have "
"one :guilabel:`Periodicity` value (or unit of time) configured at a time."
msgstr ""
"Dodatne tarife najema lahko konfigurirate v zavihku *Cene*, vendar so te "
"cene omejene na vrednost :guilabel:`Periodičnost`, izbrano v zavihku "
"*Prodaja*. Z drugimi besedami, izdelek za najem ima lahko hkrati nastavljeno "
"le eno vrednost :guilabel:`Periodičnost` (ali časovno enoto)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:73
msgid ""
"Sample of the Rental product's Periodicity, Pickup, and Return time in the "
"Rental app."
msgstr ""
"Primer periodičnosti, časa prevzema in vračila izdelka za najem v aplikaciji "
"Najem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:77
msgid "Optional: specifying rental variants"
msgstr "Izbirno: določanje različic za najem"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:80
msgid ""
"The *Variants* feature in the **Inventory** app must be enabled for this tab "
"to display."
msgstr ""
"Za prikaz tega zavihka mora biti omogočena funkcija *Različice* v aplikaciji "
"**Zaloga**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:82
msgid ""
"In the *Attributes & Variants* tab, add the appropriate attribute and its "
"values by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`. Attributes and values are useful "
"for keeping the product library manageable, tracking and differentiating the "
"inventory, and providing more detailed reports. Examples of rental variants "
"for a *Goods* product are: sizes, brand, color, and material."
msgstr ""
"V zavihku *Lastnosti in različice* dodajte ustrezno lastnost in njene "
"vrednosti s klikom na :guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico`. Lastnosti in vrednosti so "
"uporabne za lažje upravljanje knjižnice izdelkov, sledenje in razlikovanje "
"zaloge ter zagotavljanje podrobnejših poročil. Primeri različic najema za "
"izdelek vrste *Blago* so: velikosti, blagovna znamka, barva in material."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:90
msgid "Adding multiple rental prices"
msgstr "Dodajanje več cen najema"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:93
msgid ""
"The **Sales** app must be installed and the *Pricelists* feature enabled for "
"this tab to display."
msgstr ""
"Za prikaz tega zavihka mora biti nameščena aplikacija **Prodaja** in "
"omogočena funkcija *Ceniki*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:95
msgid ""
"There are two ways to configure additional rental rates in the **Rental** "
"app: :ref:`Pricelists method <rental/products/pricelist-method>` and "
"the :ref:`Prices tab method <rental/products/price-tab-method>`. The "
"**Rental** app follows specific conditions when using pricelists. Refer to "
"the :ref:`Rental pricelist rules <rental/rental-pricelist-rules>` section on "
"the *Rental* page."
msgstr ""
"V aplikaciji **Najem** lahko dodatne tarife najema konfigurirate na dva "
"načina: :ref:`Metoda s ceniki <rental/products/pricelist-method>` in "
":ref:`Metoda z zavihkom Cene <rental/products/price-tab-method>`. Aplikacija "
"**Najem** pri uporabi cenikov upošteva posebne pogoje. Oglejte si razdelek "
":ref:`Pravila cenika za najem <rental/rental-pricelist-rules>` na strani "
"*Najem*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:102
msgid ""
"It is recommended to create a new :guilabel:`Pricelist` first, then select "
"the customized :guilabel:`Pricelist` in the *Prices* tab instead of using "
"the *Default* pricelist. Keeping the *Default* pricelist blank ensures there "
"is a clean pricelist for the base rental rate."
msgstr ""
"Priporočljivo je, da najprej ustvarite nov :guilabel:`Cenik` in nato v "
"zavihku *Cene* izberete prilagojeni :guilabel:`Cenik`, namesto da uporabite "
"cenik *Privzeto*. Če pustite cenik *Privzeto* prazen, zagotovite čist cenik "
"za osnovno tarifo najema."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:111
msgid ""
"Creating a :ref:`new pricelist <sales/products/create-edit-pricelists>` "
"allows for better customization when applying rental rates to specific time "
"periods, products, or customers by using *Pricelist Rules*. It is a separate "
"form that users can apply to quotations or select on the rental product form "
"to add new price rules to."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarjanje :ref:`novega cenika <sales/products/create-edit-pricelists>` "
"omogoča boljšo prilagoditev pri uporabi tarif najema za določena časovna "
"obdobja, izdelke ali stranke z uporabo *Pravil cenika*. To je ločen obrazec, "
"ki ga lahko uporabniki uporabijo za ponudbe ali izberejo na obrazcu izdelka "
"za najem, da dodajo nova cenovna pravila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:116
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products --> Pricelists` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`. A *Create Pricelist Rules* window displays."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products --> Pricelists` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`. Odpre se okno *Ustvari pravila cenika*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:119
msgid ""
"Sample of the Create Pricelist Rules window in the Odoo Rental application."
msgstr "Primer okna Ustvari pravila cenika v aplikaciji Odoo Najem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:127
msgid ""
"A bike rental business rents out its bikes on an hourly basis, but offers a "
"20% discount for summer break. The regular hourly rate for their bikes is "
"$20."
msgstr ""
"Podjetje za izposojo koles svoja kolesa oddaja po urah, vendar med poletnimi "
"počitnicami ponuja 20-odstotni popust. Redna urna postavka za njihova kolesa "
"je 20 $."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:130
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Sales Price` in the *General Information* tab of the "
"product form, then click the :guilabel:`Sales` tab to set "
"the :guilabel:`Periodicity` to :guilabel:`Hours` and enter `30 min` for "
"the :guilabel:`Padding Time`."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite :guilabel:`Prodajna cena` v zavihku *Splošne informacije* obrazca "
"izdelka, nato kliknite zavihek :guilabel:`Prodaja`, da nastavite "
":guilabel:`Periodičnost` na :guilabel:`Ure` in vnesite `30 min` za "
":guilabel:`Čas priprave`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:134
msgid "Add alt text."
msgstr "Dodaj alternativno besedilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:137
msgid ""
"Using the Pricelist method, navigate to :menuselection:`Rental app --> "
"Products --> Pricelists` and click :guilabel:`New`. "
"Configure :guilabel:`Pricelist Rules` for the 20% discount using the "
"following settings:"
msgstr ""
"Z uporabo metode cenika pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Izposoja --> "
"Izdelki --> Ceniki` in kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`. Konfigurirajte "
":guilabel:`Pravila cenika` za 20-odstotni popust z naslednjimi nastavitvami:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:142
msgid ":guilabel:`Product`: Select *City bike* from the drop-down menu"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Izdelek`: v spustnem meniju izberite *City bike*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:144
msgid ":guilabel:`Discount`: Enter `20`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Popust`: vnesite `20`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:145
msgid ":guilabel:`Validity`: Select `Aug 1` to `Aug 31`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Veljavnost`: izberite `Aug 1` do `Aug 31`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:147
msgid "Sample of a rental product with the custom rental pricelist applied."
msgstr ""
"Primer izdelka za izposojo z uveljavljenim prilagojenim cenikom izposoje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:155
msgid ""
"Prices can also be configured directly on the product using the *Prices* "
"tab. It is recommended to create a new :guilabel:`Pricelist` first, then "
"select the customized :guilabel:`Pricelist` in the *Prices* tab instead of "
"using the *Default* pricelist. Keeping the *Default* pricelist blank ensures "
"there is a clean pricelist for the base rental rate."
msgstr ""
"Cene je mogoče konfigurirati tudi neposredno na izdelku z zavihkom *Cene*. "
"Priporočljivo je, da najprej ustvarite nov :guilabel:`Cenik`, nato pa v "
"zavihku *Cene* izberete prilagojeni :guilabel:`Cenik`, namesto da uporabite "
"cenik *Privzeto*. Če pustite cenik *Privzeto* prazen, zagotovite čist cenik "
"za osnovno tarifo izposoje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:160
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:212
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Products --> Products`, then click the desired "
"product. Click the :guilabel:`Prices` tab and click :guilabel:`Add a price`."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na :menuselection:`Izdelki --> Izdelki` in kliknite želeni izdelek. "
"Kliknite zavihek :guilabel:`Cene` in kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj ceno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:163
msgid ""
"Select the desired :guilabel:`Pricelist`. In the :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` "
"column, enter the minimum amount needed to trigger the price change. "
"The :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` column is based on the unit of time selected "
"in the :guilabel:`Periodicity` field in the *Sales* tab."
msgstr ""
"Izberite želeni :guilabel:`Cenik`. V stolpec :guilabel:`Min. količina` "
"vnesite najmanjšo količino, potrebno za sprožitev spremembe cene. Stolpec "
":guilabel:`Min. količina` temelji na časovni enoti, izbrani v polju "
":guilabel:`Periodičnost` v zavihku *Prodaja*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:167
msgid "Lastly, enter the :guilabel:`Price` rate."
msgstr "Nazadnje vnesite tarifo :guilabel:`Cena`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:172
msgid ""
"Using the same scenario in the :ref:`Pricelists method example <rental/"
"products/pricelists-method-example>`, use the *Prices* tab method by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products --> Products` and "
"clicking the bike product. Click the :guilabel:`Prices` tab, then select the "
"desired pricelist for the :guilabel:`Pricelist` column. Enter `16` for "
"the :guilabel:`Unit Price` column."
msgstr ""
"Z uporabo istega scenarija v razdelku :ref:`Primer metode cenikov <rental/"
"products/pricelists-method-example>` uporabite metodo zavihka *Cene* tako, "
"da se pomaknete na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Izposoja --> Izdelki --> "
"Izdelki` in kliknete izdelek kolesa. Kliknite zavihek :guilabel:`Cene`, nato "
"pa izberite želeni cenik za stolpec :guilabel:`Cenik`. V stolpec "
":guilabel:`Cena na enoto` vnesite `16`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:178
msgid ""
"To add the :guilabel:`Validity` column, click the :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(Settings adjust)` icon and select :guilabel:`Validity`. "
"Then select `Aug 1` to `Aug 31` for the date range in which the discount is "
"applicable."
msgstr ""
"Če želite dodati stolpec :guilabel:`Veljavnost`, kliknite ikono :icon:`oi-"
"settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(Prilagoditev nastavitev)` in izberite "
":guilabel:`Veljavnost`. Nato za datumsko obdobje, v katerem velja popust, "
"izberite `Aug 1` do `Aug 31`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:182
msgid "Sample of a rental product's Price tab."
msgstr "Primer zavihka Cene pri izdelku za izposojo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:198
msgid ""
"Refer to the *Availabilities* setting in the :ref:`Rental app's settings "
"<rental/product_type/configuration>` to set what days and business hours of "
"the week customers can book or return rental products online at a company "
"level. If the product isn't published to the website then the setting does "
"not go into effect."
msgstr ""
"Glejte nastavitev *Razpoložljivosti* v :ref:`nastavitvah aplikacije Izposoja "
"<rental/product_type/configuration>`, da na ravni podjetja nastavite, katere "
"dni in delovne ure v tednu lahko stranke na spletu rezervirajo ali vrnejo "
"izdelke za izposojo. Če izdelek ni objavljen na spletnem mestu, nastavitev "
"ne začne veljati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:206
msgid "Configure product tracking"
msgstr "Konfiguracija sledenja izdelkom"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:209
msgid ""
"To configure a physical rental product for product tracking, the "
"**Inventory** app must be installed, and *Lots & Serial Numbers* must be "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo fizičnega izdelka za izposojo za sledenje izdelkom mora "
"biti nameščena aplikacija **Zaloga**, omogočene pa morajo biti *Serije in "
"serijske številke*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:212
msgid ""
"For rental products, only :guilabel:`By Unique Serial Number` tracking can "
"be used. Selecting :guilabel:`By Lots` instead results in an error message, "
"since that setting doesn't apply to rentals."
msgstr ""
"Za izdelke za izposojo se lahko uporablja le sledenje :guilabel:`Po enolični "
"serijski številki`. Izbira možnosti :guilabel:`Po lotih` namesto tega "
"povzroči sporočilo o napaki, saj ta nastavitev ne velja za izposojo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:216
msgid ""
"Go to the :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products --> Products`, then "
"click :guilabel:`New`. In the new product window, the :guilabel:`Sales` "
"checkbox is already selected by default. Select :guilabel:`Goods` as "
"the :guilabel:`Product Type`. The :guilabel:`Tracking` field defaults "
"to :guilabel:`By Quantity`."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Izposoja --> Izdelki --> Izdelki` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`. V oknu novega izdelka je potrditveno polje "
":guilabel:`Prodaja` že privzeto označeno. Izberite :guilabel:`Blago` kot "
":guilabel:`Vrsta izdelka`. Polje :guilabel:`Sledenje` je privzeto "
"nastavljeno na :guilabel:`Po količini`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:221
msgid ""
"Click into the :guilabel:`Tracking` field and select :guilabel:`By Unique "
"Serial Number`. Enter the number of products available to rent in "
"the :guilabel:`Quantity On Hand` field."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite v polje :guilabel:`Sledenje` in izberite :guilabel:`Po enolični "
"serijski številki`. V polje :guilabel:`Količina na zalogi` vnesite število "
"izdelkov, ki so na voljo za izposojo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:224
msgid ""
"For the :guilabel:`Category` field, select :guilabel:`Goods` from the drop-"
"down menu or create a new category by typing in the name and "
"clicking :guilabel:`Create`. Configure :ref:`basic rental rate <rental/"
"products/base-rental-period-and-price>` and any :ref:`additional rates "
"<rental/products/multiple-rental-prices>`."
msgstr ""
"Za polje :guilabel:`Kategorija` v spustnem meniju izberite :guilabel:`Blago` "
"ali ustvarite novo kategorijo z vnosom imena in klikom na "
":guilabel:`Ustvari`. Konfigurirajte :ref:`osnovno tarifo izposoje <rental/"
"products/base-rental-period-and-price>` in morebitne :ref:`dodatne tarife "
"<rental/products/multiple-rental-prices>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:232
msgid "Rental Transfers feature"
msgstr "Funkcija najemalnih prenosov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:234
msgid ""
"The *Rental Transfers* feature automatically creates a delivery receipt when "
"the rental product is picked up and a return receipt when it is returned to "
"stock. Documenting stock movement creates a clean paper trail and has a "
"variety of uses:"
msgstr ""
"Funkcija *Najemalni prenosi* samodejno ustvari dobavnico, ko je najet "
"izdelek prevzet, in prejemnico ob vrnitvi, ko je vrnjen v zalogo. "
"Dokumentiranje gibanja zaloge ustvari pregleden papirni след in ima različne "
"uporabe:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:238
msgid "Tracking high-value products."
msgstr "Sledenje visoko vrednim izdelkom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:239
msgid "Tracking stock levels across multiple stores or warehouse locations."
msgstr "Sledenje ravnem zaloge v več trgovinah ali skladiščnih lokacijah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:240
msgid ""
"Tracking products between different store locations that allow pick up and "
"returns."
msgstr ""
"Sledenje izdelkov med različnimi lokacijami trgovin, ki omogočajo prevzem in "
"vračila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:242
msgid ""
"To enable *Rental Transfers*, navigate to the :menuselection:`Rental app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` and in the *Inventory* section, select "
"the :guilabel:`Rental Transfers` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Če želite omogočiti *Prenose izposoje*, pojdite v :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Rental --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve` in v razdelku *Zaloga* označite "
"potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Prenosi izposoje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:245
msgid "Example of the Rental Transfers setting for the Rental app."
msgstr "Primer nastavitve Prenosi izposoje za aplikacijo Rental."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:252
msgid ""
"The **Inventory** app automatically creates an internal default location "
"once the *Rental Transfers* feature is enabled. Odoo uses the new default "
"location, `Customer/Rental`, to track products during the rental period "
"(moving them from `Stock` to `Customer/Rental` upon rental, and back upon "
"return)."
msgstr ""
"Ko je omogočena funkcija *Prenosi izposoje*, aplikacija **Zaloga** samodejno "
"ustvari interno privzeto lokacijo. Odoo uporablja novo privzeto lokacijo, "
"`Customer/Rental`, za sledenje izdelkom med obdobjem izposoje (ob izposoji "
"jih premakne iz `Stock` na `Customer/Rental`, ob vračilu pa nazaj)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:257
msgid "Do not modify `Customer/Rental` to avoid corrupting inventory tracking."
msgstr "Ne spreminjajte `Customer/Rental`, da ne poškodujete sledenja zalogam."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:263
msgid "Multi-location management and transfers"
msgstr "Upravljanje več lokacij in prenosi"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:266
msgid ""
"Refer to the :ref:`Rental Transfers note <rental/products/rental-transfers-"
"note>` for information about internal location configuration and inventory "
"tracking."
msgstr ""
"Za informacije o konfiguraciji notranjih lokacij in sledenju zalogi si "
"oglejte :ref:`opombo o prenosih izposoje <rental/products/rental-transfers-"
"note>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:269
msgid ""
"Tracking the location of high-value physical products between locations is "
"essential. The **Rental** app helps with the *Rental Transfers* feature. "
"Activating rental transfers means the system treats rental movements "
"similarly to sales, requiring a receipt and a delivery order every time a "
"physical product is rented or returned."
msgstr ""
"Sledenje lokaciji visoko vrednih fizičnih izdelkov med lokacijami je "
"bistveno. Aplikacija **Najem** pomaga s funkcijo *Najemni prenosi*. "
"Aktiviranje najemnih prenosov pomeni, da sistem obravnava najemne premike "
"podobno kot prodajo, kar zahteva potrdilo o prejemu in dobavnico vsakič, ko "
"je fizični izdelek najet ali vrnjen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:274
msgid ""
"For multi-location management and rental item transfer tracking, navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Rental app --> Configuration --> Settings` and in the "
"*Inventory* section, select the :guilabel:`Rental Transfers` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Za upravljanje več lokacij in sledenje prenosom artiklov za izposojo pojdite "
"v :menuselection:`Aplikacija Rental --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve` in v "
"razdelku *Zaloga* označite potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Prenosi izposoje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:278
msgid ""
"Next, go to the :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` and in the *Warehouse* section, select the :guilabel:`Storage "
"Locations` checkbox. Click :guilabel:`Save` to apply the changes."
msgstr ""
"Nato pojdite v :menuselection:`Aplikacija Inventory --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Nastavitve` in v razdelku *Skladišče* označite potrditveno polje "
":guilabel:`Lokacije shranjevanja`. Kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`, da "
"uveljavite spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:282
msgid ""
"Create a :ref:`new location <inventory/use_locations/create-new-locations>` "
"and on the new location page, enter the :guilabel:`Location Name` and ensure "
"the :guilabel:`Parent Location` field is set to :guilabel:`WH`."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarite :ref:`novo lokacijo <inventory/use_locations/create-new-locations>"
"` in na strani nove lokacije vnesite :guilabel:`Naziv lokacije` ter "
"poskrbite, da je polje :guilabel:`Nadredjena lokacija` nastavljeno na "
":guilabel:`WH`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:287
msgid ""
"A bike rental business has two store locations within the same city. Both "
"locations allow for pickup and dropoff of their bikes. The company wants to "
"track its bikes accurately at each location."
msgstr ""
"Podjetje za izposojo koles ima dve trgovini v istem mestu. Obe lokaciji "
"omogočata prevzem in vračilo koles. Podjetje želi natančno slediti svojim "
"kolesom na vsaki lokaciji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:291
msgid ""
"Ensure the **Rental** and **Inventory** apps are configured by "
"enabling :guilabel:`Rental Transfers` in the **Rental app** "
"and :guilabel:`Storage Locations` in the **Inventory** app."
msgstr ""
"Prepričajte se, da sta aplikaciji **Izposoja** in **Zaloga** konfigurirani, "
"tako da omogočite :guilabel:`Prenosi izposoje` v aplikaciji **Izposoja** ter "
":guilabel:`Lokacije hrambe` v aplikaciji **Zaloga**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:294
msgid ""
"Next, go to the :menuselection:`Inventory app > Configuration > Locations`. "
"Create a new location for each storefront."
msgstr ""
"Nato pojdite na :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Locations`. Ustvarite novo lokacijo za vsako poslovalnico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/products.rst:297
msgid ""
"Sample of internal inventory locations that represent different rental store "
"locations."
msgstr ""
"Vzorec notranjih lokacij zaloge, ki predstavljajo različne lokacije najemnih "
"trgovin."

