#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:24
msgid ""
"To access the Rental app's settings, navigate to :menuselection:`Rental app "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"Za dostop do nastavitev aplikacije Rental pojdite v "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija Rental --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:27
msgid ""
"The following configurations assume the **Rental**, **Planning**, and "
"**Sales** apps are installed."
msgstr ""
"Naslednje konfiguracije predvidevajo, da so nameščene aplikacije "
"**Izposoja**, **Načrtovanje** in **Prodaja**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:32
msgid "Configure materials and a role for the physical product"
msgstr "Konfigurirajte materiale in vlogo za fizični izdelek"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:34
msgid ""
"Before creating a service product in the **Rental** app, "
"configure :ref:`materials <planning/materials>` and :ref:`create a role "
"<planning/roles>` in the **Planning** app for the physical rental products "
"(such as storage units or conference rooms)."
msgstr ""
"Pred ustvarjanjem storitvenega izdelka v aplikaciji **Izposoja** "
"konfigurirajte :ref:`materiale <planning/materials>` in :ref:`ustvarite "
"vlogo <planning/roles>` v aplikaciji **Načrtovanje** za fizične izdelke za "
"izposojo (kot so skladiščne enote ali konferenčne sobe)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:38
msgid ""
"This allows the **Planning** app to create and assign shifts for the "
"physical rental product, and the *Role* links the rental materials to the "
"rental service. Whenever the service is added to a rental order, the "
"**Rental** app syncs with the **Planning** app to check and update the "
"material shift availability."
msgstr ""
"To aplikaciji **Načrtovanje** omogoča ustvarjanje in dodeljevanje izmen za "
"fizični izdelek za izposojo, *Vloga* pa povezuje materiale za izposojo s "
"storitvijo izposoje. Vsakič, ko je storitev dodana v nalog za izposojo, se "
"aplikacija **Izposoja** sinhronizira z aplikacijo **Načrtovanje**, da "
"preveri in posodobi razpoložljivost izmene materiala."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:44
msgid "It's recommended to name the role after the service."
msgstr "Priporočljivo je, da vlogo poimenujete po storitvi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:47
msgid ""
"Shady Grove needs to add a new room tier to the **Rental** app, the *Deluxe "
"Room*. There are seven rooms that belong in this tier. Create a new *Role* "
"by navigating to the :menuselection:`Planning app --> Configuration --> "
"Roles`. Click :guilabel:`New` and create the :guilabel:`Deluxe Room Role`."
msgstr ""
"Shady Grove mora v aplikacijo **Izposoja** dodati novo kategorijo sob, "
"*Deluxe soba*. V to kategorijo spada sedem sob. Ustvarite novo *Vlogo*, tako "
"da se pomaknete na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Načrtovanje --> "
"Konfiguracija --> Vloge`. Kliknite :guilabel:`Novo` in ustvarite "
":guilabel:`Vloga Deluxe soba`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:52
msgid "Example of configured role for the Deluxe Room."
msgstr "Primer konfigurirane vloge za Deluxe Room."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:55
msgid ""
"To add the seven rooms as a resource for the *Role*, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Materials`. Click :guilabel:`New`, "
"enter the room number, and :guilabel:`Deluxe Room` for the :guilabel:`Role` "
"column. Repeat that process for all seven rooms."
msgstr ""
"Če želite sedem sob dodati kot vir za *Vlogo*, se pomaknite na "
":menuselection:`Konfiguracija --> Materiali`. Kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`, "
"vnesite številko sobe in :guilabel:`Deluxe soba` za stolpec "
":guilabel:`Vloga`. Postopek ponovite za vseh sedem sob."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:59
msgid "Example of configured materials for the Deluxe Room."
msgstr "Primer konfiguriranih materialov za Deluxe Room."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:62
msgid ""
"Create the :guilabel:`Deluxe Room` as a new *Service* product type by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New`, then configure the Deluxe Room as "
"a :guilabel:`Service` type product with the :guilabel:`Plan Services` "
"checkbox enabled and the :guilabel:`Deluxe Room` role assigned."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarite :guilabel:`Deluxe Room` kot novo vrsto izdelka *Storitev* tako, da "
"se pomaknete v :menuselection:`aplikacija Izposoja --> Izdelki`. Kliknite "
":guilabel:`Novo`, nato konfigurirajte Deluxe Room kot izdelek vrste "
":guilabel:`Storitev` z označenim potrditvenim poljem :guilabel:`Načrtuj "
"storitve` in dodeljeno vlogo :guilabel:`Deluxe Room`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:67
msgid "Example of the Plan Services field configured to the Deluxe Room role."
msgstr "Primer polja Načrtuj storitve, konfiguriranega za vlogo Deluxe Room."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:83
msgid ""
"The **Sales** and **Planning** apps must be installed for the *Prepaid/Fixed "
"Price* option of the *Invoicing Policy* and *Plan Services* fields to be "
"available. Enabling the *Sales* checkbox displays the *Invoicing Policy*."
msgstr ""
"Aplikaciji **Prodaja** in **Načrtovanje** morata biti nameščeni, da sta na "
"voljo možnosti *Predplačilo/Fiksna cena* v poljih *Politika zaračunavanja* "
"in *Načrtovanje storitev*. Omogočitev potrditvenega polja *Prodaja* prikaže "
"*Politiko zaračunavanja*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:87
msgid ""
"In the new product window, the :guilabel:`Sales` checkbox is already enabled "
"by default. Select the :guilabel:`Product Type` as :guilabel:`Service`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` drop-down menu, select :guilabel:`Prepaid/"
"Fixed Price`. Enable the :guilabel:`Plan Services` checkbox and "
"either :ref:`create a new role <planning/roles>` or select a pre-existing "
"one."
msgstr ""
"V oknu za nov izdelek je potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Prodaja` že privzeto "
"omogočeno. Izberite :guilabel:`Tip izdelka` kot :guilabel:`Storitev`. V "
"spustnem meniju :guilabel:`Politika zaračunavanja` izberite "
":guilabel:`Predplačilo/Fiksna cena`. Omogočite potrditveno polje "
":guilabel:`Načrtovanje storitev` in bodisi :ref:`ustvarite novo vlogo "
"<planning/roles>` ali izberite že obstoječo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:92
msgid "Example of a configured physical service product in the Rental app."
msgstr ""
"Primer konfiguriranega fizičnega storitvenega izdelka v aplikaciji Izposoja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:98
msgid ""
"Example of a configured Role page for the Deluxe Room in the Rental app."
msgstr "Primer konfigurirane strani Vloga za Deluxe Room v aplikaciji Izposoja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:102
msgid ""
"Assign a :guilabel:`Category` for room booking. It separates rooms from "
"other services and can be used for reports on room occupancy."
msgstr ""
"Dodelite :guilabel:`Kategorija` za rezervacijo sob. To loči sobe od drugih "
"storitev in se lahko uporablja za poročila o zasedenosti sob."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:110
msgid ""
"To set the base rental price for a rental product, open the *General "
"Information* tab and enter the lowest rental price in the :guilabel:`Sales "
"Price` field. Next, click the :guilabel:`Sales` tab, then configure the "
"following *Rental* section fields where applicable:"
msgstr ""
"Če želite nastaviti osnovno ceno izposoje za izdelek za izposojo, odprite "
"zavihek *Splošne informacije* in vnesite najnižjo ceno izposoje v polje "
":guilabel:`Prodajna cena`. Nato kliknite zavihek :guilabel:`Prodaja` in po "
"potrebi konfigurirajte naslednja polja v razdelku *Izposoja*:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Periodicity`: The unit of time the product will use for rental "
"prices."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Periodičnost`: Časovna enota, ki jo bo izdelek uporabljal za cene "
"izposoje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:115
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Padding Time`: Blocks a rental product from being available for "
"reservations. The setting is set to an hourly unit. This is available only "
"if :guilabel:`Hours` is selected in the :guilabel:`Periodicity` field and "
"the **Inventory app** is installed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Čas zaščite`: Prepreči, da bi bil izdelek za izposojo na voljo za "
"rezervacije. Nastavitev je določena v urni enoti. To je na voljo le, če je v "
"polju :guilabel:`Ure` izbrano :guilabel:`Periodičnost` polje in če je "
"nameščena **aplikacija Zaloge**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:126
msgid "The *Variants* feature must be enabled for this tab to display."
msgstr "Za prikaz tega zavihka mora biti omogočena funkcija *Različice*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:128
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line`, then select any room amenity or room item from "
"the :guilabel:`Attribute` drop-down menu. To create a new one, enter the "
"name and click :guilabel:`Create and edit` to configure the attribute and "
"values."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico`, nato izberite katero koli opremo ali "
"predmet sobe iz spustnega menija :guilabel:`Atribut`. Če želite ustvariti "
"novega, vnesite ime in kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari in uredi` za "
"konfiguracijo atributa in vrednosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:133
msgid ""
"Shady Grove has a list of amenities it wants to configure for their Deluxe "
"Room. The room has two types of bed configurations: two double beds or one "
"king bed. The maximum occupancy per room is two adults or two adults and a "
"child."
msgstr ""
"Shady Grove ima seznam opreme, ki jo želi konfigurirati za svojo Deluxe "
"sobo. Soba ima dve vrsti posteljnih konfiguracij: dve dvojni postelji ali "
"ena kraljevska postelja. Največja zasedenost sobe sta dve odrasli osebi ali "
"dve odrasli osebi in otrok."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:137
msgid ""
"Navigate to the :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products` and "
"click :guilabel:`New` to create a new product. On the :guilabel:`Attributes "
"& Variants` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line` and select the :guilabel:`Bed` "
"as an :guilabel:`Attribute`. In the :guilabel:`Values` column, "
"add :guilabel:`2 Double` and :guilabel:`1 King`. Repeat these steps until "
"all amenities have been configured."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite v :menuselection:`Aplikacija Izposoja --> Izdelki` in kliknite "
":guilabel:`Novo`, da ustvarite nov izdelek. Na zavihku :guilabel:`Lastnosti "
"in različice` kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico` ter izberite "
":guilabel:`Postelja` kot :guilabel:`Lastnost`. V stolpcu "
":guilabel:`Vrednosti` dodajte :guilabel:`1 King` in :guilabel:`2 Double`. Te "
"korake ponavljajte, dokler niso konfigurirane vse ugodnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:143
msgid "Example of the Attribute & Variants tab configured for a hotel room."
msgstr ""
"Primer zavihka Lastnosti in različice, konfiguriranega za hotelsko sobo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:151
msgid ""
"There are two ways to configure additional rental rates in the **Rental** "
"app: :ref:`Pricelists <rental/service_products/pricelist-method>` and "
"the :ref:`Prices tab <rental/service_products/prices-tab>`."
msgstr ""
"V aplikaciji **Izposoja** obstajata dva načina za konfiguracijo dodatnih "
"najemnih cen: :ref:`Ceniki <rental/service_products/pricelist-method>` in "
":ref:`zavihek Cene <rental/service_products/prices-tab>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:160
msgid ""
"Creating a :ref:`new pricelist <sales/products/create-edit-pricelists>` "
"allows for better customization when applying rental rates to specific time "
"periods, products, or customers by using :guilabel:`Pricelist Rules`. It is "
"a separate form that users can apply to quotations or select on the rental "
"product form to add new price rules to."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarjanje :ref:`novega cenika <sales/products/create-edit-pricelists>` "
"omogoča boljšo prilagoditev pri uporabi najemnih cen za določena časovna "
"obdobja, izdelke ali stranke z uporabo :guilabel:`Pravila cenika`. Gre za "
"ločen obrazec, ki ga lahko uporabniki uporabijo pri ponudbah ali izberejo na "
"obrazcu izdelka za najem za dodajanje novih cenovnih pravil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:165
msgid ""
"To create a new pricelist, go to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products --> "
"Pricelists` and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite ustvariti nov cenik, pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Izposoja --> Izdelki --> Ceniki` in kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:178
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Sales Price` and then click the :guilabel:`Sales` tab "
"and set the :guilabel:`Periodicity` to :guilabel:`Hours` and enter `24` for "
"the :guilabel:`Padding Time`."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite :guilabel:`Prodajna cena`, nato kliknite zavihek "
":guilabel:`Prodaja`, nastavite :guilabel:`Periodičnost` na :guilabel:`Ure` "
"in vnesite `24` za :guilabel:`Čas za pripravo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:181
msgid "Sample of the Rental section of the Sales tab of a service product."
msgstr "Primer razdelka Izposoja na zavihku Prodaja za storitveni izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:184
msgid ""
"Using the Pricelist method, navigate to :menuselection:`Rental app --> "
"Products --> Pricelists` and click :guilabel:`New`. Configure Pricelist "
"Rules for the daily rate with the following settings:"
msgstr ""
"Z uporabo metode cenika pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Izposoja --> "
"Izdelki --> Ceniki` in kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`. Konfigurirajte pravila "
"cenika za dnevno ceno z naslednjimi nastavitvami:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:193
msgid ""
"Sample of the customized Pricelist of service product in the Rental app."
msgstr "Primer prilagojenega cenika storitvenega izdelka v aplikaciji Izposoja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:205
msgid ""
"Rental rates can also be configured as a new price rule for an existing "
"pricelist using the :guilabel:`Prices` tab on the product form. If no "
"pricelist is configured beforehand, the *Default* pricelist is selected."
msgstr ""
"Najemne cene je mogoče konfigurirati tudi kot novo cenovno pravilo za "
"obstoječi cenik z uporabo zavihka :guilabel:`Cene` na obrazcu izdelka. Če "
"predhodno ni konfiguriran noben cenik, je izbran cenik *Privzeto*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:229
msgid ""
"Using the same scenario in the :ref:`Pricelists method example <rental/"
"service_products/pricelists-example>`, use the :guilabel:`Prices` tab method "
"by navigating to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products --> Products` and "
"click the desired product to configure. Click the :guilabel:`Prices` tab and "
"select the :guilabel:`Photographer Rental` option for "
"the :guilabel:`Pricelist` column. Enter `8` in the :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` "
"column and enter `24` for the :guilabel:`Price` column."
msgstr ""
"Z uporabo istega scenarija kot v :ref:`primeru metode cenikov <rental/"
"service_products/pricelists-example>` uporabite metodo zavihka "
":guilabel:`Cene` tako, da se pomaknete na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Izposoja --> Izdelki --> Izdelki` in kliknete želeni izdelek za "
"konfiguracijo. Kliknite zavihek :guilabel:`Cene` in izberite možnost "
":guilabel:`Najem fotografa` v stolpcu :guilabel:`Cenik`. Vnesite `8` v "
"stolpec :guilabel:`Min. količina` in vnesite `24` v stolpec :guilabel:`Cena`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders.rst:5
msgid "Rental orders"
msgstr "Naročila za najem"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:-1
msgid ""
"This page covers the rental order workflow in Odoo **Rental**, from creating "
"a quote and requesting a customer signature to tracking service time and "
"finalizing the invoice for payment."
msgstr ""
"Ta stran obravnava potek dela z naročili za najem v Odoo **Izposoja**, od "
"ustvarjanja ponudbe in zahteve za podpis stranke do sledenja času storitve "
"in dokončanja računa za plačilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:10
msgid ""
"In Odoo **Rental**, quotations are created and sent to customers, similar to "
"**Sales** quotations. Once a quotation is confirmed, it becomes a *rental "
"order* and can be invoiced and paid for. Only after a rental order is "
"confirmed can rental products be picked up."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo **Izposoja** se ponudbe ustvarjajo in pošiljajo strankam podobno kot "
"ponudbe v **Prodaja**. Ko je ponudba potrjena, postane *naročilo za najem* "
"ter jo je mogoče izdati na računu in plačati. Izdelke za najem je mogoče "
"prevzeti šele po potrditvi naročila za najem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:15
msgid ""
"To configure quotation settings, the **Sales** app **must** be installed. "
"Refer to :ref:`sales/create_quotations/quotation-settings` section on the "
"*Create quotations* page for detailed instructions."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguriranje nastavitev ponudb **mora** biti nameščena aplikacija "
"**Sales**. Za podrobna navodila si oglejte razdelek :ref:`sales/"
"create_quotations/quotation-settings` na strani *Ustvari ponudbe*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:22
msgid "Create a rental quotation"
msgstr "Ustvari ponudbo za najem"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:25
msgid ""
"Users can convert a :doc:`sales quotation <../../sales/sales_quotations/"
"create_quotations>` to a rental quotation by adding a rental product. Doing "
"so automatically adds the :guilabel:`Rental period` field. To convert a "
"rental quotation to a sales quote, remove the rental start and return dates."
msgstr ""
"Uporabniki lahko pretvorijo :doc:`prodajno ponudbo <../../sales/"
"sales_quotations/create_quotations>` v ponudbo za najem z dodajanjem izdelka "
"za najem. S tem se samodejno doda polje :guilabel:`Obdobje najema`. Če "
"želite ponudbo za najem pretvoriti v prodajno ponudbo, odstranite začetni "
"datum najema in datum vračila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:30
msgid ""
"To create a rental quotation, open the **Rental** app and create one from "
"the *Rental Orders* dashboard or navigate to :menuselection:`Rental app --> "
"Orders --> Orders`, click :guilabel:`New` and select :guilabel:`New "
"Quotation`. Then complete the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"Če želite ustvariti ponudbo za najem, odprite aplikacijo **Rental** in jo "
"ustvarite na nadzorni plošči *Nalogi za najem* ali pojdite na "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija Rental --> Naročila --> Naročila`, kliknite "
":guilabel:`Novo` in izberite :guilabel:`Nova ponudba`. Nato izvedite "
"naslednje korake:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Add a customer**: Enter or select a customer from the :guilabel:`Customer` "
"drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"**Dodajte stranko**: Vnesite ali izberite stranko iz spustnega menija "
":guilabel:`Stranka`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Add a rental product**: In the *Order Lines* tab, click :guilabel:`Add "
"Line` or :guilabel:`Catalog`, and select the desired rental product."
msgstr ""
"**Dodajte izdelek za izposojo**: V zavihku *Vrstice naročila* kliknite "
":guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico` ali :guilabel:`Katalog` in izberite želeni izdelek "
"za izposojo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Set the rental duration**: Select the desired dates and times via the pop-"
"up calendar for the :guilabel:`Rental period`."
msgstr ""
"**Nastavite trajanje izposoje**: V pojavnem koledarju izberite želene datume "
"in ure za :guilabel:`Obdobje izposoje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Apply a pricelist** (optional): Select an option from "
"the :guilabel:`Pricelist` drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"**Uporabite cenik** (neobvezno): Izberite možnost v spustnem meniju "
":guilabel:`Cenik`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Send and confirm rental quotation**: Click :guilabel:`Send` to send the "
"quotation to the customer. When the customer confirms the quotation, "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm` to finalize the order. A :guilabel:`Booked` badge "
"displays on the rental order."
msgstr ""
"**Pošljite in potrdite ponudbo za izposojo**: Kliknite :guilabel:`Pošlji`, "
"da ponudbo pošljete stranki. Ko stranka ponudbo potrdi, kliknite "
":guilabel:`Potrdi`, da zaključite naročilo. Na naročilu za izposojo se "
"prikaže značka :guilabel:`Rezervirano`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:45
msgid ""
"There can only be one rental period per rental order. Multiple rental "
"product orders with different rental periods require a rental order for each "
"rental period."
msgstr ""
"Na naročilo za najem lahko obstaja samo eno obdobje najema. Več naročil "
"najemnih izdelkov z različnimi obdobji najema zahteva naročilo za najem za "
"vsako obdobje najema."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:49
msgid ""
"If :doc:`quotation templates <../../sales/sales_quotations/quote_template>` "
"are enabled, users can select and modify a template from the :guilabel:`New` "
"button drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Če so omogočene :doc:`predloge ponudb <../../sales/sales_quotations/"
"quote_template>`, lahko uporabniki izberejo in spremenijo predlogo v "
"spustnem meniju gumba :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:52
msgid ""
"As long as the rental quotation isn't confirmed, the user can change "
"the :guilabel:`Rental period` or :doc:`Pricelist <../../sales/"
"products_prices/prices/pricing>` on the rental quotation. The **Rental** app "
"automatically updates the rental "
"product's :guilabel:`Hours`, :guilabel:`Unit Price`, and :guilabel:`Amount` "
"on the product line and the quotation :guilabel:`Total` after the change."
msgstr ""
"Dokler ponudba za izposojo ni potrjena, lahko uporabnik v ponudbi za "
"izposojo spremeni :guilabel:`Obdobje izposoje` ali :doc:`Cenik <../../sales/"
"products_prices/prices/pricing>`. Aplikacija **Izposoja** po spremembi "
"samodejno posodobi polja izdelka za izposojo :guilabel:`Ure`, "
":guilabel:`Cena na enoto` in :guilabel:`Znesek` v vrstici izdelka ter "
":guilabel:`Skupaj` ponudbe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:57
msgid ""
"When a rental order is confirmed, smart buttons may appear at the top of the "
"form, depending on the :ref:`app integrations <rental/product_type/app-"
"integration>`:"
msgstr ""
"Ko je naročilo za najem potrjeno, se lahko na vrhu obrazca prikažejo pametni "
"gumbi, odvisno od :ref:`integracij aplikacij <rental/product_type/app-"
"integration>`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:60
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`Tasks`: Linked to the **Projects** app and shows "
"any projects or tasks related to the rental order."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`Opravila`: Povezano z aplikacijo **Projekti** in "
"prikazuje vse projekte ali opravila, povezana z naročilom za izposojo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:62
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`Recorded`: Linked to the **Timesheets** app "
"and shows how many hours are related to the rental order."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`Zabeleženo`: Povezano z aplikacijo "
"**Časovnica** in prikazuje, koliko ur je povezanih z naročilom najema."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:64
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-tasks` :guilabel:`Planned`: Linked to the **Planning** app and "
"shows how many shifts are related to the rental order."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-tasks` :guilabel:`Planirano`: Povezano z aplikacijo **Planiranje** "
"in prikazuje, koliko izmen je povezanih z naročilom najema."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:66
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Delivery`: Linked to the **Inventory** app and "
"shows any delivery and receipt orders related to the rental order."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Dostava`: Povezano z aplikacijo **Zaloga** in "
"prikazuje morebitne dobavne in prevzemne naloge, povezane z naročilom za "
"najem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:69
msgid ""
"Sample of a filled-out rental order available in the Odoo Rental application."
msgstr ""
"Vzorec izpolnjenega naročila najema, dostopnega v aplikaciji Odoo Rental."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:75
msgid "Request a customer signature"
msgstr "Zahtevaj podpis stranke"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:77
msgid ""
"Odoo can request that the customer sign a rental agreement outlining the "
"arrangement between the company and the customer *before* they pick up the "
"rental products. This document ensures everything is returned on time and in "
"its original condition."
msgstr ""
"Odoo lahko zahteva, da stranka podpiše pogodbo o izposoji, ki opredeljuje "
"dogovor med podjetjem in stranko, *preden* prevzame izdelke za izposojo. Ta "
"dokument zagotavlja, da je vse vrnjeno pravočasno in v prvotnem stanju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:82
msgid ""
"Requesting a signature can be done during any stage of the order. This "
"feature also requires the :doc:`Sign <../../../productivity/sign>` app."
msgstr ""
"Zahtevo po podpisu je mogoče izvesti v kateri koli fazi naročila. Ta "
"funkcija zahteva tudi aplikacijo :doc:`Sign <../../../productivity/sign>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:85
msgid ""
"If signatures are required, go to the :menuselection:`Rental` app, and from "
"the default *Rental Orders* dashboard, select the desired rental order:"
msgstr ""
"Če so potrebni podpisi, pojdite v aplikacijo :menuselection:`Izposoja` in na "
"privzeti nadzorni plošči *Naročila za izposojo* izberite želeno naročilo za "
"izposojo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:88
msgid "In the chatter section, click :guilabel:`Activity`."
msgstr "V razdelku klepeta kliknite :guilabel:`Dejavnost`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:89
msgid ""
"In the *Schedule Activity* pop-up window, click :guilabel:`Signature "
"Request`."
msgstr ""
"V pojavnem oknu *Načrtuj dejavnost* kliknite :guilabel:`Zahteva za podpis`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:90
msgid ""
":ref:`Select an existing document template <sign/request-signatures/template-"
"odoo-record>` or :ref:`upload a new one <sign/request-signatures/one-off-"
"record>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Izberite obstoječo predlogo dokumenta <sign/request-signatures/"
"template-odoo-record>` ali :ref:`naložite novo <sign/request-signatures/one-"
"off-record>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:93
msgid ""
"After sending the request, a link to the signature request appears in the "
"record's chatter. The document is accessible to the customer via the "
"customer portal or email."
msgstr ""
"Po pošiljanju zahteve se v klepetu zapisa prikaže povezava do zahteve za "
"podpis. Dokument je stranki dostopen prek portala za stranke ali e-pošte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:97
