#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:5
msgid ""
"Requiring fixed deposits is common in many rental scenarios, such as "
"collecting security deposits. Security deposits are insurance in case of "
"damage, theft, or unpaid fees. It is typically refunded when the rented "
"product is returned in good condition, and all terms of the rental or "
"service agreement are met."
msgstr ""
"Zahteva po fiksnih varščinah je pogosta v številnih primerih najema, kot je "
"na primer pobiranje varščin. Varščine predstavljajo zavarovanje v primeru "
"škode, kraje ali neplačanih stroškov. Običajno se vrnejo, ko je izposojeni "
"izdelek vrnjen v dobrem stanju in so izpolnjeni vsi pogoji pogodbe o najemu "
"ali storitvah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:10
msgid ""
"This document covers the standard options for :ref:`configuring <rental/"
"rental_order/manage_deposits/config>`, :ref:`collecting <rental/"
"rental_orders/manage_deposits/optional-product>`, and :ref:`refunding "
"<rental/rental_order/manage_deposits/refund>` deposits within the "
"**Rentals** app."
msgstr ""
"Ta dokument obravnava standardne možnosti za :ref:`konfiguriranje <rental/"
"rental_order/manage_deposits/config>`, :ref:`zbiranje <rental/rental_orders/"
"manage_deposits/optional-product>` in :ref:`vračilo <rental/rental_order/"
"manage_deposits/refund>` varščin v aplikaciji **Izposoja**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:18
msgid ""
"The following apps are essential for configuring deposit service products "
"and processing deposit refunds:"
msgstr ""
"Naslednje aplikacije so bistvene za konfiguriranje storitvenih izdelkov za "
"varščino in obdelavo vračil varščin:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Sales**: Enables the *Price* tab on product forms when :doc:`../../sales/"
"products_prices/prices` is enabled. Also enables the use of quotation "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"**Prodaja**: omogoča zavihek *Cena* na obrazcih izdelkov, ko je omogočeno "
":doc:`../../sales/products_prices/prices`. Omogoča tudi uporabo predlog "
"ponudb."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Accounting**: Enables the use of :doc:`Credit Notes <../../../finance/"
"accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>` on rental orders, which are "
"required when returning a deposit."
msgstr ""
"**Računovodstvo**: Omogoča uporabo :doc:`dobropisov <../../../finance/"
"accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>` pri naročilih za izposojo, ki so "
"potrebni ob vračilu varščine."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:32
msgid ""
"For every rental product that requires a deposit, a second product **must** "
"be configured specifically for the deposit."
msgstr ""
"Za vsak izdelek za izposojo, ki zahteva varščino, **mora** biti posebej za "
"varščino konfiguriran drugi izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:36
msgid ""
"When configuring a digital camera rental that requires a deposit, two "
"products must be configured: `Digital Camera Rental` and `Digital Camera "
"Rental Deposit` products."
msgstr ""
"Pri konfiguriranju izposoje digitalnega fotoaparata, ki zahteva varščino, je "
"treba konfigurirati dva izdelka: izdelka `Digital Camera Rental` in `Digital "
"Camera Rental Deposit`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:40
msgid ""
"Including the product name within the deposit service product name improves "
"organizational clarity and simplifies deposit tracking."
msgstr ""
"Vključitev imena izdelka v ime storitvenega izdelka za varščino izboljša "
"organizacijsko preglednost in poenostavi sledenje varščinam."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:43
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Rental --> Products --> Products`, "
"click :guilabel:`New`, and clearly name the service product as a deposit."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na :menuselection:`Izposoja --> Izdelki --> Izdelki`, kliknite "
":guilabel:`Novo` in storitveni izdelek jasno poimenujte kot varščino."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:46
msgid ""
"Next, set the :guilabel:`Product Type` to :guilabel:`Service`, "
"the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` to :guilabel:`Based on Delivered Quantity "
"(Manual)`, and :guilabel:`Sales Price` to the desired deposit amount, and "
"the unit of measure to :guilabel:`Units`."
msgstr ""
"Nato nastavite :guilabel:`Vrsta izdelka` na :guilabel:`Storitev`, "
":guilabel:`Politika izdajanja računov` na :guilabel:`Na podlagi dostavljene "
"količine (ročno)`, :guilabel:`Prodajna cena` na želeni znesek varščine ter "
"mersko enoto na :guilabel:`Enote`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:50
msgid ""
"Choose whether to include :ref:`Sales Taxes <taxes/product>` for the deposit "
"service product. Finally, :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(save)` the "
"deposit service product."
msgstr ""
"Izberite, ali želite za storitveni izdelek varščine vključiti :ref:`prodajne "
"davke <taxes/product>`. Nazadnje :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`"
"(shranite)` storitveni izdelek varščine."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:53
msgid ""
"Rental product form configured as a digital camera deposit service in the "
"Rental app."
msgstr ""
"Obrazec izdelka za izposojo, konfiguriran kot storitev varščine za digitalni "
"fotoaparat v aplikaciji Izposoja."

