#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector.rst:5
msgid "Amazon Connector"
msgstr "Amazonov konektor"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:3
msgid "Tracking lot or serial number products with FBA orders"
msgstr "Sledenje izdelkov po serijah ali serijskih številkah pri naročilih FBA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:7
msgid ""
"When selling products tracked by lots or unique serial numbers via the "
"Fulfilled By Amazon :abbr:`FBA (Fulfilled by Amazon)` feature, Amazon's API "
"does not send the specific lot or unique serial number used for the sale. "
"The lack of information triggers a synchronization failure in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Pri prodaji izdelkov, ki se sledijo po serijah ali posameznih serijskih "
"številkah, prek funkcije Fulfilled By Amazon :abbr:`FBA (Fulfilled by "
"Amazon)`, Amazonov API ne pošlje specifične serije ali posamezne serijske "
"številke, uporabljene pri prodaji. Pomanjkanje informacij sproži napako pri "
"sinhronizaciji v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:11
msgid ""
"To successfully set up an Amazon :abbr:`FBA (Fulfilled by Amazon)` order, "
"configure a :ref:`product kit <amazon_connector/fba/product-kit>` in Odoo "
"based on the original Amazon product. When a new |FBA| order syncs, Odoo "
"sells the product kit, which prevents the error that occurs with the tracked "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Za uspešno nastavitev naročila Amazon :abbr:`FBA (Fulfilled by Amazon)` "
"konfigurirajte :ref:`komplet izdelkov <amazon_connector/fba/product-kit>` v "
"Odoo na podlagi prvotnega Amazon izdelka. Ko se novo naročilo |FBA| "
"sinhronizira, Odoo proda komplet izdelkov, kar prepreči napako, do katere "
"pride pri sledljivem izdelku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:16
msgid ""
"When :ref:`resupplying the Amazon Fulfillment center <amazon_connector/fba/"
"follow-deliveries>`, transfer the tracked product to the `WH/Amazon` "
"location. This records the movement in traceability reports and accounts for "
"inventory consumption at the point of transfer rather than the point of sale."
msgstr ""
"Pri :ref:`dopolnjevanju Amazon centra izpolnjevanja <amazon_connector/fba/"
"follow-deliveries>` prenesite sledljiv izdelek na lokacijo `WH/Amazon`. To "
"zabeleži premik v poročilih sledljivosti in upošteva porabo zaloge v "
"trenutku prenosa namesto v trenutku prodaje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:22
msgid ""
"The `WH/Amazon` location is automatically created as a default location when "
"the first Amazon account is linked."
msgstr ""
"Lokacija `WH/Amazon` se samodejno ustvari kot privzeta lokacija, ko je prvič "
"povezan račun Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:25
msgid ""
"Under this system, the quantity of the product kits remains negative "
"indefinitely. Treat this as a standard byproduct of the bypass, as the "
"actual stock levels are managed through the initial fulfillment center "
"transfer."
msgstr ""
"V tem sistemu količina kompletov izdelkov ostane negativna za nedoločen čas. "
"To obravnavajte kot standarden stranski proizvod obvoza, saj se dejanske "
"ravni zalog upravljajo prek začetnega prenosa v center izpolnjevanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:30
msgid ""
"This setup does not track the specific lot or unique serial number used for "
"the sale. It only ensures that the |FBA| order can be processed without "
"synchronization failures."
msgstr ""
"Ta nastavitev ne sledi specifični seriji ali posamezni serijski številki, "
"uporabljeni pri prodaji. Zagotavlja le, da se naročilo |FBA| lahko obdela "
"brez napak pri sinhronizaciji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:34
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:184
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies.rst:13
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/different_addresses.rst:10
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:17
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:36
msgid "The following apps are essential for the product kit workflow:"
msgstr "Naslednje aplikacije so bistvene za delotok kompleta izdelkov:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Sales app**: Enables :ref:`connecting an Amazon Seller account to Odoo "
"<amazon/setup>`."
msgstr ""
"**Aplikacija Sales**: Omogoča :ref:`povezavo računa Amazon Seller z Odoo "
"<amazon/setup>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Inventory app**: Allows for product replenishment by :ref:`warehouse "
"location <use_locations/configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"**Aplikacija Inventory**: Omogoča dopolnjevanje izdelkov po :ref:`lokaciji "
"skladišča <use_locations/configuration>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:41
msgid ""
"**Manufacturing app**: Enables :ref:`BoM creation <manufacturing/basic_setup/"
"bom-setup>` for products and product kits."
msgstr ""
"**Aplikacija Manufacturing**: Omogoča :ref:`ustvarjanje BoM <manufacturing/"
"basic_setup/bom-setup>` za izdelke in komplete izdelkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:47
msgid "Create a product kit"
msgstr "Ustvarite komplet izdelkov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:49
msgid ""
"To enable accurate tracking, create a product kit for the existing Amazon "
"product. When a new |FBA| order syncs, Odoo sells the kit, which prevents "
"the error that occurs with the tracked product."
msgstr ""
"Za omogočanje natančnega sledenja ustvarite komplet izdelkov za obstoječi "
"Amazon izdelek. Ko se novo naročilo |FBA| sinhronizira, Odoo proda komplet, "
"kar prepreči napako, do katere pride pri sledljivem izdelku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:52
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Products` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`. Then, :ref:`create a kit as a product <manufacturing/"
"advanced_configuration/kits>` that represents the Amazon item."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Products` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`New`. Nato :ref:`ustvarite komplet kot izdelek "
"<manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kits>`, ki predstavlja Amazon artikel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:57
msgid "*Never* enable :guilabel:`Track Inventory` for the product kit."
msgstr "*Nikoli* ne omogočite :guilabel:`Track Inventory` za komplet izdelkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:59
msgid "Example of a product form configured to be a kit in the Inventory app."
msgstr ""
"Primer obrazca izdelka, konfiguriranega kot komplet v aplikaciji Inventory."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:65
msgid "Link the Amazon item SKU to the product kit"
msgstr "Povežite SKU Amazon artikla s kompletom izdelkov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:67
msgid ""
"Next, go to the :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Offers` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`. Enter the desired :ref:`Amazon market <amazon/"
"supported-marketplaces>` in the :guilabel:`Marketplace` column, and select "
"the product kit in the :guilabel:`Product` column. In the :guilabel:`Amazon "
"SKU` column, enter the SKU of the existing Amazon product."
msgstr ""
"Nato pojdite na :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Offers` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`New`. V stolpec :guilabel:`Marketplace` vnesite "
"želeno :ref:`tržišče Amazon <amazon/supported-marketplaces>` in v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Product` izberite komplet izdelkov. V "
"stolpec :guilabel:`Amazon SKU` vnesite SKU obstoječega Amazon izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:73
msgid ""
"This method removes the link between the Amazon SKU and the tracked product. "
"Breaking this connection is necessary because Odoo cannot automatically "
"assign specific tracking numbers during the sync process."
msgstr ""
"Ta metoda odstrani povezavo med Amazon SKU in sledenim izdelkom. Pretrganje "
"te povezave je potrebno, ker Odoo med postopkom sinhronizacije ne more "
"samodejno dodeliti določenih številk za sledenje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:77
msgid ""
"Keeping this link active causes a synchronization failure for every |FBA| "
"order. By disconnecting them, the system bypasses the tracking requirement "
"and allows the sync to complete."
msgstr ""
"Če ta povezava ostane aktivna, povzroči napako pri sinhronizaciji za vsako |"
"FBA| naročilo. Z njihovim odklopom sistem obide zahtevo po sledenju in "
"omogoči dokončanje sinhronizacije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:80
msgid ""
"Example of a kit product linked to an Amazon SKU in the Offers page in the "
"Sales app."
msgstr ""
"Primer izdelka v kompletu, povezanega z Amazon SKU na strani Ponudbe v "
"aplikaciji Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:86
msgid "Create the BoM for the product kit"
msgstr "Ustvarite kosovnico za komplet izdelkov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:88
msgid ""
"Navigate to the product kit by clicking the :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Products --> Products` and select the product kit. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"flask` :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart button and :ref:`create a kit BoM "
"<manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit-bom>`."
msgstr ""
"Pomaknite se do kompleta izdelkov s klikom na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Prodaja --> Izdelki --> Izdelki` in izberite komplet izdelkov. Kliknite "
"pametni gumb :icon:`fa-flask` :guilabel:`Kosovnica` in :ref:`ustvarite "
"kosovnico za komplet <manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit-bom>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:92
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Components` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line` and type in "
"the name of the Amazon product that is tracked by lots or a unique serial "
"number."
msgstr ""
"V zavihku :guilabel:`Sestavine` kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico` in "
"vnesite ime Amazon izdelka, ki je sledeno po serijah ali edinstveni serijski "
"številki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:96
msgid "The Amazon product must be **the sole component** of the kit BoM."
msgstr "Amazon izdelek mora biti **edina sestavina** kosovnice kompleta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:98
msgid ""
"Example of the kit BoM for the kit product to represent the Amazon listing."
msgstr ""
"Primer kosovnice kompleta za komplet izdelkov za predstavitev Amazon objave."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:101
msgid ""
"Now the Amazon product can be processed and tracked accurately in the "
"**Sales** app by using the kit product and its associated BoM."
msgstr ""
"Amazon izdelek je zdaj mogoče obdelati in natančno slediti v aplikaciji "
"**Prodaja** z uporabo kompleta izdelkov in njegove povezane kosovnice."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:3
msgid "Amazon Connector features"
msgstr "Funkcije Amazon Connector"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Amazon Connector* synchronizes orders between Amazon and Odoo, which "
"considerably reduces the amount of time spent manually entering Amazon "
"orders (from the Amazon Seller account) into Odoo. It also allows users to "
"accurately keep track of Amazon sales in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"*Amazon Connector* sinhronizira naročila med Amazonom in Odoo, kar znatno "
"zmanjša čas, porabljen za ročno vnašanje naročil Amazon (iz računa Amazon "
"Seller) v Odoo. Uporabnikom tudi omogoča natančno spremljanje prodaje na "
"Amazonu v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:10
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:11
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/features.rst:10
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:10
msgid "Supported features"
msgstr "Podprte funkcije"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:12
msgid "The Amazon Connector is able to:"
msgstr "Amazon Connector zmore:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:14
msgid ""
"Synchronize (Amazon to Odoo) all confirmed orders (both FBA and FBM), and "
"their order items, which include:"
msgstr ""
"Sinhronizirati (iz Amazona v Odoo) vsa potrjena naročila (tako FBA kot FBM) "
"in njihove postavke naročila, ki vključujejo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:17
msgid "product name, description, and quantity"
msgstr "ime, opis in količino izdelka"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:18
msgid "shipping costs for the product"
msgstr "stroške pošiljanja za izdelek"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:19
msgid "gift wrapping charges"
msgstr "stroški darilne embalaže"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:21
msgid ""
"Create any missing partner related to an order in Odoo (contact types "
"supported: contact and delivery address)."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarite vse manjkajoče partnerje, povezane s naročilom v Odoo (podprte "
"vrste stikov: stik in naslov dostave)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:24
msgid "Notify Amazon of confirmed shipment in Odoo (FBM) to get paid."
msgstr ""
"Obvestite Amazon o potrjenem pošiljanju v Odoo (FBM), da prejmete plačilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:26
msgid ""
"Synchronize (Odoo to Amazon) all available quantities of your products (FBM)."
msgstr ""
"Sinhronizirajte (Odoo v Amazon) vse razpoložljive količine vaših izdelkov "
"(FBM)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:28
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/features.rst:22
msgid "Support multiple seller accounts."
msgstr "Podpora več prodajalskim računom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:30
msgid "Support multiple marketplaces per seller account."
msgstr "Podpora več tržnicam na prodajalski račun."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:32
msgid ""
"The following table lists capabilities provided by Odoo when using the "
"Amazon Connector:"
msgstr ""
"Naslednja tabela navaja zmogljivosti, ki jih zagotavlja Odoo pri uporabi "
"Amazonovega konektorja:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:35
msgid "Fulfilled By Amazon (FBA)"
msgstr "Izpolnjuje Amazon (FBA)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:35
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:30
msgid "Fulfilled By Merchant (FBM)"
msgstr "Izpolnjuje prodajalec (FBM)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:37
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:32
msgid "**Orders**"
msgstr "**Naročila**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:37
msgid "Synchronize shipped and cancelled orders."
msgstr "Sinhronizirajte odpremljena in preklicana naročila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:37
msgid "Synchronize unshipped and cancelled orders."
msgstr "Sinhronizirajte neodpremljena in preklicana naročila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:40
msgid "**Shipping**"
msgstr "**Pošiljanje**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:40
msgid ""
"Shipping cost is computed by Amazon, and included in the synchronized order."
msgstr ""
"Stroške pošiljanja izračuna Amazon in so vključeni v sinhronizirano naročilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:40
msgid ""
"Shipping cost is computed by Amazon and included in the synchronized orders."
msgstr ""
"Stroške pošiljanja izračuna Amazon in so vključeni v sinhronizirana naročila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:44
msgid "Shipping done by Amazon."
msgstr "Pošiljanje opravi Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:44
msgid ""
"A delivery order is automatically created in Odoo for each new order. Once "
"it has been processed in Odoo, the status is then synchronized in Amazon."
msgstr ""
"Dobavnica se samodejno ustvari v Odoo za vsako novo naročilo. Ko je obdelana "
"v Odoo, se stanje nato sinhronizira v Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:50
msgid "**Gift Wrapping**"
msgstr "**Darilna embalaža**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:50
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:61
msgid "Handled by Amazon."
msgstr "Obravnava Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:50
msgid ""
"Cost is computed by Amazon, and included in the synchronized order. Gift "
"message is added on a line of the order and on the delivery order. Then it "
"is up to the user."
msgstr ""
"Stroške izračuna Amazon in so vključeni v sinhronizirano naročilo. Darilno "
"sporočilo je dodano v vrstico naročila in na dobavnico. Nato je odvisno od "
"uporabnika."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:56
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:35
msgid "**Stock Management**"
msgstr "**Upravljanje zalog**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:56
msgid ""
"Managed by Amazon, and synchronized with a virtual location to follow it in "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Upravlja Amazon in se sinhronizira z virtualno lokacijo za sledenje v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:56
msgid "Managed in Odoo Inventory app, and synchronized with Amazon."
msgstr "Upravlja se v aplikaciji Odoo Inventory in se sinhronizira z Amazonom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:61
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:40
msgid "**Delivery Notifications**"
msgstr "**Obvestila o dostavi**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:61
msgid "Send by Amazon, based on delivery status synchronized from Odoo."
msgstr "Pošlje Amazon na podlagi stanja dostave, sinhroniziranega iz Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:66
msgid ""
"The Amazon Connector is designed to synchronize the data of sales orders. "
"Other actions, such as downloading monthly fees reports, handling disputes, "
"or issuing refunds, **must** be managed from the *Amazon Seller Central*, as "
"usual."
msgstr ""
"Amazon Connector je zasnovan za sinhronizacijo podatkov prodajnih naročil. "
"Druge ukrepe, kot so prenos mesečnih poročil o stroških, reševanje sporov "
"ali izdaja povračil, je **treba** upravljati iz *Amazon Seller Central*, kot "
"običajno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:71
msgid ""
"As of February 19, 2024, in North American marketplaces, :abbr:`FBA "
"(Fulfilled by Amazon)` orders created with the *Amazon Connector*, do not "
"get the customer's name passed onto the sales/delivery order in Odoo. This "
"is due to the fact that Amazon now calculates, and remits, sales tax on "
"behalf of sellers. In other words, personally identifiable customer "
"information is not transmitted to the seller any longer, after a :abbr:`FBA "
"(Fulfilled by Amazon)` order."
msgstr ""
"Od 19. februarja 2024 na tržiščih Severne Amerike naročila :abbr:`FBA "
"(Fulfilled by Amazon)`, ustvarjena z *Amazon Connector*, ne prejmejo imena "
"stranke na prodajnem/dobavnem naročilu v Odoo. To je posledica dejstva, da "
"Amazon zdaj izračunava in plačuje prodajno davščino v imenu prodajalcev. Z "
"drugimi besedami, osebno prepoznavne informacije o strankah se prodajalcu ne "
"prenašajo več po naročilu :abbr:`FBA (Fulfilled by Amazon)`."

