#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:3
msgid "Amazon order management"
msgstr "Upravljanje naročil Amazon"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:6
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:41
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:48
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:47
msgid "Order synchronization"
msgstr "Sinhronizacija naročil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:8
msgid ""
"Orders are automatically fetched from Amazon, and synchronized in Odoo, at "
"regular intervals."
msgstr ""
"Naročila se samodejno pridobijo iz Amazona in sinhronizirajo v Odoo v rednih "
"intervalih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:10
msgid ""
"The synchronization is based on the Amazon status: only orders whose status "
"has changed since the last synchronization are fetched from Amazon. This "
"includes changes on either end (Amazon or Odoo)."
msgstr ""
"Sinhronizacija temelji na statusu Amazon: iz Amazona se pridobijo samo "
"naročila, katerih status se je spremenil od zadnje sinhronizacije. To "
"vključuje spremembe na obeh straneh (Amazon ali Odoo)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:13
msgid ""
"For *FBA* (Fulfilled by Amazon), only *Shipped* and *Cancelled* orders are "
"fetched."
msgstr ""
"Za *FBA* (Fulfilled by Amazon) se pridobijo samo naročila s statusom "
"*Shipped* in *Cancelled*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:15
msgid ""
"For *FBM* (Fulfilled by Merchant), the same is done for *Unshipped* and "
"*Cancelled* orders. For each synchronized order, a sales order and customer "
"are created in Odoo (if the customer is not already registered in the "
"database)."
msgstr ""
"Za *FBM* (Fulfilled by Merchant) se enako naredi za naročila s statusom "
"*Unshipped* in *Cancelled*. Za vsako sinhronizirano naročilo se v Odoo "
"ustvari prodajni nalog in stranka (če stranka še ni registrirana v zbirki "
"podatkov)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:20
msgid ""
"When an order is cancelled in Amazon, and was already synchronized in Odoo, "
"the corresponding sales order is automatically cancelled in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Ko je naročilo preklicano v Amazonu in je bilo že sinhronizirano v Odoo, se "
"ustrezni prodajni nalog samodejno prekliče v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:24
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:59
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:66
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:68
msgid "Force synchronization"
msgstr "Prisilna sinhronizacija"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:26
msgid ""
"In order to force the synchronization of an order, whose status has **not** "
"changed since the previous synchronization, start by activating "
"the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`. This includes changes on either "
"end (Amazon or Odoo)."
msgstr ""
"Če želite prisiliti sinhronizacijo naročila, katerega status se **ni** "
"spremenil od prejšnje sinhronizacije, najprej aktivirajte :ref:`razvijalski "
"način <developer-mode>`. To vključuje spremembe na obeh straneh (Amazon ali "
"Odoo)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:30
msgid ""
"Then, navigate to the Amazon account in Odoo (:menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings --> Connectors --> Amazon Sync --> Amazon "
"Accounts`), and modify the date under :menuselection:`Orders Follow-up --> "
"Last Order Sync`."
msgstr ""
"Nato se pomaknite na račun Amazon v Odoo (:menuselection:`Aplikacija Sales --"
"> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve --> Konektorji --> Amazon Sync --> Računi "
"Amazon`) in spremenite datum pod :menuselection:`Orders Follow-up --> Last "
"Order Sync`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:34
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:75
msgid ""
"Be sure to pick a date that occurs prior to the last status change of the "
"desired order to synchronize and save. This will ensure synchronization "
"occurs correctly."
msgstr ""
"Prepričajte se, da izberete datum, ki je pred zadnjo spremembo statusa "
"želenega naročila za sinhronizacijo, in shranite. To bo zagotovilo pravilno "
"sinhronizacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:39
msgid ""
"To immediately synchronize the orders of an Amazon account, switch "
"to :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, head to the Amazon account in "
"Odoo, and click :guilabel:`Sync Orders`. The same can be done with pickings "
"by clicking :guilabel:`Sync Pickings`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite takoj sinhronizirati naročila računa Amazon, preklopite "
"na :ref:`razvijalski način <developer-mode>`, pojdite na račun Amazon v Odoo "
"in kliknite :guilabel:`Sync Orders`. Enako lahko storite z nabiranjem tako, "
"da kliknete :guilabel:`Sync Pickings`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:44
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:73
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:76
msgid "Manage deliveries in FBM"
msgstr "Upravljanje dostav v FBM"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:46
msgid ""
"Whenever an FBM (Fulfilled by Merchant) order is synchronized in Odoo, a "
"picking is instantly created in the *Inventory* app, along with a sales "
"order and customer record. Then, decide to either ship all the ordered "
"products to the customer at once, or ship products partially using "
"backorders."
msgstr ""
"Ko je naročilo FBM (Fulfilled by Merchant) sinhronizirano v Odoo, se v "
"aplikaciji *Zaloga* takoj ustvari nabiranje skupaj s prodajnim nalogom in "
"zapisom o stranki. Nato se odločite, ali želite vse naročene izdelke poslati "
"stranki naenkrat ali pa izdelke poslati delno z uporabo zaostalih naročil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:50
msgid ""
"When a picking related to the order is confirmed, a notification is then "
"sent to Amazon, who, in turn, notifies the customer that the order (or a "
"part of it) is on its way."
msgstr ""
"Ko je nabiranje, povezano z naročilom, potrjeno, se pošlje obvestilo "
"Amazonu, ki nato obvesti stranko, da je naročilo (ali njegov del) na poti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:54
msgid ""
"Amazon requires users to provide a tracking reference with each delivery. "
"This is needed to assign a carrier."
msgstr ""
"Amazon od uporabnikov zahteva, da pri vsaki dostavi navedejo sledilno "
"referenco. To je potrebno za dodelitev prevoznika."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:57
msgid ""
"If the carrier doesn't automatically provide a tracking reference, one must "
"be set manually. This rule applies to all Amazon marketplaces."
msgstr ""
"Če prevoznik ne zagotavlja samodejne reference za sledenje, jo je treba "
"nastaviti ročno. To pravilo velja za vse tržnice Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:61
msgid ""
"If the chosen carrier isn't supported by Odoo, a carrier with the same name "
"can still be created (e.g. create a carrier named `easyship`). The name used "
"is **not** case sensitive, but be mindful to avoid typos. If there are "
"typos, Amazon will **not** recognize them. Next, create a delivery carrier "
"named `Self Delivery` to inform Amazon that the user will make the "
"deliveries. Even with this route, a tracking reference still **must** be "
"entered. Remember, the customer is notified by email about the delivery, and "
"the carrier, along with the tracking reference, are displayed in the email "
"to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Če izbranega prevoznika Odoo ne podpira, lahko še vedno ustvarite prevoznika "
"z istim imenom (npr. ustvarite prevoznika z imenom `easyship`). Uporabljeno "
"ime **ni** občutljivo na velikost črk, vendar pazite, da se izognete "
"tipkarskim napakam. Če obstajajo tipkarske napake, jih Amazon **ne bo** "
"prepoznal. Nato ustvarite prevoznika z imenom `Self Delivery`, da obvestite "
"Amazon, da boste dostave izvajali sami. Tudi pri tej poti je **treba** "
"vnesti referenco za sledenje. Ne pozabite, da je stranka o dostavi obveščena "
"po e-pošti, prevoznik in referenca za sledenje pa sta prikazana v e-poštnem "
"sporočilu stranki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:70
msgid ""
":doc:`../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/third_party_shipper`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/third_party_shipper`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:75
msgid "Manage errors when synchronizing deliveries"
msgstr "Upravljanje napak pri sinhronizaciji dostav"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:77
msgid ""
"Sometimes, Amazon can fail to correctly process all the information sent by "
"Odoo. In this case, Odoo sends an email listing all the shipments that "
"failed and the errors Amazon sent with them. In addition, these shipments "
"are flagged with a :guilabel:`Synchronization with Amazon failed` tag."
msgstr ""
"Včasih Amazon ne uspe pravilno obdelati vseh informacij, ki jih pošlje Odoo. "
"V tem primeru Odoo pošlje e-poštno sporočilo s seznamom vseh pošiljk, ki "
"niso uspele, in napak, ki jih je poslal Amazon. Poleg tega so te pošiljke "
"označene z oznako :guilabel:`Sinhronizacija z Amazon ni uspela`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:81
msgid ""
"Usually, the error can be corrected directly in the Amazon backend or in "
"Odoo. If the problem is corrected in Odoo, synchronize the shipment again "
"using the :guilabel:`Retry Amazon Sync` button."
msgstr ""
"Običajno je napako mogoče popraviti neposredno v zalednem sistemu Amazon ali "
"v Odoo. Če je težava popravljena v Odoo, znova sinhronizirajte pošiljko z "
"gumbom :guilabel:`Ponovi sinhronizacijo Amazon`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:85
msgid ""
"It might happen that Odoo receives a notification from Amazon saying that "
"some delivery information was not processed, but without specifying which "
"shipments were affected. In that case, all the shipments in an unknown state "
"will be treated as if they failed to synchronize. Once Odoo receives a "
"notification from Amazon saying that a shipment was processed, its tag will "
"change to :guilabel:`Synchronized with Amazon`. To speed up this process, on "
"your Amazon account, click on :guilabel:`Sync Orders` to manually "
"synchronize these orders, or click on :guilabel:`Recover Order` and enter "
"the relevant Amazon Order Reference."
msgstr ""
"Lahko se zgodi, da Odoo prejme obvestilo od Amazon, da nekatere informacije "
"o dostavi niso bile obdelane, vendar brez navedbe, katere pošiljke so bile "
"prizadete. V tem primeru bodo vse pošiljke v neznanem stanju obravnavane, "
"kot da sinhronizacija ni uspela. Ko Odoo prejme obvestilo od Amazon, da je "
"bila pošiljka obdelana, se njena oznaka spremeni v :guilabel:`Sinhronizirano "
"z Amazon`. Za pospešitev tega postopka na svojem računu Amazon kliknite "
"na :guilabel:`Sinhroniziraj naročila`, da ročno sinhronizirate ta naročila, "
"ali kliknite na :guilabel:`Obnovi naročilo` in vnesite ustrezno referenco "
"naročila Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:96
msgid "Follow deliveries in FBA"
msgstr "Sledenje dostavam v FBA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:98
msgid ""
"When an FBA (Fulfilled by Amazon) order is synchronized in Odoo, a stock "
"move is recorded in the *Inventory* app for each sales order item. That way, "
"it's saved in the system."
msgstr ""
"Ko je naročilo FBA (Fulfilled by Amazon) sinhronizirano v Odoo, se za vsak "
"artikel prodajnega naloga zabeleži premik zaloge v aplikaciji *Zaloga*. Na "
"ta način je shranjen v sistemu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:101
msgid ""
"Inventory managers can access these stock moves by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Reporting --> Moves History`."
msgstr ""
"Upravitelji zalog lahko dostopajo do teh premikov zaloge tako, da se "
"pomaknejo na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Zaloga --> Poročanje --> Zgodovina "
"premikov`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:104
msgid ""
"For FBA orders, the stock move is automatically created in Odoo by the "
"Amazon connector, thanks to the shipping status of Amazon. When sending new "
"products to Amazon, the user should manually create a picking (delivery "
"order) to transfer these products from their warehouse to the Amazon "
"location."
msgstr ""
"Za naročila FBA se premik zaloge v Odoo samodejno ustvari prek Amazon "
"konektorja zahvaljujoč stanju pošiljanja Amazon. Pri pošiljanju novih "
"izdelkov v Amazon mora uporabnik ročno ustvariti nabiranje (nalog za "
"dostavo), da prenese te izdelke iz svojega skladišča na lokacijo Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:109
msgid ""
"To follow *Amazon (FBA)* stock in Odoo, make an inventory adjustment after "
"replenishing stock. An automated replenishment from reordering rules can "
"also be triggered on the Amazon location."
msgstr ""
"Za sledenje zalogi *Amazon (FBA)* v Odoo opravite prilagoditev zaloge po "
"dopolnitvi zaloge. Na lokaciji Amazon je mogoče sprožiti tudi samodejno "
"dopolnitev iz pravil ponovnega naročanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:112
msgid ""
"The Amazon location is configurable by accessing the Amazon account managed "
"in Odoo. To access Amazon accounts in Odoo navigate to :menuselection:`Sales "
"app --> Configuration --> Settings --> Connectors --> Amazon Sync --> Amazon "
"Accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Lokacijo Amazon je mogoče konfigurirati tako, da dostopate do računa Amazon, "
"ki se upravlja v Odoo. Za dostop do računov Amazon v Odoo se pomaknite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Sales --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve --> "
"Konektorji --> Amazon Sync --> Računi Amazon`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:116
msgid ""
"All accounts of the same company use the same Amazon location, by default. "
"However, it is possible to follow the stock filtered by marketplace."
msgstr ""
"Vsi računi istega podjetja privzeto uporabljajo isto lokacijo Amazon. Vendar "
"je mogoče slediti zalogi, filtrirani po tržnici."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:119
msgid ""
"To do that, first remove the marketplace, where the desired stock to follow "
"separately can be found, from the list of synchronized marketplaces, which "
"can be found by navigating to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --"
"> Settings --> Connectors --> Amazon Sync --> Amazon Accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite to narediti, najprej odstranite tržnico, kjer najdete želeno "
"zalogo za ločeno sledenje, s seznama sinhroniziranih tržnic, ki jih najdete "
"tako, da se pomaknete na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Sales --> Konfiguracija "
"--> Nastavitve --> Konektorji --> Amazon Sync --> Računi Amazon`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:124
msgid ""
"Next, create another registration for this account, and remove all "
"marketplaces--- **except** the marketplace this is desired to be isolated "
"from the others."
msgstr ""
"Nato ustvarite novo registracijo za ta račun in odstranite vse tržnice --- "
"**razen** tržnice, ki jo želite ločiti od drugih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:127
msgid ""
"Lastly, assign another stock location to the second registration of the "
"account."
msgstr "Nazadnje drugemu registraciji računa dodelite drugo lokacijo zaloge."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:130
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:118
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:116
msgid "Invoice and register payments"
msgstr "Izdaja računov in registracija plačil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:133
msgid "Issue invoices"
msgstr "Izdaja računov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:135
msgid ""
"Due to Amazon's policy of not sharing customer email addresses, it is "
"**not** possible to send invoices directly to Amazon customers from Odoo. "
"However, it **is** possible to manually upload the generated invoices from "
"Odoo to the Amazon back-end."
msgstr ""
"Zaradi politike Amazon, ki ne deli e-poštnih naslovov strank, iz Odoo **ni** "
"mogoče pošiljati računov neposredno strankam Amazon. Vendar **je** mogoče "
"ročno naložiti generirane račune iz Odoo v zaledni sistem Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:139
msgid ""
"Additionally, for B2B clients, it is currently required to manually retrieve "
"VAT numbers from the Amazon back-end **before** creating an invoice in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Poleg tega je trenutno za stranke B2B potrebno ročno pridobiti davčne "
"številke iz zalednega sistema Amazon **pred** ustvarjanjem računa v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:143
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:155
msgid "Register payments"
msgstr "Registriranje plačil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:145
msgid ""
"Since customers pay Amazon as an intermediary, creating a dedicated *Bank* "
"journal (e.g. named `Amazon Payments`), with a dedicated *Bank and Cash* "
"intermediary account is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Ker stranke plačujejo Amazonu kot posredniku, je priporočljivo ustvariti "
"namenski dnevnik *Banka* (npr. poimenovan `Plačila Amazon`) z namenskim "
"posredniškim računom *Banka in gotovina*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:148
msgid ""
"Additionally, as Amazon makes a single monthly payment, selecting all the "
"invoices linked to a single payment is necessary when registering payments."
msgstr ""
"Poleg tega je treba, ker Amazon izvede eno samo mesečno plačilo, pri "
"registriranju plačil izbrati vse račune, povezane z enim samim plačilom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:151
msgid ""
"To do that, use the appropriate :guilabel:`Journal` dedicated to Amazon "
"payments, and select :guilabel:`Batch Deposit` as the :guilabel:`Payment "
"Method`."
msgstr ""
"Za to uporabite ustrezen :guilabel:`Dnevnik`, namenjen plačilom Amazon, in "
"izberite :guilabel:`Paketna položnica` kot :guilabel:`Način plačila`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:154
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:166
msgid ""
"Then, select all the generated payments, and click :menuselection:`Actions --"
"> Create batch payment --> Validate`."
msgstr ""
"Nato izberite vsa ustvarjena plačila in kliknite :menuselection:`Dejanja --> "
"Ustvari paketno plačilo --> Potrdi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:158
msgid ""
"This same action can be performed with vendor bills from Amazon dedicated to "
"commissions."
msgstr ""
"Isto dejanje je mogoče izvesti s prodajalčevimi računi od Amazona, "
"namenjenimi provizijam."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:160
msgid ""
"When the balance is received in the bank account at the end of the month, "
"and the bank statements are recorded, credit the Amazon intermediary account "
"by the amount received."
msgstr ""
"Ko je stanje konec meseca prejeto na bančni račun in so bančni izpiski "
"zabeleženi, knjižite posredniški račun Amazon v dobro za prejeti znesek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:164
msgid "Follow Amazon sales in sales reporting"
msgstr "Sledenje prodaji Amazon v poročanju o prodaji"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:166
msgid ""
"On the Amazon account profile in Odoo, a sales team is set under "
"the :guilabel:`Order Follow-up` tab."
msgstr ""
"V profilu računa Amazon v Odoo je na zavihku :guilabel:`Spremljanje naročil` "
"nastavljena prodajna ekipa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:169
msgid ""
"This gives quick access to important metrics related to sales reporting. By "
"default, the Amazon account's sales team is shared between all of the "
"company's accounts."
msgstr ""
"To omogoča hiter dostop do pomembnih kazalnikov, povezanih s poročanjem o "
"prodaji. Privzeto je prodajna ekipa računa Amazon v skupni rabi med vsemi "
"računi podjetja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:172
msgid ""
"If desired, the sales team on the account can be changed for another, in "
"order to perform a separate reporting for the sales of this account."
msgstr ""
"Po želji je mogoče prodajno ekipo na računu spremeniti za drugo, da bi "
"izvedli ločeno poročanje za prodajo tega računa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:176
msgid "It is also possible to perform reporting on a per-marketplace basis."
msgstr "Poročanje je mogoče izvesti tudi na ravni posamezne tržnice."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:178
msgid ""
"First, remove the desired marketplace from the list of synchronized "
"marketplaces."
msgstr "Najprej odstranite želeno tržnico s seznama sinhroniziranih tržnic."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:180
msgid ""
"To access the list of synchronized marketplaces in Odoo, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings --> Connectors --"
"> Amazon Sync --> Amazon Accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite v Odoo dostopati do seznama sinhroniziranih tržnic, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Prodaja --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve --> "
"Konektorji --> Amazon Sync --> Računi Amazon`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:183
msgid ""
"Then, create another registration for this account, and remove all other "
"marketplaces **except** the one to isolate."
msgstr ""
"Nato ustvarite novo registracijo za ta račun in odstranite vse druge tržnice "
"**razen** tiste, ki jo želite izolirati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:186
msgid ""
"Lastly, assign another sales team to one of the two registrations of the "
"account."
msgstr "Nazadnje dodelite drugo prodajno ekipo eni od dveh registracij računa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/manage.rst:189
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:154
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:157
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:160
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:134
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:124
msgid ":doc:`features`"
msgstr ":doc:`features`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:3
msgid "Amazon Connector configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija konektorja Amazon"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo allows users to register an Amazon seller account in the database, but "
"the user **must** have a paid Amazon Seller account prior to completing the "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"Odoo uporabnikom omogoča registracijo prodajalčevega računa Amazon v zbirki "
"podatkov, vendar **mora** imeti uporabnik plačljiv prodajalčev račun Amazon "
"pred dokončanjem konfiguracije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:8
msgid ""
"Set up a paid Seller account on Amazon by first logging into the Amazon "
"platform, and navigating to :menuselection:`Account \\& Lists --> Start a "
"Selling Account` from the drop-down menu located in the header section."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite plačani prodajalski račun na Amazonu tako, da se najprej prijavite "
"na platformo Amazon in pojdite na :menuselection:`Račun in seznami --> Začni "
"prodajni račun` iz spustnega menija v glavi strani."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:12
msgid ""
"Then on the :guilabel:`Sell with Amazon` page, follow the sign-up process "
"and finally proceed to follow the instructions below to register and link "
"that Amazon Seller account in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Nato na strani :guilabel:`Prodaja z Amazonom` sledite postopku registracije "
"in nato sledite spodnjim navodilom za registracijo in povezavo tega "
"prodajalskega računa Amazon v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:16
msgid "`Sell with Amazon <https://www.amazon.com/b/?node=12766669011>`_"
msgstr "<https://www.amazon.com/b/?node=12766669011>`Prodaja z Amazonom`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:19
msgid "Connect Amazon Seller account to Odoo"
msgstr "Poveži prodajalski račun Amazon z Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:23
msgid ""
"To connect an Amazon Seller account in Odoo, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings --> Connectors "
"section`, activate the :guilabel:`Amazon Sync` feature, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Za povezavo prodajalskega računa Amazon v Odoo pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Prodaja --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve --> "
"razdelek Konektorji`, aktivirajte funkcijo :guilabel:`Sinhronizacija Amazon` "
"in kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:27
msgid ""
"Then, return to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings --> "
"Connectors section`, and click on the :guilabel:`Amazon Accounts` link under "
"the :guilabel:`Amazon Sync` setting."
msgstr ""
"Nato se vrnite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Prodaja --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Nastavitve --> razdelek Konektorji` in kliknite na "
"povezavo :guilabel:`Računi Amazon` pod "
"nastavitvijo :guilabel:`Sinhronizacija Amazon`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:30
msgid ""
"The Amazon Accounts link beneath the Amazon Sync settings in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Povezava Računi Amazon pod nastavitvami Sinhronizacija Amazon v Odoo Prodaji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:34
msgid ""
"Doing so reveals a separate :guilabel:`Amazon Accounts` page. From here, "
"click :guilabel:`New` to create and link a new Amazon account."
msgstr ""
"S tem se odpre ločena stran :guilabel:`Računi Amazon`. Tu "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Nov`, da ustvarite in povežete nov račun Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:37
msgid ""
"On the blank :guilabel:`Amazon Account` form page, start by choosing a name "
"for the account (e.g. `American Marketplace`). Then, in "
"the :guilabel:`Credentials` tab, select the marketplace on which the seller "
"account was initially created from the :guilabel:`Home Marketplace` drop-"
"down menu."
msgstr ""
"Na praznem obrazcu :guilabel:`Račun Amazon` najprej izberite ime računa "
"(npr. `Ameriško tržišče`). Nato v zavihku :guilabel:`Poverilnice` izberite "
"tržišče, na katerem je bil prodajalski račun prvotno ustvarjen, iz spustnega "
"menija :guilabel:`Domače tržišče`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:41
msgid "A typical Amazon Account form page in the Odoo Sales application."
msgstr "Tipična stran obrazca Račun Amazon v aplikaciji Odoo Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:45
msgid ""
"After saving, the field in the :guilabel:`Credentials` tab is replaced by "
"a :guilabel:`Link with Amazon` button."
msgstr ""
"Po shranjevanju je polje v zavihku :guilabel:`Poverilnice` nadomeščeno z "
"gumbom :guilabel:`Poveži z Amazonom`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:48
msgid ""
"A typical Amazon Account form page and Link with Amazon button in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Tipična stran obrazca Račun Amazon in gumb Poveži z Amazonom v Odoo Prodaji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:52
msgid ""
"Clicking that button redirects to either the Amazon login page, or directly "
"to the required consent page, if the user is already logged in to Amazon."
msgstr ""
"Klik na ta gumb preusmeri bodisi na prijavno stran Amazon bodisi neposredno "
"na zahtevano stran s privolitvijo, če je uporabnik že prijavljen v Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:55
msgid "On the login page, log in to the desired Amazon seller account."
msgstr "Na prijavni strani se prijavite v želeni prodajalski račun Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:57
msgid ""
"On the consent page, confirm that Amazon is allowed to give Odoo access to "
"the account and related data."
msgstr ""
"Na strani s privolitvijo potrdite, da lahko Amazon omogoči Odoo dostop do "
"računa in povezanih podatkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:60
msgid ""
"Upon confirmation, Amazon returns the user to Odoo, and the account has been "
"registered."
msgstr "Po potrditvi Amazon uporabnika vrne v Odoo in račun je registriran."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:62
msgid ""
"With the Amazon account successfully registered, the marketplaces available "
"to this specific account are synchronized with Odoo and listed under "
"the :guilabel:`Marketplaces` tab."
msgstr ""
"Ko je račun Amazon uspešno registriran, se tržišča, ki so na voljo temu "
"določenemu računu, sinhronizirajo z Odoo in so navedena v "
"zavihku :guilabel:`Tržišča`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:65
msgid ""
"If desired, remove items from the list of synchronized marketplaces to "
"disable synchronization."
msgstr ""
"Če želite, odstranite postavke s seznama sinhroniziranih tržišč, da "
"onemogočite sinhronizacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:68
msgid "Amazon orders in Odoo"
msgstr "Nalogi Amazon v Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:70
msgid ""
"When an Amazon order is synchronized, up to three line items are created on "
"the sales order in Odoo. Each one represents a product sold on Amazon: one "
"for the product that was sold on Amazon Marketplace, one for the shipping "
"charges (if any), and one for the gift wrapping charges (if any)."
msgstr ""
"Ko je nalog Amazon sinhroniziran, se na prodajnem nalogu v Odoo ustvarijo do "
"tri vrstice. Vsaka predstavlja izdelek, prodan na Amazonu: ena za izdelek, "
"ki je bil prodan na tržišču Amazon, ena za stroške pošiljanja (po potrebi) "
"in ena za stroške darilnega zavijanja (po potrebi)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:76
msgid ""
"The selection of a database product for a sales order item is done by "
"matching its :guilabel:`Internal Reference` (a customizable product "
"reference idenifier in Odoo, like `FURN001`) with the Amazon *SKU* for "
"marketplace items, the Amazon *Shipping Code* for delivery charges, and the "
"Amazon *Gift Wrapping* code for gift wrapping charges."
msgstr ""
"Izbira izdelka iz baze podatkov za postavko prodajnega naloga se izvede s "
"primerjavo njegove :guilabel:`Notranje reference` (prilagodljiv "
"identifikator reference izdelka v Odoo, kot je `FURN001`) z Amazonovim *SKU* "
"za tržne artikle, Amazonovo *Kodo pošiljanja* za stroške dostave in "
"Amazonovo kodo *Darilne embalaže* za stroške darilne embalaže."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:81
msgid ""
"For marketplace products, pairings are saved as *Amazon Offers*, which are "
"listed under the :guilabel:`Offers` smart button on the account form."
msgstr ""
"Za tržne izdelke se povezave shranijo kot *Amazon Ponudbe*, ki so navedene "
"pod pametnim gumbom :guilabel:`Ponudbe` na obrazcu računa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:84
msgid "The Amazon Offers smart button on the account form in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Pametni gumb Amazon Ponudbe na obrazcu računa v Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:88
msgid ""
"Offers are automatically created when the pairing is established, and "
"they're used for subsequent orders to lookup SKUs. If no offer with a "
"matching SKU is found, :ref:`the internal reference is used instead <amazon/"
"matching>`."
msgstr ""
"Ponudbe se samodejno ustvarijo, ko je povezava vzpostavljena, in se "
"uporabljajo za iskanje SKU-jev v naslednjih nalogih. Če ponudba z ujemajočim "
"se SKU-jem ni najdena, :ref:`se namesto tega uporabi notranja referenca "
"<amazon/matching>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:93
msgid ""
"It's possible to force the pairing of a marketplace item with a specific "
"product, by changing either the product or the SKU of an offer to ensure "
"they match. The offer can be manually created if it was not automatically "
"done yet."
msgstr ""
"Možno je prisiliti povezavo tržnega artikla z določenim izdelkom tako, da "
"spremenite bodisi izdelek bodisi SKU ponudbe, da se ujemata. Ponudbo lahko "
"ročno ustvarite, če še ni bila samodejno ustvarjena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:97
msgid ""
"This is useful if the internal reference is not used as the SKU, or if the "
"product sells under different conditions."
msgstr ""
"To je uporabno, če se notranja referenca ne uporablja kot SKU ali če se "
"izdelek prodaja pod različnimi pogoji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:100
msgid ""
"If no database product with a matching internal reference is found for a "
"given Amazon SKU or gift wrapping code, then a default database product, "
"*Amazon Sale*, is used. The same is done with the default product *Amazon "
"Shipping* if no database product is found for a given Amazon shipping code."
msgstr ""
"Če za določen Amazonov SKU ali kodo darilne embalaže ni najden noben izdelek "
"v bazi podatkov z ujemajočo se notranjo referenco, se uporabi privzeti "
"izdelek iz baze podatkov, *Amazon Sale*. Enako se naredi s privzetim "
"izdelkom *Amazon Shipping*, če za določeno Amazonovo kodo pošiljanja ni "
"najden noben izdelek v bazi podatkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:105
msgid ""
"To modify default products, activate the :ref:`developer mode <developer-"
"mode>`, and navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings --> Connectors --> Amazon Sync --> Default Products`."
msgstr ""
"Za spremembo privzetih izdelkov aktivirajte :ref:`razvijalski način "
"<developer-mode>` in pojdite na :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration "
"--> Settings --> Connectors --> Amazon Sync --> Default Products`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:110
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/setup.rst:182
msgid "Product tax configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija davka za izdelek"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:112
msgid ""
"To allow for tax reporting of Amazon sales with Odoo, the taxes applied to "
"the sales order items are those set on the product, or determined by the "
"fiscal position."
msgstr ""
"Za omogočanje davčnega poročanja o prodaji na Amazonu z Odoo so davki, ki se "
"uporabljajo za postavke prodajnega naloga, tisti, ki so nastavljeni na "
"izdelku, ali pa jih določa fiskalna pozicija."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:115
msgid ""
"Make sure to have the correct taxes set on your products in Odoo, or have it "
"done by a fiscal position, to avoid discrepancies in the subtotals between "
"*Amazon Seller Central* and Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Prepričajte se, da imate na svojih izdelkih v Odoo nastavljene pravilne "
"davke ali da jih določa fiskalna pozicija, da se izognete neskladjem v "
"vmesnih seštevkih med *Amazon Seller Central* in Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:119
msgid ""
"As Amazon does not necessarily apply the same taxes as those configured in "
"Odoo, it may happen that order totals differ by a few cents between Odoo and "
"*Amazon Seller Central*. Those differences can be resolved with a write-off "
"when reconciling the payments in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Ker Amazon ne uporablja nujno enakih davkov, kot so konfigurirani v Odoo, se "
"lahko zgodi, da se skupni zneski nalogov razlikujejo za nekaj centov med "
"Odoo in *Amazon Seller Central*. Te razlike je mogoče rešiti z odpisom pri "
"usklajevanju plačil v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:126
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/setup.rst:199
msgid "Add a new marketplace"
msgstr "Dodajanje nove tržnice"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:128
msgid ""
"All marketplaces are supported by the Amazon Connector. To add a new "
"marketplace, proceed as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Amazonov konektor podpira vse tržnice. Za dodajanje nove tržnice sledite "
"naslednjim korakom:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:131
msgid "Activate the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`."
msgstr "Aktivirajte :ref:`razvijalski način <developer-mode>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:132
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings --> "
"Connectors --> Amazon Sync --> Amazon Marketplaces`."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings --> "
"Connectors --> Amazon Sync --> Amazon Marketplaces`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:134
msgid "Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new marketplace record."
msgstr "Kliknite :guilabel:`New`, da ustvarite nov zapis tržnice."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:135
msgid ""
"Enter the Marketplace ID in the :guilabel:`API Idenifier` field, and select "
"the :guilabel:`Amazon Region` for your marketplace as described in the "
"`Amazon Documentation for marketplace IDs and regions <https://developer-"
"docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/marketplace-ids>`_, and the :guilabel:`Seller "
"Central URL` as described in the `Amazon Documentation for seller central "
"URLs <https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/seller-central-urls>`_."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite ID tržnice v polje :guilabel:`API Idenifier` in "
"izberite :guilabel:`Amazon Region` za svojo tržnico, kot je opisano v "
"`Amazonovi dokumentaciji za ID-je tržnic in regije <https://developer-"
"docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/marketplace-ids>`_, ter :guilabel:`Seller "
"Central URL`, kot je opisano v `Amazonovi dokumentaciji za URL-je Seller "
"Central <https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/seller-central-"
"urls>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:140
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Name` of the record to `Amazon.<country code>` to easily "
"retrieve it (e.g. `Amazon.se`). The :guilabel:`API Identifier`, "
"the :guilabel:`Region` and the :guilabel:`Seller Central URL` fields should "
"respectively hold the *Marketplace ID*, the selected Amazon region, and the "
"*Seller Central URL* values from the Amazon Documentation."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite :guilabel:`Ime` zapisa na `Amazon.<koda države>`, da ga lahko "
"enostavno najdete (npr. `Amazon.se`). Polja :guilabel:`API "
"Identifier`, :guilabel:`Region` in :guilabel:`Seller Central URL` naj "
"vsebujejo vrednosti *ID tržnice*, izbrano Amazonovo regijo in *URL Seller "
"Central* iz Amazonove dokumentacije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:144
msgid ""
"Once the marketplace is saved, update the Amazon Account configuration by "
"going to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings --> "
"Connectors --> Amazon Sync --> Amazon Accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Ko je tržnica shranjena, posodobite konfiguracijo Amazonovega računa tako, "
"da greste na :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings --> "
"Connectors --> Amazon Sync --> Amazon Accounts`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/setup.rst:147
msgid ""
"Select the account on which to use the new marketplace, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Marketplaces` tab, and click on :guilabel:`Update available "
"marketplaces`. An animation should confirm the success of the operation. "
"Newly added marketplaces are automatically added to the list of synchronized "
"marketplaces. If the new marketplace is not added to the list, it means that "
"it is either incompatible or unavailable for the seller account."
msgstr ""
"Izberite račun, na katerem želite uporabiti novo tržnico, pojdite na "
"zavihek :guilabel:`Tržnice` in kliknite :guilabel:`Posodobi razpoložljive "
"tržnice`. Animacija bi morala potrditi uspešnost operacije. Novo dodane "
"tržnice so samodejno dodane na seznam sinhroniziranih tržnic. Če nova "
"tržnica ni dodana na seznam, to pomeni, da je bodisi nezdružljiva bodisi "
"nedostopna za račun prodajalca."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:3
msgid "Commissions"
msgstr "Provizije"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:7
msgid ""
"Commissions are a powerful tool to motivate sales team members. They "
"incentivize performance, boost productivity, and encourage healthy "
"competition. The *Commissions* feature in Odoo's **Sales** application "
"provides a way to reward salespeople or sales teams based on their "
"performance. This feature supports the creation of flexible, measurable "
"commission structures that align with business goals, whether that means "
"driving revenue, volume, profit, or recurring contracts."
msgstr ""
"Provizije so močno orodje za motiviranje članov prodajne ekipe. Spodbujajo "
"uspešnost, povečujejo produktivnost in spodbujajo zdravo konkurenco. "
"Funkcija *Provizije* v Odoo aplikaciji **Prodaja** omogoča nagrajevanje "
"prodajalcev ali prodajnih ekip na podlagi njihove uspešnosti. Ta funkcija "
"podpira ustvarjanje prilagodljivih, merljivih struktur provizij, ki se "
"ujemajo s poslovnimi cilji, ne glede na to, ali gre za spodbujanje "
"prihodkov, obsega, dobička ali ponavljajočih se pogodb."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:16
msgid ""
"To enable the *Commissions* feature, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --"
"> Configuration --> Settings`. Scroll to the :guilabel:`Invoicing` section, "
"and tick the :guilabel:`Commissions` checkbox. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`. "
"Doing so causes a new :guilabel:`Commissions` menu to appear in the menu "
"bar. To create a new commission plan, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Commissions --> Comission Plans` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Za omogočanje funkcije *Provizije* pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Prodaja --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`. Pomaknite se do "
"razdelka :guilabel:`Fakturiranje` in označite potrditveno "
"polje :guilabel:`Provizije`. Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`. S tem se v "
"menijski vrstici pojavi nov meni :guilabel:`Provizije`. Za ustvarjanje "
"novega načrta provizij pojdite na :menuselection:`Provizije --> Načrti "
"provizij` in kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:23
msgid "Commission plan structure"
msgstr "Struktura načrta provizij"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:25
msgid "Each commission plan is comprised of several components:"
msgstr "Vsak načrt provizij je sestavljen iz več komponent:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Based on`: Determines whether commissions are awarded based on "
"progress toward :guilabel:`Targets` or :guilabel:`Achievements`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Na podlagi`: Določa, ali se provizije dodelijo glede na napredek "
"k :guilabel:`Ciljem` ali :guilabel:`Dosežkom`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`per`: Indicates whether the plan applies to individual "
"salespeople or an entire sales team"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`za`: Označuje, ali se načrt nanaša na posamezne prodajalce ali "
"celotno prodajno ekipo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Target Frequency`: Sets how often targets reset: **Monthly**, "
"**Quarterly**, or **Yearly**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pogostost ciljov`: Določa, kako pogosto se cilji ponastavijo: "
"**Mesečno**, **Četrtletno** ali **Letno**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:33
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Achievements`: Determines what is being measured toward "
"commissions."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Dosežki`: Določa, kaj se meri za provizije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:35
msgid "A new commission plan detail form."
msgstr "Obrazec s podrobnostmi novega načrta provizij."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:39
msgid "Target-based commission plans"
msgstr "Načrti provizij na podlagi ciljev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:41
msgid ""
"In a *Target* based commission plan, commissions are awarded based on the "
"percentage of sales targets reached. Target based plans are ideal for "
"setting clear, measurable goals, such as invoicing a specific amount in "
"sales per quarter, then rewarding sales people progressively based on how "
"close they come to reaching or exceeding that goal."
msgstr ""
"Pri načrtu provizij na podlagi *Ciljov* se provizije dodelijo glede na "
"odstotek doseženih prodajnih ciljev. Načrti na podlagi ciljev so idealni za "
"postavljanje jasnih, merljivih ciljev, kot je fakturiranje določenega zneska "
"prodaje na četrtletje, nato pa postopno nagrajevanje prodajalcev glede na "
"to, kako blizu so dosegli ali presegli ta cilj."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:47
msgid ""
"Target based plans differ from *Achievement* based plans because they are "
"based on reaching a fixed, predefined goal. They focus on goal-based "
"incentives and performance milestones."
msgstr ""
"Načrti na podlagi ciljev se razlikujejo od načrtov na podlagi *Dosežkov*, "
"ker temeljijo na doseganju fiksnega, vnaprej določenega cilja. Osredotočajo "
"se na spodbude, ki temeljijo na ciljih, in mejnike uspešnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:50
msgid ""
"To configure a new target based commission plan, navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Sales app --> Commissions --> Commission Plans`, then "
"click :guilabel:`New`. Click in the :guilabel:`Based on` drop-down menu and "
"select :guilabel:`Targets`. Then, select an option in the :guilabel:`per` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo novega načrta provizij na podlagi ciljev pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Prodaja --> Provizije --> Načrti provizij`, "
"nato kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`. Kliknite v spustni meni :guilabel:`Na "
"podlagi` in izberite :guilabel:`Cilji`. Nato izberite možnost v "
"polju :guilabel:`za`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:54
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`On Target Commission` field, set the payout amount for "
"reaching `100%` of the target. Update the :guilabel:`Effective Period` "
"fields to confirm the dates for this plan. Then, update "
"the :guilabel:`Target Frequency` field based on how often the targets should "
"be set and evaluated."
msgstr ""
"V polje :guilabel:`Provizija pri cilju` nastavite znesek izplačila za "
"doseganje `100%` cilja. Posodobite polji :guilabel:`Obdobje veljavnosti`, da "
"potrdite datume za ta načrt. Nato posodobite polje :guilabel:`Pogostost "
"ciljev` glede na to, kako pogosto naj se cilji določijo in ocenijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:59
msgid "*Monthly*: short term goals with frequent payouts."
msgstr "*Mesečno*: kratkoročni cilji s pogostimi izplačili."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:60
msgid ""
"*Quarterly*: aligns with business cycles and provides mid-range objectives."
msgstr ""
"*Četrtletno*: usklajeno s poslovnimi cikli in zagotavlja srednjeročne cilje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:61
msgid "*Yearly*: long term sales goals for strategic planning."
msgstr "*Letno*: dolgoročni prodajni cilji za strateško načrtovanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:63
msgid ""
"After the :guilabel:`Target Frequency` field is updated, "
"the :guilabel:`Targets` tab updates with a list of the appropriate time "
"frame. For each :guilabel:`Period`, enter a :guilabel:`Target` goal."
msgstr ""
"Ko je polje :guilabel:`Pogostost ciljev` posodobljeno, se "
"zavihek :guilabel:`Cilji` posodobi s seznamom ustreznega časovnega okvira. "
"Za vsako :guilabel:`Obdobje` vnesite cilj :guilabel:`Cilj`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:66
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:116
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Achievements` tab, add one or more :ref:`Achievement "
"metric <sales/commissions/achievement-metric>` for this plan by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Add a new achievement`."
msgstr ""
"Na zavihku :guilabel:`Achievements` dodajte eno ali več :ref:`Achievement "
"metric <sales/commissions/achievement-metric>` za ta načrt s klikom "
"na :guilabel:`Add a new achievement`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:69
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:119
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Sales People` tab to assign this plan to the "
"appropriate staff. Click either :guilabel:`Add a new Sales Person` to add "
"them individually, or :guilabel:`Add Multiple Salespersons` to bulk add "
"several at once."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite zavihek :guilabel:`Sales People`, da dodelite ta načrt ustreznim "
"zaposlenim. Kliknite bodisi :guilabel:`Add a new Sales Person`, da jih "
"dodate posamično, ali :guilabel:`Add Multiple Salespersons`, da naenkrat "
"dodate več zaposlenih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:74
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Add Multiple Salespersons` button is only available "
"if :doc:`../../general/developer_mode` is active."
msgstr ""
"Gumb :guilabel:`Add Multiple Salespersons` je na voljo le, če je :doc:`../../"
"general/developer_mode` aktiven."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:80
msgid ""
"To provide additional incentive, *commission levels* can be added to "
"*Target* based plans. These tiers allow salespeople to earn varying "
"commission amounts based on their performance levels. Levels can start at "
"`0%` and increase incrementally. This allows for salespeople to earn "
"commission even if they do not achieve `100%` of the target, as well as the "
"ability to achieve over `100%` of the target. Commission levels can be set "
"from the :guilabel:`Commissions` tab when creating a commission plan."
msgstr ""
"Za dodatno spodbudo je mogoče načrtom na podlagi *ciljev* dodati *ravni "
"provizij*. Te stopnje omogočajo prodajnemu osebju, da zasluži različne "
"zneske provizij glede na raven uspešnosti. Ravni se lahko začnejo pri `0%` "
"in postopoma naraščajo. To omogoča prodajnemu osebju, da zasluži provizijo, "
"tudi če ne doseže `100%` cilja, pa tudi možnost preseči `100%` cilja. Ravni "
"provizij je mogoče nastaviti na zavihku :guilabel:`Commissions` pri "
"ustvarjanju načrta provizij."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:87
msgid ""
"If no levels are added above 100%, salespeople are **not** able to earn "
"above the stated commission."
msgstr ""
"Če ravni nad 100% niso dodane, prodajno osebje **ne more** zaslužiti nad "
"navedeno provizijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:90
msgid ""
"In the plan below, the levels start at `0%`, and continue until `300%`. If a "
"salesperson exceeds `100%` of the expected target, their expected payout "
"continues to increase up to `300%`."
msgstr ""
"V spodnjem načrtu se ravni začnejo pri `0%` in nadaljujejo do `300%`. Če "
"prodajalec preseže `100%` pričakovanega cilja, se njegova pričakovana "
"izplačila še naprej povečujejo do `300%`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:93
msgid "An example of commission levels, with levels above 100 percent."
msgstr "Primer ravni provizij z ravnmi nad 100 odstotkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:97
msgid "Achievement-based commission plans"
msgstr "Načrti provizij na podlagi dosežkov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:99
msgid ""
"In a *Achievement* based commission plan, salespeople earn a percentage of "
"their invoice value as commission. Achievement-based plans are ideal for "
"rewarding sales activity consistently, regardless of specific goals. For "
"example, offering a `5%` commission on all invoiced amounts, regardless of "
"how much is sold."
msgstr ""
"V provizijskem načrtu, ki temelji na *dosežkih*, prodajalci zaslužijo "
"odstotek vrednosti računa kot provizijo. Načrti, ki temeljijo na dosežkih, "
"so idealni za dosledno nagrajevanje prodajne aktivnosti, ne glede na "
"določene cilje. Na primer, ponudba `5%` provizije na vse izdane račune, ne "
"glede na to, koliko je prodanega."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:105
msgid ""
"Achievement based plans differ from *Target* based plans because they are "
"calculated based on actual achievements using a flat, consistent rate. They "
"are beneficial for ongoing, non-goal based compensation plans."
msgstr ""
"Načrti na podlagi dosežkov se razlikujejo od načrtov na podlagi *ciljev*, "
"ker se izračunajo na podlagi dejanskih dosežkov z uporabo fiksne, dosledne "
"stopnje. Koristni so za tekoče načrte nadomestil, ki niso usmerjeni v cilje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:109
msgid ""
"To configure a new target based commission plan, navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Sales app --> Commissions --> Commission Plans`, then "
"click :guilabel:`New`. Click in the :guilabel:`Based on` drop-down and "
"select :guilabel:`Achievements`. Then, select an option in "
"the :guilabel:`per` field."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo novega načrta provizij na podlagi ciljev pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Sales app --> Commissions --> Commission Plans`, nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`New`. Kliknite spustni meni :guilabel:`Based on` in "
"izberite :guilabel:`Achievements`. Nato izberite možnost v "
"polju :guilabel:`per`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:113
msgid ""
"Update the :guilabel:`Effective Period` fields to confirm the dates for this "
"plan. Then, update the :guilabel:`Target Frequency` field based on how often "
"the targets should be set and evaluated."
msgstr ""
"Posodobite polja :guilabel:`Effective Period`, da potrdite datume za ta "
"načrt. Nato posodobite polje :guilabel:`Target Frequency` glede na to, kako "
"pogosto naj se cilji nastavijo in ovrednotijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:126
msgid "Achievements"
msgstr "Dosežki"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:128
msgid ""
"Performance can be measured in several ways in performance plans. These are "
"configured in the :guilabel:`Achievements` tab of each plan. It is possible "
"to track achievements by all products sold, by specific products sold, by "
"all products sold in a specific category, and more."
msgstr ""
"Uspešnost je mogoče v načrtih uspešnosti meriti na več načinov. Ti so "
"konfigurirani v zavihku :guilabel:`Dosežki` vsakega načrta. Mogoče je "
"slediti dosežkom po vseh prodanih izdelkih, po določenih prodanih izdelkih, "
"po vseh prodanih izdelkih v določeni kategoriji in več."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:132
msgid ":guilabel:`Amount Sold`: the total value of sales orders (SOs)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Amount Sold`: skupna vrednost prodajnih naročil (SOs)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:133
msgid ":guilabel:`Amount Invoiced`: the total value of confirmed invoices."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Amount Invoiced`: skupna vrednost potrjenih računov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:134
msgid ":guilabel:`Quantity Sold`: the total number of units sold via |SOs|."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Quantity Sold`: skupno število prodanih enot prek |SOs|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:135
msgid ":guilabel:`Quantity Invoiced`: the total number of units invoiced."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Quantity Invoiced`: skupno število zaračunanih enot."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:136
msgid ":guilabel:`Margin`: the profit margin (selling price minus cost price)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Margin`: profitna marža (prodajna cena minus nabavna cena)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:137
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MRR`: the new *Monthly Recurring Revenue* from subscription "
"sales. this option is **only** available if the :doc:`Subscriptions <../../"
"sales/subscriptions>` app is installed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`MRR`: novi *mesečni ponavljajoči se prihodki* iz prodaje "
"naročnin. Ta možnost je na voljo **samo**, če je nameščena "
"aplikacija :doc:`Subscriptions <../../sales/subscriptions>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:141
msgid ""
"Regardless of what the plan is :guilabel:`Based on`, each plan needs both "
"*Achievements* and *Targets* configured."
msgstr ""
"Ne glede na to, na čem je načrt :guilabel:`Based on`, mora imeti vsak načrt "
"konfigurirane tako *dosežke* kot *cilje*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:145
msgid "Plan approval"
msgstr "Odobritev načrta"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:147
msgid ""
"After confirming the details of the new plan, click :guilabel:`Approve`. "
"This moves the plan from the :guilabel:`Draft` stage into "
"the :guilabel:`Approved` stage."
msgstr ""
"Po potrditvi podrobnosti novega načrta kliknite :guilabel:`Odobri`. S tem se "
"načrt premakne iz faze :guilabel:`Osnutek` v fazo :guilabel:`Odobreno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:151
msgid ""
"Commissions plans in the :guilabel:`Approved` stage **cannot** be edited. To "
"edit an approved plan, it must first be :guilabel:`Reset to Draft`."
msgstr ""
"Načrtov provizij v fazi :guilabel:`Odobreno` **ni mogoče** urejati. Za "
"urejanje odobrenega načrta ga je treba najprej :guilabel:`Ponastavi na "
"osnutek`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:154
msgid ""
"After a plan is approved, Odoo automatically tracks performance and "
"calculates commissions based on the established parameters."
msgstr ""
"Ko je načrt odobren, Odoo samodejno sledi uspeh in izračuna provizije na "
"podlagi določenih parametrov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/commissions.rst:158
msgid ":doc:`Commissions <../../hr/payroll/commissions>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Commissions <../../hr/payroll/commissions>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:3
msgid "Gelato"
msgstr "Sladoled"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:5
msgid ""
"Gelato is a global print-on-demand platform that integrates with Odoo to "
"sync product catalogs and automate order fulfillment."
msgstr ""
"Gelato je globalna platforma za tiskanje na zahtevo, ki se integrira z Odoo "
"za sinhronizacijo katalogov izdelkov in avtomatizacijo izpolnjevanja naročil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:8
msgid ""
"Connecting Gelato's services with Odoo's **Sales** and **eCommerce** apps "
"enables the following:"
msgstr ""
"Povezava storitev Gelato z aplikacijama Odoo **Prodaja** in **eCommerce** "
"omogoča naslednje:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:10
msgid "Sync Odoo sales orders with Gelato for automated order fulfillment"
msgstr ""
"Sinhronizacija prodajnih naročil Odoo z Gelato za avtomatizirano "
"izpolnjevanje naročil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:11
msgid ""
"Create and manage Gelato products within Odoo; supports product variant and "
"image sync"
msgstr ""
"Ustvarjanje in upravljanje izdelkov Gelato v Odoo; podpira sinhronizacijo "
"variant izdelkov in slik"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:12
msgid ""
"Configure delivery options in Odoo and receive order updates via webhooks."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurirajte možnosti dostave v Odoo in prejemajte posodobitve naročil "
"prek webhokov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:18
msgid ""
"The company information (*Company name* and *Billing address*) in the Gelato "
"account *must* match the company information in the Odoo database in order "
"for sales orders to be confirmed and sent to Gelato for fulfillment."
msgstr ""
"Podatki o podjetju (*Ime podjetja* in *Naslov za izstavitev računa*) v "
"računu Gelato se *morajo* ujemati s podatki o podjetju v podatkovni bazi "
"Odoo, da se lahko prodajna naročila potrdijo in pošljejo v Gelato za "
"izpolnitev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:22
msgid "Company information in Gelato."
msgstr "Podatki o podjetju v Gelato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:25
msgid "Company information in Odoo."
msgstr "Podatki o podjetju v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:29
msgid "Configure API keys and webhooks in Gelato"
msgstr "Konfiguracija ključev API in webhokov v Gelato"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:31
msgid ""
"Before configuring the Gelato connector in Odoo, first obtain API "
"credentials and webhooks from the Gelato account."
msgstr ""
"Preden konfigurirate povezovalnik Gelato v Odoo, najprej pridobite "
"poverilnice API in webhoke iz računa Gelato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:34
msgid ""
"API connectors enable Odoo **Sales** to send and receive data from Gelato "
"for order processing, while webhooks provide real-time updates on order "
"status and shipment tracking."
msgstr ""
"Povezovalniki API omogočajo aplikaciji Odoo **Prodaja** pošiljanje in "
"prejemanje podatkov iz Gelato za obdelavo naročil, medtem ko webhoki "
"zagotavljajo posodobitve v realnem času o stanju naročila in sledenju "
"pošiljk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:38
msgid "API Key"
msgstr "API ključ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:40
msgid ""
"An API Key is a unique authentication token that allows Odoo to securely "
"communicate with Gelato's API, enabling order transmission, status updates, "
"and data synchronization."
msgstr ""
"Ključ API je edinstveni avtentikacijski žeton, ki omogoča Odoo varno "
"komunikacijo z API-jem Gelato, kar omogoča prenos naročil, posodobitve "
"statusa in sinhronizacijo podatkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:43
msgid ""
"After logging into Gelato, click :icon:`fa-code` :guilabel:`Developer` in "
"the left menu bar. From here, click on :guilabel:`API keys`. In the new "
"page, click the :guilabel:`Add API Key` button to open a new API key form. "
"Type in a name, then click :guilabel:`Create Key`."
msgstr ""
"Po prijavi v Gelato kliknite :icon:`fa-code` :guilabel:`Developer` v levem "
"meniju. Od tu kliknite na :guilabel:`API keys`. Na novi strani kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Add API Key`, da odprete nov obrazec za ključ API. Vnesite "
"ime, nato kliknite :guilabel:`Create Key`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:47
msgid "Copy the generated API key using :guilabel:`Copy to Clipboard`."
msgstr ""
"Kopirajte ustvarjeni ključ API z uporabo :guilabel:`Copy to Clipboard`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:49
msgid "Newly generated API key in the Gelato platform."
msgstr "Na novo ustvarjen ključ API na platformi Gelato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:53
msgid ""
"Copy the API key and store it somewhere safe and secure before leaving this "
"page. Once the page is refreshed or exited, the key will not be available to "
"copy."
msgstr ""
"Kopirajte ključ API in ga shranite na varno in zanesljivo mesto, preden "
"zapustite to stran. Ko se stran osveži ali zapusti, ključ ne bo več na voljo "
"za kopiranje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:56
msgid ""
"If the key cannot be copied or is lost, return to the :guilabel:`API key` "
"page and start over, creating a new API key."
msgstr ""
"Če ključa ni mogoče kopirati ali je izgubljen, se vrnite na "
"stran :guilabel:`API ključ` in začnite znova ter ustvarite nov API ključ."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:60
msgid "Webhook"
msgstr "Webhook"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:62
msgid ""
"A webhook is an automated notification system that instantly updates Odoo "
"when Gelato processes, ships, or delivers an order, ensuring real-time "
"tracking and minimal manual intervention."
msgstr ""
"Webhook je sistem samodejnih obvestil, ki takoj posodobi Odoo, ko Gelato "
"obdela, odpošlje ali dostavi naročilo, kar zagotavlja sledenje v realnem "
"času in minimalno ročno posredovanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:65
msgid ""
"To create a webhook, go to :menuselection:`Developer --> Webhooks` under "
"the :guilabel:`Developer` drop-down menu in the left menu bar. In the new "
"page, click :guilabel:`Add Webhook` to open a :guilabel:`Create Webhook` "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje webhooka pojdite na :menuselection:`Razvijalec --> Webhooki` "
"pod spustnim menijem :guilabel:`Razvijalec` v levi menijski vrstici. Na novi "
"strani kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj webhook`, da odprete "
"obrazec :guilabel:`Ustvari webhook`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:69
msgid "The webhook form requires several specific configurations:"
msgstr "Obrazec za webhook zahteva več posebnih nastavitev:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:71
msgid ""
":guilabel:`URL`: This tells Gelato where to send the order updates in Odoo. "
"Copy and paste the Odoo database URL with the additional suffix `/gelato/"
"webhook`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`URL`: To pove Gelatu, kam naj pošlje posodobitve naročila v Odoo. "
"Kopirajte in prilepite URL podatkovne baze Odoo z dodatno pripono `/gelato/"
"webhook`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:75
msgid "`https://stealthywood.odoo.com/gelato/webhook`"
msgstr "`https://stealthywood.odoo.com/gelato/webhook`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Events`: Click into the field and "
"select :guilabel:`order_status_updated`. "
"Selecting :guilabel:`order_status_updated` ensures Odoo receives order "
"changes automatically."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dogodki`: Kliknite v polje in "
"izberite :guilabel:`order_status_updated`. "
"Izbira :guilabel:`order_status_updated` zagotavlja, da Odoo samodejno "
"prejema spremembe naročil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Method`: Click into the field and select the :guilabel:`HTTP "
"Post` option, as this is the request method used to send data from Gelato to "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Metoda`: Kliknite v polje in izberite možnost :guilabel:`HTTP "
"Post`, saj je to metoda zahteve, ki se uporablja za pošiljanje podatkov iz "
"Gelata v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:81
msgid ""
"Tick the checkbox next to :guilabel:`I want to take Authorization to this "
"webhook`."
msgstr ""
"Označite potrditveno polje poleg :guilabel:`Želim dodati avtorizacijo temu "
"webhooku`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Header Name`: In this field, type in `signature` to match the "
"field in Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ime glave`: V to polje vnesite `signature`, da se ujema s poljem "
"v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:83
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Generate Key` to generate a :guilabel:`Header Value`."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Generiraj ključ`, da ustvarite :guilabel:`Vrednost "
"glave`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:84
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Create` to complete this webhook configuration."
msgstr "Kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari`, da dokončate to konfiguracijo webhooka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:86
msgid "Newly configured webhook in the Gelato platform."
msgstr "Novo konfiguriran webhook na platformi Gelato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:90
msgid ""
"Copy and paste the API key and webhook on a notepad before tabbing out of "
"the Gelato webpage as backup."
msgstr ""
"Kopirajte in prilepite API ključ in webhook v beležnico, preden zapustite "
"spletno stran Gelato, kot varnostno kopijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:94
msgid "Configure Gelato connector in Odoo"
msgstr "Konfiguriranje konektorja Gelato v Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:96
msgid ""
"In Odoo, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, then scroll to the :guilabel:`Connectors` section. Enable "
"the :guilabel:`Gelato` connector by ticking the checkbox. Next, paste the "
"newly generated API keys and webhook secret key into their respective "
"fields. Once saved, Gelato is available in Odoo **Sales** and **eCommerce** "
"products."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Sales --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Nastavitve`, nato se pomaknite do razdelka :guilabel:`Konektorji`. Omogočite "
"konektor :guilabel:`Gelato` z označitvijo potrditvenega polja. Nato "
"prilepite novo ustvarjene API ključe in skrivni ključ webhooka v ustrezna "
"polja. Ko je shranjeno, je Gelato na voljo v izdelkih Odoo **Sales** in "
"**eCommerce**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:102
msgid "Synchronizing Gelato products with Odoo Sales"
msgstr "Sinhronizacija izdelkov Gelato z Odoo Sales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:104
msgid ""
"It is recommended to have products already configured in Gelato before "
"configuring them in Odoo. To get the product ID in Gelato, navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Templates` page from the side bar menu. Select which product "
"to synchronize in Odoo, then hover over the product card to reveal "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` menu icon. Click "
"the menu icon, then click :guilabel:`Copy Template ID` to copy the product "
"template ID to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Priporočljivo je, da so izdelki že konfigurirani v Gelatu, preden jih "
"konfigurirate v Odoo. Za pridobitev ID-ja izdelka v Gelatu pojdite na "
"stran :guilabel:`Predloge` iz stranskega menija. Izberite izdelek, ki ga "
"želite sinhronizirati v Odoo, nato premaknite kazalec miške nad kartico "
"izdelka, da se prikaže ikona menija :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(navpična tripičja)`. Kliknite ikono menija, nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Kopiraj ID predloge`, da kopirate ID predloge izdelka v "
"odložišče."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:111
msgid ""
"`Start selling products with Gelato: Quick & easy setup <https://"
"www.gelato.com/blog/get-started-with-gelato-creating-products>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Začnite prodajati izdelke z Gelato: Hitra in enostavna nastavitev <https://"
"www.gelato.com/blog/get-started-with-gelato-creating-products>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:116
msgid "Odoo Sales product"
msgstr "Izdelek Odoo Sales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:118
msgid ""
"To create a product in Odoo that matches the Gelato product, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Products`, "
"select :guilabel:`New` to create a new product form. Type in the "
"product :guilabel:`Name`, then navigate to the :guilabel:`Sales` tab. Find "
"the :guilabel:`Gelato` section, then click into the :guilabel:`Template "
"Reference` field and paste the copied template ID from the Gelato product. "
"Finally, click :guilabel:`Synchronize`."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje izdelka v Odoo, ki se ujema z izdelkom Gelato, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Products`, "
"izberite :guilabel:`New`, da ustvarite nov obrazec za izdelek. "
"Vnesite :guilabel:`Name` izdelka, nato pojdite na zavihek :guilabel:`Sales`. "
"Poiščite razdelek :guilabel:`Gelato`, nato kliknite v "
"polje :guilabel:`Template Reference` in prilepite kopirani ID predloge iz "
"izdelka Gelato. Nazadnje kliknite :guilabel:`Synchronize`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:124
msgid ""
"Successful synchronization pulls the Gelato product variant options into the "
"newly configured Odoo product."
msgstr ""
"Uspešna sinhronizacija prenese možnosti variant izdelka Gelato v novo "
"konfigurirani izdelek Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:127
msgid ""
"In the new :guilabel:`Print Images` field, click the :guilabel:`default` "
"marker to set a default product image. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`(edit)` icon and select the product image file to upload, "
"then :guilabel:`Save & Close`."
msgstr ""
"V novem polju :guilabel:`Print Images` kliknite oznako :guilabel:`default`, "
"da nastavite privzeto sliko izdelka. Kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`(edit)` in izberite datoteko slike izdelka za nalaganje, "
"nato :guilabel:`Save & Close`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:132
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Print Images` field *must* be configured on all Gelato "
"products and their respective product variations before they can be ordered."
msgstr ""
"Polje :guilabel:`Print Images` *mora* biti konfigurirano za vse izdelke "
"Gelato in njihove posamezne variante izdelkov, preden jih je mogoče naročiti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:138
msgid ""
"To view and edit the newly synchronized product variants, navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Attributes & Variants` tab, which will have the variants "
"pulled from the Gelato product configuration. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Configure` button to edit and configure the variant images, "
"delivery methods, additional pricing, etc."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled in urejanje novo sinhroniziranih variant izdelkov pojdite na "
"zavihek :guilabel:`Attributes & Variants`, ki bo imel variante prenesene iz "
"konfiguracije izdelka Gelato. Kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Configure`, da "
"uredite in konfigurirate slike variant, načine dostave, dodatno določanje "
"cen itd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:144
msgid "Order a Gelato product from Odoo"
msgstr "Naročilo izdelka Gelato iz Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:146
msgid ""
"Once synchronized, Gelato products are available to order in Odoo "
"through :doc:`sales quotations <sales_quotations>` or on the **eCommerce** "
"store. Gelato delivery options are automatically synchronized upon API and "
"webhook configuration."
msgstr ""
"Ko so sinhronizirani, so izdelki Gelato na voljo za naročanje v Odoo "
"prek :doc:`sales quotations <sales_quotations>` ali v trgovini "
"**eCommerce**. Možnosti dostave Gelato se samodejno sinhronizirajo po "
"konfiguraciji API in webhook."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:150
msgid ""
"To add Gelato delivery, click :guilabel:`Add shipping` on the sales order. "
"Select :guilabel:`Standard Delivery` or :guilabel:`Express Delivery` in "
"the :guilabel:`Shipping Method` field, then click :guilabel:`Get rate`."
msgstr ""
"Za dodajanje dostave Gelato kliknite :guilabel:`Add shipping` na prodajnem "
"nalogu. V polju :guilabel:`Shipping Method` izberite :guilabel:`Standard "
"Delivery` ali :guilabel:`Express Delivery`, nato kliknite :guilabel:`Get "
"rate`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:154
msgid ""
"Once the quotation is confirmed, it becomes an active sales order, and the "
"order is sent to Gelato for fulfillment. Once a sales order is sent from "
"Odoo to Gelato, Gelato processes the order, produces the product at the "
"nearest fulfillment center, and ships it directly to the end-customer."
msgstr ""
"Ko je ponudba potrjena, postane aktiven prodajni nalog in naročilo je "
"poslano v Gelato za izpolnitev. Ko je prodajni nalog poslan iz Odoo v "
"Gelato, Gelato obdela naročilo, proizvede izdelek v najbližjem centru za "
"izpolnjevanje in ga pošlje neposredno končnemu kupcu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:159
msgid ":doc:`sales_quotations/create_quotations`"
msgstr ":doc:`sales_quotations/create_quotations`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/gelato.rst:162
msgid ""
"When creating a sales order for Gelato products in the database, only Gelato "
"products can be added to the same sales order. Multivendor orders are not "
"available with the Gelato connector at this time."
msgstr ""
"Pri ustvarjanju prodajnega naloga za izdelke Gelato v bazi podatkov je "
"mogoče istemu prodajnemu nalogu dodati samo izdelke Gelato. Naročila več "
"dobaviteljev trenutno niso na voljo s priključkom Gelato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing.rst:5
msgid "Invoicing Method"
msgstr "Način fakturiranja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:-1
msgid ""
"A down payment is an up-front payment collected when confirming a sales "
"order. This page covers invoicing fixed and percentage-based down payments "
"through the Create Invoice option, with examples, and modifying the income "
"account used for down payment invoices."
msgstr ""
"Predplačilo je vnaprejšnje plačilo, prejeto ob potrditvi prodajnega naloga. "
"Ta stran obravnava izdajo računov za fiksna in odstotna predplačila prek "
"možnosti Ustvari račun s primeri ter spreminjanje konta prihodkov, ki se "
"uporablja za račune za predplačilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:9
msgid "Down payments"
msgstr "Akontacije"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:11
msgid ""
"A down payment is an initial up-front payment made during the confirmation "
"of a sales transaction. With a down payment, the buyer pays a portion of the "
"total amount owed while agreeing to pay the remaining amount at a later "
"date. In turn, the seller provides goods or services to the buyer upon or "
"after accepting the down payment, trusting that the remaining amount is paid "
"later on."
msgstr ""
"Akontacija je začetno vnaprejšnje plačilo, opravljeno med potrditvijo "
"prodajne transakcije. Z akontacijo kupec plača del celotnega zneska, medtem "
"ko se strinja, da bo preostali znesek plačal pozneje. Prodajalec pa ob "
"sprejemu akontacije ali po njem zagotovi blago ali storitve kupcu ter zaupa, "
"da bo preostali znesek plačan pozneje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:16
msgid ""
"In the Odoo **Sales** app, down payments can be customized to fit the needs "
"of each individual sales transaction."
msgstr ""
"V aplikaciji Odoo **Sales** je mogoče akontacije prilagoditi potrebam vsake "
"posamezne prodajne transakcije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:20
msgid ""
"Down payment invoices are **not** the same as payment terms or installment "
"plans. If a single invoice issued for a sales order requires multiple "
"payment installments, that invoice uses a :doc:`payment term with an "
"installment plan <../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/"
"payment_terms>`."
msgstr ""
"Računi za akontacijo **niso** enaki plačilnim pogojem ali načrtom obrokov. "
"Če en sam račun, izdan za prodajni nalog, zahteva več obrokov plačila, ta "
"račun uporablja :doc:`plačilni pogoj z načrtom obrokov <../../../finance/"
"accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:26
msgid "Create invoices"
msgstr "Ustvari račune"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:28
msgid ""
"When a sales order is confirmed, the option to create an invoice becomes "
"available via the :guilabel:`Create Invoice` button. When clicked, a *Create "
"invoice(s)* pop-up appears. If a greater quantity of a service is being "
"delivered than what has been invoiced, the overage appears in red and the "
"option to invoice any overages is enabled by default."
msgstr ""
"Ko je prodajni nalog potrjen, postane možnost ustvarjanja računa na voljo "
"prek gumba :guilabel:`Ustvari račun`. Ob kliku se prikaže pojavno okno "
"*Ustvari račun(e)*. Če je dobavljena večja količina storitve od zaračunane, "
"se presežek prikaže z rdečo barvo, možnost izdaje računa za morebitne "
"presežke pa je privzeto omogočena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:33
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:113
msgid "Create invoice(s) pop-up form that appears in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Pojavni obrazec Ustvari račun(e), ki se prikaže v Odoo Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:37
msgid ""
"Invoices are automatically created as drafts so they can be reviewed before "
"validation. Only services set with an invoicing policy of *Prepaid/Fixed "
"Price* may be marked in red as overages. Services with other invoicing "
"policies and products marked as *Goods* are not handled the same way."
msgstr ""
"Računi se samodejno ustvarijo kot osnutki, da jih je mogoče pregledati pred "
"potrditvijo. Samo storitve z določeno politiko izdajanja računov *Vnaprej "
"plačano/fiksna cena* so lahko označene z rdečo kot presežki. Storitve z "
"drugimi politikami izdajanja računov in izdelki, označeni kot *Blago*, se ne "
"obravnavajo na enak način."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:42
msgid ""
"On the *Create invoice(s)* pop-up, there are three options to choose from in "
"the :guilabel:`Create Invoice` field:"
msgstr ""
"V pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Ustvari račun(e)` so v polju :guilabel:`Ustvari "
"račun` na izbiro tri možnosti:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:45
msgid ":guilabel:`Regular invoice`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Regular invoice`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:46
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:54
msgid ":guilabel:`Down payment (percentage)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Down payment (percentage)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:47
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:55
msgid ":guilabel:`Down payment (fixed amount)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Down payment (fixed amount)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:50
msgid "Initial down payment request"
msgstr "Začetna zahteva za akontacijo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:52
msgid "On the *Create invoice(s)* pop-up window, the down payment options are:"
msgstr "V pojavnem oknu *Ustvari račun(e)* so možnosti predplačila naslednje:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:57
msgid ""
"Select a down payment option and set the desired payment, either as a "
"percentage or a fixed amount, in the :guilabel:`Down Payment` field."
msgstr ""
"Izberite možnost pologa in nastavite želeno plačilo bodisi kot odstotek "
"bodisi kot fiksni znesek v polju :guilabel:`Znesek pologa`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:60
msgid ""
"Once all fields are filled in, click the :guilabel:`Create Draft` button. "
"Upon clicking this button, Odoo brings up the :guilabel:`Customer Invoice "
"Draft`."
msgstr ""
"Ko so vsa polja izpolnjena, kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Ustvari osnutek`. Ob "
"kliku na ta gumb Odoo odpre :guilabel:`Osnutek računa za stranko`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:64
msgid ""
"If an :guilabel:`Invalid Operation` error appears, double-check that "
"the :doc:`invoicing policy <invoicing_policy>` is configured correctly. In "
"some cases, for example, the invoicing policy is configured to require "
"delivery before sending an invoice."
msgstr ""
"Če se prikaže napaka :guilabel:`Neveljavna operacija`, še enkrat preverite, "
"ali je :doc:`politika izdajanja računov <invoicing_policy>` pravilno "
"konfigurirana. V nekaterih primerih je na primer politika izdajanja računov "
"konfigurirana tako, da zahteva dostavo pred pošiljanjem računa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:68
msgid ""
"In the *Invoice Lines* tab of the :guilabel:`Customer Invoice Draft`, the "
"down payment that was configured in the *Create invoice(s)* pop-up form "
"appears as a :guilabel:`Down Payment` line item. After "
"clicking :guilabel:`Confirm` to apply the down payment to the sales order, "
"the down payment appears in a new :guilabel:`Down Payments` section."
msgstr ""
"V zavihku *Vrstice računa* obrazca :guilabel:`Osnutek računa za stranko` se "
"predplačilo, ki je bilo nastavljeno v pojavnem obrazcu *Ustvari račun(e)*, "
"prikaže kot vrstica :guilabel:`Predplačilo`. Po kliku na :guilabel:`Potrdi` "
"za uveljavitev predplačila na prodajnem nalogu se predplačilo prikaže v "
"novem razdelku :guilabel:`Predplačila`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:76
msgid "Types of down payments"
msgstr "Vrste akontacij"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:78
msgid ""
"Odoo offers both fixed dollar amounts and partial percentage down payments "
"(such as 30% of an order's total)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo omogoča tako fiksne denarne zneske kot delna odstotna predplačila (na "
"primer 30 % celotnega zneska naročila)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:81
msgid ""
"A 100% down payment is possible and differs from a full payment of the sales "
"order. A sales order paid through the regular invoice process does not allow "
"any additional invoices to be generated and does not display "
"the :guilabel:`Create Invoice` button on the sales order. With a 100% down "
"payment, the :guilabel:`Create Invoice` button is still displayed on the "
"sales order because the system requires that another invoice be created in "
"order to complete the sales order."
msgstr ""
"100-odstotno predplačilo je mogoče in se razlikuje od celotnega plačila "
"prodajnega naloga. Prodajni nalog, plačan prek rednega postopka izdaje "
"računov, ne omogoča ustvarjanja dodatnih računov in na prodajnem nalogu ne "
"prikazuje gumba :guilabel:`Ustvari račun`. Pri 100-odstotnem predplačilu je "
"gumb :guilabel:`Ustvari račun` na prodajnem nalogu še vedno prikazan, saj "
"sistem zahteva ustvarjanje še enega računa za dokončanje prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:87
msgid "The following are two examples of down payment amounts:"
msgstr "V nadaljevanju sta dva primera zneskov akontacije:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:89
msgid ""
":ref:`Example 1: 50% down payment <sales/down_payment/50-percent-down-"
"payments>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Primer 1: 50-odstotni predujem <sales/down_payment/50-percent-down-"
"payments>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:90
msgid ""
":ref:`Example 2: 100% down payment <sales/down_payment/100-percent-down-"
"payments>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Primer 2: 100-odstotni predujem <sales/down_payment/100-percent-down-"
"payments>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:95
msgid "Example 1: 50% down payment"
msgstr "Primer 1: 50-odstotna akontacija"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:98
msgid ""
"This flow is also possible with the :guilabel:`Down payment (fixed amount)` "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Ta potek je možen tudi z možnostjo :guilabel:`Down payment (fixed amount)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:100
msgid ""
"A customer is buying a luxury cabinet from a furniture store. The furniture "
"store has configured the cabinet with an *Invoicing Policy* of *Ordered "
"quantities*. The store requires a 50% down payment on all of its furniture "
"products."
msgstr ""
"Stranka kupuje luksuzno omaro v trgovini s pohištvom. Trgovina s pohištvom "
"je konfigurirala omaro s pravilnikom obračunavanja *Invoicing Policy* za "
"*Ordered quantities*. Trgovina zahteva 50-odstotno akontacijo za vse svoje "
"izdelke pohištva."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:104
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> New`, and :ref:`create a quotation "
"<sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>` for the cabinet. Once the order "
"is confirmed (via the :guilabel:`Confirm` button), the quotation turns into "
"a sales order. Create an invoice by clicking :guilabel:`Create Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"Pomaknite se na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Prodaja --> Novo` in "
":ref:`ustvarite ponudbo <sales/create-quotation>` za omarico. Ko je naročilo "
"potrjeno (z gumbom :guilabel:`Potrdi`), se ponudba spremeni v prodajni "
"nalog. Ustvarite račun s klikom na :guilabel:`Ustvari račun`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:109
msgid ""
"Cabinet with doors sales order that's been confirmed in the Odoo Sales "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Prodajni nalog za omaro z vrati, ki je bil potrjen v aplikaciji Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:112
msgid ""
"On the *Create invoice(s)* pop-up window that appears, "
"select :guilabel:`Down payment (percentage)`, and type `50` in "
"the :guilabel:`Down Payment` field."
msgstr ""
"V pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Ustvari račun(e)`, ki se prikaže, izberite "
":guilabel:`Predplačilo (odstotek)` in v polje :guilabel:`Predplačilo` "
"vnesite `50`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:116
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Income Account` attached to the :guilabel:`Down payment` can "
"be changed. For more information, check out the documentation "
"on :ref:`income account modification on down payments <sales/invoicing/"
"income-account-modification>`."
msgstr ""
"Polje :guilabel:`Konto prihodkov`, povezano s postavko "
":guilabel:`Predplačilo`, je mogoče spremeniti. Za več informacij si oglejte "
"dokumentacijo o :ref:`spremembi konta prihodkov pri predplačilih <sales/"
"invoicing/income-account-modification>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:120
msgid ""
"Lastly, click :guilabel:`Create Draft` to create and view the invoice draft, "
"which includes the down payment as a line item under the *Invoice Lines* "
"tab. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` and the invoice's status changes "
"from :guilabel:`Draft` to :guilabel:`Posted`. It also reveals a new set of "
"buttons at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Nazadnje kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari osnutek`, da ustvarite in si ogledate "
"osnutek računa, ki vključuje predplačilo kot postavko v zavihku *Vrstice "
"računa*. Kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi` in stanje računa se spremeni iz "
":guilabel:`Osnutek` v :guilabel:`Knjiženo`. S tem se na vrhu strani prikaže "
"tudi nov nabor gumbov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:125
msgid "A sample draft invoice with down payment mentioned in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Vzorčni osnutek računa z omenjenim avansnim plačilom v aplikaciji Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:128
msgid ""
"To begin the payment process, click :guilabel:`Pay`. A *Pay* pop-up form "
"displays with auto-populated information. Confirm the information provided "
"is correct and make any necessary adjustments. When ready, click "
"the :guilabel:`Create Payment` button."
msgstr ""
"Za začetek postopka plačila kliknite :guilabel:`Plačaj`. Prikaže se pojavno "
"okno :guilabel:`Plačaj` z samodejno izpolnjenimi informacijami. Potrdite, da "
"so navedene informacije pravilne, in po potrebi naredite prilagoditve. Ko "
"ste pripravljeni, kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Ustvari plačilo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:132
msgid "Showcase of the Pay pop-up window with create payment button."
msgstr "Prikaz pojavnega okna Plačaj z gumbom ustvari plačilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:135
msgid ""
"The customer invoice changes status with a green :guilabel:`In Payment` "
"or :guilabel:`Paid` banner in the upper-right corner, depending on how the "
"database is configured and if manual confirmation of payments is required."
msgstr ""
"Strankin račun spremeni status z zelenim napisom :guilabel:`V plačilu` "
"ali :guilabel:`Plačano` v zgornjem desnem kotu, odvisno od konfiguracije "
"baze podatkov in ali je potrebna ročna potrditev plačil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:139
msgid ""
"Customer Invoice with a green Paid banner located in the upper-right corner."
msgstr "Račun stranke z zelenim napisom Plačano v zgornjem desnem kotu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:142
msgid ""
"On the sales order, a new :guilabel:`Down Payments` section is present in "
"the *Order Lines* tab, along with the down payment that was just invoiced "
"and posted. When the customer wants to pay the remaining amount of the "
"order, another invoice must be created."
msgstr ""
"Na prodajnem nalogu je v zavihku :guilabel:`Vrstice naročila` prisoten nov "
"razdelek :guilabel:`Akontacije` skupaj z akontacijo, ki je bila pravkar "
"fakturirana in knjižena. Ko želi stranka plačati preostali znesek naročila, "
"je treba ustvariti nov račun."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:146
msgid "The down payments section in the order lines tab of a sales order."
msgstr "Razdelek avansnih plačil v zavihku vrstic naročila prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:149
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Create Invoice` button. On the *Create invoice(s)* pop-"
"up window, there is a new field: :guilabel:`Already invoiced`."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Ustvari račun`. V pojavnem oknu *Ustvari račun(e)* "
"je novo polje: :guilabel:`Že zaračunano`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:152
msgid ""
"The deduct down payment option on the Create invoice(s) pop up in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Možnost odbitka akontacije v pojavnem oknu Ustvari račun(e) v Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:155
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Regular invoice` option to begin creating an invoice "
"for the exact amount needed to complete the total payment. This amount is "
"reflected in the :guilabel:`Amount Due` field on the invoice draft."
msgstr ""
"Izberite možnost :guilabel:`Navadni račun` za začetek ustvarjanja računa za "
"točen znesek, potreben za celotno plačilo. Ta znesek je prikazan v polju "
":guilabel:`Znesek za plačilo` na osnutku računa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:159
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Create Draft` to create a *Customer Invoice Draft*. To "
"complete the flow, click :guilabel:`Confirm` to change the status of the "
"invoice from :guilabel:`Draft` to :guilabel:`Posted`. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Pay`. The *Pay* form appears, with all fields auto-"
"populated with the necessary information, including the remaining amount "
"left to be paid on the order."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari osnutek`, da ustvarite *Osnutek računa za "
"stranko*. Za dokončanje postopka kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da spremenite "
"stanje računa iz :guilabel:`Osnutek` v :guilabel:`Knjiženo`. Nato kliknite "
":guilabel:`Plačaj`. Prikaže se obrazec *Plačaj*, v katerem so vsa polja "
"samodejno izpolnjena s potrebnimi podatki, vključno s preostalim zneskom "
"naročila za plačilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:165
msgid "The second Pay pop-up form in Odoo sales."
msgstr "Drugi pojavni obrazec Plačaj v Odoo sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:168
msgid ""
"After confirming that information, click :guilabel:`Create Payment`. Doing "
"so reveals the final :guilabel:`Customer Invoice` with a green :guilabel:`In "
"Payment` or :guilabel:`Paid` banner in the upper-right corner, depending on "
"how the database is configured and if manual confirmation of payments is "
"required. At this point, the flow is complete."
msgstr ""
"Po potrditvi teh podatkov kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari plačilo`. Nato se "
"prikaže končni :guilabel:`Račun za stranko` z zeleno pasico :guilabel:`V "
"plačilu` ali :guilabel:`Plačano` v zgornjem desnem kotu, odvisno od "
"konfiguracije zbirke podatkov in tega, ali je zahtevana ročna potrditev "
"plačil. Na tej točki je postopek zaključen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:174
msgid ""
"If a down payment is used with a product that has a :guilabel:`Delivered "
"quantities` invoicing policy, and the cost of the product exceeds the 50% "
"down payment, a regular invoice is created. However, for products that cost "
"less than the 50% down payment, the down payments cannot be deducted when it "
"comes time to invoice the customer."
msgstr ""
"Če se predplačilo uporabi pri izdelku s politiko izdajanja računov "
":guilabel:`Dobavljene količine` in cena izdelka presega 50-% predplačilo, se "
"ustvari navadni račun. Pri izdelkih, ki stanejo manj kot 50-% predplačilo, "
"pa predplačil ni mogoče odšteti, ko pride čas za izdajo računa stranki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:179
msgid ""
"This is because the products would have to be delivered *before* creating "
"the final invoice due to Odoo not allowing negative totals for invoices. If "
"nothing has been delivered, a :guilabel:`Credit Note` is created, which "
"cancels the draft invoice that was created after the down payment."
msgstr ""
"To je zato, ker bi morali biti izdelki dobavljeni *pred* ustvarjenjem "
"končnega računa, saj Odoo ne dovoljuje negativnih vsot za račune. Če nič ni "
"bilo dobavljeno, se ustvari :guilabel:`Dobropis`, ki prekliče osnutek "
"računa, ustvarjen po predplačilu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:184
msgid ""
"To utilize the :guilabel:`Credit Note` option, the **Inventory** application "
"must be installed in order to confirm the delivery. Otherwise, the delivered "
"quantity can be entered manually directly on the sales order."
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo možnosti :guilabel:`Dobropis` mora biti aplikacija **Zaloga** "
"nameščena, da se lahko potrdi dostava. V nasprotnem primeru je mogoče "
"dobavljeno količino vnesti ročno neposredno na prodajnem nalogu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:191
msgid "Example 2: 100% down payment"
msgstr "Primer 2: 100% avansno plačilo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:193
msgid ""
"A solar panel company sells an installation service for residential homes. "
"All installation services require a 100% down payment to cover labor costs. "
"The company prefers down payments as customers often require customization "
"add-ons for the service."
msgstr ""
"Podjetje za sončne celice prodaja inštalacijske storitve za stanovanjske "
"hiše. Vse inštalacijske storitve zahtevajo 100% avansno plačilo za kritje "
"stroškov dela. Podjetje daje prednost avanskim plačilom, ker stranke pogosto "
"zahtevajo prilagoditvene dodatke za storitev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:197
msgid ""
"To configure a 100% down payment, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"New`, and :ref:`create a quotation <sales/create_quotations/create-"
"quotation>` for the product. Upon clicking the :guilabel:`Confirm` button, "
"the quotation turns into a sales order. At that point, an invoice can now be "
"created by clicking :guilabel:`Create Invoice` in the top-left corner. On "
"the *Create invoice(s)* pop-up window that appears, select :guilabel:`Down "
"payment (percentage)`, and type `100` in the :guilabel:`Down Payment` field."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo 100% akontacije se pomaknite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"prodaja --> Novo` in :ref:`ustvarite ponudbo <sales/create-quotation>` za "
"izdelek. Ko kliknete gumb :guilabel:`Potrdi`, se ponudba spremeni v prodajni "
"nalog. Nato lahko ustvarite račun s klikom na :guilabel:`Ustvari račun` v "
"zgornjem levem kotu. V pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Ustvari račun(e)`, ki se "
"prikaže, izberite :guilabel:`Akontacija (odstotek)` in v polje "
":guilabel:`Akontacija` vnesite `100`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:204
msgid ""
"The Down payment (percentage) option selected with 100% set as the Down "
"Payment."
msgstr ""
"Izbrana možnost Avansno plačilo (odstotek) s 100 % nastavljenim kot avansno "
"plačilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:207
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Create Draft` to create an invoice draft. This also "
"brings the draft invoice into view, which includes the :guilabel:`Down "
"payment` as a line item under the *Invoice Lines* tab. The invoice can now "
"be confirmed and posted by clicking :guilabel:`Confirm`. Confirming the "
"invoice changes the status from :guilabel:`Draft` to :guilabel:`Posted`. It "
"also reveals a new series of buttons at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari osnutek`, da ustvarite osnutek računa. "
"Prikaže se osnutek računa, ki v zavihku *Postavke računa* vključuje "
":guilabel:`Predplačilo` kot postavko. Račun lahko zdaj potrdite in knjižite "
"s klikom na :guilabel:`Potrdi`. Potrditev računa spremeni stanje iz "
":guilabel:`Osnutek` v :guilabel:`Knjiženo`. Na vrhu strani se prikažejo tudi "
"novi gumbi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:213
msgid ""
"The payment can be registered by clicking the :guilabel:`Pay` button. This "
"brings up the *Pay* pop-up form, which is auto-populated with the necessary "
"information. When ready, click the :guilabel:`Create Payment` button."
msgstr ""
"Plačilo lahko registrirate s klikom na gumb :guilabel:`Plačaj`. To odpre "
"obrazec :guilabel:`Plačaj`, ki je samodejno izpolnjen s potrebnimi "
"informacijami. Ko ste pripravljeni, kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Ustvari "
"plačilo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:217
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Create Payment`, Odoo reveals the customer "
"invoice, now with a green :guilabel:`In Payment` or :guilabel:`Paid` banner "
"in the upper-right corner, depending on how the database is configured and "
"if manual confirmation of payments is required. The process is now complete, "
"and the 100% down payment has been successfully applied."
msgstr ""
"Ko kliknete :guilabel:`Ustvari plačilo`, Odoo prikaže račun stranke, zdaj z "
"zelenim pasico :guilabel:`V plačilu` ali :guilabel:`Plačano` v zgornjem "
"desnem kotu, odvisno od konfiguracije podatkovne baze in ali je potrebna "
"ročna potrditev plačil. Postopek je zdaj končan in 100 % predplačilo je bilo "
"uspešno uporabljeno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:225
msgid "Income account modification on draft down payments"
msgstr "Sprememba prihodkovnega konta pri osnutkih predplačil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:228
msgid ""
"To change or adjust the income account attached to down payments, the "
"**Accounting** app must be installed. With the **Accounting** app installed, "
"the :guilabel:`Account` column becomes available on the draft invoice. "
"Please note, the income account on posted down payments **cannot** be "
"modified."
msgstr ""
"Za spremembo ali prilagoditev prihodkovnega konta, vezanega na predplačila, "
"mora biti nameščena aplikacija **Računovodstvo**. Z nameščeno aplikacijo "
"**Računovodstvo** postane na osnutku računa na voljo stolpec "
":guilabel:`Konto`. Upoštevajte, da prihodkovnega konta na knjiženih "
"predplačilih **ni mogoče** spreminjati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:233
msgid ""
"Navigate to the invoice to be modified by going to :menuselection:`Sales app "
"--> Orders --> Orders`. Open an order, then click the :guilabel:`Invoices` "
"smart button. Open an invoice, click the drop-down arrow on the entry in "
"the :guilabel:`Account` column and click :guilabel:`Search more...` to bring "
"up the *Search: Account* form. In this form, a different account can be "
"chosen from the list of pre-existing accounts. A new account can also be "
"created by clicking the :guilabel:`New` button."
msgstr ""
"Do računa, ki ga želite spremeniti, pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Prodaja --> Nalogi --> Nalogi`. Odprite nalog, nato kliknite pametni gumb "
":guilabel:`Računi`. Odprite račun, kliknite spuščno pustičico pri vnosa v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Račun` in kliknite :guilabel:`Poišči več...`, da odprete "
"obrazec :guilabel:`Iskanje: Račun`. V tem obrazcu lahko izberete drug račun "
"s seznama obstoјеčih računov. Nov račun lahko ustvarite tudi s klikom na "
"gumb :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:240
msgid ""
"The Search:Account form with existing accounts displayed and a button to "
"create a new\n"
"account."
msgstr ""
"Obrazec Iskanje: Račun s prikazanimi obstoječimi računi in gumbom za "
"ustvarjanje novega\n"
"računa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:245
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:119
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:71
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:173
msgid ":doc:`invoicing_policy`"
msgstr ":doc:`invoicing_policy`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:246
msgid ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Covers the two invoicing policies available for a product, Ordered "
"quantities and Delivered quantities, how to configure them, and the sales "
"order workflow each one follows."
msgstr ""
"Zajema obe politiki izdajanja računov, ki sta na voljo za izdelek (Naročene "
"količine in Dostavljene količine), kako ju konfigurirati ter potek "
"prodajnega naloga za vsako od njiju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:8
msgid "Invoicing policies"
msgstr "Pravilniki za fakturiranje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:10
msgid ""
"Depending on business needs, it may be advantageous to choose whether to "
"invoice customers based on the goods and services that they order or when "
"those goods and services are delivered to them. To allow businesses maximum "
"flexibility to best meet their needs, Odoo offers two invoicing policies "
"that can be enabled in the **Sales** app: :ref:`Invoice what is ordered "
"<sales/invoicing_policy/invoice-on-order>` and :ref:`Invoice what is "
"delivered <sales/invoicing_policy/invoice-on-delivery>`."
msgstr ""
"Glede na poslovne potrebe je lahko koristno izbrati, ali fakturirati stranke "
"na podlagi blaga in storitev, ki jih naročijo, ali ko so jim to blago in "
"storitve dostavljene. Da bi podjetjem omogočili največjo prilagodljivost za "
"najboljše izpolnjevanje njihovih potreb, Odoo ponuja dva pravilnika za "
"fakturiranje, ki ju je mogoče omogočiti v aplikaciji **Prodaja**: "
":ref:`Fakturiraj, kar je naročeno <invoice-on-order>` in :ref:`Fakturiraj, "
"kar je dostavljeno <invoice-on-delivery>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:20
msgid "Configure an invoicing policy"
msgstr "Konfiguriranje politike izdajanja računov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:22
msgid ""
"To configure an invoicing policy, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll to the *Invoicing* section. Select one "
"of the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` options, either :guilabel:`Ordered "
"quantities` or :guilabel:`Delivered quantities`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite konfigurirati politiko izdajanja računov, pojdite na "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija Prodaja --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve` in se "
"pomaknite do razdelka *Izdaja računov*. Izberite eno od možnosti za "
":guilabel:`Politika izdajanja računov`: bodisi :guilabel:`Naročene količine` "
"bodisi :guilabel:`Dobavljene količine`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:26
msgid ""
"Activating an invoicing policy option automatically applies the chosen "
"option to all newly created products. Existing products **must** have their "
"invoicing policy manually updated on their product forms."
msgstr ""
"Aktiviranje možnosti pravilnika za fakturiranje samodejno uporabi izbrano "
"možnost za vse na novo ustvarjene izdelke. Obstoječi izdelki **morajo** "
"imeti svoj pravilnik za fakturiranje ročno posodobljen na njihovih obrazcih "
"izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:30
msgid "Choosing an invoicing policy in the Sales app."
msgstr "Izbira pravilnika za fakturiranje v aplikaciji Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:34
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Delivered quantities` option is chosen, it is **not** "
"possible to activate the :guilabel:`Automatic Invoicing` :icon:`fa-building-"
"o` feature, which automatically generates invoices when an online payment is "
"confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Če je izbrana možnost :guilabel:`Dobavljene količine`, **ni** mogoče "
"aktivirati funkcije :guilabel:`Samodejno izdajanje računov` :icon:`fa-"
"building-o`, ki samodejno ustvari račune ob potrditvi spletnega plačila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:38
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Automatic Invoicing` :icon:`fa-building-o` feature is "
"enabled in a multi-company database, it applies on a per-company basis and "
"must be enabled for each company using automatic invoicing."
msgstr ""
"Če je funkcija :guilabel:`Samodejno izdajanje računov` :icon:`fa-building-o` "
"omogočena v zbirki podatkov z več podjetji, velja za posamezno podjetje in "
"jo je treba omogočiti za vsako podjetje, ki uporablja samodejno izdajanje "
"računov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:43
msgid "Change the invoicing policy for existing products"
msgstr "Spreminjanje politike izdajanja računov za obstoječe izdelke"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:45
msgid ""
"Even after the invoicing policy :ref:`has been configured <sales/"
"invoicing_policy/configure-invoicing-policy>` in the **Sales** app's "
"configuration settings, the invoicing policy may still be changed on a "
"product-by-product basis. Open a product form by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Products` and click on the "
"product to be updated. In the *General Information* tab, select "
"an :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Tudi po tem, ko je bila politika izdajanja računov :ref:`konfigurirana "
"<sales/invoicing_policy/configure-invoicing-policy>` v konfiguracijskih "
"nastavitvah aplikacije **Prodaja**, jo je še vedno mogoče spremeniti za vsak "
"izdelek posebej. Odprite obrazec izdelka tako, da se pomaknete na "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija Prodaja --> Izdelki --> Izdelki` in kliknete "
"izdelek, ki ga želite posodobiti. Na zavihku *Splošne informacije* v "
"spustnem meniju izberite :guilabel:`Politika izdajanja računov`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:52
msgid "How to change invoicing policy on a product form in the Sales app."
msgstr ""
"Kako spremeniti pravilnik za fakturiranje na obrazcu izdelka v aplikaciji "
"**Prodaja**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:58
msgid "Invoice what is ordered"
msgstr "Obračunaj kar je naročeno"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:60
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Ordered quantities` option is selected in the **Sales** "
"app settings, customers are invoiced once a quotation has been confirmed. "
"The creation of a quotation in turn leads to the creation and confirmation "
"of a sales order. An invoice can then be created as soon as the sales order "
"is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Če je v nastavitvah aplikacije **Prodaja** izbrana možnost "
":guilabel:`Naročene količine`, se strankam račun izda takoj po potrditvi "
"ponudbe. Ustvarjanje ponudbe privede do ustvarjanja in potrditve prodajnega "
"naloga. Račun je nato mogoče ustvariti takoj, ko je prodajni nalog potrjen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:65
msgid "This invoicing policy has no impact on the basic Odoo sales flow."
msgstr ""
"Ta pravila izstavitve računov nimajo vpliva na osnovni potek prodaje v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:68
msgid "Invoice ordered quantity workflow"
msgstr "Potek dela pri zaračunavanju naročene količine"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:70
msgid ""
"Confirm that the product's invoicing policy is set to :guilabel:`Ordered "
"quantities` in the product form. :ref:`Create a quotation and sales order "
"<sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>` as normal. After the sales order "
"has been confirmed, create an invoice by clicking the :guilabel:`Create "
"Invoice` button on the sales order form. Choose the type of invoice to be "
"sent, click :guilabel:`Create Draft Invoice`, confirm the invoice when "
"ready, and proceed with the payment flow as normal."
msgstr ""
"Potrdite, da so pravila izstavitve računov za izdelek nastavljena na "
":guilabel:`Naročene količine` v obrazcu izdelka. :ref:`Ustvarite ponudbo in "
"prodajni nalog <sales/create-quotation>` kot običajno. Ko je prodajni nalog "
"potrjen, ustvarite račun s klikom na gumb :guilabel:`Ustvari račun` v "
"obrazcu prodajnega naloga. Izberite vrsto računa, ki ga želite poslati, "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari osnutek računa`, potrdite račun, ko je "
"pripravljen, in nadaljujte s postopkom plačila kot običajno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:78
msgid ""
"An independent artisan with a small business sells handmade jewelry "
"nationwide online. Because they have direct control over their inventory "
"levels and ship with 3rd-party carriers, they invoice their customers after "
"a sales order has been confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Samostojni obrtnik z majhnim podjetjem prodaja ročno izdelan nakit po vsej "
"državi prek spleta. Ker ima neposreden nadzor nad ravnmi svojih zalog in "
"pošilja prek zunanjih prevoznikov, strankam račun izda po potrditvi "
"prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:82
msgid ""
"They receive an order for a necklace. They send their customer a quotation, "
"confirm it, and create a sales order. After the sales order is confirmed, an "
"invoice is created and sent to the customer for payment without any "
"additional steps needed. The invoice gets paid, the necklace is shipped and "
"delivered, and the transaction is complete."
msgstr ""
"Prejme naročilo za ogrlico. Stranki pošlje ponudbo, jo potrdi in ustvari "
"prodajni nalog. Po potrditvi prodajnega naloga se račun ustvari in pošlje "
"stranki v plačilo brez dodatnih potrebnih korakov. Račun je plačan, ogrlica "
"je poslana in dostavljena ter transakcija je zaključena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:90
msgid "Invoice what is delivered"
msgstr "Obračunaj kar je dobavljeno"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:92
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Delivered quantities` option invoices customers as the "
"ordered goods are delivered. This option is often used for businesses that "
"sell large quantities of physical goods in each sales order, but may not "
"always be able to fulfill a given order all at once."
msgstr ""
"Možnost :guilabel:`Dobavljene količine` strankam izda račun ob dobavi "
"naročenega blaga. Ta možnost se pogosto uporablja v podjetjih, ki z vsakim "
"prodajnim nalogom prodajajo velike količine fizičnega blaga, vendar naročila "
"morda ne morejo vedno izpolniti v celoti naenkrat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:96
msgid ""
"In these cases, the ordered quantity may differ from the delivered quantity "
"based on product availability. Once a quotation is confirmed, and the status "
"changes from :guilabel:`Quotation sent` to :guilabel:`Sales order`, Odoo "
"automatically adds both the delivered and invoiced quantities to the invoice "
"and sales order. Both partial and complete deliveries are "
"tracked. :ref:`Backorders <inventory/multipack/backorders>` can be created "
"for partial orders that will be completed at a later time."
msgstr ""
"V teh primerih se lahko naročena količina razlikuje od dostavljene količine "
"glede na razpoložljivost izdelka. Ko je ponudba potrjena in se stanje "
"spremeni iz :guilabel:`Poslana ponudba` v :guilabel:`Prodajni nalog`, Odoo "
"samodejno doda tako dostavljene kot zaračunane količine na račun in prodajni "
"nalog. Spremljajo se tako delne kot popolne dobave. :ref:`Zaostala naročila "
"<inventory/multipack/backorders>` je mogoče ustvariti za delna naročila, ki "
"bodo dokončana pozneje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:103
msgid ""
"This invoicing policy has a minor impact on the sales flow because the "
"delivered quantity of a product needs to be manually entered on the sales "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Ta pravila izstavitve računov imajo manjši vpliv na potek prodaje, ker je "
"treba dostavljeno količino izdelka ročno vnesti v prodajni nalog."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:106
msgid "How to see delivered and invoiced quantities on Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Kako si ogledati dostavljene in zaračunane količine v Odoo Prodaji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:110
msgid ""
"If a greater quantity of a product or service is being delivered than what "
"has been invoiced, the overage appears in red, and the option to invoice any "
"overages is enabled by default."
msgstr ""
"Če se dobavi večja količina izdelka ali storitve od zaračunane, se presežek "
"prikaže rdeče, možnost zaračunavanja presežkov pa je privzeto omogočena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:117
msgid "Invoice delivered quantity workflow"
msgstr "Potek dela pri zaračunavanju dostavljene količine"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:119
msgid ""
"Confirm that the product's invoicing policy is set to :guilabel:`Delivered "
"quantities` in the product form. :ref:`Create a quotation and sales order "
"<sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>` as normal. After the sales order "
"is confirmed, the product must be delivered before an invoice can be created."
msgstr ""
"Preverite, ali je politika izdajanja računov za izdelek na obrazcu izdelka "
"nastavljena na :guilabel:`Dobavljene količine`. :ref:`Ustvarite ponudbo in "
"prodajni nalog <sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>` kot običajno. Po "
"potrditvi prodajnega naloga mora biti izdelek dobavljen, preden je mogoče "
"ustvariti račun."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:124
msgid ""
"Once the product has been shipped and delivery has been confirmed, click "
"the :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button on the sales order "
"screen and click :guilabel:`Validate` to validate the delivery order. Once "
"at least a partial delivery has been confirmed, return to the sales order "
"form. The :guilabel:`Create Invoice` button is now purple to indicate that "
"an invoice can be created and confirmed, and that it is possible to proceed "
"with the payment flow as normal."
msgstr ""
"Ko je izdelek odposlan in je dostava potrjena, kliknite pametni gumb "
":icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Dostava` na zaslonu prodajnega naloga in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da potrdite dobavnico. Ko je potrjena vsaj "
"delna dobava, se vrnite na obrazec prodajnega naloga. Gumb "
":guilabel:`Ustvari račun` se zdaj obarva vijolično, kar označuje, da je "
"račun mogoče ustvariti in potrditi ter da lahko nadaljujete s postopkom "
"plačila kot običajno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:131
msgid ""
"If a user attempts to create an invoice without validating the delivered "
"quantity, the system returns an error message alerting them to the issue."
msgstr ""
"Če uporabnik poskuša ustvariti račun brez potrjevanja dostavljene količine, "
"sistem vrne sporočilo o napaki, ki ga opozori na težavo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:135
msgid ""
"A produce distributor using the :guilabel:`Delivered quantities` invoicing "
"policy sells 50 heads of lettuce to a local restaurant."
msgstr ""
"Distributer pridelkov, ki uporablja politiko izdajanja računov "
":guilabel:`Dobavljene količine`, proda lokalni restavraciji 50 glav solate."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:138
msgid ""
"At the time of delivery, only 40 heads are available. The distributor "
"delivers the available heads of lettuce and creates an invoice for the "
"quantity delivered. Later, when the lettuce inventory is replenished, the "
"distributor delivers the remaining 10 heads of lettuce and creates a second "
"invoice to complete the order."
msgstr ""
"Ob dostavi je na voljo le 40 glav. Distributer dostavi razpoložljive glave "
"solate in ustvari račun za dobavljeno količino. Pozneje, ko je zaloga solate "
"dopolnjena, distributer dostavi preostalih 10 glav solate in ustvari drugi "
"račun za dokončanje naročila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:144
msgid ":doc:`../sales_quotations/create_quotations`"
msgstr ":doc:`../sales_quotations/create_quotations`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:145
msgid ":doc:`down_payment`"
msgstr ":doc:`down_payment`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy.rst:147
msgid ""
":doc:`../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/multipack`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/multipack`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Describes the cross-app workflow for invoicing project milestones, from "
"configuring a milestone-based service product to defining milestones and "
"invoicing a completed milestone."
msgstr ""
"Opisuje potek dela med aplikacijami za izdajanje računov za projektne "
"mejnike, od konfiguriranja storitvenega izdelka na podlagi mejnikov do "
"določanja mejnikov in izdaje računa za dokončan mejnik."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:8
msgid "Invoice project milestones"
msgstr "Obračunavanje mejnikov projekta"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:13
msgid ""
"Milestone-based invoicing is designed for companies that deliver work in "
"clearly defined phases. Instead of invoicing an entire service upfront or at "
"the very end, businesses can bill customers progressively as each stage of "
"work is completed. This approach provides customers clearer visibility into "
"progress and value delivered over time."
msgstr ""
"Obračunavanje na podlagi mejnikov je zasnovano za podjetja, ki delo izvajajo "
"v jasno opredeljenih fazah. Namesto da bi obračunali celotno storitev "
"vnaprej ali na samem koncu, lahko podjetja strankam obračunavajo postopoma, "
"ko je vsaka faza dela zaključena. Ta pristop strankam zagotavlja boljši "
"vpogled v napredek in vrednost, dostavljeno skozi čas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:18
msgid ""
"In Odoo, milestone invoicing is configured at the product level in the "
"**Sales** app, with milestone progress and completion managed in the "
"**Projects** app. When a milestone is marked as reached, the delivered "
"quantity on the sales order (SO) is updated and can be invoiced."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo je obračunavanje mejnikov konfigurirano na ravni izdelka v aplikaciji "
"**Prodaja**, napredek in dokončanje mejnikov pa se upravlja v aplikaciji "
"**Projekti**. Ko je mejnik označen kot dosežen, se dostavljeno količino na "
"prodajnem nalogu posodobi in jo je mogoče obračunati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:23
msgid "How milestone invoicing works"
msgstr "Kako deluje obračunavanje mejnikov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:25
msgid ""
"Milestone invoicing follows a clear workflow involving multiple applications "
"in Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"Obračunavanje mejnikov sledi jasnemu poteku dela, ki vključuje več aplikacij "
"v Odoo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:27
msgid ""
"A product is created in the **Sales** application, configured to be invoiced "
"based on milestones."
msgstr ""
"Izdelek se ustvari v aplikaciji **Prodaja** in se konfigurira, da se "
"obračunava na podlagi mejnikov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:28
msgid "A |SO| is created with the product."
msgstr "|SO| se ustvari z izdelkom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:29
msgid ""
"A project in the **Projects** app is created with multiple milestones "
"included."
msgstr ""
"V aplikaciji **Projekti** je ustvarjen projekt z več vključenimi mejniki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:30
msgid ""
"A milestone is reached, and marked complete, causing the *Delivered* "
"quantity on the |SO| line to update."
msgstr ""
"Mejnik je dosežen in označen kot dokončan, kar povzroči posodobitev količine "
"*Dostavljeno* v vrstici |SO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:32
msgid ""
"An invoice is created for the completed milestone, which can be sent to the "
"customer."
msgstr ""
"Za dokončani mejnik je ustvarjen račun, ki ga je mogoče poslati stranki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:35
msgid ""
"This document covers the **Sales** app configuration and invoicing flow for "
"invoicing based on project milestones. For more information on creating, "
"managing, and marking milestones as complete, and how to link them to tasks, "
"see :doc:`Project milestones <../../../services/project/project_management/"
"project_milestones>`."
msgstr ""
"Ta dokument zajema konfiguracijo aplikacije **Prodaja** in postopek "
"izdajanja računov za obračunavanje na podlagi projektnih mejnikov. Za več "
"informacij o ustvarjanju, upravljanju in označevanju mejnikov kot dokončanih "
"ter o tem, kako jih povezati z opravili, glejte :doc:`Projektni mejniki "
"<../../../services/project/project_management/project_milestones>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:41
msgid "Create milestone products"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje izdelkov mejnikov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:43
msgid ""
"To begin, a service product must be configured specifically for milestone-"
"based invoicing. Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> "
"Products` and click :guilabel:`New`. Enter the necessary information, "
"including the product title and :guilabel:`Sales Price`."
msgstr ""
"Najprej je treba konfigurirati storitveni izdelek posebej za obračunavanje "
"na podlagi mejnikov. Pojdite na :menuselection:`aplikacija Prodaja --> "
"Izdelki --> Izdelki` in kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`. Vnesite potrebne "
"informacije, vključno z nazivom izdelka in :guilabel:`Prodajno ceno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:47
msgid ""
"For the :guilabel:`Product Type`, select :guilabel:`Service`. Doing so "
"reveals the :guilabel:`Create on Order` field. Select "
"either :guilabel:`Project`, :guilabel:`Project and Task`, "
"or :guilabel:`Task`, depending on how the product is to be tracked in the "
"**Project** app."
msgstr ""
"Za :guilabel:`Vrsto izdelka` izberite :guilabel:`Storitev`. S tem se "
"razkrije polje :guilabel:`Ustvari ob naročilu`. "
"Izberite :guilabel:`Projekt`, :guilabel:`Projekt in opravilo` "
"ali :guilabel:`Opravilo`, odvisno od tega, kako naj bo izdelek sledjen v "
"aplikaciji **Projekti**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:52
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Project Template` can also be selected for the product. "
"See :doc:`Project templates <../../../services/project/project_management/"
"project_templates>` for more information. Project templates can have "
"milestones defined, however, the *Quantity (%)* field must be manually "
"updated on each newly created project."
msgstr ""
"Za izdelek je mogoče izbrati tudi :guilabel:`Predlogo projekta`. Za več "
"informacij glejte :doc:`Predloge projektov <../../../services/project/"
"project_management/project_templates>`. Predloge projektov lahko imajo "
"definirane mejnike, vendar je treba polje *Količina (%)* pri vsakem novo "
"ustvarjenem projektu ročno posodobiti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:57
msgid ""
"For the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy`, select :guilabel:`Based on "
"Milestones`. This option ensures that the product's delivered quantities "
"update automatically once a milestone is completed."
msgstr ""
"Za :guilabel:`Pravila obračunavanja` izberite :guilabel:`Na podlagi "
"mejnikov`. Ta možnost zagotavlja, da se dostavljene količine izdelka "
"samodejno posodobijo, ko je mejnik dokončan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:61
msgid ""
"*Based on Milestones* is only available if there is at least one project "
"with *Milestones* enabled."
msgstr ""
"*Na podlagi mejnikov* je na voljo samo, če obstaja vsaj en projekt z "
"omogočenimi *Mejniki*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:65
msgid "Defining milestones"
msgstr "Določanje mejnikov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:68
msgid ""
"This document focuses on the process of selling and invoicing a milestone "
"product in the **Sales** app. For more information on creating milestones in "
"the **Project** app, see :doc:`Project milestones <../../../services/project/"
"project_management/project_milestones>`."
msgstr ""
"Ta dokument se osredotoča na postopek prodaje in obračunavanja izdelka z "
"mejniki v aplikaciji **Prodaja**. Za več informacij o ustvarjanju mejnikov v "
"aplikaciji **Projekti** glejte :doc:`Projektni mejniki <../../../services/"
"project/project_management/project_milestones>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:72
msgid ""
"After the milestone product has been sold, a  *Milestones* smart button is "
"added to the |SO|. Click the smart button to view, edit, or create new "
"milestones."
msgstr ""
"Ko je izdelek z mejniki prodan, se gumbu |SO| doda pametni gumb *Mejniki*. "
"Kliknite pametni gumb za ogled, urejanje ali ustvarjanje novih mejnikov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:75
msgid ""
"From here, the :guilabel:`Delivered %` can be altered. This amount equates "
"to the total cost of the |SO| that is billed when the milestone is reached."
msgstr ""
"Od tukaj lahko spremenite :guilabel:`Dostavljeno %`. Ta znesek ustreza "
"skupnim stroškom |SO|, ki se obračunajo, ko je mejnik dosežen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:79
msgid ""
"A company that provides pool installation services bills based on predefined "
"milestones as the work is completed. Each milestone equates to 25% of the "
"total services:"
msgstr ""
"Podjetje, ki zagotavlja storitve postavitve bazena, obračunava na podlagi "
"vnaprej določenih mejnikov, ko je delo dokončano. Vsak mejnik ustreza 25 % "
"celotnih storitev:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:82
msgid "Site Preparation & Excavation"
msgstr "Priprava terena in izkop"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:83
msgid "Structural Installation"
msgstr "Strukturna postavitev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:84
msgid "Plumbing & Equipment Installation"
msgstr "Postavitev vodovoda in opreme"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:85
msgid "Finishing & Final Inspection"
msgstr "Zaključna dela in končni pregled"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:87
msgid "The milestones for a sales order line."
msgstr "Mejniki za vrstico prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:90
msgid ""
"The team uses a project template, called *Pool installation*, with these "
"milestones defined. A new project is created whenever a |SO| with the *Pool "
"installation services* product is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Ekipa uporablja predlogo projekta z imenom *Postavitev bazena*, ki ima te "
"mejnike definirane. Nov projekt se ustvari vsakič, ko je potrjen |SO| z "
"izdelkom *Storitve postavitve bazena*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:95
msgid "Invoicing a completed milestone"
msgstr "Fakturiranje zaključenega mejnika"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:97
msgid ""
"Milestones can be tracked through the **Project** app (see :ref:`Using "
"milestones <project/project_milestones/using-milestones>`). Additionally, a "
"milestone can be marked complete by navigating to the |SO|, and clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Milestones` smart button. On the *Milestones* page, enable "
"the checkbox in the :guilabel:`Reached` column for the milestone."
msgstr ""
"Mejnike je mogoče spremljati prek aplikacije **Projekt** (glejte "
":ref:`Uporaba mejnikov <project/project_milestones/using-milestones>`). "
"Poleg tega lahko mejnik označite kot dokončan tako, da odprete |SO| in "
"kliknete pametni gumb :guilabel:`Mejniki`. Na strani *Mejniki* označite "
"potrditveno polje v stolpcu :guilabel:`Doseženo` za mejnik."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:102
msgid ""
"Then, click :guilabel:`View Sales Order` or use the breadcrumbs to return to "
"the |SO|. The :guilabel:`Delivered` column will be updated to reflect the "
"*Delivered %* for the milestone reached."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Pogled prodajnega naloga` ali uporabite drobtine za "
"vrnitev na |SO|. Stolpec :guilabel:`Dostavljeno` se bo posodobil in prikazal "
"*Dostavljeno %* za doseženi mejnik."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:105
msgid ""
"These steps can be repeated as additional milestones are reached until the |"
"SO| has been fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"Te korake je mogoče ponoviti, ko so doseženi dodatni mejniki, dokler ni |SO| "
"izpolnjen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:108
msgid ""
"Reaching a milestone does *not* automatically create an invoice. Instead, it "
"updates the |SO| to reflect the amount of the total that is ready for "
"invoicing."
msgstr ""
"Doseganje mejnika *ne* ustvari računa samodejno. Namesto tega posodobi |SO|, "
"da odraža znesek celote, ki je pripravljen za fakturiranje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:111
msgid ""
"Once one or more milestones have been reached, navigate to the |SO|, and "
"confirm the :guilabel:`Delivered` column has updated correctly. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Create Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"Ko je dosežen en ali več mejnikov, se pomaknite na |SO| in potrdite, da se "
"je stolpec :guilabel:`Dostavljeno` pravilno posodobil. Nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari račun`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:114
msgid ""
"Additional milestones can be invoiced as they are completed, until all "
"services are complete."
msgstr ""
"Dodatni mejniki se lahko fakturirajo, ko so zaključeni, dokler niso vse "
"storitve zaključene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:117
msgid ":doc:`time_materials`"
msgstr ":doc:`time_materials`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone.rst:118
msgid ":doc:`proforma`"
msgstr ":doc:`proforma`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:3
msgid "Pro-forma invoices"
msgstr "Predračuni"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:5
msgid ""
"A *pro-forma invoice* is an abridged or estimated invoice sent in advance of "
"a delivery of goods. It notes the kind and quantity of goods, their value, "
"and other important information, such as weight and transportation charges."
msgstr ""
"*Predračun* je skrajšan ali ocenjen račun, poslan pred dobavo blaga. Navaja "
"vrsto in količino blaga, njegovo vrednost in druge pomembne informacije, kot "
"so teža in stroški prevoza."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:9
msgid ""
"Pro-forma invoices are commonly used as preliminary invoices with a "
"quotation. They are also used during importation for customs purposes. They "
"differ from a normal invoice, in that they are *not* a demand (or request) "
"for payment."
msgstr ""
"Predračuni se običajno uporabljajo kot predhodni računi s ponudbo. "
"Uporabljajo se tudi pri uvozu za carinske namene. Razlikujejo se od "
"običajnega računa v tem, da *niso* zahteva (ali prošnja) za plačilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:16
msgid ""
"In order to utilize pro-forma invoices, the *Pro-Forma Invoice* feature "
"**must** be activated."
msgstr "Za uporabo predračunov **mora** biti aktivirana funkcija *Predračun*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:18
msgid ""
"To enable this feature, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, and in the :guilabel:`Quotations \\& Orders` "
"section, click the checkbox next to :guilabel:`Pro-Forma Invoice`. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Save` to save all changes."
msgstr ""
"Za omogočitev te funkcije pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Sales --> "
"Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve` in v razdelku :guilabel:`Ponudbe in naročila` "
"kliknite potrditveno polje poleg :guilabel:`Predračun`. Nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`, da shranite vse spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:22
msgid "The Pro-Forma Invoice feature setting in the Odoo Sales application."
msgstr "Nastavitev funkcije predračuna v aplikaciji Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:27
msgid "Send pro-forma invoice"
msgstr "Pošlji predračun"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:29
msgid ""
"With the :guilabel:`Pro-Forma Invoice` feature activated, the option to send "
"a pro-forma invoice is now available on any quotation or sales order, via "
"the :guilabel:`Send Pro-Forma Invoice` button."
msgstr ""
"S funkcijo :guilabel:`Predračun` aktivirano je zdaj na voljo možnost "
"pošiljanja predračuna na katerem koli predračunu ali prodajnem nalogu prek "
"gumba :guilabel:`Pošlji predračun`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:32
msgid ""
"The Send Pro-Forma Invoice button on a typical sales order in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Gumb Pošlji predračun na običajnem prodajnem nalogu v Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:37
msgid ""
"Pro-forma invoices can **not** be sent for a sales order or quotation if an "
"invoice for a down payment has already been sent, or for a recurring "
"subscription."
msgstr ""
"Predračunov **ni** mogoče pošiljati za prodajni nalog ali predračun, če je "
"bil že poslan račun za polog ali za ponavljajočo se naročnino."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:40
msgid ""
"In either case, the :guilabel:`Send Pro-Froma Invoice` button does **not** "
"appear."
msgstr "V obeh primerih se gumb :guilabel:`Pošlji predračun` **ne** prikaže."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:42
msgid ""
"However, pro-forma invoices **can** be sent for services, event "
"registrations, courses, and/or new subscriptions. Pro-forma invoices are not "
"limited to physical, consumable, or storable goods."
msgstr ""
"Vendar pa je predračune **mogoče** pošiljati za storitve, prijave na "
"dogodke, tečaje in/ali nove naročnine. Predračuni niso omejeni na fizično "
"blago, potrošni material ali blago za skladiščenje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:45
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Send Pro-Forma Invoice` button is clicked, a pop-up "
"window appears, from which an email can be sent."
msgstr ""
"Ko kliknete gumb :guilabel:`Pošlji predračun`, se prikaže pojavno okno, iz "
"katerega lahko pošljete e-pošto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:48
msgid ""
"In the pop-up window, the :guilabel:`Recipients` field is auto-populated "
"with the customer from the sales order or quotation. The :guilabel:`Subject` "
"field and the body of the email can be modified, if necessary."
msgstr ""
"V pojavnem oknu je polje :guilabel:`Prejemniki` samodejno izpolnjeno s "
"stranko iz prodajnega naloga ali predračuna. Polje :guilabel:`Zadeva` in "
"besedilo e-pošte lahko po potrebi spremenite."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:52
msgid ""
"The pro-forma invoice is automatically added as an attachment to the email."
msgstr "Predračun je samodejno dodan kot priloga e-pošti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:54
msgid ""
"When ready, click :guilabel:`Send`, and Odoo instantly sends the email, with "
"the attached pro-forma invoice, to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Ko ste pripravljeni, kliknite :guilabel:`Pošlji` in Odoo takoj pošlje e-"
"pošto s priloženim predračunom stranki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:57
msgid ""
"The email pop-up window that appears with pro-forma invoice attached in Odoo "
"Sales."
msgstr ""
"Pojavno okno e-pošte, ki se prikaže s priloženim predračunom v Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:62
msgid ""
"To preview what the pro-forma invoice looks like, click on the PDF at the "
"bottom of the email pop-up window *before* clicking :guilabel:`Send`. When "
"clicked, the pro-forma invoice is downloaded instantly. Open that PDF to "
"view (and review) the pro-forma invoice."
msgstr ""
"Če želite predogledati, kako izgleda predračun, kliknite na PDF na dnu "
"pojavnega okna e-pošte *preden* kliknete :guilabel:`Pošlji`. Ko kliknete, se "
"predračun takoj prenese. Odprite ta PDF za ogled (in pregled) predračuna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma.rst:66
msgid "Sample pro-forma invoice PDF from Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Vzorec PDF predračuna iz Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Covers invoicing a sales order based on time and materials, including "
"configuring service products for time spent, tracking and invoicing "
"expenses, and invoicing purchases linked to the order."
msgstr ""
"Zajema izdajanje računov za prodajni nalog na podlagi časa in materiala, "
"vključno s konfiguriranjem storitvenih izdelkov za porabljen čas, "
"spremljanjem in izdajanjem računov za stroške ter izdajanjem računov za "
"nakupe, povezane z nalogom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:8
msgid "Invoicing based on time and materials"
msgstr "Izdajanje računov na podlagi časa in materiala"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:10
msgid ""
"Invoicing based on time and/or materials is typically used when accurately "
"estimating the size of a project isn't possible, or when the requirements of "
"a project may change."
msgstr ""
"Izdajanje računov na podlagi časa in/ali materiala se običajno uporablja, ko "
"natančna ocena obsega projekta ni mogoča ali ko se zahteve projekta lahko "
"spremenijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:13
msgid ""
"This is different from a fixed-price contract, when a customer agrees to pay "
"a specified total for the fulfillment of the contract---no matter what needs "
"to be paid to the employees, sub-contractors, vendors, suppliers, and so on."
msgstr ""
"To se razlikuje od pogodbe s fiksno ceno, ko se stranka strinja, da bo "
"plačala določen skupni znesek za izpolnitev pogodbe—ne glede na to, kaj je "
"treba plačati zaposlenim, podizvajalcem, prodajalcem, dobaviteljem itd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:17
msgid ""
"The Odoo *Sales* app can invoice for time and various other expenses (e.g. "
"transport, lodging), as well as purchases needed to fulfill an order."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija Odoo *Sales* lahko izdaja račune za čas in različne druge stroške "
"(npr. prevoz, nastańitev) ter nabave, potrebne za izpolnitev naročila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:23
msgid "App and settings configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija aplikacije in nastavitev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:25
msgid ""
"First, in order to accurately keep track of the progress of a project, the "
"Odoo *Project* and *Accounting* apps **must** be installed."
msgstr ""
"Najprej je treba za natančno sledenje napredka projekta **mora** namestiti "
"aplikaciji Odoo *Projekt* in *Računovodstvo*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:28
msgid ""
"To install the *Project* app, navigate to :menuselection:`Odoo main "
"dashboard --> Apps`. Then, on the :guilabel:`Apps` page, locate "
"the :guilabel:`Project` app block, and click :guilabel:`Activate`. The page "
"automatically refreshes and returns to the main Odoo dashboard, where the "
"*Project* app is now available to access."
msgstr ""
"Za namestitev aplikacije *Projekt* se pomaknite na :menuselection:`Glavna "
"nadzorna plošča Odoo --> Aplikacije`. Nato na strani :guilabel:`Aplikacije` "
"poiščite blok aplikacije :guilabel:`Projekt` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Aktiviraj`. Stran se samodejno osveži in se vrne na "
"glavno nadzorno ploščo Odoo, kjer je aplikacija *Projekt* zdaj na voljo za "
"dostop."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:33
msgid "Repeat the same process to install the *Accounting* application."
msgstr "Ponovite enak postopek za namestitev aplikacije *Računovodstvo*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:35
msgid ""
"After installation, click the :guilabel:`Accounting` app icon from the main "
"Odoo dashboard, and navigate to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Settings`. "
"On the :guilabel:`Settings` page, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Analytics` "
"section, and ensure the box next to :guilabel:`Analytic Accounting` is "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Po namestitvi kliknite ikono aplikacije :guilabel:`Računovodstvo` na glavni "
"nadzorni plošči Odoo in se pomaknite na :menuselection:`Konfiguracija --> "
"Nastavitve`. Na strani :guilabel:`Nastavitve` se pomaknite navzdol do "
"razdelka :guilabel:`Analitika` in prepričajte se, da je polje "
"ob :guilabel:`Analitično računovodstvo` označeno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:40
msgid ""
"How it looks to activate the Analytic Accounting setting in Odoo Accounting "
"Setting page."
msgstr ""
"Kako izgleda aktivacija nastavitve Analitično računovodstvo na strani "
"nastavitev Odoo računovodstva."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:44
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:50
msgid "Then, click :guilabel:`Save` to save all changes."
msgstr "Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`, da shranite vse spremembe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:46
msgid ""
"Then, navigate to :menuselection:`Odoo main dashboard --> Project app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`. On the :guilabel:`Settings` page, in "
"the :guilabel:`Time Management` section, ensure the box beside "
"the :guilabel:`Timesheets` feature is checked."
msgstr ""
"Nato se pomaknite na :menuselection:`Glavna nadzorna plošča Odoo --> "
"Aplikacija Projekt --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`. Na "
"strani :guilabel:`Nastavitve`, v razdelku :guilabel:`Upravljanje časa`, se "
"prepričajte, da je polje ob funkciji :guilabel:`Časovnice` označeno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:52
msgid ""
"What the Timesheets feature looks like on the Odoo Project settings page."
msgstr ""
"Kako izgleda funkcija Časovnice na strani nastavitev aplikacije Odoo Projekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:59
msgid "Service product configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija izdelka storitve"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:61
msgid ""
"With the *Timesheets* feature activated in the *Project* app, it is now "
"possible to invoice for time spent on a project, but **only** when the "
"following product configurations have been made."
msgstr ""
"Ko je funkcija *Časovnice* aktivirana v aplikaciji *Projekt*, je zdaj mogoče "
"izdajati račune za čas, porabljen za projekt, vendar **samo**, če so bile "
"izvedene naslednje konfiguracije izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:65
msgid ""
"Invoicing for time spent on a project is **only** possible with products "
"that have *Service* set as the *Product Type* on their product form."
msgstr ""
"Izdajanje računov za čas, porabljen za projekt, je **samo** mogoče z "
"izdelki, ki imajo kot *Vrsta izdelka* nastavljeno *Storitev* na obrazcu "
"izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:68
msgid ""
"To configure a service product, first navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app "
"--> Products --> Products`. On the :guilabel:`Products` page, select the "
"desired service product to be configured, or click :guilabel:`New` to create "
"a new product."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo izdelka storitve se najprej pomaknite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Prodaja --> Izdelki --> Izdelki`. Na "
"strani :guilabel:`Izdelki` izberite želeni izdelek storitve za konfiguracijo "
"ali kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`, da ustvarite nov izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:72
msgid ""
"From the product form, in the :guilabel:`General Information` tab, set "
"the :guilabel:`Product Type` to :guilabel:`Service`. Then, open the drop-"
"down menu in the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` field, and "
"select :guilabel:`Based on Timesheets`."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu izdelka, v zavihku :guilabel:`Splošne informacije`, "
"nastavite :guilabel:`Vrsta izdelka` na :guilabel:`Storitev`. Nato odprite "
"spustni meni v polju :guilabel:`Politika izdajanja računov` in "
"izberite :guilabel:`Glede na časovnice`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:76
msgid ""
"Next, from the :guilabel:`Create on Order` drop-down menu, "
"select :guilabel:`Project \\& Task`. That setting indicates that, when a "
"sales order is created with this specific service product, a new project and "
"task is created in the *Project* app."
msgstr ""
"Nato iz spustnega menija :guilabel:`Ustvari pri naročilu` "
"izberite :guilabel:`Projekt in opravilo`. Ta nastavitev pomeni, da se ob "
"ustvarjanju prodajnega naloga s tem določenim izdelkom storitve v aplikaciji "
"*Projekt* ustvarita nov projekt in opravilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:80
msgid ""
"The correct settings for Invoicing Policy and Create on Order fields for "
"service product."
msgstr ""
"Pravilne nastavitve za polji Politika izdajanja računov in Ustvari pri "
"naročilu za izdelek storitve."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:85
msgid ""
"The option :guilabel:`Task` can be chosen instead from the :guilabel:`Create "
"on Order` drop-down menu. If :guilabel:`Task` is chosen, select an existing "
"project that the task will appear in from :guilabel:`Project` field, which "
"only appears if :guilabel:`Task` is chosen in the :guilabel:`Create on "
"Order` field."
msgstr ""
"Iz spustnega menija :guilabel:`Ustvari pri naročilu` je mogoče namesto tega "
"izbrati možnost :guilabel:`Opravilo`. Če je izbrano :guilabel:`Opravilo`, v "
"polju :guilabel:`Projekt`, ki se prikaže samo, če je v "
"polju :guilabel:`Ustvari pri naročilu` izbrano :guilabel:`Opravilo`, "
"izberite obstoječi projekt, v katerem se bo pojavilo opravilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:91
msgid "Add time spent to sales order"
msgstr "Dodajanje porabljenega časa prodajnemu nalogu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:93
msgid ""
"After properly configuring a service product with the correct *Invoicing "
"Policy* and *Create on Order* options, it is possible to add time spent to a "
"sales order."
msgstr ""
"Ko je izdelek storitve pravilno konfiguriran s pravilnima možnostma "
"*Politika izdajanja računov* in *Ustvari pri naročilu*, je mogoče prodajnemu "
"nalogu dodati porabljeni čas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:96
msgid ""
"To see that in action, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> New` to "
"open a blank quotation form. Then, proceed to add a :guilabel:`Customer`, "
"and in the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a product`, and "
"select the properly :ref:`configured service product <sales/time-materials/"
"configuration-product>` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled v praksi pojdite na :menuselection:`aplikacija Prodaja --> Novo`, "
"da odprete prazen obrazec ponudbe. Nato dodajte :guilabel:`Stranka` in v "
"zavihku :guilabel:`Postavke naročila` kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj izdelek` ter "
"v spustnem meniju izberite ustrezno :ref:`konfiguriran storitveni izdelek "
"<sales/time_materials/configured-service-product>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:101
msgid "Next, click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the order."
msgstr "Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da potrdite naročilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:103
msgid ""
"After confirming the sales order, two smart buttons appear at the top of the "
"order form: :guilabel:`Projects` and :guilabel:`Tasks`."
msgstr ""
"Po potrditvi prodajnega naloga se na vrhu obrazca naročila prikažeta dva "
"pametna gumba: :guilabel:`Projekti` in :guilabel:`Opravila`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:106
msgid ""
"How the Projects and Tasks smart buttons look on a Sales Order in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Kako izgledajo pametna gumba Projekti in Opravila na prodajnem nalogu v Odoo "
"Prodaji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:110
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Projects` smart button is clicked, it reveals the specific "
"project related to this sales order. If the :guilabel:`Tasks` smart button "
"is clicked, it reveals the specific project task related to this sales "
"order. Both are also accessible in the *Project* app."
msgstr ""
"Če kliknete pametno tipko :guilabel:`Projekti`, se prikaže določen projekt, "
"povezan s tem prodajnim nalogom. Če kliknete pametno "
"tipko :guilabel:`Opravila`, se prikaže določeno opravilo projekta, povezano "
"s tem prodajnim nalogom. Oba sta dostopna tudi v aplikaciji *Projekt*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:114
msgid ""
"In order to add time spent on a sales order, click the :guilabel:`Tasks` "
"smart button."
msgstr ""
"Če želite dodati porabljen čas za prodajni nalog, kliknite pametno "
"tipko :guilabel:`Opravila`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:116
msgid ""
"On the task form, select the :guilabel:`Timesheets` tab. From "
"the :guilabel:`Timesheets` tab, employees can be assigned to work on the "
"project, and the time they spend working on the task can be added by the "
"employees or by the person who created the sales order."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu opravila izberite zavihek :guilabel:`Časovnice`. V "
"zavihku :guilabel:`Časovnice` je mogoče kadru dodeliti delo na projektu, "
"zaposleni ali oseba, ki je ustvarila prodajni nalog, pa lahko doda čas, ki "
"ga porabijo za delo na opravilu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:120
msgid ""
"To add an employee, and the time spent working on the task, "
"click :guilabel:`Add a line` in the :guilabel:`Timesheets` tab. Then, select "
"the appropriate :guilabel:`Date` and :guilabel:`Employee`. There is also the "
"option to add a brief description of the work done during this time in "
"the :guilabel:`Description` column, but it's not required."
msgstr ""
"Če želite dodati kader in porabljen čas za delo na opravilu, "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico` v zavihku :guilabel:`Časovnice`. Nato "
"izberite ustrezen :guilabel:`Datum` in :guilabel:`Kader`. Obstaja tudi "
"možnost dodajanja kratkega opisa opravljenega dela v tem času v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Opis`, vendar ni obvezno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:125
msgid ""
"Lastly, enter the amount of time worked on the task in the :guilabel:`Hours "
"Spent` column, and click away to complete that line in "
"the :guilabel:`Timesheets` tab."
msgstr ""
"Nazadnje vnesite čas, porabljen za opravilo, v stolpec :guilabel:`Porabljene "
"ure` in kliknite stran, da dokončate to vrstico v "
"zavihku :guilabel:`Časovnice`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:129
msgid ""
"The time entered in the :guilabel:`Hours Spent` column is immediately "
"reflected in the :guilabel:`Allocated Time` field (located near the top of "
"the task form) as a percentage, which reflects how much of the total "
"allocated work hours have been done so far."
msgstr ""
"Čas, vnešen v stolpec :guilabel:`Porabljene ure`, se takoj odraža v "
"polju :guilabel:`Dodeljeni čas` (ob vrhu obrazca opravila) kot odstotek, ki "
"odraža, koliko skupnih dodeljenih delovnih ur je bilo doslej opravljenih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:133
msgid ""
"That same information is found as numerical hours in the :guilabel:`Hours "
"Spent` and :guilabel:`Remaining Hours` fields, located at the bottom of "
"the :guilabel:`Timesheets` tab."
msgstr ""
"Iste informacije so kot številčne ure na voljo v "
"poljih :guilabel:`Porabljene ure` in :guilabel:`Preostale ure`, ki se "
"nahajajo na dnu zavihka :guilabel:`Časovnice`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:136
msgid ""
"How the Timesheets tab appears on a task form in Odoo Sales and Odoo Project."
msgstr ""
"Kako se zavihek Časovnice prikazuje na obrazcu opravila v Odoo Prodaja in "
"Odoo Projekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:140
msgid ""
"Repeat this process for however many employees and hours have been worked on "
"the project."
msgstr ""
"Ta postopek ponovite za toliko zaposlenih in ur, kolikor jih je bilo "
"porabljenih za projekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:143
msgid "Invoice time spent"
msgstr "Zaračunavanje porabljenega časa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:145
msgid ""
"Once all the necessary employees and time spent have been added to the "
"project task, return to the sales order to invoice the customer for those "
"hours. To do that, either click the :guilabel:`Sales Order` smart button at "
"the top of the task form, or return to the sales order via the breadcrumb "
"links, located in the upper-left of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Ko so vsi potrebni zaposleni in porabljen čas dodani opravilu projekta, se "
"vrnite na prodajni nalog, da stranki zaračunate te ure. To storite tako, da "
"kliknete pametno tipko :guilabel:`Prodajni nalog` na vrhu obrazca opravila "
"ali se vrnete na prodajni nalog prek povezav za navigacijo v zgornjem levem "
"kotu zaslona."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:150
msgid ""
"Back on the sales order form, the time that was added to the task is "
"reflected in the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab (in the :guilabel:`Delivered` "
"column) and in the new :guilabel:`Recorded Hours` smart button at the top of "
"the sales order."
msgstr ""
"Nazaj na obrazcu prodajnega naloga se čas, dodan opravilu, odraža v "
"zavihku :guilabel:`Vrstice naloga` (v stolpcu :guilabel:`Dobavljeno`) in v "
"novi pametni tipki :guilabel:`Zabeležene ure` na vrhu prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:154
msgid ""
"To invoice the customer for time spent on the project, "
"click :guilabel:`Create Invoice`, and select :guilabel:`Regular invoice` "
"from the :guilabel:`Create invoices` pop-up window. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Create Draft Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite stranki zaračunati čas, porabljen za projekt, "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari račun` in v pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Ustvari "
"račune` izberite :guilabel:`Navaden račun`. Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari "
"osnutek računa`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:158
msgid ""
"Doing so reveals a :guilabel:`Customer Invoice Draft`, clearly showing all "
"the work that's been done in the :guilabel:`Invoice Lines` tab."
msgstr ""
"S tem se prikaže :guilabel:`Osnutek računa stranki`, ki jasno prikazuje vse "
"opravljeno delo v zavihku :guilabel:`Vrstice računa`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:162
msgid ""
"Pay attention to the :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` column in "
"the :guilabel:`Customer Invoice`, as that information is necessary to ensure "
"other time/material invoicing tasks are completed properly and accurately."
msgstr ""
"Bodite pozorni na stolpec :guilabel:`Analitična porazdelitev` "
"v :guilabel:`Računu stranki`, saj so te informacije potrebne za pravilno in "
"natančno dokončanje drugih opravil zaračunavanja časa/materiala."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:166
msgid "Invoice draft showing time spent on sales order in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Osnutek računa, ki prikazuje porabljen čas za prodajni nalog v Odoo Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:170
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the invoice and continue with the "
"invoicing process."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da potrdite račun in nadaljujete s postopkom "
"zaračunavanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:176
msgid "Expenses configuration"
msgstr "Nastavitev stroškov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:178
msgid ""
"In order to track and invoice expenses related to a sales order, the Odoo "
"*Expenses* app **must** be installed."
msgstr ""
"Za sledenje in zaračunavanje stroškov, povezanih s prodajnim nalogom, "
"**mora** biti nameščena aplikacija Odoo *Stroški*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:181
msgid ""
"To install the *Expenses* app, navigate to :menuselection:`Odoo main "
"dashboard --> Apps`. Then, on the :guilabel:`Apps` page, locate "
"the :guilabel:`Expenses` app block, and click :guilabel:`Activate`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite namestiti aplikacijo *Stroški*, se pomaknite "
"na :menuselection:`Glavna nadzorna plošča Odoo --> Aplikacije`. Nato na "
"strani :guilabel:`Aplikacije` poiščite blok aplikacije :guilabel:`Stroški` "
"in kliknite :guilabel:`Aktiviraj`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:185
msgid ""
"The page automatically refreshes and returns to the main Odoo dashboard, "
"where the :guilabel:`Expenses` app is now available to access."
msgstr ""
"Stran se samodejno osveži in se vrne na glavno nadzorno ploščo Odoo, kjer je "
"zdaj na voljo aplikacija :guilabel:`Expenses`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:191
msgid "Add expenses to sales order"
msgstr "Dodaj stroške prodajnemu nalogu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:193
msgid ""
"To add an expense to a sales order, first navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Expenses` app. Then, from the main *Expenses* dashboard, "
"click :guilabel:`New`, which reveals a blank expense form."
msgstr ""
"Če želite dodati strošek prodajnemu nalogu, najprej pojdite na "
"aplikacijo :menuselection:`Expenses`. Nato na glavni nadzorni plošči "
"*Expenses* kliknite :guilabel:`New`, kar prikaže prazen obrazec za stroške."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:196
msgid ""
"On the expense form, add a :guilabel:`Description` of the expense (e.g. "
"`Hotel Stay`, `Plane Ticket`). Next, in the :guilabel:`Category` field, "
"select the appropriate option from the drop-down menu "
"(e.g. :guilabel:`Meals`, :guilabel:`Miles`, :guilabel:`Travel \\& "
"Accommodation`)."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu za stroške dodajte :guilabel:`Description` stroška (npr. `Hotel "
"Stay`, `Plane Ticket`). Nato v polju :guilabel:`Category` izberite ustrezno "
"možnost iz spustnega menija "
"(npr. :guilabel:`Meals`, :guilabel:`Miles`, :guilabel:`Travel \\& "
"Accommodation`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:201
msgid ""
"Expense categories can be added and modified by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> Configuration --> Expense Categories`."
msgstr ""
"Kategorije stroškov lahko dodate in spremenite tako, da pojdete "
"na :menuselection:`Expenses app --> Configuration --> Expense Categories`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:204
msgid ""
"Then, enter the total amount of the expense in the :guilabel:`Total` field, "
"as well as any :guilabel:`Included Taxes` that may apply. Next, ensure that "
"the correct :guilabel:`Employee` is selected, and designate who paid for the "
"expense in the :guilabel:`Paid By` field: the :guilabel:`Employee (to "
"reimburse)` or the :guilabel:`Company`."
msgstr ""
"Nato vnesite skupni znesek stroška v polje :guilabel:`Total` ter "
"morebitne :guilabel:`Included Taxes`, ki se lahko uporabijo. Nato se "
"prepričajte, da je izbran pravilen :guilabel:`Employee`, in določite, kdo je "
"plačal strošek v polju :guilabel:`Paid By`: :guilabel:`Employee (to "
"reimburse)` ali :guilabel:`Company`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:209
msgid ""
"Next, in the :guilabel:`Customer to Reinvoice` field, select the appropriate "
"sales order from the drop-down menu. Then, select that same sales order "
"information from the :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` field, as well."
msgstr ""
"Nato v polju :guilabel:`Customer to Reinvoice` izberite ustrezni prodajni "
"nalog iz spustnega menija. Nato izberite enake informacije prodajnega naloga "
"tudi v polju :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:214
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` field will **only** have the "
"corresponding sales order as an option if the sales order contains a service "
"product that is billed based on *Timesheets*, *Milestones*, or *Delivered "
"Quantities*."
msgstr ""
"Polje :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` bo imelo ustrezen prodajni nalog kot "
"možnost **samo**, če prodajni nalog vsebuje storitev, ki se zaračunava na "
"podlagi *Timesheets*, *Milestones* ali *Delivered Quantities*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:218
msgid ""
"How to properly fill out an expense form that's attached to a sales order in "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Kako pravilno izpolniti obrazec za stroške, ki je priložen prodajnemu nalogu "
"v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:222
msgid ""
"If there are any receipts that should be uploaded and attached to the "
"expense, click the :guilabel:`Attach Receipt` button, and upload the "
"necessary documents to the expense. This is **not** required, but it may "
"affect whether or not an expense is approved."
msgstr ""
"Če obstajajo računi, ki bi jih bilo treba naložiti in priložiti strošku, "
"kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Attach Receipt` in naložite potrebne dokumente k "
"strošku. To **ni** obvezno, vendar lahko vpliva na to, ali bo strošek "
"odobren ali ne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:226
msgid ""
"When all the information has been entered, click :guilabel:`Create Report` "
"to create an expense report detailing all the expense information that was "
"just entered."
msgstr ""
"Ko so vneseni vsi podatki, kliknite :guilabel:`Create Report`, da ustvarite "
"poročilo o stroških s podrobnostmi o vseh pravkar vnesenih informacijah o "
"strošku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:229
msgid "How an Expense Report Summary looks in Odoo Expenses."
msgstr "Kako izgleda povzetek poročila o stroških v Odoo Expenses."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:233
msgid ""
"Then, there's the option to :guilabel:`Submit to Manager` for approval. Once "
"approved, the :guilabel:`Report in Next Payslip` appears."
msgstr ""
"Nato je na voljo možnost :guilabel:`Submit to Manager` za odobritev. Po "
"odobritvi se prikaže :guilabel:`Report in Next Payslip`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:236
msgid ""
"To showcase a complete flow in this example, select :guilabel:`Submit to "
"Manager`. Then, the manager would click :guilabel:`Approve` to approve this "
"expense, and click :guilabel:`Post Journal Entries` to post this expense to "
"the accounting journal."
msgstr ""
"Za prikaz celotnega poteka v tem primeru izberite :guilabel:`Submit to "
"Manager`. Nato bi vodja kliknil :guilabel:`Approve`, da odobri ta strošek, "
"in kliknil :guilabel:`Post Journal Entries`, da objavi ta strošek v "
"računovodski dnevnik."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:241
msgid "Invoice expenses"
msgstr "Zaračunaj stroške"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:243
msgid ""
"To invoice a customer for an :ref:`expense on a sales order <sales/"
"time_materials/add-expenses-sales-order>`, navigate to the related sales "
"order, either from the :menuselection:`Sales` app or from the expense report "
"in the :menuselection:`Expenses` app. From the expense report, click "
"the :guilabel:`Sales Orders` smart button at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Če želite stranki zaračunati :ref:`strošek na prodajnem nalogu <sales/"
"time_materials/add-expenses-sales-order>`, se pomaknite na povezani prodajni "
"nalog bodisi iz aplikacije :menuselection:`Prodaja` bodisi iz poročila o "
"stroških v aplikaciji :menuselection:`Stroški`. V poročilu o stroških "
"kliknite pametni gumb :guilabel:`Prodajni nalogi` na vrhu strani."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:248
msgid ""
"If the expense report was linked to the sales order, the newly-configured "
"expense now has its own line in the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab, and can be "
"invoiced to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Če je bilo poročilo o stroških povezano s prodajnim nalogom, ima na novo "
"konfiguriran strošek svojo vrstico v zavihku :guilabel:`Order Lines` in ga "
"je mogoče zaračunati stranki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:251
msgid ""
"An expense appearing on Order Lines tab of a Sales Order in Odoo Sales "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Strošek, ki se prikaže v zavihku Order Lines prodajnega naloga v aplikaciji "
"Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:255
msgid ""
"To invoice the customer for the expense on the sales order, "
"click :guilabel:`Create Invoice`, select :guilabel:`Regular Invoice` from "
"the :guilabel:`Create invoices` pop-up window, then click :guilabel:`Create "
"Draft Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite stranki zaračunati strošek na prodajnem nalogu, "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Create Invoice`, izberite :guilabel:`Regular Invoice` v "
"pojavnem oknu :guilabel:`Create invoices` in nato kliknite :guilabel:`Create "
"Draft Invoice`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:259
msgid ""
"Doing so reveals a :guilabel:`Customer Invoice Draft` for the expense. Then, "
"the invoicing process can be completed as usual."
msgstr ""
"S tem se prikaže :guilabel:`Customer Invoice Draft` za strošek. Nato lahko "
"proces fakturiranja dokončate kot običajno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:262
msgid ""
"Sample customer invoice for an expense generated from a sales order in Odoo "
"Sales."
msgstr ""
"Vzorčni račun stranki za strošek, ustvarjen iz prodajnega naloga v Odoo "
"Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:267
msgid "Purchase configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija nabave"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:269
msgid ""
"In order to invoice a customer for purchases made on a sales order, the "
"*Purchase* application **must** be installed."
msgstr ""
"Da bi stranki zaračunali nakupe iz prodajnega naloga, **mora** biti "
"nameščena aplikacija *Purchase*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:272
msgid ""
"To install the *Purchase* application, navigate to :menuselection:`Odoo main "
"dashboard --> Apps`. Then, on the :guilabel:`Apps` page, locate "
"the :guilabel:`Purchase` app block, and click :guilabel:`Activate`. The page "
"automatically refreshes and returns to the main Odoo dashboard, where "
"the :guilabel:`Purchase` app is now available to access."
msgstr ""
"Za namestitev aplikacije *Purchase* pojdite na :menuselection:`Glavna "
"nadzorna plošča Odoo --> Aplikacije`. Nato na strani :guilabel:`Aplikacije` "
"poiščite blok aplikacije :guilabel:`Purchase` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Aktiviraj`. Stran se samodejno osveži in vrne na glavno "
"nadzorno ploščo Odoo, kjer je zdaj na voljo aplikacija :guilabel:`Purchase`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:280
msgid "Add purchase to sales order"
msgstr "Dodaj nabavo k prodajnemu nalogu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:282
msgid ""
"To add a purchase to a sales order, a purchase order must first be created. "
"To create a purchase order, navigate to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> "
"New` to reveal a blank purchase order form."
msgstr ""
"Da bi dodali nabavo k prodajnemu nalogu, morate najprej ustvariti nabavni "
"nalog. Za ustvaritev nabavnega naloga pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Purchase --> Nov`, da se prikaže prazen obrazec nabavnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:285
msgid ""
"First, add a :guilabel:`Vendor` to the purchase order. Then, under "
"the :guilabel:`Products` tab, click the :guilabel:`extra column options` "
"drop-down menu, represented by two horizontal lines with dots on them, "
"located to the far-right of the column headers. From that drop-down menu, "
"select :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution`."
msgstr ""
"Najprej dodajte :guilabel:`Dobavitelja` k nabavnemu nalogu. Nato v "
"zavihku :guilabel:`Izdelki` kliknite spustni meni :guilabel:`dodatne "
"možnosti stolpcev`, ki ga predstavljata dve vodoravni črti s pikami, na "
"skrajni desni strani glav stolpcev. Iz tega spustnega menija "
"izberite :guilabel:`Analitična porazdelitev`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:290
msgid ""
"How to add analytic distribution column on purchase order form in Odoo "
"Purchase."
msgstr ""
"Kako dodati stolpec analitične porazdelitve na obrazec nabavnega naloga v "
"Odoo Purchase."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:294
msgid ""
"After adding the :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` column to the headers on "
"the :guilabel:`Products` tab of the purchase order form, proceed to add the "
"product(s) to the purchase order. To do that, click :guilabel:`Add a "
"product`, and select the desired product from the drop-down menu. Repeat for "
"all the products to add."
msgstr ""
"Ko dodate stolpec :guilabel:`Analitična porazdelitev` k glavam v "
"zavihku :guilabel:`Izdelki` obrazca nabavnega naloga, nadaljujte z "
"dodajanjem izdelkov k nabavnemu nalogu. To storite tako, da "
"kliknete :guilabel:`Dodaj izdelek` in iz spustnega menija izberete želeni "
"izdelek. Ponovite za vse izdelke, ki jih želite dodati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:300
msgid ""
"In order for a purchase to be properly invoiced on a sales order, the "
"product on the purchase order **must** be marked as :guilabel:`Can be "
"Expensed`, have an :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` set to :guilabel:`Delivered "
"quantities`, and have the :guilabel:`At cost` option selected in "
"the :guilabel:`Re-Invoice Expenses` field on its product form."
msgstr ""
"Da bi bil nakup pravilno zaračunan na prodajnem nalogu, **mora** biti "
"izdelek na nabavnem nalogu označen kot :guilabel:`Lahko stroškovno knjižen`, "
"imeti :guilabel:`Pravila fakturiranja` nastavljena na :guilabel:`Dobavljene "
"količine` in imeti izbrano možnost :guilabel:`Po nabavni ceni` v "
"polju :guilabel:`Ponovno zaračunaj stroške` na njegovem obrazcu izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:305
msgid ""
"Product settings for a purchase order to be invoiced on a sales order in "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitve izdelka, da se nabavni nalog zaračuna na prodajnem nalogu v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:309
msgid ""
"Then, select the appropriate :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` associated "
"with the sales order to which this purchase order is related. To do that, "
"click the empty :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` field to reveal "
"an :guilabel:`Analytic` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Nato izberite ustrezno :guilabel:`Analitično porazdelitev`, povezano s "
"prodajnim nalogom, na katerega se nanaša ta nabavni nalog. To storite tako, "
"da kliknete prazno polje :guilabel:`Analitična porazdelitev`, da se prikaže "
"pojavno okno :guilabel:`Analitika`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:313
msgid ""
"Then, from the :guilabel:`Departments` drop-down menu, select the analytic "
"distribution associated with the desired sales order to be invoiced for the "
"purchase."
msgstr ""
"Nato iz spustnega menija :guilabel:`Oddelki` izberite analitično "
"porazdelitev, povezano z želenim prodajnim nalogom, ki bo zaračunan za nakup."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:316
msgid ""
"How to select the Analytic Distribution department from a purchase order in "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Kako izbrati oddelek analitične porazdelitve iz nabavnega naloga v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:320
msgid ""
"Once all the information is entered in the :guilabel:`Products` tab of the "
"purchase order, confirm the order by clicking :guilabel:`Confirm Order`. "
"Then, click :guilabel:`Receive Products` when the products have been "
"received. This creates a receipt form."
msgstr ""
"Ko so vsi podatki vneseni v zavihek :guilabel:`Izdelki` nabavnega naloga, "
"potrdite nalog s klikom na :guilabel:`Potrdi nalog`. Nato "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Prejmi izdelke`, ko so izdelki prejeti. To ustvari "
"obrazec prejema."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:325
msgid ""
"If any serial/lot numbers must be entered before validating the receipt of "
"products, then on the receipt form, click the :guilabel:`details` icon "
"represented by four horizontal lines located to the far-right of the product "
"line."
msgstr ""
"Če je treba vnesti kakršne koli serijske/šaržne številke pred potrditvijo "
"prejema izdelkov, potem na obrazcu prejema kliknite "
"ikono :guilabel:`podrobnosti`, ki jo predstavljajo štiri vodoravne črte na "
"skrajni desni strani vrstice izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:329
msgid ""
"This reveals a :guilabel:`Detailed Operations` tab, in which the "
"necessary :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number(s)` and :guilabel:`Done` quantity can "
"be added. When ready, click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the data."
msgstr ""
"To prikaže zavihek :guilabel:`Podrobne operacije`, v katerem lahko dodate "
"potrebne :guilabel:`Šaržne/serijske številke` in "
"količino :guilabel:`Opravljeno`. Ko ste pripravljeni, "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da potrdite podatke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:333
msgid "Then, click :guilabel:`Validate` to validate the purchase order."
msgstr "Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da potrdite nabavni nalog."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:335
msgid ""
"Next, return to the purchase order, via the breadcrumb links at the top of "
"the page, and click :guilabel:`Create Bill` to create a vendor bill that can "
"be invoiced to the customer on the attached sales order."
msgstr ""
"Nato se vrnite na nabavni nalog prek povezav za navigacijo na vrhu strani in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari račun`, da ustvarite dobaviteljev račun, ki ga "
"lahko zaračunate stranki na priloženem prodajnem nalogu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:339
msgid ""
"Vendor bill draft for a purchase order to be invoiced to a customer in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Osnutek dobaviteljevega računa za nabavni nalog, ki bo zaračunan stranki v "
"Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:344
msgid ""
"Make sure to enter a :guilabel:`Bill Date` on the :guilabel:`Vendor Bill "
"Draft` before confirming. If a :guilabel:`Bill Date` is *not* entered, an "
"error window appears, requesting that information to be entered before "
"confirmation can occur."
msgstr ""
"Pred potrditvijo se prepričajte, da ste v :guilabel:`Osnutek dobaviteljevega "
"računa` vnesli :guilabel:`Datum računa`. Če :guilabel:`Datum računa` *ni* "
"vnešen, se prikaže okno z napako, ki zahteva vnos te informacije pred "
"potrditvijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:348
msgid ""
"Then, click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the vendor bill, which is then "
"automatically added to the sales order, where it can be invoiced directly to "
"the customer attached to it."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da potrdite dobaviteljev račun, ki se nato "
"samodejno doda k prodajnemu nalogu, kjer ga je mogoče neposredno izdati v "
"račun stranki, povezani z njim."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:352
msgid "Invoice purchase"
msgstr "Zaračunaj nakup"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:354
msgid ""
"To invoice a customer for a purchase on a sales order, first :ref:`add the "
"purchase to the sales order <sales/time_materials/add-purchase-to-sales-"
"order>`, then navigate to the desired sales order in "
"the :menuselection:`Sales` app."
msgstr ""
"Če želite stranki izdati račun za nakup na prodajnem nalogu, najprej "
":ref:`dodajte nakup na prodajni nalog <sales/time_materials/add-purchase-to-"
"sales-order>`, nato pa se pomaknite do želenega prodajnega naloga v "
"aplikaciji :menuselection:`Prodaja`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:358
msgid ""
"On the sales order that was attached to the purchase order, the purchased "
"product now has its own product line under the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab, "
"and it is ready to be invoiced."
msgstr ""
"Na prodajnem nalogu, ki je bil povezan z nabavnim nalogom, ima kupljeni "
"izdelek zdaj svojo vrstico pod zavihkom :guilabel:`Vrstice naročila` in je "
"pripravljen za izdajo računa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:361
msgid ""
"Purchase order product on sales order to be invoiced to customer via Odoo "
"Sales."
msgstr ""
"Izdelek iz nabavnega naloga na prodajnem nalogu, ki se zaračuna stranki prek "
"Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:365
msgid ""
"To invoice the customer for the purchase, simply click :guilabel:`Create "
"Invoice`, select :guilabel:`Regular Invoice` from the :guilabel:`Create "
"invoices` pop-up window, then click :guilabel:`Create Draft Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite stranki zaračunati nakup, preprosto kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari "
"račun`, izberite :guilabel:`Običajni račun` iz pojavnega "
"okna :guilabel:`Ustvari račune`, nato pa kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari osnutek "
"računa`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:369
msgid ""
"Doing so reveals a :guilabel:`Customer Invoice Draft` with the newly-added "
"purchase order product in the :guilabel:`Invoice Lines` tab."
msgstr ""
"S tem se prikaže :guilabel:`Osnutek računa stranki` z novo dodanim izdelkom "
"iz nabavnega naloga v zavihku :guilabel:`Vrstice računa`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:372
msgid ""
"Customer invoice draft with purchase product attached to sales order in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Osnutek računa stranki z izdelkom iz nabave, povezanim s prodajnim nalogom v "
"Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials.rst:376
msgid ""
"To complete the invoicing process, click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the "
"invoice, and then click :guilabel:`Register Payment` in "
"the :guilabel:`Register Payment` pop-up form."
msgstr ""
"Če želite dokončati postopek izdajanja računa, kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, "
"da potrdite račun, nato pa kliknite :guilabel:`Registriraj plačilo` v "
"obrazcu :guilabel:`Registriraj plačilo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector.rst:5
msgid "Lazada Connector"
msgstr "Lazada Connector"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:3
msgid "Lazada Connector features"
msgstr "Funkcije Lazada Connector"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **Lazada Connector** synchronizes orders, products, and inventory "
"between Lazada and Odoo, streamlining your operations across Southeast "
"Asia's marketplaces. It reduces manual data entry between systems and "
"enhances order management, enabling efficient tracking of Lazada sales "
"within Odoo."
msgstr ""
"**Lazada Connector** sinhronizira naročila, izdelke in zalogo med Lazado in "
"Odoo ter poenostavi vaše poslovanje na tržnicah jugovzhodne Azije. Zmanjša "
"ročno vnašanje podatkov med sistemi in izboljša upravljanje naročil, kar "
"omogoča učinkovito sledenje prodaji Lazada v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:13
