msgid ""
"A Lazada Seller account (:guilabel:`Personal Self-Developed` "
"or :guilabel:`Enterprise Self-Developed`)."
msgstr ""
"Račun Lazada Seller (:guilabel:`Personal Self-Developed` "
"ali :guilabel:`Enterprise Self-Developed`)."

