#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:192
msgid ""
"Commas cannot be used in attribute and value names since they are used by "
"the database to separate items from each other."
msgstr ""
"Vejice ni mogoče uporabljati v imenih atributov in vrednosti, saj jih "
"podatkovna baza uporablja za ločevanje elementov med seboj."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:195
msgid ""
"When product attributes and values are configured in the database, they can "
"be used in product import spreadsheets to add more information and detail to "
"imported products."
msgstr ""
"Ko so atributi izdelkov in vrednosti konfigurirani v podatkovni bazi, jih je "
"mogoče uporabiti v preglednicah za uvoz izdelkov za dodajanje več informacij "
"in podrobnosti uvoženim izdelkom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:198
msgid ""
"To import products with product attributes and values, the product import "
"template spreadsheet must be configured with specific :guilabel:`Product "
"Attributes / Attribute`, :guilabel:`Product Attributes / Values`, "
"and :guilabel:`Name` columns. These specific columns are **required** to "
"import products with specific variants properly."
msgstr ""
"Za uvoz izdelkov z atributi in vrednostmi izdelkov mora biti preglednica "
"predloge za uvoz izdelkov konfigurirana s posebnimi "
"stolpci :guilabel:`Atributi izdelkov / Atribut`, :guilabel:`Atributi "
"izdelkov / Vrednosti` in :guilabel:`Ime`. Ti posebni stolpci so **obvezni** "
"za pravilen uvoz izdelkov s posebnimi različicami."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:203
msgid ""
"Product variants spreadsheet with product attributes and variants for import "
"purposes."
msgstr ""
"Preglednica različic izdelkov z atributi in različicami izdelkov za namene "
"uvoza."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:206
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: The product's name."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ime`: Ime izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:207
msgid ":guilabel:`Product Attributes / Attribute`: The name of the attribute."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Atributi izdelkov / Atribut`: Ime atributa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:208
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Attributes / Values`: The values pertaining to the "
"corresponding attribute."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Atributi izdelkov / Vrednosti`: Vrednosti, ki se nanašajo na "
"ustrezen atribut."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:211
msgid ""
"To import multiple values, separate them with a single comma (**not a comma "
"followed by a space**) in the product import template spreadsheet (e.g., "
"`furniture,couch,home`)."
msgstr ""
"Za uvoz več vrednosti jih v preglednici predloge za uvoz izdelkov ločite z "
"eno vejico (**ne z vejico, ki ji sledi presledek**) (npr. "
"`furniture,couch,home`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:214
msgid ""
"When the desired products and product variants have been entered and saved "
"in the spreadsheet, they can be imported into Odoo. To do that, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Products`. On "
"the :guilabel:`Products` page, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Action)` "
"icon and select :menuselection:`Import records --> Upload File`."
msgstr ""
"Ko so želeni izdelki in različice izdelkov vneseni in shranjeni v "
"preglednici, jih je mogoče uvoziti v Odoo. Za to pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`aplikacija Prodaja --> Izdelki --> Izdelki`. Na "
"strani :guilabel:`Izdelki` kliknite ikono :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Dejanje)` in izberite :menuselection:`Uvozi zapise --> "
"Naloži datoteko`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:219
msgid ""
"Once the spreadsheet with the newly-configured products and product variants "
"has been uploaded, click :guilabel:`Import`. Odoo loads "
"the :guilabel:`Products` page, where the newly added products can be found."
msgstr ""
"Ko je preglednica z novo konfiguriranimi izdelki in variantami izdelkov "
"naložena, kliknite :guilabel:`Uvozi`. Odoo naloži stran :guilabel:`Izdelki`, "
"kjer najdete novo dodane izdelke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:223
msgid ""
"To view and modify the attributes and variants on any products, select the "
"desired product from the :guilabel:`Products` page, and click "
"the :guilabel:`Attributes \\& Variants` tab."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled in spreminjanje atributov in variant katerega koli izdelka izberite "
"želeni izdelek na strani :guilabel:`Izdelki` in kliknite "
"zavihek :guilabel:`Atributi in variante`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:227
msgid ""
"A furniture company wants to import their existing product list into Odoo "
"**Sales** app. Several of the company's products have different variations:"
msgstr ""
"Podjetje za pohištvo želi uvoziti svoj obstoječi seznam izdelkov v "
"aplikacijo Odoo **Sales**. Več izdelkov podjetja ima različne variacije:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:230
msgid "Customizable Desk"
msgstr "Prilagodljiva miza"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:232
msgid "Color: White, Black"
msgstr "Barva: bela, črna"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:233
msgid "Legs: Wood, Steel"
msgstr "Noge: les, jeklo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:234
msgid "Stool"
msgstr "Stol"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:236
msgid "Color: Green, Navy"
msgstr "Barva: zelena, temno modra"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:237
msgid "Seat: Leather, Wood"
msgstr "Sedež: usnje, les"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:239
msgid ""
"In the template, the Customizable desk and Stool are in the :guilabel:`Name` "
"column with Color, Legs, and Seat in the :guilabel:`Product Attribute/"
"Attribute` column. White, black, wood, steel, and leather are all in "
"the :guilabel:`Product Attribute/Value` column."
msgstr ""
"V predlogi sta miza in stol, ki ju je mogoče prilagoditi, v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Ime`, barva, noge in sedež pa so v "
"stolpcu :guilabel:`Atribut izdelka/Atribut`. Bela, črna, les, jeklo in usnje "
"so vsi v stolpcu :guilabel:`Atribut izdelka/Vrednost`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:243
msgid "Example of a product variant type import spreadsheet."
msgstr "Primer preglednice za uvoz različic izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:247
msgid "Importing products and product variants from files"
msgstr "Uvoz izdelkov in variant izdelkov iz datotek"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:249
msgid ""
"Files with product information can be imported from both the Product menu "
"and the Product Variants menu. By default, Odoo splits large files into "
"batches of 2,000 rows. For variant imports, all variants of the same "
"template must be imported in the same batch. To ensure that no products are "
"missed, set the import batch size to a greater amount than the number of "
"products to import."
msgstr ""
"Datoteke z informacijami o izdelkih je mogoče uvoziti iz menija Izdelki in "
"menija Variante izdelkov. Privzeto Odoo razdeli velike datoteke v serije po "
"2.000 vrstic. Pri uvozu variant je treba vse variante iste predloge uvoziti "
"v isti seriji. Da zagotovite, da noben izdelek ni izpuščen, nastavite "
"velikost serije uvoza na večjo številko od števila izdelkov, ki jih želite "
"uvoziti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/import.rst:255
msgid ":doc:`variants`"
msgstr ":doc:`variants`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:5
msgid ""
"Product variants are used to give single products a variety of different "
"characteristics and options for customers to choose from, such as size, "
"style, or color, just to name a few."
msgstr ""
"Različice izdelkov se uporabljajo za zagotavljanje posameznim izdelkom "
"različnih značilnosti in možnosti, med katerimi lahko stranke izbirajo, kot "
"so velikost, slog ali barva, da navedemo le nekaj primerov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:8
msgid ""
"Product variants can be managed by navigating to :menuselection:`Sales app --"
"> Products --> Products`, clicking a product with variants, and clicking "
"the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart button."
msgstr ""
"Različice izdelkov lahko upravljate tako, da se pomaknete na "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija Prodaja --> Izdelki --> Izdelki`, kliknete "
"izdelek z različicami in kliknete pametni gumb :icon:`fa-sitemap` "
":guilabel:`Različice`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:13
msgid ""
"An apparel company has the following variant breakdown for one of its best-"
"selling t-shirts:"
msgstr ""
"Podjetje za oblačila ima naslednji razčlen različic za eno od svojih "
"najbolje prodajanih majic:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:15
msgid "Unisex Classic Tee"
msgstr "Unisex klasična majica"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:17
msgid "Color: Blue, Red, White, Black"
msgstr "Barva: modra, rdeča, bela, črna"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:18
msgid "Size: S, M, L, XL, XXL"
msgstr "Velikost: S, M, L, XL, XXL"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:20
msgid ""
"Here, the **T-shirt** is the product template, and **T-shirt: Blue, S** is a "
"specific product variant."
msgstr ""
"Tukaj je **majica** predloga izdelka, **Majica: modra, S** pa je določena "
"različica izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Color** and **Size** are *attributes*, and the corresponding options (like "
"**Blue** and **S**) are *values*."
msgstr ""
"**Barva** in **Velikost** sta *atributa*, ustrezne možnosti (kot sta "
"**Modra** in **S**) pa so *vrednosti*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:26
msgid ""
"In this instance, there is a total of twenty different product variants: "
"four **Color** options multiplied by five **Size** options. Each variant has "
"its own inventory count, sales totals, and other similar records in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"V tem primeru je skupno dvajset različnih različic izdelkov: štiri možnosti "
"**barve** pomnožene s petimi možnostmi **velikosti**. Vsaka različica ima "
"svoj števec zalog, skupne prodaje in druge podobne zapise v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:31
msgid ""
":ref:`Product variants in the eCommerce <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"product-variants>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Različice izdelkov v e-trgovini <ecommerce/categories_variants/product-"
"variants>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:38
msgid ""
"To use product variants, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --"
"> Settings`, then enable the :guilabel:`Variants` feature in the *Product "
"Catalog* section, and click :guilabel:`Save` at the top of "
"the :guilabel:`Settings` page."
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo različic izdelkov pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Prodaja --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`, nato v razdelku *Katalog "
"izdelkov* omogočite funkcijo :guilabel:`Različice` ter kliknite "
":guilabel:`Shrani` na vrhu strani :guilabel:`Nastavitve`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:45
msgid "Attributes"
msgstr "Lastnosti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:47
msgid ""
"Before product variants can be set up, attributes **must** be created. To "
"create, manage, and modify attributes, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app "
"--> Products --> Attributes`."
msgstr ""
"Pred nastavitvijo različic izdelkov je **treba** ustvariti lastnosti. Za "
"ustvarjanje, upravljanje in spreminjanje lastnosti pojdite na "
":menuselection:`Aplikacija Prodaja --> Izdelki --> Lastnosti`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:51
msgid ""
"The order of attributes on the :guilabel:`Attributes` page dictates how they "
"appear on the *Product Configurator*, *Point of Sale* dashboard, and "
"*eCommerce* pages."
msgstr ""
"Vrstni red atributov na strani :guilabel:`Atributi` določa, kako se "
"prikazujejo v *Konfiguratorju izdelkov*, nadzorni plošči *Prodajne točke* in "
"straneh *eSpodbude*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:54
msgid ""
"To create a new attribute from the :guilabel:`Attributes` page, "
"click :guilabel:`New`. Doing so reveals a blank attributes form that can be "
"customized and configured in a number of ways."
msgstr ""
"Če želite ustvariti nov atribut na strani :guilabel:`Atributi`, "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`. S tem se prikaže prazen obrazec atributov, ki ga "
"je mogoče prilagoditi in konfigurirati na več načinov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:57
msgid "A blank attribute creation form in the Odoo Sales application."
msgstr "Prazen obrazec za ustvarjanje atributa v aplikaciji Odoo Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:60
msgid "First, create an :guilabel:`Attribute Name`, such as `Color` or `Size`."
msgstr ""
"Najprej ustvarite :guilabel:`Ime atributa`, na primer `Barva` ali `Velikost`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:62
msgid ""
"Next, select one of the options from the :guilabel:`Display Type` field. "
"The :guilabel:`Display Type` determines how this product is shown on the "
"online store, *Point of Sale* dashboard, and *Product Configurator*."
msgstr ""
"Nato izberite eno od možnosti iz polja :guilabel:`Vrsta "
"prikaza`. :guilabel:`Vrsta prikaza` določa, kako se ta izdelek prikaže v "
"spletni trgovini, nadzorni plošči *Prodajne točke* in *Konfiguratorju "
"izdelkov*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:66
msgid "The following :guilabel:`Display Type` options are available:"
msgstr "Na voljo so naslednje možnosti :guilabel:`Vrsta prikaza`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:70
msgid "Radio"
msgstr "Radio gumbi"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:72
msgid "Options appear as radio buttons."
msgstr "Možnosti se prikažejo kot izbirni gumbi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:74
msgid "Radio display type"
msgstr "Vrsta prikaza radio gumbov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:77
msgid "Pills"
msgstr "Tablete"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:79
msgid "Options appear as selectable buttons."
msgstr "Možnosti se prikažejo kot gumbi, ki jih je mogoče izbrati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:81
msgid "Pills display type"
msgstr "Vrsta prikaza tabletek"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:84
msgid "Select"
msgstr "Izbira"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:86
msgid "Options appear in a drop-down menu."
msgstr "Možnosti se prikažejo v spustnem meniju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:88
msgid "Select display type"
msgstr "Vrsta prikaza izbire"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:91
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Barva"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:93
msgid ""
"Options appear as small, colored circles; the colors can be defined using "
"any HTML color code."
msgstr ""
"Možnosti se prikažejo kot majhni barvni krogi; barve je mogoče določiti z "
"uporabo katere koli kode barv HTML."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:95
msgid "Color display type"
msgstr "Vrsta prikaza barve"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:98
msgid "Multi-checkbox"
msgstr "Večkratno označevanje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:100
msgid ""
"Options appear as selectable checkboxes. This allows customers to choose "
"multiple options, e.g., to add extras to food orders or highly customizable "
"products."
msgstr ""
"Možnosti se prikažejo kot potrditvena polja, ki jih je mogoče izbrati. To "
"kupcem omogoča izbiro več možnosti, npr. dodajanje dodatkov k naročilom "
"hrane ali zelo prilagodljivim izdelkom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:103
msgid "Multi-checkbox display type"
msgstr "Vrsta prikaza večkratnega označevanja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:106
msgid "Image"
msgstr "Slika"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:108
msgid "Options appear as images."
msgstr "Možnosti se prikažejo kot slike."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:110
msgid "Image display type"
msgstr "Vrsta prikaza slike"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:113
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Variant Creation` field determines when new variants are "
"automatically created once an attribute is added to a product. Once added to "
"a product, an attribute's :guilabel:`Variant Creation` mode cannot be edited."
msgstr ""
"Polje :guilabel:`Ustvarjanje različic` določa, kdaj se nove različice "
"samodejno ustvarijo, ko je lastnost dodana izdelku. Ko je lastnost enkrat "
"dodana izdelku, njenega načina :guilabel:`Ustvarjanje različic` ni več "
"mogoče urejati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:117
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Instantly`: Creates all possible variants as soon as attributes "
"and values are added to a product template."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Takoj`: Ustvari vse možne variante takoj, ko so atributi in "
"vrednosti dodani predlogi izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dynamically`: Creates variants **only** when corresponding "
"attributes and values are added to a sales order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dinamično`: Ustvari variante **samo**, ko so ustrezni atributi in "
"vrednosti dodani prodajnemu nalogu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:121
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Never`: Prevents the automatic creation of purchaseable variants "
"with this tag. Instead, this tag is treated as being informational. If more "
"than one value is assigned to an attribute with this tag, all values are "
"loaded when the product displays, since the creation of"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nikoli`: preprečuje samodejno ustvarjanje različic za nakup s to "
"oznako. Namesto tega se ta oznaka obravnava kot informativna. Če je "
"lastnosti s to oznako dodeljenih več vrednosti, se ob prikazu izdelka "
"naložijo vse vrednosti, saj ustvarjanje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:124
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Never`: Prevents the automatic creation of purchasable variants "
"with this tag. Instead, this tag is treated as being informational. If more "
"than one value is assigned to an attribute with this tag, all values are "
"loaded when the product displays, since the creation of discrete variants is "
"prevented."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nikoli`: Preprečuje samodejno ustvarjanje različic za nakup s to "
"oznako. Namesto tega se ta oznaka obravnava kot informativna. Če je atributu "
"s to oznako dodeljenih več vrednosti, se ob prikazu izdelka naložijo vse "
"vrednosti, saj je ustvarjanje posameznih različic preprečeno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:130
msgid ""
"If the attribute's :guilabel:`Display Type` is :guilabel:`Multi-checkbox`, "
"you **must** set the :guilabel:`Variant Creation` field to :guilabel:`Never`."
msgstr ""
"Če je :guilabel:`Vrsta prikaza` atributa :guilabel:`Večkratno potrditveno "
"polje`, **morate** polje :guilabel:`Ustvarjanje različic` nastaviti "
"na :guilabel:`Nikoli`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:133
msgid ""
"In the *eCommerce* tab, "
"the :guilabel:`Category`, :guilabel:`Filter`, :guilabel:`On Product Cards`, "
"and :guilabel:`Show Thumbnails` fields can be found."
msgstr ""
"V zavihku *Spletna trgovina* se nahajajo polja :guilabel:`Kategorija`, "
":guilabel:`Filter`, :guilabel:`Na karticah izdelkov` in :guilabel:`Prikaži "
"sličice`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Category`: Sets the category to regroup similar attributes under "
"for comparison purposes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kategorija`: Določa kategorijo, v katero se združijo podobni "
"atributi za namene primerjave."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:138
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Filter`: Determines whether these attribute options are visible "
"to customers as they shop online."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Filter`: Določa, ali so te možnosti atributa vidne strankam pri "
"spletnem nakupovanju."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:140
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On Product Cards`: Makes variants available for selection from "
"the shop's pages. This option is only available if :guilabel:`Variant "
"Creation` is set to *Instantly*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Na karticah izdelkov`: Omogoča izbiro različic na straneh "
"trgovine. Ta možnost je na voljo le, če je :guilabel:`Ustvarjanje različic` "
"nastavljeno na *Takoj*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:142
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Show Thumbnails`: Uses product variant images in place of the "
"attribute value text. This option is only available if :guilabel:`Variant "
"Creation` is set to *Instantly*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prikaži sličice`: Namesto besedila vrednosti atributa uporabi "
"slike različice izdelka. Ta možnost je na voljo le, če je "
":guilabel:`Ustvarjanje različic` nastavljeno na *Takoj*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:145
msgid ""
"To view the details related to the selected attribute category, click the "
"category's list entry."
msgstr ""
"Če si želite ogledati podrobnosti o izbrani kategoriji atributov, kliknite "
"vnos kategorije na seznamu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:147
msgid ""
"A standard attribute category detail page accessible via its internal link "
"arrow icon."
msgstr ""
"Standardna stran s podrobnostmi kategorije atributa, dostopna prek ikone "
"puščice notranje povezave."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:150
msgid ""
"Here, the :guilabel:`Category Name` and :guilabel:`Sequence` are displayed "
"at the top, followed by :guilabel:`Related Attributes` associated with the "
"category. These attributes can be dragged and dropped into a desired "
"priority order."
msgstr ""
"Tukaj sta na vrhu prikazana :guilabel:`Ime kategorije` in "
":guilabel:`Zaporedje`. Sledi :guilabel:`Povezani atributi`, povezani s "
"kategorijo. Te atribute lahko povlečete in spustite v želeni prednostni "
"vrstni red."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:154
msgid ""
"Attributes can be directly added to the category, as well, by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`."
msgstr ""
"Atribute lahko kategoriji dodate tudi neposredno s klikom "
"na :guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:157
msgid ""
"To create an attribute category directly from this field, start typing the "
"name of the new category, then select either :guilabel:`Create` "
"or :guilabel:`Create and edit...` from the drop-down menu that appears."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje kategorije atributa neposredno iz tega polja začnite vnašati "
"ime nove kategorije in nato v spustnem meniju, ki se prikaže, "
"izberite :guilabel:`Ustvari` ali :guilabel:`Ustvari in uredi...`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:161
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Create` creates the category, which can be modified "
"later. Clicking :guilabel:`Create and edit...` creates the category and "
"reveals a :guilabel:`Create Category` pop-up window, in which the new "
"attribute category can be configured and customized."
msgstr ""
"Klik na :guilabel:`Ustvari` ustvari kategorijo, ki jo je mogoče pozneje "
"spremeniti. Klik na :guilabel:`Ustvari in uredi...` ustvari kategorijo in "
"odpre pojavno okno :guilabel:`Ustvari kategorijo`, v katerem je mogoče novo "
"kategorijo atributa konfigurirati in prilagoditi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:168
msgid "Attribute values"
msgstr "Vrednosti atributov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:170
msgid ""
"Attribute values should be added in the *Attribute Values* tab. Values can "
"be added to an attribute at any time. To add a value, click :guilabel:`Add a "
"line` and enter the name of the value in the :guilabel:`Value` column."
msgstr ""
"Vrednosti atributov dodate v zavihku *Vrednosti atributov*. Vrednosti lahko "
"atributu dodate kadar koli. Če želite dodati vrednost, kliknite "
":guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico` in v stolpec :guilabel:`Vrednost` vnesite naziv "
"vrednosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:179
msgid ""
"Once an attribute is created, use the attribute (and its values) to create a "
"product variant. To do that, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --"
"> Products`, and select an existing product to view that desired product's "
"form. Or, click :guilabel:`Create` to create a new product, to which a "
"product variant can be added."
msgstr ""
"Ko je atribut ustvarjen, uporabite atribut (in njegove vrednosti) za "
"ustvarjanje variante izdelka. Če želite to narediti, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Prodaja --> Izdelki --> Izdelki` in izberite "
"obstoječi izdelek za ogled obrazca želenega izdelka. Ali pa "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Ustvari`, da ustvarite nov izdelek, kateremu lahko "
"dodate varianto izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:184
msgid ""
"On the product form, click the *Attributes \\& Variants* tab to view, "
"manage, and modify attributes and values for the product."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu izdelka kliknite zavihek *Atributi in različice*, da si ogledate, "
"upravljate in spreminjate atribute ter vrednosti za izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:187
msgid "The attributes and values tab on a typical product form in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Zavihek z atributi in vrednostmi na tipičnem obrazcu izdelka v Odoo Prodaji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:190
msgid ""
"To add an attribute to a product and subsequent attribute values, "
"click :guilabel:`Add a line` in the *Attributes \\& Variants* tab. Then, "
"choose the desired attribute from the drop-down menu that appears."
msgstr ""
"Za dodajanje atributa izdelku in posledičnih vrednosti atributa kliknite "
":guilabel:`Dodaj vrstico` v zavihku :guilabel:`Atributi in variante`. Nato "
"iz spustnega menija, ki se prikaže, izberite želeni atribut."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:195
msgid ""
"Attributes can be created directly from the *Attributes \\& Variants* tab of "
"a product form. To do that, start typing the name of the new attribute in "
"the blank field, and select either :guilabel:`Create` or :guilabel:`Create "
"and edit...` from the mini drop-down menu that appears."
msgstr ""
"Atribute lahko ustvarite neposredno iz zavihka :guilabel:`Atributi in "
"variante` na obrazcu izdelka. Če želite to narediti, začnite vnašati ime "
"novega atributa v prazno polje in izberite bodisi :guilabel:`Ustvari` bodisi "
":guilabel:`Ustvari in uredi...` iz mini spustnega menija, ki se prikaže."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:199
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Create` creates the attribute, which can be customized "
"later. Clicking :guilabel:`Create and edit...` creates the attribute, and "
"a :guilabel:`Create Attribute` pop-up form appears. In the pop-up form, "
"proceed to modify the attribute in a number of ways."
msgstr ""
"Klik na :guilabel:`Ustvari` ustvari atribut, ki ga je mogoče pozneje "
"prilagoditi. Klik na :guilabel:`Ustvari in uredi...` ustvari atribut in "
"prikaže se pojavni obrazec :guilabel:`Ustvari atribut`. V pojavnem obrazcu "
"nadaljujte s spreminjanjem atributa na več načinov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:203
msgid ""
"Once an attribute is selected in the :guilabel:`Attribute` column, proceed "
"to select the specific attribute values to apply to the product, via the "
"drop-down menu available in the :guilabel:`Values` column."
msgstr ""
"Ko je atribut izbran v stolpcu :guilabel:`Atribut`, nadaljujte z izbiro "
"specifičnih vrednosti atributov, ki jih želite uporabiti za izdelek, prek "
"spustnega menija, ki je na voljo v stolpcu :guilabel:`Vrednosti`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:208
msgid "There is no limit to how many values can be added."
msgstr "Ni omejitve, koliko vrednosti je mogoče dodati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:211
msgid ""
"Similar product variant creation processes are accessible through the "
"Purchase, Inventory, and Similar product variant creation processes are "
"accessible through the **Purchase**, **Inventory**, and **eCommerce** "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"Podobni postopki ustvarjanja različic izdelkov so dostopni prek Nabava, "
"Zaloga in Podobni postopki ustvarjanja različic izdelkov so dostopni prek "
"aplikacij **Nabava**, **Zaloga** in **Spletna trgovina**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:218
msgid "Configure variants"
msgstr "Konfiguracija različic"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:220
msgid ""
"On the attribute line is a :guilabel:`Configure` button. When clicked, Odoo "
"opens a separate page with that product's specific product "
"variant :guilabel:`Values`. The layout of this page may differ slightly from "
"what is pictured based on the apps, modules, and prior configurations of the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"V vrstici atributa je gumb :guilabel:`Konfiguriraj`. Ob kliku nanj Odoo "
"odpre ločeno stran z :guilabel:`Vrednosti` različic tega izdelka. Postavitev "
"te strani se lahko nekoliko razlikuje od prikazane, odvisno od aplikacij, "
"modulov in predhodnih nastavitev baze podatkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:227
msgid "Variants smart button"
msgstr "Pametni gumb Različice"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:229
msgid ""
"When a product has attributes and variants configured in its *Attributes \\& "
"Variants* tab, a :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart button "
"appears at the top of its product form. The :icon:`fa-"
"sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart button indicates how many variants are "
"currently configured for that specific product. Using the smart button is "
"the primary way to access variants for products."
msgstr ""
"Ko ima izdelek v zavihku *Atributi in različice* konfigurirane atribute in "
"različice, se na vrhu njegovega obrazca izdelka prikaže pametni gumb "
":icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Različice`. Pametni gumb :icon:`fa-sitemap` "
":guilabel:`Različice` prikazuje, koliko različic je trenutno konfiguriranih "
"za ta določen izdelek. Uporaba pametnega gumba je glavni način za dostop do "
"različic izdelkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:235
msgid "The variants smart button at the top of the product form in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Pametni gumb različic na vrhu obrazca izdelka v Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:238
msgid ""
"When the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart button is clicked, "
"Odoo reveals a separate page showcasing all the specific product variant "
"combinations configured for that specific product."
msgstr ""
"Ob kliku na pametni gumb :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Različice` Odoo "
"prikaže ločeno stran z vsemi kombinacijami različic izdelka, konfiguriranimi "
"za ta določen izdelek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:241
msgid ""
"The variants page accessible via the variants smart button on the product "
"form in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Stran z različicami, dostopna prek pametnega gumba različic na obrazcu "
"izdelka v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:245
msgid "Impact of variants"
msgstr "Vpliv različic"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:247
msgid ""
"In addition to offering more detailed product options to customers, product "
"variants have their own impacts that can be taken advantage of throughout "
"the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Poleg ponujanja podrobnejših možnosti izdelkov strankam imajo različice "
"izdelkov svoje vplive, ki jih je mogoče izkoristiti v celotni bazi podatkov "
"Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:250
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Barcode`: barcodes are associated with each variant, instead of "
"the product template. Each individual variant can have its own unique "
"barcode/SKU."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Črtna koda`: črtne kode so povezane z vsako različico, ne s "
"predlogo izdelka. Vsaka posamezna različica ima lahko svojo edinstveno črtno "
"kodo/SKU."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:252
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Price`: every product variant has its own public price, which is "
"the sum of the product template price *and* any extra charges for particular "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cena`: vsaka različica izdelka ima svojo javno ceno, ki je vsota "
"cene predloge izdelka *in* morebitnih dodatnih stroškov za določene atribute."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:256
msgid ""
"A red shirt's sales price is $23 -- because the shirt's template price is "
"$20, plus an additional $3 for the red color variant. Pricelist rules can be "
"configured to apply to the product template. A red shirt's sales price is "
"$23 -- because the shirt's template price is $20, plus an additional $3 for "
"the red color variant. Pricelist rules can be configured to apply to the "
"product template or to the variant."
msgstr ""
"Prodajna cena rdeče srajce je 23 $ -- ker je cena predloge srajce 20 $, plus "
"dodatni 3 $ za rdečo barvno različico. Pravila cenika je mogoče "
"konfigurirati tako, da veljajo za predlogo izdelka. Prodajna cena rdeče "
"srajce je 23 $ -- ker je cena predloge srajce 20 $, plus dodatni 3 $ za "
"rdečo barvno različico. Pravila cenika je mogoče konfigurirati tako, da "
"veljajo za predlogo izdelka ali za različico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:262
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Inventory`: Inventory is counted for each individual product "
"variant. On the product template form, the inventory reflects the sum of all "
"variants, but the actual inventory is computed by individual variants."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Zaloga`: Zaloga se šteje za vsako posamezno varianto izdelka. Na "
"obrazcu predloge izdelka zaloga odraža vsoto vseh variant, toda dejanska "
"zaloga se izračuna po posameznih variantah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:265
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manufacturing`: a single BoM can be used for multiple variants of "
"the same product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Proizvodnja`: en sam kosovnik se lahko uporablja za več variant "
"istega izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:266
msgid ""
"Refer to :doc:`../../../../inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/"
"advanced_configuration/product_variants` documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Za več informacij glejte dokumentacijo :doc:`../../../../inventory_and_mrp/"
"manufacturing/advanced_configuration/product_variants`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:269
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Picture`: each product variant can have its own specific picture."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Slika`: vsaka različica izdelka ima lahko svojo posebno sliko."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:272
msgid ""
"Changes to the product template automatically apply to every variant of that "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Spremembe predloge izdelka se samodejno uporabijo za vsako različico tega "
"izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:275
msgid "Adding and deleting attributes from product variants"
msgstr "Dodajanje in brisanje atributov iz različic izdelkov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:277
msgid ""
"When attributes are added or deleted from products, variants that have "
"already been created are affected. Depending on whether or not these "
"variants have been used in orders, they are archived or deleted and "
"recreated."
msgstr ""
"Ko so atributi dodani ali izbrisani iz izdelkov, to vpliva na različice, ki "
"so že bile ustvarjene. Glede na to, ali so bile te različice uporabljene v "
"nalogih ali ne, se arhivirajo ali izbrišejo in ponovno ustvarijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:281
msgid ""
"Variants that have not been used in an order are deleted and recreated with "
"the new attributes. This may result in the deletion of additional "
"customizations, depending on how the variants were configured."
msgstr ""
"Variante, ki niso bile uporabljene v naročilu, se izbrišejo in ponovno "
"ustvarijo z novimi atributi. To lahko privede do brisanja dodatnih "
"prilagoditev, odvisno od tega, kako so bile variante konfigurirane."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:284
msgid ""
"Variants that have been previously used in one or more orders are archived "
"and removed from the product catalog instead of being deleted."
msgstr ""
"Variante, ki so bile predhodno uporabljene v enem ali več naročilih, se "
"arhivirajo in odstranijo iz kataloga izdelkov namesto brisanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:288
msgid ""
"A business offers leather motorcycle jackets with the following attributes "
"and values for a total of 27 product variants:"
msgstr ""
"Podjetje ponuja usnjene motoristične jakne z naslednjimi atributi in "
"vrednostmi za skupno 27 variant izdelka:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:291
msgid "Size: Small, Medium, Large"
msgstr "Velikost: Majhna, Srednja, Velika"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:292
msgid "Color: Black, Brown, Natural"
msgstr "Barva: Črna, Rjava, Naravna"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:293
msgid "Material: Leather, Vegan Leather, Premium Leather"
msgstr "Material: Usnje, Veganski usnje, Vrhunsko usnje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:295
msgid ""
"Due to rising costs, the business makes the decision to stop offering "
"different leathers and removes the \"Material\" attribute from the product "
"form. This has the following effects:"
msgstr ""
"Zaradi naraščajočih stroškov se podjetje odloči, da ne bo več ponujalo "
"različnih vrst usnja in odstrani atribut \"Material\" iz obrazca izdelka. To "
"ima naslednje posledice:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:298
msgid "Any leather jacket variants that have been sold will be archived"
msgstr "Vse variante usnjenih jakn, ki so bile prodane, bodo arhivirane"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:299
msgid "Any leather jacket variants that have not been sold will be deleted"
msgstr "Vse variante usnjenih jakn, ki niso bile prodane, bodo izbrisane"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:300
msgid ""
"A new set of variants using just Size and Color attributes will be created, "
"for a total of 9 product variants"
msgstr ""
"Ustvarjen bo nov nabor variant, ki uporablja samo atributa Velikost in "
"Barva, za skupno 9 variant izdelka"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:303
msgid ""
"The business owner can find archived product variants by navigating to the "
"product's form, clicking the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart "
"button, clicking the drop-down in the search bar, and finally clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Archived` tag in the :icon:`fa-filter`. The business owner "
"can find archived product variants by navigating to the product's form and "
"clicking the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart button. On the "
"*Variants* page, click the drop-down in the search bar, then click "
"the :guilabel:`Archived` tag in the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Variants`. "
"Any deleted variants and their customizations will be lost."
msgstr ""
"Lastnik podjetja lahko najde arhivirane različice izdelkov tako, da odpre "
"obrazec izdelka, klikne pametni gumb :icon:`fa-sitemap` "
":guilabel:`Različice`, klikne spustni meni v iskalni vrstici in nazadnje "
"klikne oznako :guilabel:`Arhivirano` v :icon:`fa-filter`. Lastnik podjetja "
"lahko najde arhivirane različice izdelkov tako, da odpre obrazec izdelka in "
"klikne pametni gumb :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Različice`. Na strani "
"*Različice* kliknite spustni meni v iskalni vrstici, nato pa kliknite oznako "
":guilabel:`Arhivirano` v :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Različice`. Vse "
"izbrisane različice in njihove prilagoditve bodo izgubljene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants.rst:312
msgid ":doc:`import`"
msgstr ":doc:`import`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:3
msgid "Returns and refunds"
msgstr "Vračila in povračila"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Odoo *Sales* app provides two different ways to process returns. The "
"method used depends on whether or not an invoice has been sent."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija Odoo *Prodaja* ponuja dva različna načina obdelave vračil. "
"Uporabljena metoda je odvisna od tega, ali je bil račun že izdan ali ne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:11
msgid "Before invoicing"
msgstr "Pred izdajo računa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:13
msgid ""
"Returns are completed using *Reverse Transfers* when a customer decides to "
"return a product **before** an invoice has been sent or validated."
msgstr ""
"Vračila se obdelajo z uporabo *Povratnih prenosov*, ko se stranke odločijo "
"vrniti izdelek **preden** je bil račun izdan ali potrjen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:17
msgid ""
"In order to use *Reverse Transfers*, the *Inventory* app **must** be "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo *Povratnih prenosov* **mora** biti nameščena aplikacija *Zaloga*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:19
msgid ""
"To start a return before invoicing, navigate to the :menuselection:`Sales` "
"app, select the desired sales order, and click on the :guilabel:`Delivery` "
"smart button to open the associated delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Za začetek vračila pred izdajo računa odprite "
"aplikacijo :menuselection:`Prodaja`, izberite želeni prodajni nalog in "
"kliknite pametno tipko :guilabel:`Dostava`, da odprete povezan dobavni nalog."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:23
msgid ""
"A typical sales order with a highlighted delivery smart button in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Tipičen prodajni nalog s poudarjeno pametno tipko dostave v aplikaciji Odoo "
"Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:27
msgid "On the validated delivery order, click :guilabel:`Return`."
msgstr "Na potrjenem dobavnem nalogu kliknite :guilabel:`Vračilo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:29
msgid ""
"A validated delivery order with a highlighted Return button in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Potrjen dobavni nalog s poudarjeno tipko Vračilo v aplikaciji Odoo Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:33
msgid "This opens a :guilabel:`Reverse Transfer` pop-up window."
msgstr "To odpre pojavno okno :guilabel:`Povratni prenos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:35
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Quantity` matches the validated quantities from "
"the delivery order. Update the quantities, if necessary. Click on "
"the :guilabel:`🗑️ (trash)` icon next to a line item to remove it from the "
"return."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto se :guilabel:`Količina` ujema s potrjenimi količinami iz dobavnega "
"naloga. Po potrebi posodobite količine. Kliknite ikono :guilabel:`🗑️ (koš)` "
"poleg postavke, da jo odstranite iz vračila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:39
msgid ""
"The \"Reverse Transfer\" pop-up window, to make a return before invoicing "
"the customer."
msgstr ""
"Pojavno okno \"Povratni prenos\" za vračilo pred izdajo računa stranki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:43
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Return` to confirm the return. This generates a new "
"warehouse operation for the incoming returned product(s)."
msgstr ""
"Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Vračilo`, da potrdite vračilo. To ustvari novo "
"skladiščno operacijo za dohodni vračeni izdelek(e)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:46
msgid "Warehouse operation after a return has been confirmed in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Skladiščna operacija po potrditvi vračila v aplikaciji Odoo Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:50
msgid ""
"Upon receiving the return, the warehouse team validates the warehouse "
"operation by clicking :guilabel:`Validate`. Then, on the original sales "
"order, the :guilabel:`Delivered` quantity updates to reflect the difference "
"between the initial validated quantities and the returned quantities."
msgstr ""
"Po prejemu vračila skladiščna ekipa potrdi skladiščno operacijo s klikom "
"na :guilabel:`Potrdi`. Nato se na prvotnem prodajnem nalogu "
"količina :guilabel:`Dostavljeno` posodobi tako, da odraža razliko med "
"začetnimi potrjenimi količinami in vracanimi količinami."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:54
msgid ""
"The updated \"Delivered\" quantity on the sales order after the reverse "
"transfer."
msgstr ""
"Posodobljena količina \"Dostavljeno\" na prodajnem nalogu po povratnem "
"prenosu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:58
msgid ""
"When an invoice is created, the customer receives an invoice **only** for "
"the products they are keeping, if any."
msgstr ""
"Ko je račun ustvarjen, stranka prejme račun **samo** za izdelke, ki jih "
"obdrži, če sploh."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:64
msgid "After invoicing"
msgstr "Po izdaji računa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:66
msgid ""
"Sometimes, customers return an item after they receive and/or pay for their "
"invoice. In these cases, a return using only *Reverse Transfers* is "
"insufficient since validated, or sent, invoices cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
"Včasih stranke vrnejo izdelek po prejemu in/ali plačilu računa. V teh "
"primerih je vračilo z uporabo samo *Storniranja dobave* nezadostno, saj "
"potrjenih ali poslanih računov ni mogoče spremeniti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:70
msgid ""
"However, *Reverse Transfers* can be used in conjunction with *Credit Notes* "
"to complete the customer's return."
msgstr ""
"Vendar pa je mogoče *Storniranje dobave* uporabiti skupaj z *Dobropisi* za "
"dokončanje vračila stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:73
msgid ""
"To start a return after invoicing, navigate to the relevant sales order in "
"the :menuselection:`Sales` app."
msgstr ""
"Če želite začeti vračilo po izdaji računa, pojdite na ustrezen prodajni "
"nalog v aplikaciji :menuselection:`Prodaja`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:76
msgid ""
"If there is a payment registered on the sales order, the payment details "
"appear in the chatter, and the invoice (accessible through "
"the :guilabel:`Invoices` smart button) has a green :guilabel:`In Payment` "
"banner."
msgstr ""
"Če je na prodajnem nalogu zabeleženo plačilo, se podrobnosti plačila "
"prikažejo v pogovornem oknu, na računu (dostopen prek pametnega "
"gumba :guilabel:`Računi`) pa se prikaže zelen napis :guilabel:`V plačilu`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:80
msgid "Sample of a green in payment banner in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Vzorec zelenega napisa V plačilu v Odoo Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:84
msgid ""
"From the sales order, click on the :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button to view "
"the validated delivery order. Then, click :guilabel:`Return` to open "
"the :guilabel:`Reverse Transfer` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Iz prodajnega naloga kliknite pametni gumb :guilabel:`Dobava`, da si "
"ogledate potrjeno dobavnico. Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Vrni`, da odprete "
"pojavno okno :guilabel:`Storniraj prenos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:87
msgid ""
"Next, edit the :guilabel:`Product` and/or :guilabel:`Quantity`, as needed "
"for the return. Then, click :guilabel:`Return`. This generates a new "
"warehouse operation for the incoming returned product(s), which is validated "
"by the warehouse team once the return is received by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Validate`."
msgstr ""
"Nato po potrebi uredite :guilabel:`Izdelek` in/ali :guilabel:`Količina` za "
"vračilo. Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Vrni`. To ustvari novo skladiščno "
"operacijo za dohodne vrnjene izdelke, ki jo skladiščna ekipa potrdi, ko "
"prejme vračilo, s klikom na :guilabel:`Potrdi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:92
msgid ""
"Then, on the sales order, the :guilabel:`Delivered` quantity updates to "
"reflect the difference between the initial validated quantities and the "
"returned quantities."
msgstr ""
"Nato se na prodajnem nalogu količina :guilabel:`Dobavljeno` posodobi, da "
"odraža razliko med začetnimi potrjenimi količinami in vrnjenimi količinami."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:95
msgid ""
"To process a refund, navigate to the relevant invoice (from the sales order, "
"click on the :guilabel:`Invoices` smart button). Then, click "
"the :guilabel:`Credit Note` button at the top of the validated invoice."
msgstr ""
"Če želite obdelati povračilo, pojdite na ustrezen račun (iz prodajnega "
"naloga kliknite na pametni gumb :guilabel:`Računi`). Nato kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Dobropis` na vrhu potrjenega računa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:99
msgid ""
"A typical customer invoice with a Credit Note button highlighted in Odoo "
"Sales."
msgstr "Tipičen račun stranke s poudarjenim gumbom Dobropis v Odoo Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:103
msgid "Doing so reveals a :guilabel:`Credit Note` pop-up form."
msgstr "S tem se prikaže obrazec :guilabel:`Dobropis`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:105
msgid "Typical credit note pop-up form that appears in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Tipičen obrazec dobropisa, ki se prikaže v Odoo Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:109
msgid ""
"Start by entering a :guilabel:`Reason displayed on Credit Note` and a "
"specific :guilabel:`Journal` to process the credit. Then, select a "
"specific :guilabel:`Reversal Date`."
msgstr ""
"Začnite z vnosom :guilabel:`Razlog prikazan na dobropisu` in "
"posebnega :guilabel:`Dnevnika` za obdelavo dobropisa. Nato izberite "
"določen :guilabel:`Datum storniranja`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:112
msgid ""
"After the information is filled in, click :guilabel:`Reverse` "
"or :guilabel:`Reverse and Create Invoice`. Then, edit the draft, if needed."
msgstr ""
"Ko so podatki izpolnjeni, kliknite :guilabel:`Storniraj` "
"ali :guilabel:`Storniraj in ustvari račun`. Nato po potrebi uredite osnutek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:115
msgid "Lastly, click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the credit note."
msgstr "Na koncu kliknite :guilabel:`Potrdi`, da potrdite dobropis."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:117
msgid ""
"When complete, a blue banner reading: :guilabel:`You have outstanding "
"credits for this customer. You can allocate them to mark this invoice as "
"paid.` appears at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Ko je končano, se na vrhu strani prikaže moder napis: :guilabel:`Za to "
"stranko imate neporabljene dobropise. Lahko jih dodelite, da označite ta "
"račun kot plačan`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:121
msgid ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns.rst:122
msgid ""
":ref:`Handling returns through the customer portal <ecommerce/handling/"
"returns>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Obravnava vračil prek portala za stranke <ecommerce/handling/returns>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:6
msgid "Sales quotations"
msgstr "Prodajne ponudbe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:8
msgid ""
"A *sales quotation* or quote is a document sent to a customer that outlines "
"the estimated costs and terms for goods and services. Once accepted, a "
"quotation can be converted into a sales order, which serves as the final "
"agreement before delivery and invoicing."
msgstr ""
"*Prodajna ponudba* ali ponudba je dokument, poslan stranki, ki opisuje "
"ocenjene stroške in pogoje za blago in storitve. Ko je sprejeta, se ponudba "
"lahko pretvori v prodajni nalog, ki služi kot končni dogovor pred dobavo in "
"izdajo računa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:13
msgid "Sales flow overview"
msgstr "Pregled prodajnega procesa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:15
msgid ""
"Quotations fit into a broader sales flow that connects different stages of "
"customer interactions from initial interest to payment."
msgstr ""
"Ponudbe spadajo v širši prodajni proces, ki povezuje različne stopnje stikov "
"s strankami od začetnega zanimanja do plačila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:18
msgid "The typical flow follows these steps:"
msgstr "Tipičen proces sledi tem korakom:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:20
msgid ""
"*Quotation*: A proposal sent to the customer with product details and "
"pricing."
msgstr ""
"*Ponudba*: Predlog, poslan stranki s podrobnostmi izdelka in cenovanjem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:21
msgid ""
"*Sales order*: Created automatically when the customer accepts the "
"quotation, confirming the sale."
msgstr ""
"*Prodajni nalog*: Ustvarjen samodejno, ko stranka sprejme ponudbo, s čimer "
"se prodaja potrdi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:23
msgid ""
"*Delivery* (if applicable): Products are shipped or services are delivered."
msgstr ""
"*Dostava* (če je primerno): Izdelki so poslani ali storitve so izvedene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:24
msgid ""
"*Invoice*: The final bill is issued based on the sales order or delivered "
"products/services."
msgstr ""
"*Račun*: Končni račun je izdan na podlagi prodajnega naloga ali dostavljenih "
"izdelkov/storitev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:25
msgid ""
"*Payment*: The customer settles the invoice, completing the sales cycle."
msgstr "*Plačilo*: Stranka poravna račun in zaključi prodajni cikel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:27
msgid ""
"This flow helps businesses track the entire lifecycle of a sale while "
"keeping information consistent across apps."
msgstr ""
"Ta proces pomaga podjetjem spremljati celoten življenjski cikel prodaje, "
"hkrati pa ohranja doslednost informacij po aplikacijah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:30
msgid ""
"In Odoo, quotations are configured in the **Sales** app. They can also be "
"generated from other apps as part of the sales workflow:"
msgstr ""
"V Odoo so ponudbe konfigurirane v aplikaciji **Prodaja**. Lahko se tudi "
"ustvarijo iz drugih aplikacij kot del prodajnega procesa:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:33
msgid ""
"**CRM**: :doc:`Convert opportunities <../crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes>` "
"into quotes to follow up on potential deals."
msgstr ""
"**CRM**: :doc:`Pretvorite priložnosti <../crm/acquire_leads/send_quotes>` v "
"ponudbe za sledenje potencialnim poslom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Helpdesk**: :doc:`Generate quotes from tickets <../../services/helpdesk/"
"advanced/after_sales>` when offering paid services or products."
msgstr ""
"**Služba za pomoč**: :doc:`Ustvarite ponudbe iz zahtevkov <../../services/"
"helpdesk/advanced/after_sales>` pri ponujanju plačljivih storitev ali "
"izdelkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Subscriptions**: :doc:`Offer recurring services <../subscriptions>` before "
"starting an automatic billing cycle."
msgstr ""
"**Naročnine**: :doc:`Ponudite ponavljajoče se storitve <../subscriptions>` "
"pred začetkom samodejnega cikla obračunavanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:42
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:8
msgid "Create quotations"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje ponudb"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:42
msgid "Create, configure, and send quotations to customers."
msgstr "Ustvarjanje, konfiguriranje in pošiljanje ponudb strankam."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:47
msgid "Quotation templates"
msgstr "Predlog ponudb"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:47
msgid ""
"Configure and use quotation templates to send tailor-fit quotations at a "
"quicker pace."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurirajte in uporabite predloge ponudb za pošiljanje prilagojenih "
"ponudb v hitrejšem tempu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:52
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products.rst:3
msgid "Optional products"
msgstr "Izbirni izdelki"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:52
msgid "Offer useful and related products to customers to increase sales."
msgstr "Ponudite strankam koristne in sorodne izdelke za povečanje prodaje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:57
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:3
msgid "Online signatures for order confirmations"
msgstr "Spletni podpisi za potrditve naročil"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:57
msgid ""
"Customers have the ability to confirm orders via online signatures, directly "
"on sales orders."
msgstr ""
"Stranke imajo možnost potrditve naročil s spletnimi podpisi neposredno na "
"prodajnih nalogih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:62
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_paid_to_validate.rst:3
msgid "Online payment order confirmation"
msgstr "Potrditev naročila s spletnim plačilom"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:62
msgid ""
"Customers have the ability to confirm orders via online payment, directly on "
"sales orders."
msgstr ""
"Stranke imajo možnost potrditve naročil s spletnim plačilom neposredno na "
"prodajnih nalogih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:67
msgid "Quotation Deadlines"
msgstr "Roki za ponudbe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:67
msgid ""
"Set deadlines on quotations to encourage customers to act in a timely manner "
"when closing business deals."
msgstr ""
"Nastavite roke na ponudbah, da spodbudite stranke k pravočasnemu ukrepanju "
"pri sklepanju poslovnih poslov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:73
msgid "Deliver orders and invoices to different addresses"
msgstr "Dostava naročil in računov na različne naslove"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:73
msgid ""
"Specify separate customer delivery and invoicing addresses on quotations."
msgstr ""
"Navedite ločena naslova stranke za dostavo in izdajanje računov v ponudbah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:78
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/orders_and_variants.rst:3
msgid "Product variants on quotations and sales orders"
msgstr "Različice izdelkov na ponudbah in prodajnih nalogih"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:78
msgid ""
"Add product variants to sales orders to provide additional options for "
"single products."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte različice izdelkov v prodajne naloge, da zagotovite dodatne možnosti "
"za posamezne izdelke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:83
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder.rst:6
msgid "PDF quote builder"
msgstr "Graditelj ponudbe PDF"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:83
msgid ""
"Add custom PDF files to quotations to elevate the document's headers and "
"designs."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte prilagojene datoteke PDF ponudbam, da izboljšate glavo in obliko "
"dokumenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:89
msgid "Sales quotations in business deals"
msgstr "Prodajne ponudbe v poslovnih poslih"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:91
msgid ""
"Sales quotations serve as a key step in the sales process, bridging the gap "
"between a customer's initial inquiry about goods and services and the final "
"contractual agreement for payment and delivery. The quotation also provides "
"transparency in pricing, helping both parties negotiate and finalize the "
"terms before making a commitment."
msgstr ""
"Prodajne ponudbe služijo kot ključna stopnja v prodajnem procesu, saj "
"premostijo vrzel med začetnim povpraševanjem stranke glede blaga in storitev "
"ter končnim pogodbenim dogovorom za plačilo in dostavo. Ponudba zagotavlja "
"tudi preglednost pri oblikovanju cen, kar obema stranema pomaga pogajati se "
"in dokončati pogoje pred prevzemom obveznosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:96
msgid ""
"Sales quotations play a crucial role in business transactions by defining "
"the scope and cost of what is being sold to the end-customer; setting clear "
"expectations on pricing, delivery, tax, and payment terms; and providing a "
"documented stage where the business deal can be negotiated before agreed "
"upon."
msgstr ""
"Prodajne ponudbe igrajo ključno vlogo v poslovnih transakcijah, saj določajo "
"obseg in stroške tega, kar se prodaja končni stranki; postavljajo jasna "
"pričakovanja glede cen, dostave, davkov in plačilnih pogojev; ter "
"zagotavljajo dokumentirano stopnjo, kjer se lahko o poslovnem dogovoru "
"pogajamo, preden se o njem dogovorimo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:102
msgid "Key components of a sales quotation"
msgstr "Ključne komponente prodajne ponudbe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:104
msgid "A well-structured sales quotation comprises the following:"
msgstr "Dobro strukturirana prodajna ponudba vključuje naslednje:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:106
msgid ""
"Quotation number and date: A unique identifier for tracking and reference, "
"as well as the :doc:`dates of issue and expiration <sales_quotations/"
"deadline>`. In Odoo **Sales** app, the quotation number is assigned under a "
"standard naming convention once it is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Številka in datum ponudbe: Edinstven identifikator za spremljanje in "
"sklicevanje, pa tudi :doc:`datumi izdaje in veljavnosti <sales_quotations/"
"deadline>`. V aplikaciji Odoo **Prodaja** se številka ponudbe dodeli po "
"standardni konvenciji poimenovanja, ko je potrjena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:109
msgid ""
"Customer information: Customer name and contact information, as well "
"as :doc:`invoicing and delivery address <sales_quotations/"
"different_addresses>`."
msgstr ""
"Informacije o stranki: Ime stranke in kontaktne informacije, pa "
"tudi :doc:`naslov za izdajo računa in dostavo <sales_quotations/"
"different_addresses>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:111
msgid ""
"Products and services: Itemized listing of items to be purchased, including "
"quantity, specifications (as needed), and unit price."
msgstr ""
"Izdelki in storitve: Podrobni seznam artiklov za nakup, vključno s količino, "
"specifikacijami (po potrebi) in enotno ceno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:113
msgid ""
"Payment terms and :doc:`pricelists <products_prices/prices/pricing>`: "
"Configured agreements and rules for the pricing and payment of this "
"particular sales quotation."
msgstr ""
"Plačilni pogoji in :doc:`ceniki <products_prices/prices/pricing>`: "
"Konfigurirani dogovori in pravila za cene in plačilo za to določeno prodajno "
"ponudbo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:115
msgid ""
"Special pricing: Optional :doc:`discounts and promotional pricing "
"<products_prices/prices/pricing>` to update and/or modify individual product "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"Posebne cene: Izbirni :doc:`popusti in promocijske cene <products_prices/"
"prices/pricing>` za posodobitev in/ali spremembo posameznih vrstic izdelkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:117
msgid ""
"Total cost and currency: Summary totals of product or service and shipping "
"prices, including relevant taxes."
msgstr ""
"Skupni stroški in valuta: Povzetek seštevkov cen izdelkov ali storitev in "
"dostave, vključno z ustreznimi davki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:120
msgid ""
"In Odoo's **Sales** app, quotations can include additional details and "
"configurations that add more detail and information, such as :doc:`quotation "
"templates <sales_quotations/quote_template>`, :doc:`subscription plans "
"<../../sales/subscriptions>`, and :doc:`sales team referrer name "
"<sales_quotations/create_quotations>`."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo aplikaciji **Prodaja** lahko ponudbe vključujejo dodatne podrobnosti "
"in konfiguracije, ki dodajo več informacij, kot so :doc:`predloge ponudb "
"<sales_quotations/quote_template>`, :doc:`naročniški načrti <../../sales/"
"subscriptions>` in :doc:`ime napotitelja prodajne ekipe <sales_quotations/"
"create_quotations>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations.rst:125
msgid "Unconfirmed sales quotation in Odoo **Sales** app."
msgstr "Nepotrjena prodajna ponudba v Odoo aplikaciji **Prodaja**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Explains how to configure quotation settings, create a quotation and fill in "
"its Order Lines, Optional Products, and Other Info tabs, and send it to a "
"customer for confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Pojasnjuje, kako konfigurirati nastavitve ponudb, ustvariti ponudbo, "
"izpolniti njene zavihke Postavke naročila, Izbirni izdelki in Druge "
"informacije ter jo poslati stranki v potrditev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:10
msgid ""
"In Odoo **Sales**, quotations can be created and sent to customers. Once a "
"quotation has been confirmed, it officially turns into a *sales order*, "
"which can then be invoiced and paid for."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo **Prodaji** lahko ustvarite in pošljete ponudbe strankam. Ko je "
"ponudba potrjena, se uradno spremeni v *prodajni nalog*, ki ga je nato "
"mogoče fakturirati in plačati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:18
msgid ""
"To access these setting options, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll to the :guilabel:`Quotations & "
"Orders` section."
msgstr ""
"Za dostop do teh nastavitev pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Prodaja --"
"> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve` in se pomaknite do odseka :guilabel:`Ponudbe "
"in naročila`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:21
msgid "The Quotations and Orders section on the Odoo Sales app Settings page."
msgstr ""
"Odsek Ponudbe in naročila na strani z nastavitvami aplikacije Odoo Prodaja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mandatory Product`: Prevents sales without a linked product from "
"being completed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Obvezni izdelek`: Preprečuje dokončanje prodaje brez povezanega "
"izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:25
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Online Signature`: Requests an online signature by default to "
"validate orders. This may be changed on individual orders."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Spletni podpis`: privzeto zahteva spletni podpis za potrditev "
"naročil. To je mogoče spremeniti pri posameznih naročilih."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Online Payment`: Requests online prepayment from customers to "
"confirm orders. The payment may be full or partial. When this option is "
"active, an additional field (:guilabel:`Payment X %`) appears. A demo with "
"the current payment provider may be configured by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Configure Demo` button. Other providers may be selected by "
"clicking :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`View Other Providers`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Spletno plačilo`: za potrditev naročil od strank zahteva spletno "
"predplačilo. Plačilo je lahko celotno ali delno. Ko je ta možnost aktivna, "
"se prikaže dodatno polje (:guilabel:`Plačilo X %`). Predstavitveno različico "
"s trenutnim ponudnikom plačil lahko konfigurirate s klikom na gumb "
":guilabel:`Konfiguriraj demo`. Druge ponudnike lahko izberete s klikom na "
":icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Ogled drugih ponudnikov`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Quotation Validity`: Determines a set amount "
"(in :guilabel:`days`) that quotations remain valid for. This default may be "
"changed per order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Privzeta veljavnost ponudbe`: določa določeno obdobje (v "
":guilabel:`dneh`), v katerem ponudbe ostanejo veljavne. To privzeto vrednost "
"je mogoče spremeniti pri vsakem naročilu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sale Warnings`: Issues warning messages to database users about "
"orders that include specific products or customers."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Opozorila pri prodaji`: uporabnike baze podatkov opozori na "
"naročila, ki vključujejo določene izdelke ali stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`PDF Quote builder`: Customizes the look of quotations with header "
"pages, product descriptions, footer pages, and more."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Graditelj ponudb PDF`: Prilagodite videz ponudb z naslovno "
"stranjo, opisi izdelkov, nogo in več."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Display Product Images`: Allows product images to be displayed on "
"PDFs and online quotations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prikaz slik izdelkov`: omogoča prikaz slik izdelkov v datotekah "
"PDF in na spletnih ponudbah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Lock Confirmed Sales`: Ensures that orders cannot be edited once "
"confirmed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Zakleni potrjeno prodajo`: zagotavlja, da naročil po potrditvi ni "
"več mogoče urejati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pro-Forma Invoice`: Allows pro-forma invoices to be sent to "
"customers ahead of regular invoices."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Predračun`: omogoča pošiljanje predračunov strankam pred rednimi "
"računi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:44
msgid ""
"To activate any of these settings, click the checkbox beside the desired "
"options. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`. The values set in "
"the :guilabel:`Online Signature`, :guilabel:`Online "
"Payment`, :guilabel:`Default Quotation Validity`, and :guilabel:`Display "
"Product Images` fields are company-specific. In a multi-company database, "
"these must be set for each individual company."
msgstr ""
"Če želite aktivirati katero koli od teh nastavitev, označite potrditveno "
"polje poleg želenih možnosti. Nato kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`. Vrednosti, "
"nastavljene v poljih :guilabel:`Spletni podpis`, :guilabel:`Spletno "
"plačilo`, :guilabel:`Privzeta veljavnost ponudbe` in :guilabel:`Prikaz slik "
"izdelkov`, so specifične za posamezno podjetje. V večpodjetniški bazi "
"podatkov jih je treba nastaviti za vsako posamezno podjetje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:52
msgid "Quotations dashboard"
msgstr "Nadzorna plošča ponudb"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:54
msgid ""
"The *Quotations* dashboard is the page that appears when "
"the :menuselection:`Sales app` is opened."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Aplikacija Sales` se ob odprtju prikaže stran *Ponudbe*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:56
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Quotations` dashboard displays all quotations in "
"the database related to the current user, as indicated by the "
"default :guilabel:`My Quotations` filter present in the search bar."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto nadzorna plošča :guilabel:`Ponudbe` prikazuje vse ponudbe v zbirki "
"podatkov, povezane s trenutnim uporabnikom, kot je navedeno s privzetim "
"filtrom :guilabel:`Moje ponudbe`, prisotnim v iskalni vrstici."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:60
msgid "The Quotations dashboard present in the Odoo Sales application."
msgstr "Nadzorna plošča Ponudbe v aplikaciji Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:64
msgid ""
"To view *all* quotations in the database, remove the :guilabel:`My "
"Quotations` filter from the search bar."
msgstr ""
"Če želite pregledati *vse* ponudbe v zbirki podatkov, odstranite "
"filter :guilabel:`Moje ponudbe` iz iskalne vrstice."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:67
msgid ""
"Quotations on this page appear in a default list view, but can also be "
"viewed in a :icon:`oi-view-kanban` :guilabel:`Kanban` view, :icon:`fa-"
"calendar` :guilabel:`Calendar`, :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`Pivot` "
"table, :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`Graph`, or :icon:`fa-clock-"
"o` :guilabel:`Activity` view."
msgstr ""
"Ponudbe na tej strani so prikazane v privzetem seznamskem pogledu, lahko pa "
"si jih ogledate tudi v pogledu :icon:`oi-view-"
"kanban` :guilabel:`Kanban`, :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`Koledar`, vrtilni "
"tabeli :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`Pivot`, pogledu :icon:`fa-area-"
"chart` :guilabel:`Graf` ali pogledu :icon:`fa-clock-o` :guilabel:`Dejavnost`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:72
msgid ""
"To view or modify any listed quotation from the :guilabel:`Quotations` "
"dashboard, click on the desired quotation line from the list, and Odoo "
"reveals the specific form for that selected quotation."
msgstr ""
"Za ogled in/ali spremembo katere koli ponudbe s seznama na nadzorni plošči "
":guilabel:`Ponudbe` kliknite želeno vrstico ponudbe s seznama in Odoo "
"prikaže obrazec za izbrano ponudbo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:79
msgid "Create a quotation"
msgstr "Ustvari ponudbo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:81
msgid ""
"To create a quotation, open the :menuselection:`Sales app`, and click "
"the :guilabel:`New` button, located in the upper-left corner of the "
"main :guilabel:`Quotations` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje ponudbe odprite :menuselection:`aplikacijo Sales` in kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Novo`, ki se nahaja v zgornjem levem kotu glavne nadzorne "
"plošče :guilabel:`Ponudbe`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:85
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`New` button is **only** present if the :guilabel:`Quotations` "
"dashboard is in list or Kanban view."
msgstr ""
"Gumb :guilabel:`Novo` je prisoten **samo**, če je nadzorna "
"plošča :guilabel:`Ponudbe` v seznamskem ali Kanban pogledu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:88
msgid ""
"Clicking the :guilabel:`New` button reveals a blank quotation form, with "
"various fields and tabs to configure."
msgstr ""
"S klikom na gumb :guilabel:`Novo` se prikaže prazen obrazec ponudbe z "
"različnimi polji in zavihki za konfiguracijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:91
msgid ""
"Begin by entering the customer's name in the :guilabel:`Customer` field at "
"the top of the form. This is a **required** field."
msgstr ""
"Začnite z vnosom imena stranke v polje :guilabel:`Stranka` na vrhu obrazca. "
"To je **obvezno** polje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:94
msgid ""
"If the customer's information is already in the database, "
"the :guilabel:`Invoice Address` and :guilabel:`Delivery Address` fields auto-"
"populate with the saved information for those respective fields, based on "
"the data from that customer's contact record (found in the **Contacts** "
"application)."
msgstr ""
"Če so podatki o stranki že v zbirki podatkov, se polji :guilabel:`Naslov za "
"račun` in :guilabel:`Naslov za dostavo` samodejno izpolnita s shranjenimi "
"podatki za ta polja na podlagi podatkov iz zapisa stika te stranke (najdete "
"jih v aplikaciji **Stiki**)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:99
msgid ""
"If the customer was referred by another customer or contact, enter their "
"name in the :guilabel:`Referrer` field."
msgstr ""
"Če je bila stranka napotena s strani druge stranke ali stika, vnesite njeno "
"ime v polje :guilabel:`Napotitelj`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:102
msgid ""
"If a :guilabel:`Referrer` is selected, a new field, :guilabel:`Commission "
"Plan` appears, in which a commission can be selected from the drop-down "
"menu. This commission is rewarded to the contact selected in "
"the :guilabel:`Referrer` field."
msgstr ""
"Če je izbran :guilabel:`Napotitelj`, se prikaže novo polje :guilabel:`Načrt "
"provizij`, v katerem lahko iz spustnega menija izberete provizijo. Ta "
"provizija se dodeli stiku, izbranemu v polju :guilabel:`Napotitelj`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:106
msgid ""
"Next, if they have not already been auto-populated with the customer's "
"information, enter the appropriate addresses in the :guilabel:`Invoice "
"Address` and :guilabel:`Delivery Address` fields. Both of these fields are "
"**required**."
msgstr ""
"Nato, če še nista bila samodejno izpolnjena s podatki stranke, vnesite "
"ustrezne naslove v polji :guilabel:`Naslov za račun` in :guilabel:`Naslov za "
"dostavo`. Obe polji sta **obvezni**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:110
msgid ""
"Then, if desired, choose a :guilabel:`Quotation Template` from the drop-down "
"field to apply to this quotation. It should be noted that some additional "
"fields may appear, depending on the template selected."
msgstr ""
"Nato, če želite, izberite :guilabel:`Predlogo ponudbe` iz spustnega polja za "
"uporabo v tej ponudbi. Opozoriti je treba, da se lahko prikažejo dodatna "
"polja, odvisno od izbrane predloge."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:114
msgid ""
"The default date that appears in the :guilabel:`Expiration` field is based "
"on the number configured in the :ref:`Default Quotation Validity setting "
"<sales/create_quotations/quotation-settings>` (in :menuselection:`Sales app "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`)."
msgstr ""
"Privzeti datum, ki se pojavi v polju :guilabel:`Rok veljavnosti`, temelji na "
"številki, konfigurirani v :ref:`nastavitvi privzete veljavnosti ponudbe "
"<sales/create_quotations/quotation-settings>` (v :menuselection:`aplikacija "
"Prodaja --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:119
msgid ""
"When using a quotation template, the date in the :guilabel:`Expiration` "
"field is based on the :guilabel:`Quotation Validity` figure on the template "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Pri uporabi predloge ponudbe datum v polju :guilabel:`Potek` temelji na "
"podatku :guilabel:`Veljavnost ponudbe` na obrazcu predloge."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:122
msgid ""
"If the quotation is for a recurring product or subscription, select the "
"desired :guilabel:`Recurring Plan` from that specific drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Če je ponudba za ponavljajoč se izdelek ali naročnino, izberite "
"želeni :guilabel:`Recurring Plan` iz tega spustnega menija."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:125
msgid ""
"If desired, select a specific :guilabel:`Pricelist` to be applied to this "
"quotation."
msgstr ""
"Če želite, izberite določen :guilabel:`Pricelist`, ki se bo uporabil za to "
"ponudbo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:127
msgid ""
"Lastly, select any specific :guilabel:`Payment Terms` to be used for this "
"quotation."
msgstr ""
"Nazadnje izberite določene :guilabel:`Plačilni pogoji`, ki se bodo uporabili "
"za to ponudbo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:130
msgid "Order Lines tab"
msgstr "Zavihek Order Lines"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:132
msgid ""
"The first tab on the quotation form is the *Order Lines* tab. In this tab, "
"products may be added to the quotation by the *Description* column or "
"through the *Product Catalog*."
msgstr ""
"Prvi zavihek na obrazcu ponudbe je zavihek *Vrstice naročila*. V tem zavihku "
"lahko izdelke v ponudbo dodate prek stolpca *Opis* ali prek *Kataloga "
"izdelkov*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:135
msgid ""
"To add a product using the *Description* column, type the product's name. If "
"it exists in the database, it appears as an autocomplete option and can be "
"clicked to configure as desired and added to the order. If the product does "
"not exist in the database, enter the desired name and relevant information "
"like quantity and price."
msgstr ""
"Če želite dodati izdelek prek stolpca *Opis*, vnesite ime izdelka. Če "
"obstaja v bazi podatkov, se prikaže kot možnost samodejnega dokončanja, ki "
"jo lahko kliknete, poljubno konfigurirate in dodate v naročilo. Če izdelek "
"ne obstaja v bazi podatkov, vnesite želeno ime in ustrezne podatke, kot sta "
"količina in cena."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:140
msgid ""
"The Description column in a quotation with both a manually added product and "
"the\n"
"autocomplete open."
msgstr ""
"Stolpec Opis v ponudbi z ročno dodanim izdelkom in odprtim\n"
"samodejnim dokončanjem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:145
msgid ""
"Products added to sales quotations by manually entering a name and price are "
"**not** added to the database. They only exist on the quotation/sales order "
"where they were typed into the *Description* column."
msgstr ""
"Izdelki, dodani v prodajne ponudbe z ročnim vnosom imena in cene, se **ne** "
"dodajo v bazo podatkov. Obstajajo le v ponudbi/prodajnem nalogu, kjer so "
"bili vneseni v stolpec *Opis*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:149
msgid ""
"To add a product through the *Product Catalog*, click :guilabel:`Catalog` to "
"reveal a separate page showcasing every item and potential product variant "
"in an organized catalog display. Items can be organized "
"by :guilabel:`Product Category` and :guilabel:`Attributes`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite dodati izdelek prek *Kataloga izdelkov*, kliknite "
":guilabel:`Katalog`, da se odpre ločena stran, ki prikazuje vsak artikel in "
"morebitno različico izdelka v urejenem kataloškem prikazu. Artikle je mogoče "
"razvrstiti po :guilabel:`Kategorija izdelka` in :guilabel:`Lastnosti`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:153
msgid ""
"A product catalog accessible via a quotation in the Odoo Sales application."
msgstr "Katalog izdelkov, dostopen prek ponudbe v aplikaciji Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:156
msgid ""
"From here, locate the desired items, click the :icon:`fa-shopping-"
"cart` :guilabel:`Add` button on the product card, and adjust the quantity, "
"if needed. When complete, click the :guilabel:`Back to Quotation` button in "
"the upper-left corner to return to the quotation, where the newly selected "
"catalog items can be found in the *Order Lines* tab."
msgstr ""
"Tukaj preprosto poiščite želene artikle, kliknite gumb :icon:`fa-shopping-"
"cart` :guilabel:`Add` na kartici izdelka in po potrebi prilagodite količino. "
"Ko končate, kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Back to Quotation` v zgornjem levem "
"kotu, da se vrnete v ponudbo, kjer najdete na novo izbrane kataloge artiklov "
"v zavihku :guilabel:`Order Lines`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:161
msgid ""
"If multiple items should be presented in a more organized way on the "
"quotation, click :guilabel:`Add a section`, enter a name for the section, "
"and drag-and-drop that section heading in the desired location amongst the "
"items in the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab. The section heading appears in "
"bold and a sub-total for all products in a section is displayed. Then, if "
"desired, :ref:`add a Section Template <sales/quote_template/section-"
"templates>` to this quotation."
msgstr ""
"Če želite na ponudbi več artiklov predstaviti bolj pregledno, kliknite "
":guilabel:`Dodaj razdelek`, vnesite ime razdelka ter povlecite in spustite "
"ta naslov razdelka na želeno mesto med artikli v zavihku :guilabel:`Vrstice "
"naročila`. Naslov razdelka se prikaže v krepkem tisku, prikazana pa je tudi "
"delna vsota za vse izdelke v razdelku. Nato po želji :ref:`dodajte predlogo "
"razdelka <sales/quote_template/section-templates>` k tej ponudbi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:167
msgid ""
"If needed, click :guilabel:`Add a note` beneath a certain product line to "
"add a custom note about that specific product. The note appears in italics. "
"Then, if needed, proceed to drag-and-drop the note beneath the desired "
"product line."
msgstr ""
"Po potrebi kliknite :guilabel:`Add a note` pod določeno vrstico izdelka, da "
"dodate opombo po meri za ta določeni izdelek. Opomba se prikazuje ležeče. "
"Nato po potrebi povlecite in spustite opombo pod želeno vrstico izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:171
msgid ""
"Beneath the product lines, there are buttons that can be clicked to apply "
"any of the following: :guilabel:`Coupon "
"Code`, :guilabel:`Promotions`, :guilabel:`Discount`, and :guilabel:`Add "
"shipping`."
msgstr ""
"Pod vrsticami izdelkov so gumbi, s katerimi lahko uporabite karkoli od "
"naslednjega: :guilabel:`Coupon Code`, :guilabel:`Promotions`, "
":guilabel:`Discount` in/ali :guilabel:`Add shipping`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:175
msgid ":doc:`../products_prices/ewallets_giftcards`"
msgstr ":doc:`../products_prices/ewallets_giftcards`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:176
msgid ":doc:`../products_prices/loyalty_discount`"
msgstr ":doc:`../products_prices/loyalty_discount`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:177
msgid ":doc:`../products_prices/prices/pricing`"
msgstr ":doc:`../products_prices/prices/pricing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:178
msgid ":doc:`../../../essentials/product_catalog`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../essentials/product_catalog`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:181
msgid "Optional Products tab"
msgstr "Zavihek Optional Products"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:183
msgid ""
"Open the *Optional Products* tab to select related products that can be "
"presented to the customer, which may result in an increased sale."
msgstr ""
"Odprite zavihek *Izbirni izdelki*, da izberete sorodne izdelke, ki jih lahko "
"ponudite stranki, kar lahko privede do večje prodaje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:186
msgid ""
"For example, if the customer wants to buy a car, an optional product that "
"could be offered is a *Trailer Hitch*."
msgstr ""
"Na primer, če stranka želi kupiti avto, je izbirni izdelek, ki bi ga lahko "
"ponudili, *Priklopna kljuka*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:190
msgid ":doc:`optional_products`"
msgstr ":doc:`optional_products`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:193
msgid "Other Info tab"
msgstr "Zavihek Ostale informacije"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:195
msgid ""
"In the *Other Info* tab, there are various quotation-related configurations "
"separated into four different "
"sections: :guilabel:`Sales`, :guilabel:`Delivery`, :guilabel:`Invoicing`, "
"and :guilabel:`Tracking`."
msgstr ""
"V zavihku :guilabel:`Ostale informacije` so različne konfiguracije, povezane "
"s ponudbo, razdeljene v štiri različne razdelke: :guilabel:`Prodaja`, "
":guilabel:`Dostava`, :guilabel:`Izdajanje računov` in :guilabel:`Sledenje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:200
msgid ""
"Some fields **only** appear if specific settings and options have been "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Nekatera polja se prikažejo **samo**, če so bile konfigurirane določene "
"nastavitve in možnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:203
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_products.rst:92
msgid "Sales section"
msgstr "Razdelek Prodaja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:205
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Sales` section of the *Other Info* tab, there are sales "
"specific fields that can be configured."
msgstr ""
"V razdelku :guilabel:`Prodaja` zavihka :guilabel:`Ostale informacije` so "
"polja, specifična za prodajo, ki jih je mogoče konfigurirati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:208
msgid ""
"The Sales section of the Other Info tab of a quotation form in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Razdelek Prodaja zavihka Ostale informacije obrazca ponudbe v Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:211
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salesperson`: Assign a salesperson from the drop-down menu to be "
"associated with this quotation. The user who originally created the "
"quotation is selected in this field by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prodajalec`: V spustnem meniju dodelite prodajalca, ki bo povezan "
"s to ponudbo. Uporabnik, ki je prvotno ustvaril ponudbo, je v tem polju "
"privzeto izbran."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Team`: Assign a specific sales team to this quotation. If "
"the selected :guilabel:`Salesperson` is a member of a sales team, that team "
"is auto-populated in the field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prodajna ekipa`: Tej ponudbi dodelite določeno prodajno ekipo. Če "
"je izbrani :guilabel:`Prodajalec` član prodajne ekipe, se ta ekipa samodejno "
"vnese v polje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:215
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select a company from the drop-down menu that this "
"quotation should be associated with. This field only appears when working in "
"a multi-company environment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Podjetje`: V spustnem meniju izberite podjetje, s katerim naj bo "
"povezana ta ponudba. To polje se prikaže le pri delu v okolju z več podjetji."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Online signature`: Click this checkbox to request an online "
"signature from the customer to confirm the order. This field only appears if "
"the *Online Signature* setting has been enabled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Spletni podpis`: označite to potrditveno polje, če želite od "
"stranke zahtevati spletni podpis za potrditev naročila. To polje se prikaže "
"le, če je omogočena nastavitev *Spletni podpis*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:219
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Online payment`: Click this checkbox and enter a desired "
"percentage in the adjacent field to request an online payment from the "
"customer (for that designated percentage of the total amount) to confirm the "
"order. This field only appears if the *Online Payment* setting has been "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Spletno plačilo`: označite to potrditveno polje in v sosednje "
"polje vnesite želeni odstotek, da od stranke za potrditev naročila zahtevate "
"spletno plačilo (v določenem odstotku celotnega zneska). To polje se prikaže "
"le, če je omogočena nastavitev *Spletno plačilo*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:223
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer Reference`: Enter a custom reference ID for this "
"customer. The entered reference ID can contain letters, numbers, or a mix of "
"both."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sklic stranke`: Vnesite ID sklica po meri za to stranko. Vneseni "
"ID sklica lahko vsebuje črke, številke ali kombinacijo obojega."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:225
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Add specific tags to the quotation for added organization "
"and enhanced searchability in the Odoo **Sales** application. Multiple tags "
"can be added, if necessary."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Oznake`: Ponudbi dodajte posebne oznake za boljšo organizacijo in "
"izboljšano iskanje v aplikaciji Odoo **Sales**. Po potrebi lahko dodate več "
"oznak."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:229
msgid "Delivery section"
msgstr "Razdelek Dostava"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:231
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Delivery` section of the *Other Info* tab, there are "
"delivery-specific fields that can be configured."
msgstr ""
"V razdelku :guilabel:`Dostava` zavihka :guilabel:`Ostale informacije` so "
"polja, specifična za dostavo, ki jih je mogoče konfigurirati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:234
msgid ""
"The Delivery section of the Other Info tab of a quotation form in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Razdelek Dostava zavihka Ostale informacije obrazca ponudbe v Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:237
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Shipping Weight`: Displays the weight of the items being shipped. "
"This field is not modifiable. Product weight is configured on individual "
"product forms."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Teža pošiljke`: Prikazuje težo artiklov, ki se pošiljajo. Tega "
"polja ni mogoče spreminjati. Teža izdelka se konfigurira na posameznih "
"obrazcih izdelkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:239
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Incoterm`: Select an Incoterm (International Commercial Term) to "
"use as predefined commercial terms for international transactions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Incoterm`: izberite Incoterm (mednarodni trgovinski izraz), ki se "
"uporablja kot vnaprej določeni trgovinski pogoji za mednarodne transakcije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:241
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Incoterm Location`: If an Incoterm is being used, enter the "
"international location in this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lokacija Incoterm`: Če uporabljate Incoterm, v to polje vnesite "
"mednarodno lokacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:243
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Shipping Policy`: Select a desired shipping policy from the drop-"
"down menu. If all products are delivered at once, the delivery order is "
"scheduled based on the greatest product lead time. Otherwise, it is based on "
"the shortest lead time. The available options are :guilabel:`As soon as "
"possible` or :guilabel:`When all products are ready`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pravila pošiljanja`: Izberite želeno pravilo pošiljanja iz "
"spustnega menija. Če so vsi izdelki dostavljeni hkrati, je dobavni nalog "
"načrtovan na podlagi najdaljšega dobavnega roka izdelka. V nasprotnem "
"primeru temelji na najkrajšem dobavnem roku. Na voljo sta možnosti: "
":guilabel:`Čim prej` ali :guilabel:`Ko so vsi izdelki pripravljeni`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:247
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Date`: Click into the empty field to reveal a calendar "
"popover, from which a customer delivery date can be selected. If no custom "
"date is required, refer to the :guilabel:`Expected` date listed to the right "
"of that field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Datum dostave`: Kliknite v prazno polje, da se prikaže pojavni "
"koledar, iz katerega lahko izberete datum dostave stranki. Če po meri "
"določen datum ni potreben, glejte datum :guilabel:`Pričakovano`, naveden "
"desno od tega polja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:252
msgid "Invoicing section"
msgstr "Razdelek za izdajo računov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:254
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Invoicing` section of the *Other Info* tab, there are "
"invoicing specific fields that can be configured."
msgstr ""
"V razdelku :guilabel:`Izdaja računov` zavihka :guilabel:`Ostale informacije` "
"so na voljo polja, specifična za izdajo računov, ki jih je mogoče "
"konfigurirati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:257
msgid ""
"The Invoicing section of the Other Info tab of a quotation form in Odoo "
"Sales."
msgstr ""
"Razdelek za izdajo računov zavihka Ostale informacije v obrazcu ponudbe v "
"Odoo Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:260
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fiscal Position`: Select a fiscal position to be used to adapt "
"taxes and accounts for particular customers or sales orders/invoices. The "
"default value comes from the customer. If a selection is made in this field, "
"an :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Update Taxes` clickable link and icon "
"appear. When clicked, the taxes for this particular customer and quotation "
"are updated. A confirmation window appears as well."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Davčni položaj`: Izberite davčni položaj, ki bo uporabljen za "
"prilagajanje davkov in kontov za določene stranke ali prodajne naloge/"
"račune. Privzeta vrednost izhaja iz stranke. Če izberete vrednost v tem "
"polju, se prikaže :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Posodobi davke`, ki je "
"povezava in ikona, na katero lahko kliknete. Ko kliknete, se posodobijo "
"davki za to določeno stranko in ponudbo. Prikaže se tudi potrditveno okno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:265
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Analytic Account`: Select an analytic account to apply to this "
"customer/quotation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Analitični konto`: Izberite analitični konto, ki se uporabi za to "
"stranko/ponudbo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:268
msgid "Tracking section"
msgstr "Razdelek za sledenje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:270
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Tracking` section of the *Other Info* tab, there are "
"tracking-specific fields that can be configured."
msgstr ""
"V razdelku :guilabel:`Sledenje` zavihka :guilabel:`Ostale informacije` so na "
"voljo polja, specifična za sledenje, ki jih je mogoče konfigurirati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:273
msgid ""
"The Tracking section of the Other Info tab of a quotation form in Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Razdelek za sledenje zavihka Ostale informacije v obrazcu ponudbe v Odoo "
"Sales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:276
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source Document`: Enter the reference of the document that "
"generated the quotation/sales order, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Izvorni dokument`: Vnesite referenco dokumenta, ki je ustvaril "
"ponudbo/prodajni nalog, če je primerno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:278
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Opportunity`: Select the specific opportunity (from the **CRM** "
"app) related to this quotation, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Priložnost`: Izberite določeno priložnost (iz aplikacije "
"**CRM**), povezano s to ponudbo, če je primerno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:280
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Campaign`: Select the marketing campaign related to this "
"quotation, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kampanja`: Izberite trženjsko kampanjo, povezano s to ponudbo, če "
"je primerno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:281
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Medium`: Select the method by which this quotation originated "
"(e.g., *Email*), if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Medij`: Izberite metodo, s katero je nastala ta ponudba (npr. *E-"
"pošta*), če je primerno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:283
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: Select the source of the link used to generate this "
"quotation (e.g., *Facebook*), if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vir`: Izberite vir povezave, uporabljene za ustvarjanje te "
"ponudbe (npr. *Facebook*), če je primerno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:287
msgid ":doc:`../../../websites/website/reporting/link_tracker`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../websites/website/reporting/link_tracker`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:290
msgid "Notes tab"
msgstr "Zavihek Opombe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:292
msgid ""
"In the *Notes* tab of the quotation form, enter any specific internal notes "
"about the quotation and customer, if desired."
msgstr ""
"V zavihku *Opombe* na obrazcu ponudbe lahko po želji vnesete morebitne "
"interne opombe o ponudbi in stranki."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:298
msgid "Send and confirm a quotation"
msgstr "Pošiljanje in potrditev ponudbe"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:300
msgid ""
"Once all the necessary fields and tabs have been configured, it is time to "
"send the quotation to the customer for confirmation. Upon confirmation, the "
"quotation turns into an official sales order."
msgstr ""
"Ko so konfigurirana vsa potrebna polja in zavihki, je čas, da ponudbo "
"pošljete stranki v potrditev. Po potrditvi se ponudba spremeni v uradni "
"prodajni nalog."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:303
msgid "At the top of the form, there is a series of buttons:"
msgstr "Na vrhu obrazca je serija gumbov:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:305
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send by Email`: When clicked, a pop-up window appears with the "
"customer's name and email address in the :guilabel:`Recipients` field, the "
"quotation (and reference ID) in the :guilabel:`Subject` field, and a brief "
"default message in the body of the email, which can be modified if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pošlji po e-pošti`: Ko kliknete, se prikaže pojavno okno z imenom "
"in e-poštnim naslovom stranke v polju :guilabel:`Prejemniki`, ponudbo (in "
"referenčni ID) v polju :guilabel:`Zadeva` ter kratko privzeto sporočilo v "
"telesu e-pošte, ki ga je po potrebi mogoče spremeniti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:310
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:318
msgid ""
"Below that, a PDF copy of the quotation is attached. When ready, "
"click :guilabel:`Send` to send the quotation via email to the customer so "
"they can review and confirm it."
msgstr ""
"Spodaj je priložena kopija ponudbe v PDF obliki. Ko je pripravljeno, "
"kliknite :guilabel:`Pošlji`, da pošljete ponudbo stranki po e-pošti, da jo "
"lahko pregleda in potrdi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:312
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send PRO-FORMA Invoice`: This button **only** appears if the *Pro-"
"Forma Invoice* setting has been enabled. When clicked, a pop-up window "
"appears with the customer's name and email address in "
"the :guilabel:`Recipients` field, the *Proforma* invoice (and reference ID) "
"in the :guilabel:`Subject` field, and a brief default message in the body of "
"the email, which can be modified if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pošlji predračun`: Ta gumb se prikaže **samo**, če je omogočena "
"nastavitev *Predračun*. Ko kliknete, se prikaže pojavno okno z imenom in e-"
"poštnim naslovom stranke v polju :guilabel:`Prejemniki`, *predračun* (in "
"referenčni ID) v polju :guilabel:`Zadeva` ter kratko privzeto sporočilo v "
"telesu e-pošte, ki ga je po potrebi mogoče spremeniti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:320
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Confirm`: When clicked, the quotation is confirmed, and the "
"status changes to :guilabel:`Sales Order`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Potrdi`: Ko kliknete, se ponudba potrdi in status se spremeni "
"v :guilabel:`Prodajni nalog`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:322
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Preview`: When clicked, Odoo reveals a preview of the quotation "
"the customer sees when they log into their customer portal. Click "
"the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Back to edit mode` link at the top of "
"the preview page, in the blue banner, to return to the quotation form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Predogled`: Ko kliknete, Odoo prikaže predogled ponudbe, kot jo "
"vidi stranka, ko se prijavi v svoj strankarski portal. Kliknite "
"povezavo :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Nazaj na način urejanja` na vrhu "
"strani s predogledom v modrem pasičnem oknu, da se vrnete na obrazec ponudbe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:325
msgid ":guilabel:`Cancel`: When clicked, the quotation is canceled."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Prekliči`: Ko kliknete, se ponudba prekliče."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:328
msgid ""
"If the *Lock Confirmed Sales* setting is enabled, the sales order "
"becomes :guilabel:`Locked` and is indicated as such on the sales order form."
msgstr ""
"Če je omogočena nastavitev *Zakleni potrjene prodaje*, postane prodajni "
"nalog :guilabel:`Zaklenjen` in je kot tak označen na obrazcu prodajnega "
"naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:331
msgid ""
"At this point, the quotation has been confirmed, turned into a sales order, "
"and is now ready to be invoiced and paid for."
msgstr ""
"Na tej točki je ponudba potrjena, spremenjena v prodajni nalog in zdaj "
"pripravljena za izdajo računa in plačilo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/create_quotations.rst:334
msgid ""
"For more information about invoicing, refer to :doc:`Invoice based on "
"delivered or ordered quantities <../invoicing/invoicing_policy>`."
msgstr ""
"Za več informacij o izdaji računov glejte :doc:`Račun na podlagi dobavljenih "
"ali naročenih količin <../invoicing/invoicing_policy>`."

