msgstr "Seznam zahtevanih preklopov API obsega za omogočanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:75
msgid ""
"For newly created accounts, it may be necessary to submit the app for review "
"before enabling API usage. Click :guilabel:`Publish App` to generate a new "
"API key. Take the :guilabel:`Service ID`, :guilabel:`App key`, "
"and :guilabel:`App secret` of the app."
msgstr ""
"Za novo ustvarjene račune je mogoče, da je treba aplikacijo oddati v pregled "
"preden omogočite uporabo API. Kliknite :guilabel:`Objavi aplikacijo` za "
"generiranje novega ključa API. Vzemite :guilabel:`ID "
"storitve`, :guilabel:`Ključ aplikacije` in :guilabel:`Skrivnost aplikacije` "
"aplikacije."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:79
msgid "Locating the App key and App secret in the credentials menu."
msgstr ""
"Iskanje ključa aplikacije in skrivnosti aplikacije v meniju poverilnic."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:83
msgid "Connect TikTok Shop seller account to Odoo"
msgstr "Povežite račun prodajalca TikTok Shop z Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:85
msgid ""
"Go to Odoo's Apps module, search for the :guilabel:`TikTok Shop Connector` "
"module, and click :guilabel:`Activate` to install it."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite v modul Aplikacije Odoo, poiščite modul :guilabel:`TikTok Shop "
"Connector` in kliknite :guilabel:`Aktiviraj` za namestitev."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:88
msgid "The TikTok Shop Connector module in Odoo Apps."
msgstr "Modul TikTok Shop Connector v aplikacijah Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:91
msgid ""
"Once installed, activate the feature by going to :menuselection:`Sales --> "
"Configuration --> Shops`. Click :guilabel:`Connect New Shop`."
msgstr ""
"Po namestitvi aktivirajte funkcijo tako, da pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Prodaja --> Nastavitve --> Trgovine`. "
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Poveži novo trgovino`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:94
msgid "Navigating to the Shops configuration menu in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Navigacija do menija nastavitev trgovin v prodaji Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:97
msgid ""
"Fill in the :guilabel:`App Key`, :guilabel:`App Secret` "
"and :guilabel:`Service ID`."
msgstr ""
"Izpolnite :guilabel:`Ključ aplikacije`, :guilabel:`Skrivnost aplikacije` "
"in :guilabel:`ID storitve`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:99
msgid "Entering the TikTok app credentials into Odoo."
msgstr "Vnašanje poverilnic aplikacije TikTok v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:102
msgid ""
"The system redirects to an authentication page to connect the newly created "
"app to the TikTok Shop seller account. Ensure the login credentials match "
"the specific TikTok Shop account intended for connection and complete the "
"authentication process."
msgstr ""
"Sistem vas preusmeri na stran za overjanje za povezavo novo ustvarjene "
"aplikacije z računom prodajalca TikTok Shop. Preverite, da se prijavne "
"poverilnice ujemajo z določenim računom TikTok Shop, namenjenim za povezavo, "
"in dokončajte postopek overjanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:106
msgid "The TikTok Shop seller authentication and login screen."
msgstr "Zaslon za overjanje in prijavo prodajalca TikTok Shop."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:109
msgid ""
"Upon completion, the system redirects back to Odoo. Click the :guilabel:`Re-"
"authorize Shop` button to refresh the authorization and get a new Refresh "
"Token."
msgstr ""
"Po dokončanju sistem preusmeri nazaj v Odoo. Kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Ponovno pooblaščeno trgovino` za osvežitev pooblastitve in "
"pridobitev novega žetona osvežitve."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:113
msgid "Configure shop before go-live"
msgstr "Konfigurirajte trgovino pred zagonom"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:115
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales --> Configuration --> Shops`. Select the "
"TikTok account and configure the :guilabel:`FBS Warehouse` field to limit "
"stock fetching to specific warehouses. Enable synchronizing inventory in "
"shop settings to push stock levels to TikTok Shop."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na :menuselection:`Prodaja --> Nastavitve --> Trgovine`. Izberite "
"račun TikTok in konfigurirajte polje :guilabel:`FBS Skladišče` za omejitev "
"pridobivanja zalog na določena skladišča. Omogočite sinhronizacijo zaloge v "
"nastavitvah trgovine za potisk ravni zaloge v TikTok Shop."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/setup.rst:119
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Sync Catalog` button in Odoo to automatically fetch "
"active TikTok Shop products. Shipping labels, orders, inventory and product "
"catalogs can be manually synced using their respective buttons on the shop "
"configuration page."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite gumb :guilabel:`Sinhroniziraj katalog` v Odoo za samodejno "
"pridobivanje aktivnih izdelkov TikTok Shop. Pošiljne nalepke, naročila, "
"zalogo in kataloge izdelkov je mogoče ročno sinhronizirati z ustreznimi "
"gumbi na strani konfiguracije trgovine."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:6
msgid "Subscriptions"
msgstr "Naročnine"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:8
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Subscriptions** app is designed to manage recurring revenue "
"through subscription-based products or services. It supports automated "
"invoicing, renewal management, and customer lifecycle tracking."
msgstr ""
"Odoo aplikacija **Naročnine** je zasnovana za upravljanje ponavljajočih se "
"prihodkov prek izdelkov ali storitev, ki temeljijo na naročninah. Podpira "
"avtomatizirano izdajanje računov, upravljanje podaljšanja in sledenje "
"življenjskega cikla stranke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:12
msgid ""
"Subscriptions can be created manually or automatically through online sales, "
"with varying options for recurring billing. The app integrates with other "
"Odoo modules such as **Invoicing**, **CRM**, **Sales**, and **Helpdesk** to "
"support end-to-end subscription workflows."
msgstr ""
"Naročnine je mogoče ustvariti ročno ali samodejno prek spletne prodaje, z "
"različnimi možnostmi za ponavljajoče se obračunavanje. Aplikacija se "
"integrira z drugimi moduli Odoo, kot so **Izdajanje računov**, **CRM**, "
"**Prodaja** in **Služba za pomoč**, da podpira celovite delovne procese "
"naročnin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:18
msgid "Renew a subscription"
msgstr "Podaljšaj naročnino"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:18
msgid "Understand the core management activity for subscriptions"
msgstr "Razumevanje osnovne dejavnosti upravljanja naročnin"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:24
msgid "Upsell a subscription"
msgstr "Nadgradnja naročnine"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:24
msgid "Offer more value for current subscribers on the same sales order"
msgstr "Ponudite več vrednosti trenutnim naročnikom na istem prodajnem nalogu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:30
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:28
msgid "Close a subscription"
msgstr "Zapri naročnino"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:30
msgid ""
"Customize subscription plan templates tailored to various product offerings"
msgstr ""
"Prilagodite predloge načrtov naročnin, prilagojene različnim ponudbam "
"izdelkov"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:36
msgid "eCommerce integration"
msgstr "Integracija eCommerce"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:36
msgid "Offer subscription products through your Odoo eCommerce store"
msgstr "Ponudite naročniške izdelke prek svoje spletne trgovine Odoo eCommerce"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:43
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Subscriptions <https://www.odoo.com/slides/"
"subscription-20>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo navodila: Naročnine <https://www.odoo.com/slides/subscription-20>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:46
msgid "Set up recurring plans"
msgstr "Nastavitev načrtov ponavljanja"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:48
msgid ""
"To get started with subscription products in Odoo, *recurring plans* "
"(previously known as *recurrence periods*) must first be configured."
msgstr ""
"Če želite začeti z izdelki na naročnino v Odoo, je treba najprej "
"konfigurirati *načrte ponavljanja* (prej znane kot *obdobja ponavljanja*)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:51
msgid ""
"Recurring plans are the time windows in which subscriptions are active "
"before they renew again. While a subscription is active, customers receive "
"products or services, and may also have access to additional benefits such "
"as support desk triage. In terms of payment, these recurring plans designate "
"how often the customer is charged in order to maintain the benefits of their "
"subscription."
msgstr ""
"Načrti ponavljanja so časovna okna, v katerih so naročnine aktivne, preden "
"se znova obnovijo. Medtem ko je naročnina aktivna, stranke prejemajo izdelke "
"ali storitve in lahko imajo tudi dostop do dodatnih ugodnosti, kot je triaža "
"službe za pomoč. Kar zadeva plačilo, ti načrti ponavljanja določajo, kako "
"pogosto je stranka obračunana, da ohrani ugodnosti svoje naročnine."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:56
msgid ""
"To configure recurring plans, go to :menuselection:`Subscriptions app --> "
"Configuration --> Recurring Plans`."
msgstr ""
"Za konfiguracijo načrtov ponavljanja pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Naročnine --> Konfiguracija --> Načrti ponavljanja`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:59
msgid ""
"By default, the **Subscriptions** app includes a number of common recurring "
"plans already available, such as :guilabel:`Monthly` and :guilabel:`Yearly`."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto aplikacija **Naročnine** vključuje številne pogoste načrte "
"ponavljanja, ki so že na voljo, kot sta :guilabel:`Mesečno` "
"in :guilabel:`Letno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:62
msgid ""
"Create a new recurring plan by clicking :guilabel:`New` on "
"the :guilabel:`Recurring Plans` dashboard, to reveal a blank form where the "
"plan :guilabel:`Name`, :guilabel:`DETAILS`, :guilabel:`SELF-SERVICE` "
"and :guilabel:`Pricing` field values are specified."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarite nov ponavljajoči se načrt s klikom na :guilabel:`Novo` na nadzorni "
"plošči :guilabel:`Ponavljajoči se načrti`, da se prikaže prazen obrazec, "
"kjer so navedene vrednosti "
"polj :guilabel:`Ime`, :guilabel:`PODROBNOSTI`, :guilabel:`SAMOPOŠTREŽBA` "
"in :guilabel:`Cene`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:66
msgid "A blank recurring plan form in the Odoo Subscriptions application."
msgstr "Prazen obrazec ponavljajočega se načrta v aplikaciji Odoo Naročnine."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:70
msgid ""
"The `Days` unit of measure *cannot* be used as a :guilabel:`Billing Period` "
"for subscription products. The daily recurrence period in Odoo is designated "
"for rentals, and **cannot** be added to subscription-based sales orders."
msgstr ""
"Enota mere `Dnevi` *ne more* biti uporabljena kot :guilabel:`Obdobje "
"zaračunavanja` za naročniške izdelke. Dnevno obdobje ponavljanja v Odoo je "
"namenjeno najemom in **ne more** biti dodano prodajnim nalogom, ki temeljijo "
"na naročninah."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:74
msgid ""
"This limitation is there to avoid sales orders that would generate daily "
"invoices."
msgstr ""
"Ta omejitev obstaja, da se preprečijo prodajni nalogi, ki bi ustvarjali "
"dnevne račune."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:77
msgid "DETAILS section"
msgstr "Razdelek PODROBNOSTI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:79
msgid ""
"After giving the recurring plan a suitable :guilabel:`Name` (e.g. `Monthly`, "
"`Bi-weekly`, `Quarterly`, etc.), proceed to the form's :guilabel:`DETAILS` "
"section to fill out the following configuration fields:"
msgstr ""
"Ko ponavljajočemu se načrtu dodelite primerno :guilabel:`Ime` (npr. "
"`Mesečno`, `Dvotedensko`, `Trimesečno` itd.), nadaljujte v "
"razdelek :guilabel:`PODROBNOSTI` obrazca in izpolnite naslednja "
"konfiguracijska polja:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Billing Period`: determines the frequency with which the "
"subscription is billed. Set the unit of time "
"(:guilabel:`Weeks`, :guilabel:`Months`, or :guilabel:`Years`) in the drop-"
"down menu and the numerical value in the corresponding text field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Obračunsko obdobje`: določa pogostost obračunavanja naročnine. V "
"spustnem meniju nastavite časovno enoto "
"(:guilabel:`Tedni`, :guilabel:`Meseci` ali :guilabel:`Leta`) in številčno "
"vrednost v ustrezno tekstovno polje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Automatic Closing`: a numerical value, in days, where the "
"subscription is set to close automatically if payment is not made."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Samodejno zapiranje`: numerična vrednost v dnevih, po katerih se "
"naročnina samodejno zapre, če plačilo ni izvedeno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:90
msgid ""
"If a subscription is set to renew on the 1st of every month, and "
"the :guilabel:`Automatic Closing` value is set to `15` :guilabel:`Days`, "
"then the subscription will close on the 16th of that month if payment is not "
"received."
msgstr ""
"Če je naročnina nastavljena na podaljšanje 1. v mesecu in je "
"vrednost :guilabel:`Samodejno zapiranje` nastavljena na "
"`15` :guilabel:`Dni`, se bo naročnina zaprla 16. v tem mesecu, če plačilo ni "
"prejeto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Align to Period Start`: sets new and recurring subscription plans "
"to bill on the first day of the next :guilabel:`Billing Period`. When a "
"subscription plan is purchased in the middle of a billing period, the "
"invoice shows a reduced cost. Setting a custom period start dates (such as "
"the 5th of each month) requires custom development and is not available by "
"default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Poravnaj na začetek obdobja`: nastavi nove in ponavljajoče se "
"naročniške pakete tako, da se obračunajo prvi dan "
"naslednjega :guilabel:`Obračunskega obdobja`. Ko je naročniški paket kupljen "
"sredi obračunskega obdobja, račun prikazuje znižane stroške. Nastavitev "
"datumov začetka obdobja po meri (na primer 5. dan v mesecu) zahteva razvoj "
"po meri in privzeto ni na voljo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:100
msgid ""
"On the 15th of July, a customer purchases a monthly subscription for a "
"streaming service. Selecting :guilabel:`Align to Period Start` for this "
"recurring plan configures this subscription to bill on the 1st of each "
"month. The subscription begins as soon as payment is confirmed. The "
"quotation shows the full cost of the subscription for July 1 - 31, but the "
"invoice shows an adjusted cost for July 15 - 31. On the 1st of August, the "
"customer is charged the full price for the month's subscription."
msgstr ""
"15. julija kupec kupi mesečno naročnino na pretočno storitev. Izbira "
"možnosti :guilabel:`Poravnaj na začetek obdobja` za ta ponavljajoči se paket "
"nastavi to naročnino tako, da se obračuna 1. dan v mesecu. Naročnina se "
"začne takoj, ko je plačilo potrjeno. Ponudba prikazuje polno ceno naročnine "
"za 1.–31. julij, račun pa prikazuje prilagojene stroške za 15.–31. julij. 1. "
"avgusta se kupcu zaračuna polna cena za mesečno naročnino."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:107
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: optional assignment, if the database has :doc:`Multi-"
"company <../general/companies/multi_company>` functionality enabled. "
"Assigning this value will make the recurring plan available for that "
"company's location, specifically."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Podjetje`: neobvezna dodelitev, če je v bazi podatkov omogočena "
"funkcionalnost :doc:`Več podjetij <../general/companies/multi_company>`. "
"Dodelitev te vrednosti bo ponavljajoči se načrt naredila dostopnega "
"specifično za lokacijo tega podjetja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invoice Email Template`: assigns a specific email template to be "
"used in subscriptions invoicing communications. The default assignment here "
"is `Invoice: Sending` which contains various dynamic fields that "
"autopopulate specific variables across the :guilabel:`Subject` field "
"and :guilabel:`Content` tab, such as the customer's name, invoice number, "
"total amount invoiced, etc."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Predloga e-pošte za račun`: dodeli specifično predlogo e-pošte, "
"ki se uporabi v komunikaciji zaračunavanja naročnin. Privzeta dodelitev je "
"`Račun: Pošiljanje`, ki vsebuje različna dinamična polja, ki samodejno "
"izpolnjujejo specifične spremenljivke v polju :guilabel:`Zadeva` in "
"zavihku :guilabel:`Vsebina`, kot so ime stranke, številka računa, skupni "
"zaračunan znesek itd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:116
msgid ""
"Although this field is optional, it is recommended to use it since this type "
"of communication fulfills good business practices around price transparency, "
"regular customer communication (especially as it relates to charged "
"amounts), and helps build contextual financial documentation around "
"recurring revenues."
msgstr ""
"Čeprav je to polje neobvezno, je priporočljivo, da ga uporabite, saj ta "
"vrsta komunikacije izpolnjuje dobre poslovne prakse glede transparentnosti "
"cen, redne komunikacije s strankami (zlasti kar zadeva zaračunane zneske) in "
"pomaga graditi kontekstualno finančno dokumentacijo glede ponavljajočih se "
"prihodkov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:121
msgid ""
"An email template in Odoo used to send subscriptions invoicing messages to "
"customers."
msgstr ""
"Predloga e-pošte v Odoo, uporabljena za pošiljanje sporočil o zaračunavanju "
"naročnin strankam."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:124
msgid ""
"The `Invoice: Sending` email template is accessible by clicking "
"the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` (:guilabel:`Internal link`) that appears after "
"hovering over the :guilabel:`Invoice Email Template` drop-down field in "
"the :guilabel:`Recurring Plans` form."
msgstr ""
"Predloga e-pošte `Račun: Pošiljanje` je dostopna s klikom na :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` (:guilabel:`Notranja povezava`), ki se prikaže po prehodu miške preko "
"spustnega polja :guilabel:`Predloga e-pošte za račun` v "
"obrazcu :guilabel:`Ponavljajoči se načrti`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:129
msgid "SELF-SERVICE section"
msgstr "Razdelek SAMOPOŠTREŽBA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:131
msgid ""
"The following optional fields enable customers to take administrative "
"actions on their own subscriptions. Enabling any of these options may "
"decrease customer service request volume or increase customer lifetime value "
"(LTV)."
msgstr ""
"Naslednja neobvezna polja omogočajo strankam, da izvajajo upravna dejanja na "
"lastnih naročninah. Omogočanje katerekoli od teh možnosti lahko zmanjša "
"obseg zahtev za storitve za stranke ali poveča življenjsko vrednost stranke "
"(LTV)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:135
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Closable`: checking this box will give customers the power to "
"close their own subscriptions. Consider enabling this option to reduce "
"customer service requests and improve the overall customer experience; "
"customers that can manage their own subscriptions in this way helps offload "
"tedious tasks for sales and support teams, and reduces the likelihood of "
"negative reviews."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Zapirljivo`: ob označitvi tega polja bodo stranke dobile moč "
"zapiranja lastnih naročnin. Razmislite o omogočitvi te možnosti za "
"zmanjšanje zahtev za storitve za stranke in izboljšanje splošne izkušnje "
"strank; stranke, ki lahko na ta način upravljajo lastne naročnine, pomagajo "
"razbremeniti zamudna opravila prodajnih in podpornih ekip ter zmanjšujejo "
"verjetnost negativnih ocen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:141
msgid ""
"Although this option is generally advisable to enable, sales teams with "
"strong customer offboarding processes may consider leaving this option "
"unchecked in order to force an interaction that might save the subscription "
"or a different form of recurring revenue (such as in the case of a lesser "
"subscription or a new trial period with an alternative plan)."
msgstr ""
"Čeprav je to možnost na splošno priporočljivo omogočiti, lahko prodajne "
"ekipe z močnimi procesi odhoda strank razmislijo o tem, da te možnosti ne "
"označijo, da bi prisilile interakcijo, ki bi morda rešila naročnino ali "
"drugačno obliko ponavljajočega se prihodka (kot v primeru manjše naročnine "
"ali novega preskusnega obdobja z alternativnim načrtom)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:146
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add Products`: allows customers to add new products or edit "
"existing product quantities to their recurring sales orders, thereby "
"enabling customer-driven upselling. When enabled, :doc:`Upsell quotations "
"<subscriptions/upselling>` are generated in Odoo whenever a customer "
"performs a quantitative adjustment on their sales order product lines."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dodaj izdelke`: omogoča strankam dodajanje novih izdelkov ali "
"urejanje obstoječih količin izdelkov v ponavljajoče se prodajne naloge, s "
"čimer omogoča dodatno prodajo, vodeno s strani strank. Ko je omogočeno, se v "
"Odoo ustvarijo :doc:`Ponudbe za dodatno prodajo <subscriptions/upselling>`, "
"kadarkoli stranka izvede količinsko prilagoditev svojih vrstic izdelkov "
"prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:151
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Renew`: enabling this allows customers to manually create "
"a :doc:`Renewal quotation <subscriptions/renewals>` for their subscription."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Podaljšaj`: omogočanje tega omogoča strankam ročno "
"ustvarjanje :doc:`Ponudbe za podaljšanje <subscriptions/renewals>` za "
"njihovo naročnino."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:153
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Optional Plans`: adding values here from the drop-down field menu "
"enables customers to switch their subscription plans, in which case a new "
"subscription quotation or renewal quote is created to accommodate the change "
"request."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Izbirni načrti`: dodajanje vrednosti tukaj iz spustnega menija "
"omogoča strankam preklapljanje načrtov naročnin, pri čemer se ustvari nova "
"ponudba za naročnino ali ponudba za podaljšanje za prilagoditev zahteve za "
"spremembo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:158
msgid "Pricing tab"
msgstr "Zavihek cene"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:160
msgid ""
"Make product-specific pricing adjustments, as part of the recurring plan, by "
"adding them to the :guilabel:`Pricing` tab order lines. Sequentially add "
"the :guilabel:`Products`, along with any respective :guilabel:`Product "
"Variants`, and then assign a :guilabel:`Pricelist` (if available) and "
"a :guilabel:`Recurring Price`."
msgstr ""
"Naredite prilagoditve cen za posamezne izdelke kot del ponavljajočega se "
"načrta tako, da jih dodate v vrstice naročila zavihka :guilabel:`Cene`. "
"Zaporedno dodajte :guilabel:`Izdelke` skupaj z "
"ustreznimi :guilabel:`Različicami izdelka`, nato dodelite :guilabel:`Cenik` "
"(če je na voljo) in :guilabel:`Ponavljajočo se ceno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:166
msgid ""
"Price rules that are added here take precedent over the default pricing "
"information on the subscription product's form. This is meant to accommodate "
"deals, discounts, and similar pricing adjustment strategies that would "
"incentivize customers to purchase the recurring plan."
msgstr ""
"Pravila cen, ki so dodana tukaj, imajo prednost pred privzetimi "
"informacijami o cenah na obrazcu naročniškega izdelka. To je namenjeno "
"prilagajanju ponudb, popustov in podobnih strategij prilagajanja cen, ki bi "
"spodbudile stranke k nakupu ponavljajočega se načrta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:171
msgid "Smart buttons"
msgstr "Pametni gumbi"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:173
msgid ""
"At the top of the individual :guilabel:`Recurring Plans` form, are two smart "
"buttons to aid in navigating the recurring revenue sources attached to the "
"plan:"
msgstr ""
"Na vrhu posameznega obrazca :guilabel:`Ponavljajoči se načrti` sta dva "
"pametna gumba, ki pomagata pri navigaciji po virih ponavljajočih se "
"prihodkov, povezanih z načrtom:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:176
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Subscriptions`: shows the number of active subscriptions sales "
"orders that fall under the recurring plan. Clicking the button leads to a "
"tabled list view, where each row hyperlinks to a respective subscriptions "
"sales order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Naročnine`: prikazuje število aktivnih naročniških prodajnih "
"nalogov, ki spadajo pod ponavljajoči se načrt. Klik na gumb pripelje do "
"seznama v obliki tabele, kjer vsaka vrstica vsebuje hiperpovezavo do "
"ustreznega naročniškega prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:179
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Subscription Items`: lists all the individual recurring "
"subscription services that are active, in an itemized "
"fashion. :guilabel:`Subscription` and :guilabel:`Customer` values will "
"repeat if the customer ordered multiple subscriptions on the same sales "
"order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Naročniške postavke`: navaja vse posamezne ponavljajoče se "
"naročniške storitve, ki so aktivne, na podroben način. "
"Vrednosti :guilabel:`Naročnina` in :guilabel:`Stranka` se bodo ponavljale, "
"če je stranka naročila več naročnin na istem prodajnem nalogu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:186
msgid "Product form configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija obrazca izdelka"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:188
msgid ""
"With recurring plans set up, create a subscription product by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Subscriptions app --> Products --> Products`, and click "
"either an existing product to edit, or make a new one by "
"clicking :guilabel:`New` to open up the subscription product's form."
msgstr ""
"Ko so ponavljajoči se načrti nastavljeni, ustvarite naročniški izdelek tako, "
"da se pomaknete na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Naročnine --> Izdelki --> "
"Izdelki` in kliknite bodisi obstoječi izdelek za urejanje bodisi naredite "
"novega s klikom na :guilabel:`Novo`, da se odpre obrazec naročniškega "
"izdelka."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:193
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Subscriptions` option is already enabled, "
"prompting Odoo to recognize it as a subscription product. Be sure to leave "
"the :guilabel:`Subscriptions` and :guilabel:`Sales` options enabled."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto je možnost :guilabel:`Naročnine` že omogočena, kar spodbudi Odoo, "
"da ga prepozna kot naročniški izdelek. Poskrbite, da "
"možnosti :guilabel:`Naročnine` in :guilabel:`Prodaja` ostanejo omogočene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:197
msgid "A basic subscription product form in Odoo Subscriptions application."
msgstr "Osnovni obrazec naročniškega izdelka v aplikaciji Odoo Naročnine."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:200
msgid ""
"On the product form, configure the following items in the :guilabel:`General "
"Information` tab so the subscription product will function correctly:"
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu izdelka konfigurirajte naslednje elemente v "
"zavihku :guilabel:`Splošne informacije`, da bo naročniški izdelek deloval "
"pravilno:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:203
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product type`: this value is typically set to "
"a :guilabel:`Service`, however other product types may be used depending on "
"the purpose of the subscription (e.g., physical product box subscriptions, "
"eLearning course with supplemental physical goods, etc.)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vrsta izdelka`: ta vrednost je običajno nastavljena "
"na :guilabel:`Storitev`, vendar se lahko uporabijo tudi druge vrste "
"izdelkov, odvisno od namena naročnine (npr. naročnine na škatle s fizičnimi "
"izdelki, tečaji e-učenja z dodatnimi fizičnimi dobrinami itd.)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:206
msgid ""
":doc:`Invoicing policy <sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy>`: set this value "
"to when the customer should be charged for their subscription."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Politika fakturiranja <sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy>`: nastavite "
"to vrednost na to, kdaj naj bo stranka zaračunana za svojo naročnino."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:208
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unit of Measure`: how the product should be counted in Odoo, for "
"stock purposes. For most subscriptions, the :abbr:`UoM (Unit of Measure)` "
"will be :guilabel:`Units`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Merska enota`: kako naj se izdelek šteje v Odoo za namene zaloge. "
"Za večino naročnin bo :abbr:`ME (merska enota)` enaka :guilabel:`Enote`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:210
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Price`: enter the recurring cost of the subscription that "
"the customer will pay per recurrence period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prodajna cena`: vnesite ponavljajoče se stroške naročnine, ki jih "
"bo stranka plačala za posamezno obdobje ponavljanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:214
msgid ""
"When creating a subscription for a physical good, selecting the "
"wrong :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` will lead to errors when creating "
"invoices. Physical products must be set to :guilabel:`Ordered quantities`."
msgstr ""
"Pri ustvarjanju naročnine za fizično blago bo izbira "
"napačnega :guilabel:`Pravilnika fakturiranja` vodila do napak pri "
"ustvarjanju računov. Fizični izdelki morajo biti nastavljeni "
"na :guilabel:`Naročene količine`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:218
msgid ""
"Optionally set up information on the :doc:`Attributes & Variants <sales/"
"products_prices/products/variants>` tab if the subscription contains "
"multiple choices for customers (i.e. food delivery, tailored fashion boxes, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Po želji nastavite informacije na zavihku :doc:`Atributi in variante <sales/"
"products_prices/products/variants>`, če naročnina vsebuje več možnosti za "
"stranke (npr. dostava hrane, prilagojene modne škatle itd.)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:222
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Recurring Prices` tab, clarify the pricing options for the "
"subscription. For each option available, click :guilabel:`Add a price rule` "
"to add a new row."
msgstr ""
"V zavihku :guilabel:`Ponavljajoče se cene` pojasnite možnosti cen za "
"naročnino. Za vsako razpoložljivo možnost kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj pravilo "
"cen`, da dodate novo vrstico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:226
msgid ""
"Longer time :guilabel:`Recurring Plan` time periods are typically "
"incentivized with cost savings. Consider dropping the "
"total :guilabel:`Recurring Price` values to offer customers a discount while "
"supporting the business's financial runway."
msgstr ""
"Daljša časovna obdobja :guilabel:`Ponavljajočega se načrta` so običajno "
"spodbujena s prihranki pri stroških. Razmislite o znižanju skupnih "
"vrednosti :guilabel:`Ponavljajoče se cene`, da strankam ponudite popust in "
"hkrati podprete finančno vzdržnost podjetja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:230
msgid ""
"Last, if the subscription is meant to be sold on the **eCommerce** website, "
"click the :icon:`fa-globe` :menuselection:`Go To Website` smart button and "
"in the product page header, click the gray slider "
"from :guilabel:`Unpublished` to the green :guilabel:`Published` status."
msgstr ""
"Nazadnje, če je naročnina namenjena prodaji na spletni strani **eCommerce**, "
"kliknite pametni gumb :icon:`fa-globe` :menuselection:`Pojdi na spletno "
"mesto` in v glavi strani izdelka kliknite sivi drsnik "
"iz :guilabel:`Neobjavljeno` v zeleni status :guilabel:`Objavljeno`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:237
msgid "Create a subscriptions quotation"
msgstr "Ustvarite ponudbo za naročnine"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:239
msgid ""
"Manually create a new customer subscription by navigating to either "
"the :menuselection:`Sales` or :menuselection:`Subscriptions` app dashboards, "
"and then clicking :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Ročno ustvarite novo naročnino stranke tako, da se pomaknete na nadzorno "
"ploščo aplikacije :menuselection:`Prodaja` ali :menuselection:`Naročnine` in "
"nato kliknete :guilabel:`Novo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:243
msgid ""
"Products that have been marked as :guilabel:`Subscriptions` on their product "
"forms, and are also sold on the **eCommerce** website will *automatically* "
"create and confirm subscription quotations in the backend of Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Izdelki, ki so bili na svojih obrazcih izdelka označeni "
"kot :guilabel:`Naročnine` in se prav tako prodajajo na spletni strani "
"**eCommerce**, bodo *samodejno* ustvarili in potrdili ponudbe za naročnine v "
"zaledju Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:248
msgid ""
"Sales orders with a defined recurring plan automatically become "
"subscriptions."
msgstr ""
"Prodajni nalogi z določenim ponavljajočim načrtom samodejno postanejo "
"naročnine."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:250
msgid ""
"On the quotation form, fill in the necessary fields such "
"as :guilabel:`Customer` and :guilabel:`Recurring Plan`, as well as "
"the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab."
msgstr ""
"Na obrazcu ponudbe izpolnite potrebna polja, kot so :guilabel:`Stranka` "
"in :guilabel:`Ponavljajoči načrt`, kot tudi zavihek :guilabel:`Vrstice "
"naloga`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:253
msgid "Optionally, specify a:"
msgstr "Izbirno lahko navedete:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:255
msgid ""
":doc:`Quotation Template <sales/sales_quotations/quote_template>`, if one is "
"readily available to help populate the form fields."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Predlogo ponudbe <sales/sales_quotations/quote_template>`, če je na "
"voljo in pomaga pri izpolnjevanju polj obrazca."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:257
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expiration` date, to indicate when the subscription offer is no "
"longer valid."
msgstr ""
"Datum :guilabel:`Poteka`, da označite, kdaj ponudba naročnine ni več "
"veljavna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:260
msgid ""
"Expiration dates pair well with :doc:`discounts <sales/products_prices/"
"prices/discounts>` to incentivize faster purchases, since the discount will "
"expire with the quotation if it's not turned into a sales order within the "
"specified date range."
msgstr ""
"Datumi poteka dobro delujejo s :doc:`popusti <sales/products_prices/prices/"
"discounts>`, da spodbudijo hitrejše nakupe, saj bo popust potekel s ponudbo, "
"če se ne spremeni v prodajni nalog v določenem časovnem okviru."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:264
msgid ""
":doc:`Pricelist <sales/products_prices/prices/pricing>`, if one is available "
"and appropriate to use (i.e., summer sale discount, VIP customer, etc.)."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Cenik <sales/products_prices/prices/pricing>`, če je na voljo in "
"primeren za uporabo (npr. poletna razprodaja, VIP stranka itd.)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:266
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Terms`, to set a specified time window for when the "
"subscription must be paid. This is not to be confused for when the quotation "
"is *confirmed* and becomes a sales order, to where, payment may then be "
"obtained immediately or within a certain amount of days, weeks, months, etc."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Plačilni pogoji`, da nastavite določen časovni okvir, kdaj mora "
"biti naročnina plačana. To ne sme biti zamenjano s trenutkom, ko je ponudba "
"*potrjena* in postane prodajni nalog, pri čemer se lahko plačilo pridobi "
"takoj ali v določenem številu dni, tednov, mesecev itd."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:271
msgid "A completed example of a new subscription quotation in Odoo."
msgstr "Izpolnjen primer nove ponudbe naročnine v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:275
msgid ""
"Define different invoice and delivery addresses by enabling "
"the :doc:`Customer Addresses </applications/finance/accounting/"
"customer_invoices/customer_addresses>` feature."
msgstr ""
"Določite različne naslove za izdajo računa in dostavo z omogočanjem "
"funkcije :doc:`Naslovi strank </applications/finance/accounting/"
"customer_invoices/customer_addresses>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:281
msgid "Confirmation"
msgstr "Potrditev"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:283
msgid ""
"Send the quotation to the customer for confirmation by clicking "
"on :guilabel:`Send By Email`, or confirm it immediately by clicking "
"on :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"Pošljite ponudbo stranki v potrditev s klikom na :guilabel:`Pošlji po e-"
"pošti` ali jo takoj potrdite s klikom na :guilabel:`Potrdi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:287
msgid ""
"Click on :guilabel:`Preview` to preview the customer portal where the "
"customer can view their quotation, sign and pay it, and communicate with you."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na :guilabel:`Predogled`, da si ogledate portal za stranke, kjer si "
"lahko stranka ogleda svojo ponudbo, jo podpiše in plača ter komunicira z "
"vami."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:290
msgid ""
"If an :guilabel:`Online signature` or :guilabel:`Online payment` is required "
"to confirm the quotation, set the checkboxes next to either (or both) of "
"these labels in the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab, under the :guilabel:`SALES` "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Če je za potrditev ponudbe potreben :guilabel:`Spletni podpis` "
"ali :guilabel:`Spletno plačilo`, označite potrditveni polji poleg ene (ali "
"obeh) teh oznak v zavihku :guilabel:`Druge informacije` pod "
"razdelkom :guilabel:`PRODAJA`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:295
msgid ":ref:`Online Payments <accounting/payments/online>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Spletna plačila <accounting/payments/online>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions.rst:296
msgid ""
":doc:`Payment providers and payment methods </applications/finance/"
"payment_providers>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Ponudniki plačil in načini plačila </applications/finance/"
"payment_providers>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:3
msgid "Subscriptions and automatic payments"
msgstr "Naročnine in samodejna plačila"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:5
msgid ""
"By default, the **Subscriptions** app will automatically generate quotations "
"and invoices for customers, but it can also support automatic payments. "
"Setting up automatic payments requires additional configuration, including "
"choosing an automatic payment provider and either setting up a customer "
"portal or an **eCommerce** website. Here's an overview of how to get started."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto bo aplikacija **Naročnine** samodejno generirala ponudbe in račune "
"za stranke, lahko pa podpira tudi samodejna plačila. Nastavitev samodejnih "
"plačil zahteva dodatno konfiguracijo, vključno z izbiro ponudnika samodejnih "
"plačil ter nastavitvijo portala za stranke ali spletne strani **eCommerce**. "
"Tukaj je pregled, kako začeti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:11
msgid "Setting up a payment processor that supports automatic payments"
msgstr "Nastavitev plačilnega procesorja, ki podpira samodejna plačila"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:13
msgid ""
"Setting up automatic recurring payments requires using a payment provider "
"that supports tokenization. Tokenization lets customers save their payment "
"details, such as credit card or banking account information, for automatic "
"billing. The following payment providers support tokenization:"
msgstr ""
"Nastavitev samodejnih ponavljajočih se plačil zahteva uporabo ponudnika "
"plačil, ki podpira tokenizacijo. Tokenizacija strankam omogoča shranjevanje "
"podatkov o plačilu, kot so podatki o kreditni kartici ali bančnem računu, za "
"samodejno zaračunavanje. Naslednji ponudniki plačil podpirajo tokenizacijo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:17
msgid ":doc:`Adyen <../../finance/payment_providers/adyen>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Adyen <../../finance/payment_providers/adyen>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:18
msgid ":doc:`Authorize.net <../../finance/payment_providers/authorize>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Authorize.net <../../finance/payment_providers/authorize>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:19
msgid ":doc:`Flutterwave <../../finance/payment_providers/flutterwave>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Flutterwave <../../finance/payment_providers/flutterwave>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:20
msgid ":doc:`Razorpay <../../finance/payment_providers/razorpay>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Razorpay <../../finance/payment_providers/razorpay>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:21
msgid ":doc:`Stripe <../../finance/payment_providers/stripe>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Stripe <../../finance/payment_providers/stripe>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:22
msgid ":doc:`Xendit <../../finance/payment_providers/xendit>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Xendit <../../finance/payment_providers/xendit>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:24
msgid "Here are the steps to setting up automatic payments."
msgstr "Tukaj so koraki za nastavitev samodejnih plačil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:26
msgid "Choose a payment provider that supports tokenization."
msgstr "Izberite ponudnika plačil, ki podpira tokenizacijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:27
msgid ""
"Follow the provider's own setup guide to create an account and begin "
"configuring their API credentials in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Sledite navodilom ponudnika za ustvarjanje računa in začetek konfiguracije "
"njegovih API poverilnic v Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:29
msgid ":ref:`Enable <payment_providers/add_new>` the payment provider."
msgstr ":ref:`Omogočite <payment_providers/add_new>` ponudnika plačil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:30
msgid ""
":ref:`Configure the payment methods <payment_providers/payment_methods>` for "
"the chosen payment provider."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Konfigurirajte načine plačila <payment_providers/payment_methods>` za "
"izbranega ponudnika plačil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:32
msgid ""
":ref:`Configure the tokenization <payment_providers/tokenization>` for the "
"chosen payment provider."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Konfigurirajte tokenizacijo <payment_providers/tokenization>` za "
"izbranega ponudnika plačil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:36
msgid "How customers can set up automatic payments"
msgstr "Kako lahko stranke nastavijo samodejno plačevanje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:38
msgid ""
"Once these steps are complete, payment providers will be able to create "
"tokens with customers' saved payment details during the checkout process. "
"Saved payment details can then be used for future online or recurring "
"subscription charges. Customers can also log into their :doc:`customer "
"portal <../../general/users/user_portals>` and enter their payment "
"information there."
msgstr ""
"Ko so ti koraki zaključeni, bodo ponudniki plačil lahko ustvarili žetone s "
"shranjenimi plačilnimi podatki strank med postopkom nakupa. Shranjene "
"plačilne podatke je nato mogoče uporabiti za prihodnja spletna ali "
"ponavljajoča se plačila naročnin. Stranke se lahko prijavijo tudi v "
"svoj :doc:`portal za stranke <../../general/users/user_portals>` in tam "
"vnesejo svoje plačilne podatke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:43
msgid ""
"Some payment providers will automatically save customers' payment "
"information as part of the checkout process. Others will give them the "
"option to save their information for future payments. If customers choose "
"not to save their payment information, they will not be able to make "
"automatic payments."
msgstr ""
"Nekateri ponudniki plačil bodo samodejno shranili plačilne podatke strank "
"kot del postopka nakupa. Drugi jim bodo ponudili možnost, da shranijo svoje "
"podatke za prihodnja plačila. Če se stranke odločijo, da ne bodo shranile "
"svojih plačilnih podatkov, ne bodo mogle opraviti samodejnih plačil."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:49
msgid ""
"Building an **eCommerce** website requires the :doc:`Website <../../websites/"
"website>` app."
msgstr ""
"Za izgradnjo spletne strani **eCommerce** je potrebna "
"aplikacija :doc:`Website <../../websites/website>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:52
msgid "What happens if an automatic payment fails?"
msgstr "Kaj se zgodi, če samodejno plačilo ne uspe?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:54
msgid "When an automatic payment fails, the sales order is updated with:"
msgstr "Ko samodejno plačilo ne uspe, se prodajni nalog posodobi z:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:56
msgid "a :guilabel:`Payment Failure` tag"
msgstr "oznako :guilabel:`Neuspelo plačilo`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:57
msgid ""
"the :guilabel:`Contract in exception` checkbox ticked (in "
"the :guilabel:`Subscription` section of the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab)."
msgstr ""
"označenim potrditvenim poljem :guilabel:`Pogodba v izjemi` (v "
"razdelku :guilabel:`Naročnina` zavihka :guilabel:`Druge informacije`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:60
msgid ""
"Being marked :guilabel:`Contract in exception` prevents scheduled actions "
"from running, which keeps the system from accidentally double-charging the "
"customer if the automatic payment actually went through. Because the status "
"of the payment failed to register with the system, users must manually check "
"if the payment has been made before automatic payments and other scheduled "
"actions can resume."
msgstr ""
"Označba :guilabel:`Pogodba v izjemi` preprečuje izvajanje načrtovanih "
"dejanj, kar preprečuje, da bi sistem po nesreči dvakrat zaračunal kupcu, če "
"je samodejno plačilo dejansko uspelo. Ker se status plačila ni registriral v "
"sistemu, morajo uporabniki ročno preveriti, ali je bilo plačilo opravljeno, "
"preden se lahko nadaljujejo samodejna plačila in druga načrtovana dejanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:65
msgid ""
"To do this, navigate to :menuselection:`Subscriptions app --> Subscriptions "
"--> Quotations`. Click into the desired subscription, then check the Chatter "
"to see if the payment was made."
msgstr ""
"Za to pojdite na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Naročnine --> Naročnine --> "
"Ponudbe`. Kliknite na želeno naročnino in nato preverite klepet, da vidite, "
"ali je bilo plačilo opravljeno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:68
msgid ""
"If the payment *was not* made, first enter :doc:`developer mode <../../"
"general/developer_mode>`. Then, click the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab, and "
"untick the checkbox next to :guilabel:`Contract in exception`. Reload the "
"sales order and confirm that the :guilabel:`Payment Failure` tag is gone."
msgstr ""
"Če plačilo *ni bilo* izvedeno, najprej vključite :doc:`razvijalski način "
"<../../general/developer_mode>`. Nato kliknite zavihek :guilabel:`Druge "
"informacije` in počistite potrditveno polje ob :guilabel:`Pogodba v izjemi`. "
"Ponovno naložite prodajni nalog in potrdite, da je oznaka :guilabel:`Napaka "
"pri plačilu` izginila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:72
msgid ""
"If the payment *was* made, a new invoice must be made and posted manually. "
"This automatically updates the next invoice date of the subscription. Once "
"the invoice is created, enter :doc:`developer mode <../../general/"
"developer_mode>` and navigate to the new sales order. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab, and untick the checkbox next "
"to :guilabel:`Contract in exception`. Reload the sales order and confirm "
"that the :guilabel:`Payment Failure` tag is gone."
msgstr ""
"Če je bilo plačilo *izvedeno*, je treba ročno ustvariti in knjižiti nov "
"račun. To samodejno posodobi datum naslednjega računa naročnine. Ko je račun "
"ustvarjen, vključite :doc:`razvijalski način <../../general/developer_mode>` "
"in se pomaknite na nov prodajni nalog. Kliknite zavihek :guilabel:`Druge "
"informacije` in počistite potrditveno polje ob :guilabel:`Pogodba v izjemi`. "
"Ponovno naložite prodajni nalog in potrdite, da je oznaka :guilabel:`Napaka "
"pri plačilu` izginila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:78
msgid ""
"The contract in exception option selected with the payment failure tag shown."
msgstr ""
"Izbrana možnost pogodba v izjemi z prikazano oznako napaka pri plačilu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:81
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Contract in exception` option selected with "
"the :guilabel:`Payment Failure` tag shown."
msgstr ""
"Izbrana možnost :guilabel:`Pogodba v izjemi` s prikazano "
"oznako :guilabel:`Napaka pri plačilu`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:84
msgid ""
"In both cases, once the :guilabel:`Contract in exception` checkbox is no "
"longer ticked, Odoo handles renewals automatically again. If the "
"subscription remains in :guilabel:`Payment Failure`, it is ignored by Odoo "
"until the sales order is closed."
msgstr ""
"V obeh primerih, ko potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Pogodba v izjemi` ni več "
"označeno, Odoo ponovno samodejno upravlja podaljšanja. Če naročnina ostane v "
"stanju :guilabel:`Napaka pri plačilu`, jo Odoo ignorira, dokler prodajni "
"nalog ni zaprt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:89
msgid ":doc:`../../finance/payment_providers`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../finance/payment_providers`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/automatic_payments.rst:90
msgid ":doc:`../../general/users/user_portals`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../general/users/user_portals`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:3
msgid "Close subscriptions"
msgstr "Zapri naročnine"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Subscriptions** app provides flexibility for businesses to decide "
"whether customers can self-manage their subscriptions, or restrict that "
"ability entirely."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija Odoo **Subscriptions** podjetjem omogoča fleksibilnost pri "
"odločanju, ali lahko stranke samostojno upravljajo svoje naročnine ali pa "
"jim ta možnost v celoti omejijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:9
msgid ""
"A subscription must have been invoiced before it can be closed. "
"Subscriptions that have not yet been invoiced may be cancelled instead."
msgstr ""
"Naročnina mora biti fakturirana, preden jo je mogoče zapreti. Naročnine, ki "
"še niso bile fakturirane, je mogoče namesto tega preklicati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:15
msgid ""
"To allow customers to close their own subscriptions using their user portal, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Subscriptions app --> Configuration --> "
"Recurring Plans`. From there, either create a new plan by "
"clicking :guilabel:`New` or select an existing one to modify it."
msgstr ""
"Če želite strankam omogočiti, da zapirajo svoje naročnine prek uporabniškega "
"portala, pojdite na :menuselection:`Subscriptions app --> Configuration --> "
"Recurring Plans`. Tam ustvarite nov načrt s klikom na :guilabel:`New` ali "
"izberite obstoječega za spreminjanje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:19
msgid ""
"Once on the :guilabel:`Recurring Plans` form, enable "
"the :guilabel:`Closable` option in the :guilabel:`Self-Service` section. "
"This adds a drop-down menu that allows plans to be closed either on the date "
"of the user's choosing or at the end of the current renewal period."
msgstr ""
"Ko ste na obrazcu :guilabel:`Recurring Plans`, omogočite "
"možnost :guilabel:`Closable` v razdelku :guilabel:`Self-Service`. S tem "
"dodate spustni meni, ki omogoča zapiranje načrtov bodisi na datum po izbiri "
"uporabnika bodisi ob koncu trenutnega obdobja podaljšanja."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:23
msgid ""
"The Closable option enabled and displaying the drop-down menu in Odoo "
"Subscriptions."
msgstr ""
"Možnost Closable omogočena in prikazuje spustni meni v Odoo Subscriptions."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:30
msgid ""
"The methods available for closing a subscription depend on "
"users' :doc:`access rights <../../general/users/access_rights>`. Users with "
"administrator access rights to the Odoo database can close the subscription "
"from within the **Subscriptions** app. External users must use "
"their :doc:`user portal <../../general/users/user_portals>`."
msgstr ""
"Metode, ki so na voljo za zapiranje naročnine, so odvisne od "
"uporabnikovih :doc:`pravic dostopa <../../general/users/access_rights>`. "
"Uporabniki s pravicami dostopa skrbnika do podatkovne zbirke Odoo lahko "
"zapirajo naročnino znotraj aplikacije **Subscriptions**. Zunanji uporabniki "
"morajo uporabljati svoj :doc:`uporabniški portal <../../general/users/"
"user_portals>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:36
msgid "With administrator access rights"
msgstr "S pravicami dostopa skrbnika"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:38
msgid ""
"After a quotation for a subscription product has been confirmed, it becomes "
"a sales order, and the subscription status changes to :guilabel:`In "
"Progress`. At that point, the subscription may be closed."
msgstr ""
"Ko je ponudba za izdelek naročnine potrjena, postane prodajni nalog in "
"status naročnine se spremeni v :guilabel:`In Progress`. Takrat je mogoče "
"naročnino zapreti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:42
msgid ""
"From the dashboard, open the :menuselection:`Subscriptions` app. By default, "
"the **Subscriptions** dashboard displays both :guilabel:`In Progress` "
"and :guilabel:`Paused` subscriptions. Open an in-progress subscription."
msgstr ""
"Z nadzorne plošče odprite aplikacijo :menuselection:`Naročnine`. Privzeto "
"nadzorna plošča **Naročnine** prikazuje tako :guilabel:`V teku` "
"kot :guilabel:`Začasno ustavljene` naročnine. Odprite naročnino v teku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:46
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Close` button is at the top of the subscription order. "
"Clicking it opens the *Close Subscription* form, allowing an administrator "
"to enter the date when the subscription is to be closed in "
"the :guilabel:`When` field and select the reason for closing from the drop-"
"down menu of options in the :guilabel:`Reason` field. Custom reasons may be "
"created by opening the :guilabel:`Reason` drop-down and "
"choosing :guilabel:`Search more...`"
msgstr ""
"Gumb :guilabel:`Zapri` se nahaja na vrhu naročniškega naloga. Klik nanj "
"odpre obrazec *Zapri naročnino*, ki skrbniku omogoča vnos datuma zaprtja "
"naročnine v polje :guilabel:`Kdaj` in izbiro razloga za zaprtje iz spustnega "
"menija možnosti v polju :guilabel:`Razlog`. Razloge po meri lahko ustvarite "
"tako, da odprete spustni meni :guilabel:`Razlog` in izberete :guilabel:`Išči "
"več...`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:52
msgid ""
"When the desired :guilabel:`Reason` is entered, click the :guilabel:`Submit` "
"button. Clicking :guilabel:`Submit` on the :guilabel:`Close` form updates "
"the chatter with the reason for closing. Once it's been closed, "
"a :guilabel:`Churned` banner appears on the subscription order and the "
"chatter reflects the subscription's updated status, end date, and reason for "
"closure."
msgstr ""
"Ko je vnešen želeni :guilabel:`Razlog`, kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Pošlji`. "
"Klik na :guilabel:`Pošlji` v obrazcu :guilabel:`Zapri` posodobi klepet z "
"razlogom za zaprtje. Ko je naročnina zaprta, se na naročniškem nalogu "
"prikaže pasica :guilabel:`Churned`, klepet pa odraža posodobljeno stanje "
"naročnine, datum zaključka in razlog za zaprtje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:57
msgid ""
"A churned sales order for a closed subscription in Odoo Subscriptions "
"showing the banner\n"
"and the chatter."
msgstr ""
"Prodajni nalog churned za zaprto naročnino v Odoo Subscriptions s prikazano "
"pasico\n"
"in klepetom."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:62
msgid "Customer view"
msgstr "Pogled stranke"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:65
msgid ""
"As an administrator, the ability to visualize what users see when managing "
"their subscriptions is accessible via the :guilabel:`Preview` button at the "
"top of each subscription sales order."
msgstr ""
"Kot skrbnik lahko dostopate do možnosti vizualizacije, kaj vidijo uporabniki "
"pri upravljanju svojih naročnin, prek gumba :guilabel:`Predogled` na vrhu "
"vsakega naročniškega prodajnega naloga."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:68
msgid ""
"In the user portal, subscriptions may be managed by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Subscriptions` button on the home page. Clicking this button "
"takes the user to the :guilabel:`Subscriptions` page, where they can see a "
"list of all subscriptions associated with their account, including those "
"that are currently closed."
msgstr ""
"V uporabniškem portalu lahko uporabniki upravljajo naročnine s klikom na "
"gumb :guilabel:`Naročnine` na domači strani. Klik na ta gumb uporabnika "
"pripelje na stran :guilabel:`Naročnine`, kjer lahko vidijo seznam vseh "
"naročnin, povezanih z njihovim računom, vključno s tistimi, ki so trenutno "
"zaprte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:73
msgid ""
"Clicking a subscription opens the details page for that subscription, which "
"includes a :guilabel:`Close Subscription` button. Clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Close Subscription` button opens a :guilabel:`Close "
"Subscription` pop-up, where users must select from a list of reasons why "
"they are choosing to close the subscription."
msgstr ""
"Klik na naročnino odpre stran s podrobnostmi te naročnine, ki vključuje "
"gumb :guilabel:`Zapri naročnino`. Klik na gumb :guilabel:`Zapri naročnino` "
"odpre pojavno okno :guilabel:`Zapri naročnino`, kjer morajo uporabniki "
"izbrati s seznama razlogov, zakaj se odločajo za zaprtje naročnine."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:78
msgid ""
"The close subscription pop-up window customers see when closing a "
"subscription."
msgstr ""
"Pojavno okno za zaprtje naročnine, ki ga stranke vidijo pri zapiranju "
"naročnine."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:82
msgid ""
"Users must choose a pre-configured reason why the subscription is being "
"closed. They **cannot** enter a custom reason from the user portal. "
"Administrators can create custom reasons for users to choose from by logging "
"into the database and navigating to :menuselection:`Subscriptions app --> "
"Configuration --> Close Reasons`."
msgstr ""
"Uporabniki morajo izbrati vnaprej nastavljen razlog za zaprtje naročnine. "
"Razloga po meri **ne morejo** vnesti iz uporabniškega portala. Skrbniki "
"lahko ustvarijo razloge po meri, ki jih lahko uporabniki izberejo, tako da "
"se prijavijo v bazo podatkov in navigirajo do :menuselection:`Aplikacija "
"Naročnine --> Konfiguracija --> Razlogi za zaprtje`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/closing.rst:87
msgid ""
"Once the customer has chosen a reason for closing the subscription, they can "
"click the :guilabel:`Submit` button on the pop-up window. Upon closure, the "
"subscription order in the user portal is labeled :guilabel:`Closed`. Within "
"the database, the subscription is marked *Churned*, and the specified reason "
"for closure is added to the chatter."
msgstr ""
"Ko stranka izbere razlog za zaprtje naročnine, lahko klikne "
"gumb :guilabel:`Pošlji` v pojavnem oknu. Po zaprtju je naročniški nalog v "
"uporabniškem portalu označen kot :guilabel:`Zaprto`. V bazi podatkov je "
"naročnina označena kot *Churned*, navedeni razlog za zaprtje pa je dodan v "
"klepet."

